window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_DIVINE_DAO_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3701,"title":"Chapter 3701: Setting up a Formation with a few steps","paragraphs":["Chapter 3701: Setting up a Formation with a few steps","Translator: Henyee Translations , Editor: Henyee Translations","“Interesting.” Not far away, a handsome young man smiled, “Kong Feiyi, what","do you think?”","There was also a young man beside him, but compared to his soaring vigor, that person was practically a sick cat. His face was a little pale, as if he had not woken up yet. He was laidback and did not have the slightest bit of spirit.","This sickly young man’s eyes were half-open. He glanced at Ling Han, and said, “To be able to injure Hou Qingbai with a single strike while being a Human Dao Foundation, he is indeed quite interesting.”","“Do you want to spar with him?” The handsome young man egged him on.","Kong Feiyi chuckled and said, “Firstly, I’m lazy. If I have the time to fight, I might as well lie down for a while longer. Secondly, even if he’s a four-star genius, he’s only Human Dao Foundation, after all. How can he be a match for me? I’m not interested in bullying others, and if you want me to suppress my cultivation level, I’ll be even lazier.”","The handsome young man laughed loudly, “Can’t you change your laziness?”","“No.” Kong Feiyi shook his head, “Yang Yuan, just give up.","The handsome young man, Yang Yuan couldn’t help but shake his head and say, “Kong Feiyi, you’re clearly only in your twenties, yet you already look like an old geezer. If you were to live until four to five hundred years old, you’d probably be too lazy to even cultivate, right?”","“Hehe, you really know me well. As expected of my good friend,” Kong Feiyi","said with a smile.","“Forget about it. I can’t be bothered to scold you either. Just watch the show,”","Yang Yuan shook his head helplessly.","The two of them continued to sit by and watch. On the other side, after Hou Qingbai had spouted a bunch of nonsense, he was finally unable to restrain his fury, and decided to make a move.","-Aside from the large black dog, there was probably no one else that could bear Ling Han’s verbal attacks, which would drive others to death with fury.","“I want you to die!” Hou Qingbai charged over, the Battle Armor on his body glowing, boosting him with great power. As he shot out a punch, his power reached the peak stage of Ultimate Dao Foundation, which was extremely terrifying.","This brought with it a dazzling brilliance, and a sonic boom was left behind","him, exploding in all directions.","Even ordinary Ultimate Dao Foundation cultivators wouldn’t dare to face such a punch head-on. They would definitely die.","Ling Han was naturally unafraid, but he didn’t take it head-on. Instead, he moved his feet and circled around in a limited space.","Everyone considered this natural in fact. It would be strange if he could match the power of the peak stage of the Ultimate Dao Foundation.","“However, a long-term defense is bound to lead to a loss. As long as he is hit by","a punch, then he would lose everything,” someone made a judgement.","“Mhm!” The people beside him all expressed their deep agreement.","Princess Bixiao was even more anxious. Though she knew that Ling Han had charged all the way into the top 12 in the Metal Element Fruit Gathering, and his abilities were astonishing, the prodigies that had come this time were really too strong. Ling Han might not be able to get any advantage.","Now that she saw that Ling Han was only dodging and not attacking, she was naturally worried, and thought that Ling Han was no match.","She was the one who had caused this trouble. If anything happened to Ling Han because of this, she would not be able to rest easy for the rest of her life.","“Brat, how long can you dodge for?” Hou Qingbai smirked coldly. His offensive became even more rapid, wanting to take Ling Han down with thunderous","force.","Though he now had the absolute upper hand, he still hadn’t taken down Ling Han even after so long, which made him feel slightly embarrassed.","Thus, he definitely had to capture Ling Han as soon as possible.","Ling Han had already circled five times around the area. He shook his head. The difficulty of setting up a formation in battle had indeed increased greatly.","He said calmly, “I advise you not to move again.”","“Are you begging for mercy?” Hou Qingbai laughed loudly, but how could he possibly pay any heed to this? He continued to attack Ling Han.","Weng! Multiple veined patterns lit up on the ground, and 36 columns of light shot out at the same time, shooting towards Hou Qing Bai.","Pa, pa, pa, pa! These rays of light landed on the Battle Armor, creating a loud sound. Meanwhile, Hou Qingbai’s expression changed drastically, and he stumbled.","After he retreated three steps, xiu, xiu, xiu, another 36 pillars of light shot over. He paled in shock, yet could not dodge at all. Instantly, he was hit head-on, and his figure swayed again.","However, this time, he finally knew that he had already stepped into the formation, and could not move recklessly. Otherwise, the consequences would be very serious.","He forcefully steadied himself, but the attack of the pillars of light made him feel extremely uncomfortable. Instantly, he spluttered out a mouthful of blood.","This scene rendered everyone speechless.","“This guy is actually a... Formation Master!”","“Hehe, I really had not expected this. I had thought that he was dead for sure. I had not thought that there would actually be such a turn of events.","” Setting up formations with steps, this guy’s talent in formations is truly amazing.”","“This requires an incredibly deep understanding of formations, and only then would one be able to stomp down, and change the power of heaven and earth.” “Although it’s extremely likely that this guy is only a Human Tier Low Grade Formation Master, the fact that he can set up formations with steps speaks volumes of his natural talent.”","“His future... is limitless!”","Everyone nodded, seeing Ling Han in a new light.","Even if Ling Han possessed extremely high natural talent in martial arts, or even if it was a three-star genius or four-star genius, for the heirs of these great sects, they would only give him a second look at most. However, formation geniuses were a different story.","Similar to alchemy, the number of Formation Masters was also quite limited, and there were pitifully few that could be called prodigies.","With the help of such a person, it would be much easier to venture into ancient sites in the future. Not only would it increase the safety level, it could also allow one to venture deeper into some places that should not have been reachable.","All of a sudden, Ling Han’s value had increased countless times over.","Of course, Ling Han was doing this on purpose. He couldn’t possibly stay on the Celestial Sea Planet forever. He had to eventurally adventure into the galaxy, so he needed a certain amount of connections.","Hou Qingbai was both furious and depressed. “Who would’ve thought? You’re actually a Formation Master!”","If he had known this would happen, he definitely wouldn’t have battled in the same area as Ling Han. In the end, he had been trapped by Ling Han.","However, even if he had long since known that Ling Han was a Formation Master, he could not have imagined that Ling Han’s natural talent had actually reached the extent of setting up formations with steps.","This was practically over the top!","“Enough with the nonsense,” Ling Han said calmly. “Kneel down and apologize. Otherwise, you’ll stay inside for the rest of your life.” This was naturally an exaggeration. With his formation abilities, he could only temporarily change the general trend of heaven and earth. At most, in five minutes, this place would return to normal.","However, Hou Qingbai didn’t that and he was completely terrified by the formation.","“You dare?!” he roared. He was the descendant of a great elite at Sect Master-level, so how could he kneel down and apologize in public? What a joke!","“Is that so?” Ling Han smiled, raised his foot and stomped. Weng, the originally dim veined patterns immediately lit up again. Xiu, xiu, xiu, xiu, 36 pillars of light shot out in unison.","Did he think that everything would be fine as long as he stood in the formation without moving?","How naive!","He was a Formation Master, and as the Formation Master was right next to it, how could it be that he couldn’t control the formation?","“Wu!” Hou Qingbai released a muffled groan, and tried his best to dodge, but the speed of the pillars of light was too fast, so how could he possibly dodge? Under the combined attacks of the pillars of light, even the Battle Armor couldn’t protect him. After five rounds of attacks, pa, the Battle Armor shattered.","” Ah- ” Hou Qingbai released a terrible scream, but the good news was that he had finally rushed out of the formation."]},{"number":3702,"title":"Chapter 3702: Resolute and decisive","paragraphs":["Chapter 3702: Resolute and decisive","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hou Qingbai felt his vision darken, and a figure had already appeared in front of him.","Ling Han.","He wanted to attack, but he had just raised his hand, when he let out a pained groan. The Battle Armor had been damaged, and he had also been hit by the pillars of light. He was severely injured, so what power did he have left?","Ling Han delivered a palm strike, and pa, Hou Qingbai was smacked onto the ground.","Everyone sighed. This was the strength of a Formation Master. He definitely couldn’t be underestimated.","You see, without much effort, a two-star genius had been defeated, and this was a formation that Ling Han had set up at the last minute. If he was given enough time to prepare, even if he was facing ten or even a hundred Hou Qingbais, Ling Han would probably also be on the winning side, right?","Just think of those ancient sites, and you would know. Actually, they all had formations, and how many people had been trapped there?","Thinking of this, everyone’s eyes lit up, and became even more determined to befriend Ling Han.","Ling Han’s heart also thumped in excitement. He had seen another path. If formations were studied to the pinnacle, would they be able to kill even Saints?","Of course, who knew how many steps he had to take.","“Kneel down and apologize. Otherwise, die!” he said coldly. Since he had already spoken, he naturally had to keep his word.","Hou Qingbai raised his head high. How could he possibly kneel in front of so many people? He sneered, and said, “Do you dare to kill me? If I die, my personal memorial tablet will immediately shatter, and my father will immediately receive the news. At that time, when he charges over, not only you, but even the entire Celestial Sea Planet will be buried with me!”","“Kill me, then go ahead and kill me!”","Ling Han’s eyes sharpened. He could not accept being threatened at all. So what if it was a great elite of Sect Master-level? Worse come to worst, he could burn him with the Heavenly Dao Flames. In any case, he still had eight chances to use it.","It was just that there was a bit of trouble. If he used the Heavenly Dao Flames, it was very likely that he would be able to attract attention from the Holy Land of Metal Element. As long as the latter made a comparison, they would discover that the two flames were of the same origin.","Naturally, the fact that he was the true culprit who had set fire to the Holy Land would be exposed.","However, so what?","111 oblige you!” Ling Han said coldly, his killing intent surging like ice. Everyone gritted their teeth. This guy was really too decisive, wasn’t he? He would kill even the son of a great elite of Sect Master-level just like that? “Brother Ling, please have mercy!” Immediately, someone stepped out to mediate the situation, “Hou Qingbai is right. If a great elite of Sect Master-level arrives, the people here would be plunged into misery and suffering. Even if Brother Ling Ling has a way to escape, how innocent would the people here","It was a green-haired young man, his eyes shining like small suns. It was unknown whether he came from a Foreign Race, or was born with an Innate Divine Physique.","He smiled at Ling Han and said, “I’m Cheng Fei, and I actually don’t know Hou Qingbai. So, Brother Ling, please don’t think that I’m speaking up for him.”","“That’s right. Brother Ling still has a bright and boundless future ahead of you. There is no need for you to die here,” another advised.","Princess Bixiao also walked over, and said, “Forget it!”","“Hou Qingbai, quickly apologize to this lady!” Cheng Fei shouted at Hou Qingbai.","Hou Qingbai’s face was as white as a sheet. He had genuinely been frightened by Ling Han just then. Ling Han’s killing intent was as cold as ice, and it was incomparably firm and bone-chilling. This made him realize that Ling Han wasn’t simply trying to scare him. Instead, he genuinely dared to attack.","With this thought, he cowered.","For the sake of competing with a native, he was actually going to give up his life?","Of course, it was not worth it.","Thus, he turned to Princess Bixiao and said, “I’m sorry, I was too abrupt!” He swore that he would definitely avenge this humiliation. In future, he would make Ling Han kneel in front of him, and make him suffer a fate worse than death, while he would play Princess Bixiao to death.","These lowly people actually dared to humiliate him.","Princess Bixiao hurriedly said to Ling Han, “Forget it, forget it. He has already apologized.” She was really worried about Ling Han, and did not want anything to happen to him.","In any case, Ling Han had already stepped out bravely for her, which made her feel a sweetness in her heart.","Just when everyone thought that Ling Han was about to stop, they saw Ling Han raise his foot and suddenly kick out.","Pa! Hou Qingbai collapsed to the ground.","Ling Han walked over and pulled his upper body up. This time, Hou Qingbai was forced into a kneeling position.","“I told you to kneel down and apologize. Did you not hear me clearly?” he whispered by Hou Qingbai’s ear, while his right hand gripped onto the latter’s neck. “You can test my courage, and see if I dare to kill you!”","A terrifying chill instantly spread throughout his body, and Hou Qingbai couldn’t help but shiver. This killing intent was as cold as ice, directly penetrating into his heart.","He didn’t dare to try. Just now, he had already been frightened by Ling Han’s killing intent. This guy really couldn’t be judged by common sense. Who knows, he might make a move.","In any case, he had already been forced into a kneeling position, so it wouldn’t hurt to say another word, right?","“S-sorry, I was wrong!” he said to Princess Bixiao again, his face flushed red.","Kneeling down in public and apologizing, as the son of a Sect Master, how could he endure this?","This was utterly humiliating.","Scram!” Ling Han casually waved his hand and tossed Hou Qingbai away.","At this moment, everyone was speechless.","This guy was really too stubborn, wasn’t he? Just because he said he wanted someone to kneel down and apologize, he had to force them to kneel. Merely apologizing was useless.","Hard-headed, he was really too hard-headed.","However, some people saw that there was something deeper behind this, and that was Ling Han’s determination.","Without achieving his goal, he would definitely not give up, and would definitely not compromise.","In martial arts, this was an incomparably valuable quality. No matter what kind of hardships and difficulties they encountered, they would not give up. Even if they crashed into a wall, they would not turn back. Instead, they would have to forcefully crash through the wall – or kill themselves there.","No wonder this guy had been able to achieve setting up formations with steps at such a young age. With this kind of perseverance and determination, as well as enough natural talent, it would be strange if he did not have such accomplishments.","“Brother Ling, I am Su Feilang, and would like to befriend you.”","“I amZhuang Boming. Greetings, Brother Ling.”","IIJ II","Everyone gathered around, wanting to befriend Ling Han. This was a formation genius, and a future Formation Grandmaster, so he was definitely worth befriending.","As for offending Hou Qingbai?","Hehe, they were all the descendants and heirs of Sect Master, or even Venerate Tier elites, so how could they be afraid?","Ling Han also became cordial, and greeted everyone one by one. These people could possibly become his connections after he entered into the galaxy in future, so he did not mind making a few more friends.","After talking for a while, he finally said to Princess Bixiao, “Come let’s eo back.”? ’??? 6","Princess Bixiao’s mind was still filled with the scene of Ling Han forcing Hou Qingbai to kneel down. Her heart throbbed. To avenge her, this man had even thrashed the son of a great elite of Sect Master Tier, just like that. He had even forced him to lower his head and kneel down in apology. How could she not be touched?","At this moment, she was truly willing to bear children for Ling Han.","Yes, it was indeed a monkeyO.","Not long after, the two of them returned to the “camp”.","Ling Han began to set up formations, preparing to concoct Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pills.","If he wasn’t a Formation Master, he would first have to buy the corresponding formation foundations, then ask a Formation Master to set up a formation for him. Now, there was no need to go to so much trouble. Ling Han himself was Formation Master, taking care of everything single-handedly.","Begin."]},{"number":3703,"title":"Chapter 3703: Refining the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill","paragraphs":["Chapter 3703: Refining the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The concoction of the Celestial level alchemical pill was slightly more complicated. Merely the formation alone was not enough. It also needed an alchemy cauldron, which was very important.","Because the quality of the cauldron would also affect the quality of the completed pill.","Ling Han didn’t have a good alchemy cauldron in his possession right now, so he could only use the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower as a replacement. Why was the cauldron so important?","This was because an alchemist’s cauldron was like a Spirit Tool. It would be fused with a sliver of divine sense. Thus, it would be extremely sensitive to changes in energy, and alchemy was actually using energy to extract the medicinal properties, guide the medicinal properties, and fuse the medicinal properties.","The more sensitive one was to energy, the higher the chances of concocting alchemical pills, and the higher the grade of the completed pill.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was Ling Han’s Spirit Tool. It was forged from the Origin Gold, and could be considered the strongest alchemy cauldron in the world, right?","Ling Han activated the formation. Boom! The power of heaven and earth surged out.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower floated gently. With Ling Han’s guidance, he extracted the power of heaven and earth into the ninth level of the tower. Now, only this level was empty, and could be used as space for the alchemy cauldron.","Ling Han made slight adjustments through that sliver of divine sense, changing the strength and category of energy that had entered the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Materials were thrown out one after another, and were absorbed by the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Ling Han performed precise control, and his consciousness turned into thin threads, not being detected in the slightest.","The refinement process was progressing in an orderly manner, and one of the greatest benefits of using the Primal ChaosExtreme Lightning Tower to concoct alchemical pills was that the cauldron would not explode. At most, the alchemical pill would be messed up, and only a portion of the ingredients would be wasted.","Three hours passed, and Ling Han couldn’t help but frown.","He had failed.","The Alchemy Emperor actually failed?","Ling Han recalled the entire process, and nodded, “The medicinal recipe is set in stone, but the age of the ingredients could not possibly completely match the medicinal recipe. Thus, slight adjustments have to be made. This is my mistake.”","He started again, and another three hours later, a smile appeared on Ling Han’s face.","Success.","With a thought, xiu, xiu, xiu, seven green alchemical pills flew out of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","“Grade of completed pill, High Grade!”","Ling Han laughed loudly. He had successfully refined it on his second attempt, and it had even reached High Grade. What was there to be dissatisfied about?","“If I refine it a few more times, I’ll definitely be able to reach the quality of Peak Grade.”","However, after concocting two alchemical pills, Ling Han’s spiritual power was also greatly exhausted, and he could no longer continue.","He would rest first, and continue tomorrow.","He wasn’t a petty person, and he gave Princess Bixiao and Sixth Baby each two Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pills.","One pill could only be ingested each day. After all, it was a medicine, and had a certain level of poison. If one ingested too much, not only would it be useless for cultivating, one would also accumulate alchemical poison. When it reached a certain level, even a Saint would not be able to save him.","However, to the majority, this problem did not exist.","—Who would be so wealthy that they could eat Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pills every day, and still have excess?","Princess Bixiao was naturally overjoyed. The Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill was extremely valuable, and no one on the Celestial Sea Planet could refine it. However, after some thought, she accepted it.","Er, in any case, she owed too many debts, so she would repay these debts with her body.","Her face was flushed, and she was extremely embarrassed.","Sixth Baby didn’t want it, and she said, “Father, we’re a bit special. Celestial medicines have no effect on us.”","Yi, could it be that since you guys grew from the gourd vine, so you won’t eat greens?","Alright, Ling Han nodded. He trusted the babies very much, and also believed in their uniqueness. Since Sixth Baby said that the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill had no effect on her, then it definitely had no effect.","Ling Han put the alchemical pill away. This thing should be one of the most practical alchemical pills for Foundation Building Tier cultivators. Now, there were extraordinarily many Foundation Building Tier cultivators here, so there should be a wide market for them, and they could be sold for a high price.","Moreover, he had also promised the stall keeper that he would sell him a portion of the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pills that he had concocted in exchange for more Foxwood.","“When the time comes to concoct alchemical pills, I regret not having enough!” Ling Han exclaimed ruefully.","The next morning, the sun had just risen. Ling Han swallowed an Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill first, then started to cultivate.","In this way, he could maximize the effects of the alchemical pill.","Hong, with the guidance of the Great Sun Lotus Technique, the power of heaven and earth surged into Ling Han’s body. The apertures all over his body opened up. There were 360 of them, which was a whole ten times more than the weakest Foundation Building Tier cultivator, so the speed of his cultivation was naturally a whole ten times slower.","Additionally, there were two mysterious powers taking effect inside his body, endlessly turning into mystical power that he could absorb, strengthening the foundations of the Celestial Path.","This was naturally the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill that he had just ingested, as well as the Silver Dragon Fish that he had ingested earlier. The unique trait of the Silver Dragon Fish was that its effects would not immediately appear, but would be exhibited in the following period of time.","This was especially the case with the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill. The effects were extremely obvious, and Ling Han could clearly sense that his cultivation speed was much faster than the day before.","“I don’t know the limits of Human Dao Foundation, so I can’t estimate my own progress. Did I really advance into the middle stage of Human Dao Foundation?”","Ling Han stroked his chin and said, “Forget about it. I’ll ignore this for now. In any case, as long as I can’t advance any further in my cultivation, I would have reached the pinnacle of Human Dao Foundation.”","He first concocted a cauldron of alchemical pills. This time, they were still High Grade alchemical pills, and had not leaped into the level of Peak Grade. However, the number of completed alchemical pills had reached eight, which meant that Ling Han had actually made some improvement in concocting the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill.","Only one night had passed, and he had only concocted one more cauldron, and he had already attained this kind of improvement. His reputation as the Alchemy Emperor was definitely not just for show.","However, his spiritual power was almost exhausted. Ling Han didn’t want to exhaust himself too much, so he didn’t refine a second cauldron.","He went to the marketplace and found the stall keeper from yesterday.","“Yi, brother, it’s you?” The stall keeper smiled, and said, “What is it? You’ve wasted all the ingredients, and now you want to replenish them?”","Ling Han laughed loudly, drew out a pill bottle and handed it over.","“Yi, you’ve succeeded!” The stall keeper was skeptical. After taking the pill bottle, he uncorked it, and when he looked at it, he couldn’t help but feel moved.","He had naturally eaten Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pills before, so he was naturally no stranger to this.","This was definitely a genuine item, and furthermore... its quality was extraordinary.","“You really succeeded?” The stall keeper looked at Ling Han in shock.","It had only been a day, and he had already concocted it?","For the majority of alchemists, being able to concoct a successful cauldron out of every ten cauldrons was already quite impressive. Thus, though he had sold Ling Han a length of Foxwood, he did not think that Ling Han would really be able to concoct anything.","At least, not so fast.","Yet Ling Han had succeeded, and furthermore, the grade of the completed pill was so high.","Inconceivable, this was really inconceivable.","“I’m Lin Xiu. Let’s be friends,” the stall keeper said.","“Ling Han.” Ling Han also smiled slightly, and stretched out a hand towards the other.","Lin Xiu shook hands with Ling Han, and said, “I come from the Permanent Bright Planet, also known as the Medicinal Garden Planet. The heaven and earth there is especially suitable for growing Celestial medicines. A great many Celestial medicines that do not survive on other planets can survive in the Medicinal Garden Planet. Furthermore, they grow well and quickly.”","“Hehe, the reason why I’m here this time is actually to sell medicinal ingredients. Going to the Mystery Realm is only in passing.”","Er, he was really honest."]},{"number":3704,"title":"Chapter 3704: Galaxy Network","paragraphs":["Chapter 3704: Galaxy Network","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han chatted with Lin Xiu for a while, and Lin Xiu indeed kept his word. He took out a few more segments of Foxwood and sold them to Ling Han. They were far older than the previous segment, and the price was quite fair.","The two of them reached an agreement. Lin Xiu would sell Ling Han as much Foxwood as he wanted, and Ling Han would sell the same amount of Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pills to Lin Xiu.","It looked like Ling Han had profited greatly, but he was the Alchemy Emperor, and his pill completion rate had exceeded imagination. For an ordinary alchemist, this kind of requirement was already very high.","Ling Han found out that most of the people on the Medicinal Garden Planet were farmers, but there wasn’t a single alchemist. Thus, the medicinal ingredients produced could only be sold, but couldn’t be refined.","Though they were in the upper reaches of the alchemical pill business, they did not earn much profit. The majority of the profits had been taken by the alchemists.","It couldn’t be helped. The medicinal ingredients purchasing teams from the planets around Medicinal Garden Planet worked together to lower the price, resulting in the price of the raw ingredients not being high.","“Can’t you guys transport the medicinal ingredients out by yourselves?” Ling Han asked.","“We have thought about it, and we have tried.” Lin Xiu shook his head, “But there are interstellar pirates outside our planet, and they have snatched all our goods, and the result is even worse.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but sneer, “What interstellar pirates? It’s most likely those medicinal purchasing groups in disguise.”","“Sigh!” Lin Xiu sighed, and said, “It can’t be helped. Although the Medicinal Garden Planet is suitable for medicinal ingredients to grow, it’s not suitable for the growth of cultivators. It can’t produce any elites, so we can only wait to have our prices sliced.”","Ling Han nodded, “Then why have you come out this time? Firstly, to sell medicinal ingredients, and secondly, to become stronger?”","“If I can become Sect Master-level in the future, I would really like to see who would dare to bully Medicinal Garden Planet,” Lin Xing said angrily.","Ling Han paused, then said, “In future, I can sell you two Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pills every time.”","“Really?” Lin Xiu’s eyes lit up.","“Really.” Ling Han nodded.","“Thank you.”","“No need. I’m not givingyou alchemical pills, I’m still taking payment.”","“Haha.” Lin Xiu patted Ling Han’s shoulder. The Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill had always been priceless. Aside from the Dao Child and Holy Daughter of the great sects, there were very few other heirs that could consume it.","Ling Han selling an additional Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill to him was a huge favor.","He did not say any more words of thanks, but rather kept it in his heart. He would definitely repay him in future.","Ling Han took out an additional Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill. This was nothing to him. As long as there was enough Foxwood, as the Alchemy Emperor, how could he fear that there would be no alchemical pills?","Moreover, the other was born in the Medicinal Garden Planet, so he definitely had a channel to obtain a large amount of precious medicinal ingredients. This connection was extremely useful to him.","Ling Han returned to his tent, and saw that there were already a great many people waiting for him, wanting to further develop relations with him.","A formation prodigy was really worth befriending.","Ling Han also observed people. If he could get along with them, he would say a few more words. If they couldn’t, he wouldn’t deliberately offend them either. He just couldn’t be bothered to deal with them. Once he spoke less, they would know what he was doing, and wouldn’t take the initiative to be rebuffed.","A few days later, someone issued a bounty. Whoever could kill Ling Han would be able to obtain a thousand Dao Stones.","When Ling Han received the news, he was extremely surprised. How was he supposed to receive this bounty? He didn’t even know who the person who issued the bounty was.","“You’re actually curious about this?” Princess Bixiao didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. Shouldn’t you be more concerned about who issued the bounty and how to deal with possible assassins?","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “It’s most likely a bounty issued by Hou Qingbai. I’m thinking, if others really succeed and go to him to collect the bounty, what if he doesn’t admit it?”","Princess Bixiao was rendered speechless.","Ling Han soon found out that this bounty wasn’t a joke.","Though the galaxy was huge, after so many years of development, aside from the boundless and distant edges of the universe, the whole galaxy was actually already connected.","The internal structure of the planet was through the Wide Star Vine, while the connection between planets was through spatial nodes.","On the planets where martial arts were developing normally, many people would buy connectors to connect to the colossal Galaxy Network, and find out in real time what major events were happening in the galaxy.","It was said that this Galaxy Network was constructed by an Ancestral King in the ancient times, who had used great power to open up spatial nodes one after another.","After the Galaxy Network was constructed, a kind of virtual currency was also created, and that was Universe Coins.","The Universe Coins were linked to the Dao Stones, and the exchange rate was one to one. Meanwhile, the stability of the Universe Coins was maintained by the Ancestral King-level force that had built the Galaxy Network. They had a large number of Dao Stones in their possession, and it was guaranteed that the Universe Coins could be exchanged for Dao Stones.","With such a foundation, interstellar trading became possible.","The bounty for Ling Han was posted on the Galaxy Network. Whoever killed Ling Han and uploaded the image of Ling Han’s death would be recognized by this platform, and the 1000 Universe Coins that the person who had posted the bounty had previously written off would be directly recorded into his account.","—Previously, the internet platform of the Dark North Nation was the model of the Galaxy Network. However, at that time, there was no Wide Star Vine, so they had to rely on the help of satellites, light cables, and so Chen Fengyan, as an “ancient person” from more than 2000 years ago, definitely knew about the Galaxy Network.","“Yi, there’s actually such a good thing?” Ling Han was surprised. Unfortunately, he didn’t have a connection device, and couldn’t connect to the Galaxy Network.","However, there were many extraterrestrial visitors here, so he could borrow them.","Ling Han used someone else’s connection device to log into the Galaxy Network, and instantly, an incredibly vast world appeared in front of him.","Before this, he was like a frog at the bottom of a well, and the things he could come into contact with were extremely barren.","“Hehe, as long as you have enough Universe Coins, you can also buy cultivation techniques, pill recipes, formation techniques.” Ling Han nodded, “If you want to obtain Universe Coins, the fastest way would be to obtain the Charging Stone, and there are charging points set up by the Chang Clan on many planets.","The Chang Clan was the descendant of that Ancestral King that had constructed the Galaxy Network. With such a colossal network in their grasp, after countless years, the wealth and power of the Chang Clan must have reached a terrifying extent.","Unfortunately, even with such astonishing resources, the Chang Clan was still unable to produce a second Ancestral King.","The difficulty of the Imperial Path could be imagined.","“However, firstly, the Dao Stones in my possession are limited, and secondly, there are no charging points on the Celestial Sea Planet.”","“Then, I can only earn Universe Coins first.”","“I can auction off the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill, and have someone transfer money to me through the Galaxy Network... Oh, no wonder someone asked me for an account number when I was selling ingredients.”","“I don’t have an account number, but Lin Xiu should have one. Let’s just leave the money with him first.”","“En, I’ll ask him tomorrow what his account is called.”","Ling Han swept his gaze over it. Pill recipes were extremely expensive. The cheapest Celestial level pill recipe was at least 500 Dao Stones. Furthermore, pill recipes were unique. In other words, after you obtained a new pill recipe, you could apply for a proprietary application on the Galaxy Network. Even if others bought this pill recipe from you, they would not be allowed to sell it on the Galaxy Network.","It was the same for cultivation techniques and formation techniques, protecting the fruits of labour of the creator as much as possible.","Of course, for the Chang Clan, they could read all the cultivation techniques, pill recipes, formations, and so on, of the world, without paying any price at all.","Thus, it would be difficult for the Chang Clan to not be strong."]},{"number":3705,"title":"Chapter 3705: Super genius","paragraphs":["Chapter 3705: Super genius","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","With so many resources, how could there be no one envious?","There definitely was.","But what kind of existence was the Chang Clan?","Having once produced an Ancestral King, and having an Ancestral Weapon as overseer, this could guarantee the fortune for millions and millions of years!","-Without the appearance of the Great Emperor, the ancestral weapon would be invincible, and even Saints would have to bow their heads in submission.","The Chang Clan was naturally eternally prosperous.","In the circle of Great Emperors, there was an unwritten rule. As long as Great Emperor-level forces did not seek death themselves, and angered an existing Great Emperor, the Great Emperor would not deliberately target them either.","This was because the Great Emperor was not indestructible. How could it be that he was not worried that after his death, another Great Emperor would similarly destroy his force?","On the other hand, this was also a show of respect to his predecessors. Which one of those who could become a Great Emperor did not have outstanding bearing and was peerless in the world?","There could only be one in a single era!","Ling Han sighed ruefully, and began to search again. Then, he discovered another source of income.","And that was to fight on the martial arts ring, and make bets.","In the Galaxy Network, two people’s wills could take form and engage in battle.","It could be a battle at the same cultivation level, or it could be a battle where there was a gap of a few cultivation levels between them. It could be a one-on- one battle, a one-on-many battle, or a group battle. There were various methods, and it was up to the individual to choose.","This was called Galaxy Network Tournament.","In this place, one could fight with others, place bets, or not place bets.","However, those who used the Galaxy Network Tournament would have to pay","0.1 Universe Coins each time.","If they didn’t fight, they could also participate in the ranking battles. If they could rank in the top 1000 at a certain cultivation level, they would be recognized as a prodigy by the entire universe.","That was because practically everyone in the entire universe was connected to this network. To be able to rank in the top 1000 among such a colossal number of cultivators, on average, not even one in a galaxy would be able to do so.","For example, in the Centaur Galaxy, where Celestial Sea Planet belonged, not one person made it into any of the leaderboards-the Foundation Building List, the Cauldron Forging List, the Core Formation List, and so on were all zero. Thus, in terms of the entire universe, the Centaur Galaxy was definitely not ranked. They did not have super elites in the higher cultivation levels, and there weren’t any stunning rising stars that could hold up the skies of the future among the lower cultivation levels either.","If one could make it into the leaderboard, such as the Foundation Building Tier List, they would immediately be able to obtain 1000 Universe Coins, and every year after that, the platform would distribute 1000 Dao Stones as rewards – if they dropped out of the leaderboard, that would naturally be gone.","To the super genius, 1000 Dao Stones naturally wasn’t much. However, the most important thing was the ranking itself. This was a great honor.","Aside from that, there were also various records. If one could break these records, they would similarly be rewarded with Universe Coins, and this kind of glory was even more dazzling, because there were many people on the leaderboard, but what about the record holder?","There was only a single name for each record, and there was no second place.","However, after so many years, the records were also becoming harder and harder to break. This meant that he had to surpass all the prodigies within hundreds of millions of years or even tens of billions of years!","Just how difficult was it to break records?","However, what was astonishing was that there were actually people who broke records repeatedly among the Foundation Building Tier cultivators. Moreover, it wasn’t just one, but three. This was extremely inconceivable.","These three people did not reveal their real names, nor did they reveal their true identities. Instead, they appeared with code names.","One was called Heaven Crushing, one was called Origin, and one was called","Myriad Dao.","All were very arrogant.","However, it was unknown whether they were male or female, age, or cultivation level, because even Saints could break the record of Foundation Building Tier. In any case, the Galaxy Network would suppress cultivation level. This was the power of the Ancestral King, and even Saints had to adhere to it. After experiencing eternity, every record should be unbreakable. Being able to break any one of them would be enough to shake the whole universe, but now, three of such top prodigies actually came out in one go?","Ling Han’s interest was suddenly piqued. He wanted to fight with these three people to see who was the number one elite of the Foundation Building Tier. Unfortunately, he was presently borrowing a connection device. Furthermore, even if he wanted to break records, he would use a code name, and did not want to become the target of all.","-Even Emperor-level forces would probably recruit prodigies that could break records, right? Then, if he encountered someone more overbearing, and if they were rejected, they would move to erase him. Wasn’t that just causing trouble for himself?","Thus, Ling Han definitely had to get a connection device that belonged to him first.","He returned the connecting device, and on the second day, returned to the Imperial Capital, so that Tang Yun’er could make a trip to buy a connecting device for him.","“Huh? Ugly, you also know of the connector?” The little girl licked the toffee and said, “Unfortunately, I’m still young, and my cultivation level isn’t high enough. My Spiritual Power isn’t strong enough, so I can’t use the connection device.”","Ling Han’s expression darkened, “When did I become Ugly? “Compared to Sister LuanXing, you’re naturally ugly!” Tang Yun’er said confidently. “Sigh, how can someone as ugly as you be worthy of Sister Luan Xing? If I were you, I’d knock myself to death to avoid tainting Sister Luan Xing.”","“Cut the crap and run errands for me,” Ling Han said in irritation. At first, he had still felt slightly apologetic, asking the little girl to run around for a few months, but now, he could only feel irritated and tempted to slap this little girl’s behind.","“I’m not going! I’m going to accompany Big Sister!” the little loli said with a humph. She wasn’t afraid of Ling Han.","“Go immediately.” The empress’s soft voice rang out.","“Yes, Big Sister.” The little loli immediately stood up, and could not be more obedient","In order to intimidate these rascals, the empress had to be the one to do it. You see, even the seven babies were very obedient towards the empress. Of course, they were even more familiar with Hu Niu. After all, they were on the same “age” level.","Ling Han was worried, so he had the Second Baby follow Tang Yun’er. In any case, the babies didn’t need to cultivate anyways, so they didn’t need to worry about wasting time traveling through the galaxy.","He returned to the entrance of the Mystery Realm, and continued to wait for the Mystery Realm to open.","With every passing day, Ling Han would concoct an additional cauldron of Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pills. After a few days, he also had a considerable amount of stock on hand. Considering his poverty, he asked Ling Han to help him sell off a few.","One pill for ten Dao Stones, and would be immediately sold out once it was taken out, making Ling Han feel rueful. Rare items were still best displayed through the auction method.","In these few days, he had become an esteemed guest of the extraterrestrial visitors. Every day, there would be people inviting him to the banquet, and they had only one purpose, and that was when the Mystery Realm opened, they hoped that Ling Han could join their team.","Ling Han wasn’t interested in forming a team with anyone. He politely declined, but expressed that after entering into the Mystery Realm, he could cooperate if he had the chance. He didn’t go all out on his words.","The assassination of Ling Han was not carried out, because the five great Spirit Transformation Tier elites had all spoken, forbidding a bloody battle from taking place here. Killing people was naturally even more forbidden. At present, no one dared to commit a crime openly.","However, once the Mystery Realm opened, the situation would be different. Even the Spiritual Transformation True Lords wouldn’t be able to control it. Ling Han was completely unconcerned about this.","In a battle of equal cultivation levels, who would be killing whom? In any case, the one who would die would definitely not be him.","He did not mind using this chance to pretend to be a pig to eat a tiger, and instead, make a fortune out of it."]},{"number":3706,"title":"Chapter 3706: Moon Occult Mystery Realm opens","paragraphs":["Chapter 3706: Moon Occult Mystery Realm opens","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","However, those extraterrestrial prodigies had paid an exorbitant price to come here, and that was not for the sake of doing business. They just happened to have some treasures that they had no use for, and could use this opportunity to trade.","Thus, after a few days, the marketplace became quiet. There were many people walking around, and few people selling. Later, almost all of them were just looking around.","Lin Xiu also closed his stall. He planned to sell the medicinal ingredients to Ling Han, because he had seen Ling Han’s prodigious talent in alchemy. Though the latter presently could only concoct one kind of alchemical pill, the future prospects were definitely boundless, and they could work together on a long -term basis.","Most importantly, Lin Xiu also believed in Ling Han’s character.","The Moon Occult Mystery Realm didn’t open for a long time, but those who should come had already arrived, and they were all waiting nearby. Some people didn’t have much patience, fighting and causing trouble every day. Thankfully, they still didn’t dare to kill people due to the intimidation from the Spirit Transformation True Lords.","Just when Ling Han thought that he would wait until Tang Yun’er returned, the Moon Occult Mystery Realm suddenly opened.","Without the slightest sign, moonlight gushed out, like a spring.","Everyone ran out one after another to take a look, and saw that the place where the pillar of light had shot out previously was already enveloped by endless moonlight. Occasionally, it would surge out towards the surroundings, which was both magnificent and grand.","“The Moon Occult Mystery Realm has opened!”","Xiu, a figure flew over, standing proudly in the skies, exuding a powerful aura.","The Nine Spirits True Lord!","Xiu, xiu, xiu! More figures flew over, but there were pitifully few people that could stand quietly in the skies. This required the cultivation level of Celestial Sea Planet, at least, and among the natives of the Celestial Sea Planet, only Chen Fengyan met the standards. The others all came from the prison.","The problem was, no matter how big the prison was, how many people could there be?","Thus, there were only a few hundred people standing in the sky at this moment. Compared to the other planets, where tens of thousands would appear at the drop of a hat, this number was naturally pitifully small.","No wonder those extraterrestrial visitors looked down on the Celestial Sea Planet. In terms of abilities, the Celestial Sea Planet was as weak as could be. “Work hard, go on.”","Don t retreat in the face of difficulties. You have to advance bravely.”","Those elites all began to instruct their heirs. Very few people said that they had to be more careful, but rather encouraged them to take risks.","For the sake of obtaining the inheritance of the Saint, wasn’t that natural?","At this time, in order to make the best use of their time, everyone entered into the area that was enshrouded by the moonlight.","Ling Han carried the Sixth Baby in his arms, and also headed there. Meanwhile, Princess Bixiao followed closely behind him.","He could clearly feel that there were a great many people’s eyes focused on him. Some were very obscure, while there were some that did not hide their killing intent at all.","These people might not take a thousand Dao Stones to heart, but wasn’t snatching treasures and killing people in a Mystery Realm a matter of course? Thus, they would eliminate a competitor and earn some Dao Stones while they were at it, so why not?","After all, this time, there were still no prodigies on the level of Dao Child and Holy Daughter. Even if they were the key heirs of major sects, the cultivation resources they could obtain were still limited. A thousand Dao Stones was relatively a considerable amount of wealth.","As for why no prodigies on the level of Dao Child and Holy Daughter had come, was it because those great sects were actually not optimistic that they would be able to gain anything?","True, this Mystery Realm had existed for tens of thousands of years. In the past, there must have been true prodigies that had come here before, and none of them had passed the test. As time passed, those great sects could no longer be bothered to let the top prodigies come here to waste their time.","Thus, these inferior prodigies replaced them. It was fine even if they couldn’t obtain the inheritance of the Saint. At the very least, they could still gain some experience.","Was that really the case?","Ling Han thought internally, yet his steps did not slow down in the slightest. In the ancient site, he was not afraid of anyone targeting him. Worse come to worst, he would just get into a fight.","Speaking of fighting, who would he be afraid of among his peers?","When Ling Han entered into the moonlight, a mysterious power surged, extraordinarily majestic.","“En, this is the power of Transfer!”","At present, Ling Han was deeply versed in formation techniques. Though the number of formations he could lay out was limited, he already had no lack of understanding of formation techniques, so it was naturally not the slightest bit difficult for him to judge the type of formation technique.","This Mystery Realmdefinitely isn’t underground. In fact, it’s not actually on the Celestial Sea Planet, but rather on the fragments of the ancient Celestial Sea Planet.”","Ling Han took a few more steps, and the moonlight that filled the skies had already disappeared. A desolate plain appeared ahead of him, and when he raised his head, the galaxy was different.","“As expected, this is definitely not Celestial Sea Planet. Otherwise, there would not have been such a massive deviation in the position of the stars.”","“Yi, where is this?” Princess Bixiao also walked in. She looked at the skies in surprise.","“We should have already left Celestial Sea Planet,” Ling Han said in a solemn voice.","Princess Bixiao frowned, and said, “If this is in the galaxy, why hasn’t anyone discovered it all these years?”","This was a problem. Though the galaxy was colossal, after innumerable years, those galactic scout ships that explored for mineral ore and medicinal planets would have discovered this place, right?","Perhaps it’s the doing of a Saint.” Ling Han pondered for a moment, before saying, “From the outside, perhaps this is a shattered meteorite.”","All right then.” Princess Bixiao nodded, reluctantly agreeing with Ling Han’s deduction.","Those who entered this space definitely didn’t all appear here. Ling Han remembered clearly that the person walking in front of him was a middle-aged man in black, but when he walked out, that person had disappeared.","It was absolutely impossible that the other’s speed was so fast that he had already ran off. Ling Han trusted his own eyesight. In this little bit of time, the other would not be able to escape from the limits of his vision.","Hence, there was only one possibility. Though there was only one “door” through which one could enter, in the process of teleportation, it was possible that everyone would be randomly assigned to any corner.","For Princess Bixiao to be able to follow behind him, this could only be considered very coincidental.","“Let’s go.”","Ling Han said in excitement. The previous generations of prodigies had been unable to obtain the inheritance of the Saint, but this didn’t mean that he couldn’t.","He was the man who had obtained the Origin Gold!","“Now that I think about it, if Wu Qingxu could leave behind some inheritance, then wouldn’t I not have to work so hard?” Ling Han thought. This Saint probably worshipped the Great Emperor Wu Ya too much, and thought that in front of the Great Emperor Wu Ya, those inheritances of his would be completely useless, so he simply followed him to the afterlife.","Sigh, 1 wouldn’t have minded.","Ling Han’s expression was filled with gloom. Being able to become a Saint, he was practically the strongest existence in the world. He must have obtained countless treasures in his lifetime. Just a few of them would allow him to work a few hundred or a few thousand years less.","“Ling Han, someone wants me to take your life!” A slightly childish voice suddenly rang out from behind him.","Yi, who was this? He felt like he was showing off.","Ling Han turned around, only to see a youth of 15 or 16 years old standing behind him. This youth was still wet behind the ears, and his face was filled with childishness.","This young man’s name was Zhuang Bufan. He came from an extraordinary background, and his older brother was one of the few prodigies. Since childhood, he had seen his older brother show off everywhere, and this had left an inerasable impression in his young heart.","Young people naturally liked to imitate those they admired. Thus, the tone of his voice was completely the same as his elder brother’s.","It was very pretentious, and very much in need of a beating."]},{"number":3707,"title":"Chapter 3707: Taking in an underling","paragraphs":["Chapter 3707: Taking in an underling","Translator: Henyee Translations I Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han smiled at Zhuang Bufan, and said, “Children shouldn’t learn to speak like adults. Hurry up and go home.”","Zhuang Bufan was enraged. What he hated the most was others calling him childish.","“Don’t underestimate me!” he shouted loudly.","“Suddenly raising your voice is usually because you’ve been hit where it hurts, so you fly into a rage out of humiliation,” Ling Han said slowly. When it came to verbal attacks, he was naturally incredibly sharp. He had trained with the large black dog.","Zhuang Bufan’s face instantly flushed red. “I’m already sixteen years old, not a child! I’m not!”","“Fine, fine, fine. If you say you’re not, then you’re not. Come, Sixth Baby, give him a piece of candy. Take it and hurry home,” Ling Han said.","‘F*ckyou!’","Zhuang Bufan looked at the toffee that Sixth Baby handed over, his eyes practically spitting fire.","Previously, he had put on a very high airs, and the moment he appeared, he said, “Someone wants me to take your life”, which was filled with a pretentious air but who would have expected that Ling Han would not play by the rules? He did not ask who wanted him to make a move, and did not exchange blows with him in exasperation. Instead, he teased him like he was a child.","Now, he was about to explode in fury.","No, he couldn’ t hold himself back any longer.","Xiu, he charged out, and shot out a punch.","Sixth Baby giggled, and also leaped out of Ling Han’s arms, greeting Zhuang","Bufan.","Was a child worthy of fighting with him?","Zhuang Bufan humphed, and with a casual wave of his hand, he was just about to sweep Sixth Baby aside.","In this palm strike, he was very measured in his movements, and his power was very gentle.","However, when his palm struck out, he was shocked, and suddenly came to his senses. The entry conditions here were Foundation Building Tier cultivators.","Thus, this baby was a Foundation Building Tier cultivator!","F***, a Foundation Building Tier cultivator that was only two to three years old, what the heck was that?","However, it was already too late for him to change his move. Sixth Baby was surging over with terrifying power, as if she could destroy a planet.","She was born with a Divine Physique, and her battle prowess far surpassed that of ordinary Human Dao Foundation.","Thankfully, Sixth Baby was more proficient in stealth and penetration, and not in strengthening her attacks. If it was Eldest Baby, then once this freakishly violent maniac showed her might, her destructive power would be several times stronger.","Peng! The attack landed, and Zhuang Bufan screamed in pain as he was sent flying.","Sixth Baby clapped her hands, turned her head and smiled, saying childishly,","“Done and dealt with.”","Ling Han nodded, “Let’s go.”","This Zhuang Bufan could only be considered a child. Furthermore, when he had faced off against Sixth Baby just now, he had deliberately used gentle force. For the sake of this, he had no intention of killing him.","“Stop right there!” Zhuang Bufan jumped up, “I was only careless just now! He would not yield. Previously, it was only because he had seen that Sixth Baby was too small, so he hadn’t even used 1% of his strength. He had really lost unjustly.","“You wet-behind-the-ears brat, are you asking for a beating?” Sixth Baby pointed at Zhuang Bufan and said, “Aren’t you afraid of being struck by lightning for showing off so much?”","A muscle twitched in Zhuang Bufan’s cheek. Ling Han had a toxic tongue, and","this little girl was not outdone either.","Sure enough, they were both from the same family.","With a shake of his right hand, a long sword appeared. Weng, the sword trembled slightly, and its whole body glowed. Vein-like patterns shone, exuding a terrifying intimidation.","“You really want to play?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“Come fight me!” Zhuang Bufan shouted loudly. “If you can take ten moves from me, I won’t kill you.”","“Sure,” Ling Han said. With a single step, he had already appeared before","Zhuang Bufan.","So fast!","Zhuang Bufan was internally shocked. He had not even managed to catch sight of Ling Han. This speed was really too fast. However, his reaction speed was not slow either. Immediately, he brandished his sword and stabbed out at Ling Han.","The Celestial Tool showed its might, and multiple seals circulated.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and spread open his right hand. Then, he retracted his hand, and he had already taken all the Sword Qi into his palm.","“You’re seeking death!” Zhuang Bufan said with a cold chuckle. Boom! The seals in his Sword Qi exploded, unleashing its full might.","However, he immediately discovered to his shock that the energy exploded in Ling Han’s hands, but it couldn’t break through the latter’s control at all. F***, what kind of hand was that? Was it forged from Divine Metal? “How is it?” Ling Han spread open his hand. He had completely dispersed this flash of Sword Qi.","Zhuang Bufan was rendered speechless. Was this the gulf between their abilities? This was far too great!","“I am no match for you,” he said honestly, his face filled with disappointment. Previously, his opinion of himself had been too high. Thus, when he saw that there was such a wide gap between himself and Ling Han, he was naturally extremely disappointed.","Ling Han patted his shoulder and said, “It’s only natural that you’re no match forme.”","“Could it be that you’re a Heavenly Dao Foundation cultivator, or even an Ultimate Dao Foundation Building cultivator?” Zhuang Bufan’s eyes lit up. He had just entered the Foundation Building Tier, so it was naturally very normal for him to be no match for a Heavenly Dao Foundation prodigy.","“No, I just entered the Foundation Building Tier,” Ling Han said seriously. Zhuang Bufan instantly felt hurt. They had both just broken through to the Foundation Building Tier, but the gap in strength was actually so wide, which meant just how far was the gap in talent between the two of them?","You call this comforting?","“lam invincible among my peers, so there is no need for you to take it to heart,” Ling Han continued.","Zhuang Bufan glanced at Ling Han, and felt frustrated.","‘You’re the expert of showing off! Who dares to say that they re invincible among their peers?’","“In a battle of equal cultivation levels, you will definitely be no match for my brother!” he said forcefully, as if he too wanted to make himself believe it firmly.","“Oh?” Ling Han smiled sheepishly.","“My older brother is ranked 88,000th in the Galaxy Network Tournament!” Zhuang Bufan declared proudly.","Pu!","Ling Han couldn’t help but splutter with laughter. It is 88,000th, so what was there to be proud of?","However, his smile quickly disappeared, because Zhuang Bufan was presently looking at him plaintively.","“This is indeed very extraordinary,” Princess Bixiao interjected, “The Galaxy Network Tournament includes practically all the cultivators in the entire universe. Those that can make it into the leaderboard are all super geniuses that have surpassed an entire galaxy.”","“That’s right!” Zhuang Bufan felt like he had finally met someone who understood him. “Don’t think that my older brother’s ranking is low. Though he is ranked in the 80,000s, in the Centaur Galaxy, he is still a top-notch existence, and is also ranked the highest in our Bright Foundation Planet.” Ling Han gave an ‘oh’, and asked, “Your brother is in the Foundation Building Tier?”","“Humph, my older brother is only twenty-nine years old this year, and is already a Cauldron Forging Tier elite!” Zhuang Bufan declared proudly. Ling Han smacked him on the back of the head, and said, “You’re just a child. Don’t speak in such an old-fashioned manner.”","Zhuang Bufan clutched his head, and looked towards Princess Bixiao. He hoped that this beautiful big sister could deal with Ling Han, so that he would not always treat him like a child.","Unfortunately, how could Princess Bixiao possibly help him?","“Cauldron Forging Tier... then I can’t fight at the same cultivation level. However, when I connect to the Galaxy Network in the future, I can spar with him,” Ling Han murmured to himself.","“You are definitely no match for my brother.” Zhuang Bufan had a kind of blind admiration for his own brother.","“What’s your brother’s name? In future, I’ll go up and challenge him to a battle,” Ling Han said with a smile.","” Zhuang Feif an!”","Ling Han couldn’t help but glance at him. “I’ve discovered that your clansmen are all quite shameless.?”","One was Feifan, while the other was Bufan. This was practically extraordinary. “You’re the shameless one!” Zhuang Bufan shouted loudly. He naturally had to defend the pride of his clan.","“Come, become my underling,” Ling Han suddenly thought."]},{"number":3708,"title":"Chapter 3708: Ancient battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 3708: Ancient battlefield","Translator: Henyee Translations . Editor: Henyee Translations","Though Zhuang Bufan’s name exuded a strong air of posturing, to be able to become a Foundation Building cultivator at sixteen years old, his talent was indeed not just for show.","Of course, he couldn’t compare to the seven babies. They had grown from a gourd vine.","“I don’t want to be your underling!” Zhuang Bufan objected loudly.","“Heh, you’ll definitely agree,” Ling Han said with a chuckle. There was a hint of evil in his eyes.","“You, what do you want to do?” Zhuang Bufan’s heart clenched.","Ling Han broke into a smile, sunny and harmonious, “lam going to hang you from a tree, take off your pants and spank your behind.”","Zhuang Bufan’s breathing instantly stopped. This was too vicious; how could he treat him like this?","“How about it?” Ling Han patted Zhuang Bufan’s shoulder, “Are you going to be my lackey or not?”","“... I will,” Zhuang Bufan forced out through gritted teeth. If he was really to be beaten naked, he would really go crazy.","“Then what should you call me?” Ling Han patiently coaxed.","“Boss,” Zhuang Bufan whispered.","“What?”","“Boss!” This time, his voice was much louder.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “I was just joking with you just now. How could an upright person like me possibly do something like hang someone from a tree, take off his pants, and spank his behind?”","When these words fell, Princess Bixiao, Sixth Baby, and Zhuang Bufan all complained at the same time.","You can do it, definitely.","Ling Han blinked his eyes. Since when had his credibility become so poor that","even a kid like Sixth Baby would complain about him?","Forget it, who cares.","Ling Han had taken in a lackey, so he was in a good mood. He borrowed Zhuang Bufan’s connection device, but was unable to connect to the Galaxy Network.","“There is no network in the Mystery Realm,” Zhuang Bufan explained, but there was mockery in his tone.","Ling Han patted his shoulder and said, “Come, say it again.","Zhuang Bufan felt a sharp pain in his shoulder, and he hurriedly said, “Boss, the Mystery Realm doesn’t have a network.”","These words were much more respectful.","Ling Han nodded in satisfaction and tossed the connection device back to Zhuang Bufan. Since the Galaxy Network couldn’t be used, it would be impossible for them to quickly communicate with each other. They would have to return to the most primitive state of communication.","It had to be either face to face, or fire a signal bomb or something of the sort.","The distance could not possibly be too far.","“However, a great many people have come. Not only is there no shortage of elites, a great many people have also joined forces, but after entering, it is highly possible that they have all separated. By the looks of it, the difficulty level of gathering back together is very high.”","“My cultivation level is too low, after all. If I were to face a three-star or even four-star genius of Ultimate Dao Foundation, unless I use the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, it would be very difficult to match.”","“Furthermore, if there are too many of such opponents, I would also be having","a headache.”","“Now, while these people have not reunited, we have to either quickly find the inheritance of the Saint, or defeat them one by one. We can’t drag things out too long.”","Ling Han suddenly thought in his heart.","The four of them walked for a while, but this place was astonishingly huge. Furthermore, it was a boundless desolate plain, and there was no end in sight.","Ling Han thus decided to move separately. They would first scout out various directions, and then return to meet up.","The four of them headed in different directions, and very soon, they each disappeared into the horizon.","Ling Han didn’t care whether Zhuang Bufan returned or not. In any case, he had only taken him as a lackey on a whim.","He flew on his Tool. There was no suppression from the power of heaven and earth here, so flying was no problem.","Ling Han didn’t fly forward. Instead, he flew toward the sky.","After flying for about an hour, he realized that he could not ascend further. -A large golden net had appeared in the skies, stopping him from advancing further, and what formed this large net were multiple golden threads. Upon a closer look, these golden threads were covered with mysterious patterns.","This was a Saint’s formation?","The people inside couldn’t go out, and from the outside, did it look like this planet fragment didn’t exist in the first place?","Ling Han was extremely curious. However, how could he see through the formation of a Saint? After studying it for a while, he couldn’t make heads or tails of it at all, so he could only descend.","Walking forwards, after about half a day’s time, a change finally appeared in the desolate plain.","Was this... an ancient battlefield?","Ling Han saw many corpses ahead of him, as well as damaged Battle Armors, weapons, and flags, rising and falling continuously. The scale of the battle at that time was definitely astonishing.","He was not the first person to arrive here. There were already a considerable number of people who had entered into the area of the ancient battlefield ahead of him, and were presently rummaging through the weapons and Battle Armor. However, too much time had passed, and even these Battle Armors and weapons were tattered. Furthermore, they were not the first people here. If there really was anything valuable, would it have been left for them?","“Ling Han?” Someone turned around, and when they saw him, they couldn t help but sneer. “Although I don’t think much of that bounty, since you’ve delivered yourself to my doorstep, I don’t mind earning some extra income. This was a middle-aged man with a sturdy build, looking down on Ling Han from the corners of his eyes.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Since you want to die, I will oblige you.”","Did they all think that he was an easy target to bully?","“You are nothing more than a minor character from a backward planet. You can be dealt with in a single move.” The other charged over, raising his hand to strike down at the top of Ling Han’s head.","Ling Han merely stretched out a hand, and grabbed onto the other’s wrist.","What!","The middle-aged man revealed an expression of shock, and hurriedly struggled with all his might, but his wrist seemed to have taken root in Ling Han s hand, and did not move in the slightest.","“I’ve always been a very amicable person. If you people don’t come to make trouble for me, I can’t be bothered to bully you either,” Ling Han said. He didn’t look at the middle-aged man, but rather swept his gaze over the others in the ancient battlefield. “However, this doesn’t mean that I won’t kill people!” Boom, the Heavenly Dao Flames instantly enveloped the middle-aged man. “Ah—” The middle-aged man screamed tragically, but it was only an instant, and he was soundless, burnt to nothing by the fiery flames.","A considerable number of people showed expressions of fear. For the majority, 1000 Dao Stones could also be considered a small sum of money. If it was just something casual, no one would mind lending a helping hand. However, if this could possibly endanger their lives, then no one would be willing.","As it turned out, Ling Han was not only a prodigious Formation Master. His own strength was also astonishingly strong.","It was best not to trifle with them.","However, there were those who were wary, and there were naturally those who were unconcerned.","“He’s just a brat who has just advanced into the Foundation Building Tier! A blue-robed middle-aged man strode over. He actually had fish gills at the side of his mouth, appearing extremely strange.","Obviously, his original form should be some kind of fish, or shrimp or crab. His form was not complete enough, and that was why he still had gills.","“I’ve disliked you for a long time. However, you’ve been hiding in the Imperial Capital all this while, and now that you’re no longer protected by Chen Fengyan, killing you will be as easy as the turn of a palm!” the blue-robed middle-aged man said in a baleful voice. He launched a palm strike at Ling Han.","Ling Han brandished his fists in response. Peng! The two bursts of power reverberated, instantly sweeping up a great many wreckages in the vicinity. White bones danced wildly, and broken blades flew in unison.","In this exchange, the two of them were evenly matched.","“Extraordinary as expected. A mere Human Dao Foundation can actually match the power of a peak stage Ultimate Dao Foundation!” The blue-robed middle- aged man sneered, “Unfortunately, I am not a Foundation Building Tier cultivator, but rather a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator!”","He attacked again."]},{"number":3709,"title":"Chapter 3709: Kill one as a warning to a hundred others","paragraphs":["Chapter 3709: Kill one as a warning to a hundred others","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The blue-robed middle-aged man charged over, and once again stretched out a hand to deliver a palm strike at Ling Han. Boom, this time, multiple golden patterns appeared in the force, and there was an aura that surpassed Foundation Building Tier.","He was at the Cauldron Forging Tier.","Though this place suppressed cultivation level, when a Cauldron Forging Tier was here, the power he could unleash was only Foundation Building Tier peak stage. However, Cauldron Forging Tier was still Cauldron Forging Tier, after all, so it still had some advantages. For example, he could use the Celestial Cauldron that he had formed inside his body.","This aura was the Celestial Cauldron showing its might, forming an aura that surpassed the Foundation Building Tier, and could effectively suppress the Foundation Building Tier.","If this aura were in the outside world, 90% of the Foundation Building Tier cultivators would lose their battle prowess once they unleashed this aura. This was the suppression of the level of being. It was like a wolf that had encountered a tiger, and could only tremble in fear.","This place suppressed cultivation level, so the might of the Celestial Cauldron wasn’t as great. However, it still had a certain amount of deterrence power against Foundation Building cultivators. At the very least, it could reduce the battle prowess of Foundation Building cultivators by 20-30%.","This was also why the middle-aged man in blue dared to attack Ling Han.","Ling Han nodded, and said, “You’re from the prison, right?”","As he spoke, he replied with a punch of his own. His aura was steady, and was completely unaffected by the Celestial Cauldron.","Just how terrifying was the foundation stone of the Celestial Path that he had built? Even the heavens would unleash their might to erase it, so how could it possibly be suppressed by a mere Celestial Cauldron?","It could be said that while a Saint’s aura could easily kill Ling Han, but even if the Great Emperor appeared, Ling Han still wouldn’t yield.","That was because his Celestial Foundation was incredibly sturdy, and no one could hope to shake it.","Boom!","The two of them exchanged blows again, and it was still a tie.","The blue-robed middle-aged man revealed an expression of confusion and shock. Ling Han was actually unaffected by his Celestial Cauldron, and his battle prowess hadn’t weakened in the slightest?","It was too strange.","The Celestial Cauldron’s pressure on Human Dao Foundation was the greatest, followed by the Heavenly Dao Foundation, and if it was an Ultimate Dao Foundation, the effects would be very small.","But no matter how small it was, it would still have an effect. How could it possibly be like how Ling Han was completely unscathed?","He forcefully suppressed his shock, and said calmly, “That’s right. I come from the prison, and in my eyes, you’re nothing but trash. If it weren’t for Chen Fengyan protecting you, would you dare to strut around in front of us?” “You’re wearing some rare treasure, aren’t you? You’re actually unaffected by the Celestial Cauldron!” he couldn’t help but ask.","When these words were said, the people in the ancient battlefield all looked tempted.","A rare treasure that could resist the Celestial Cauldron’s oppressive might? That was really too practical.","To say nothing of this place, if they encountered a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator after they left, that would be equivalent to having an additional chance of escaping. That was because the moment the Celestial Cauldron appeared, it would directly suppress the essence of life. Foundation Building Tier cultivators might feel their knees go weak, and not even be able to think of running for their lives.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t say that this was because his celestial foundation was based on the ancient Celestial Gate, which even the heavens envied, so it was naturally awesome.","“I’ll send you on your way!” he said solemnly. His figure charged out, and the Demonic Monkey Fists was unleashed. His fists were wrapped with the Heavenly Dao Flames, and with the combined attacks of 108 overlapping layers of power, just how terrifying was the power of this combination punch?","Boom, boom, boom, punch after punch, incinerating the heavens and obliterating the earth.","The blue-robed middle-aged man’s advantage was all in the Celestial Cauldron, but the suppression of his cultivation level was completely ineffective. In truth, he was no different from an ordinary Ultimate Dao Foundation. Under Ling Han’s powerful suppression, his disadvantage was extremely great.","In this perilous situation, he felt extreme regret. If he had known earlier, he wouldn’t have jumped out.","“Do you regret it now?” Ling Han asked calmly. “Unfortunately, it’s too late!”","Faced with such ridicule, the middle-aged man in blue couldn’t help but blush. However, his life was in danger, so how could he still care about his pride? He hurriedly said, “Stop! Stop! I’ll immediately surrender to the Dark North Nation. You can’t kill me!”","Ling Han sneered, “Unfortunately, I am not the Department Chief of the Foreign Affairs Department of the Dark North Nation now. I am just an ordinary adventurer. Whoever wants to kill me, I will destroy them. Even if the Heavenly King comes, it would be useless!”","He attacked aggressively, and in just a few moves, the blue-robed middle-aged man was blasted into smithereens.","Seeing this scene, everyone shook their heads. Presumably, even if the man in blue died, he would be filled with regret, right? If it was in the outside world, it would only be a matter of a single thought for him to kill Ling Han, but now, he had been killed by Ling Han instead.","Adventuring in the Mystery Realm was just that dangerous. Those with higher cultivation levels could also die in the hands of those with lower cultivation levels.","Ling Han swept an eye over the surrounding people, and asked, “Who else wants my head?”","Everyone acted as if they had not heard him, and went off to do their own things. If they nodded, that would be equivalent to making an enemy of Ling Han. That was definitely not allowed, but if they shook their heads, that would be equivalent to bowing their heads to Ling Han. They could not bring themselves to do so, so they could only pretend that they had not heard anything.","Ling Han walked in the ancient battlefield. The sunlight was clearly dazzling, but because there were bones all over the ground, it gave off a sinister feeling.","He also looked at the Battle Armors and weapons, and shook his head. They were all in tatters, and could not be used at all.","Continuing onwards, Ling Han wanted to see what lay at the end of this ancient battlefield.","He quickened his pace, yet gave a muffled humph, and immediately stopped.","Ling Han lowered his head to take a look. There were a few more rips on his clothes. Those had been torn open by the air after he had just sped up.","How could the air possess such terrifying destructive power?","As Ling Han walked, he secretly experienced it, and enlightenment rose up in his heart. It was not the sharpness of the air, but rather that there was a kind of killing intent in the air. If one rubbed against it intensely, it would cause a very great destructive effect.","He activated the Starlight Screen and slowly sped up. However, he was only able to reach double the speed of sound, and he had already reached his limit. It was as if there were countless invisible blades in the air, and in an instant, the Starlight Screen was torn apart.","Ling Han slowed down slightly. The Starlight Screen’s energy consumption was coincidentally equal to his rate of recovery, so he was able to maintain the effects of the Starlight Screen at all times.","Soon, the sun set in the west, and the sky began to darken.","It was unknown which corner of the galaxy this was. Though the sun could be seen, the moon did not exist. Thus, when the sun had disappeared from the horizon, the whole world had instantly become dark, with only stars scattered here and there, exuding a faint brilliance.","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han suddenly stopped in his tracks. He could sense a strange aura.","However, the surroundings were completely silent, so how could there be anything strange?","Ling Han trusted his instincts very much. He activated his eye technique and looked around again.","After advancing into Celestial Path, his eye technique had also improved astonishingly, being able to see through all illusions, and see through the fine details, immediately discovering what was strange.","In the heaven and earth, multiple auras rose, like smoke.","Ka, a soft sound rang out. If Ling Han hadn’t been completely focused, it was very likely that he wouldn’t have heard it, and even if he had heard it, he might have directly overlooked it.","But now, he activated his eye technique and looked in that direction.","A shocking scene appeared. A corpse was slowly getting up. It had one leg broken, but it was still supported by a rusted saber. It stood up with its other leg. Weng, two balls of dark flames popped up in its eye sockets.","Er, he had to be seeing things."]},{"number":3710,"title":"Chapter 3710: Bloody battle of corpses","paragraphs":["Chapter 3710: Bloody battle of corpses","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","A corpse that had been dead for who knew how many years suddenly stood up again.","Was it haunted? Or was there an indescribable power supporting this place, allowing the dead to rise again?","Ling Han preferred the latter option. He didn’t sense any spiritual fluctuation, so this wreckage should have crawled up under the influence of some kind of power.","Ka, ka, ka! The sounds were endless, and countless corpses were crawling up on their own. Some were even wearing tattered Battle Armors, and green flames were flickering in their eye sockets.","These corpses all set their eyes on Ling Han, and pointed the weapons in their hands at him. Their killing intent blazed, as if it was solid.","Boom, not too far away, the ground split apart, and a rider appeared. Beneath him was a skeletal warhorse that was as tall as nine meters, and this rider was not much better off either. All that was left of him was bone, though there was still a part of his body that was wrapped in the damaged armour.","But even so, this skeletal knight was still exuding a powerful aura. The fierce aura seemed to have solidified, and entwined around the battle spear in his hands. It was as if even if the heavens came down on him, he would still be able to pierce through with a single spear strike.","“Charge!” This skeleton rider released a cold voice, and instantly, the army of corpses rushed towards Ling Han.","Ling Han unleashed a murderous aura, yet it was completely ineffective. These Corpse Soldiers were all inanimate objects, and had no souls. They could move completely because they were being controlled by an unknown power. Thus, the barrage of murderous aura was naturally ineffective against them.","Then let’s switch tactics.","“An!” Ling Han shouted, and the Six Characters Bright King Curse was activated.","The Buddhist chant was vast and mighty, but it still did not have the slightest effect.","This confirmed Ling Han’s thoughts. Though the army of corpses looked frightening, they were not vengeful ghosts, so the Buddhist chant was also ineffective against them.","Boom, the army of corpses charged over, and a dense wave of Saber Qi and","Sword Qi shot over.","Ling Han activated his Starlight Screen. Peng, peng, peng! The shockwaves were all blocked.","However, with such a barrage of attacks, the Starlight Screen was more or less exhausted. It only needed another casual attack, and it would definitely shatter.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t sit still and wait for death. No matter how confident he was, he couldn’t possibly stay where he was like an idiot and be bombarded by so many corpses. In that case, no matter how strong he was, he would still be blasted into smithereens.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! He used his movement technique and leaped out of the encirclement. However, there were corpses everywhere here. No matter where Ling Han ran, all he could do was battle.","Then let’s battle.","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and attacked in quick succession. The Demonic Monkey Fists was activated, and he was incredibly powerful.","These army of corpses all possessed the strength to build foundations of human Dao. The might of their combined attacks was incredibly frightening, but their defenses were considerably weak. Even if they were only scraped by the aftermath of Ling Han’s punch, their bones still flew, and they immediately fell apart.","Boom, his present strength was incomparably frightening. As he shot out a punch, the force of his punch could reach as far as three hundred meters, yet still maintain a powerful destructive power. With a single punch, a large area would be emptied out ahead of him.","He was extraordinarily fierce and domineering, his battle prowess terrifying, and the army of corpses was superior in numbers. It was as if there was no end to it, as they endlessly charged over.","These skeleton soldiers had no emotions, knew no pain, and only knew to battle. This made them terrifying killing machines. More importantly, there were too many of them.","Just how big was this ancient battlefield?","They were all corpses, and now all of them had gotten back to their feet. There was no end in sight. How long would he have to continue fighting?","If it was another person, they would definitely be fighting and retreating at the same time, wanting to leave this ancient battlefield, because there was a limit to a man’s power.","However, Ling Han didn’t retreat.","In terms of power alone, he could only rival those at the peak stage of the Ultimate Dao Foundation, but in terms of the reserves of mystical power, he could completely challenge the Spirit Transformation True Lord or even Sect Master. It couldn’t be helped. Who asked him to have innumerable dimensions inside his body that had all become his Mystery Realms?","Fight, fight, fight.","Hong, hong, hong! Ever since Ling Han had advanced into Celestial Path, he had never battled to his heart’s content like this, which made him feel very pleased.","In truth, he was completely capable of summoning the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. This was the embryonic form of an Imperial Weapon, and the strength of the defense of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower would probably need the combined attacks of several Ultimate Dao Foundations to be able to break through it. The attacks of Human Dao Foundation were completely negligible.","But now, Ling Han only wanted to battle, and wanted to use his fists to pacify everything.","If he could avoid relying on external power, then he should avoid relying on external power. This was the same even if it was his own Spirit Tool.","The intensity of this battle was extremely high. If it was another Foundation Building cultivator, even if it was the Ultimate Dao Foundation cultivator, he would be exhausted after two to three hours, at most. However, this did not apply at all to Ling Han. He had endless power, and was completely capable of battling at this kind of intensity for a few months.","Of course, it was one thing for the mystical power to last, but one also had to take into account the limits of the body’s burden. A few months was too much, but a few days was no problem at all.","After a night of hard fighting, at dawn, the first ray of sunlight appeared, illuminating the ground.","instantly, the corpses that had just been incredibly fierce seemed to have lost their motivation all of a sudden. They all fell to the ground, and became dead again.","It was dawn.","Ling Han looked at the dazzling sunlight, thinking that these corpses should only move at night, but what was the meaning of their existence?","Yi?","He was startled, and saw a streak of light enshroud him. Then, it left a mark on his wrist, and disappeared with a flash.","Why did they all like to do this?","Ling Han touched his wrist; he had been given a stamp again. Was this very fun? They might as well directly give him some benefits, such as allowing his cultivation level to leap greatly. This was the practical thing.","He sat down in a cross-legged position, planning to cultivate, but he immediately discovered that this power of heaven and earth was extraordinarily weak. It was not enough to support his cultivation at all. It could only help him recover mystical power.","This was because... the ground beneath their feet was not a planet, but only a shard of a planet. Could it only be considered a larger meteorite?","Ling Han still ingested an Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill. Since he couldn’t rely on the power of heaven and earth, he could only rely on the alchemical pill.","He used the Great Sun Lotus Technique to stimulate the medicinal effects, and the effects of the Silver Dragon Fish were also taking effect. Thus, even without the help of the power of heaven and earth, Ling Han’s cultivation level was also rapidly improving, and his Human Dao Foundation Stone was becoming stronger and stronger.","In the beginning, this was only the size of a soybean, but now, it was already slightly larger than a human head.","This could be considered a Spiritual Power Spirit Tool. It could shrink in size, but its weight was extremely light. Thus, even if it was used for attack, the effects were completely incomparable to a Spiritual Power Spirit Tool. Ordinarily, the limit of the foundation stone of Human Dao was the size of a manhole cover. Going by this calculation, Ling Han would probably be able to reach the end of Human Dao Foundation after cultivating for a few more months.","However, he wasn’t an ordinary Foundation Building Tier cultivator. Thus, it was unknown to what extent his Human Dao Foundation Stone could reach.","He thought for a moment, then decided to retreat first, and meet up with Sixth Baby, Princess Bixiao, and Zhuang Bufan. Then, he would return here, and continue to challenge this ancient battlefield."]},{"number":3711,"title":"Chapter 3711: Top 290,000 on the Galaxy Network","paragraphs":["Chapter 3711: Top 290,000 on the Galaxy Network","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han returned to the place where he had split up with Princess Bixiao and","Sixth Baby. Not long after, he saw Princess Bixiao and Sixth Baby appear, but Princess Bixiao wasn’t alone. Instead, there was an imposing-looking young man beside her.","Yi?","“Who are you?” Without waiting for Ling Han to begin, the young man shouted at Ling Han, his tone extremely harsh, filled with animosity towards Ling Han.","Ling Han immediately understood. That person had encountered Princess Bixiao when she had been travelling alone. He had probably been astounded by her divine beauty, and had thus followed Princess Bixiao all this while. Now that he had seen her having a “secret rendezvous” with a man like him, he was naturally burning with jealousy.","“None of your business,” he stated calmly.","“Oh, I know. You’re the guy who has a bounty placed on your head. Your name is Ling something.” The young man very quickly recognized Ling Han’s identity. He humphed, “I don’t want to kill a nameless pawn like you, and others will think that I covet that tiny bit of Dao Stones. Get lost!”","“Shameless!” Sixth Baby said in a sweet voice. “Father, beat him up. Beat him so hard that even his mother doesn’t recognize him.”","Sigh, even Sixth Baby had become so violent.","Ling Han turned his head, and said seriously, “How many times have I taught","you? We have to convince others with virtue!”","Princess Bixiao couldn’t help but ridicule in her mind. ‘You’re using virtue to convince others? You couldn’t be more violent. 1","The young man was enraged by Ling Han and Sixth Baby’s exchange, and he balefully said, “How dare you! You actually dare to act insolent in front of me, Zhan Hong! Do you know who I am?”","Ling Han smiled, “I do. Didn’t you say it yourself, that your name is Zhan Hong?”","That, that’s right.","Zhan Hong was taken aback, but he kept feeling like something was off?","“Did your parents call you Zhan Hong because they wanted you to make a name for yourself?” Sixth Baby asked?. “However, names are usually the opposite of the future. For example, if someone’s name is Changsheng, they usually won’t live forever, but rather die early.?”","This damn child, how could she speak like this?","Then if my name was Zhan Hong, then wouldn’t I achieve nothing at all?","Zhan Hong’s eyes were baleful, and he said darkly, There is no benefit in saying such words in front of me! For the sake of Lady Bixiao, I will be lenient, so get lost immediately!”","Ling Han smiled as he looked at Princess Bixiao, asking, “Do you know this idiot?”","Princess Bixiao spread her hands and said, “He’s the one who’s been following me all this while. I can’t get rid of him no matter what.”","This was also a clarification for Ling Han. ‘I have absolutely no intention of flirting with him.’","“B@stard!” Zhan Hong roared loudly, and charged towards Ling Han. He obviously did not have the simple idea of just giving Ling Han a good thrashing, instead, he had the intention of killing Ling Han. A blood-coloured long saber appeared in his hand, and he slashed out at Ling Han.","Shua, Saber Qi swept out unhindered, turning into a shrill rainbow, incredibly thick and long.","Ling Han activated the Celestial Crossing Finger and tapped out.","Peng!","The force of the finger collided with the Saber Qi, yet it was completely unable to block the Saber Qi, and was forcibly shattered. Furthermore, the Saber Qi still majestically slashed over, as if even if there was a Divine Metal fortress in front of it, it could still be broken through with a single strike.","A disdainful smile spread across Zhan Hong’s face. Just how powerful was he?","How could he be matched by a nameless nobody like Ling Han?","Peng, the Saber Qi struck, creating a brilliant light, as well as a great explosion of energy.","He was a dead man.","Zhan Hong thought. Even with such strength, he still dared to be insolent in front of him. He really did not know where his confidence came from.","However, when the energy surged out, he revealed an astounded expression, because Ling Han just happened to be standing there unscathed, and there was starlight flickering on his body, turning into something like a bell.","He didn’t die? Not only did he not die, he was completely unscathed.","Was that starlight activated by some kind of cultivation technique that Ling","Han had channelled, or was it activated by a precious tool?","Zhan Hong immediately regained his composure. So what if he had blocked a saber strike from him? It could only be said that the other’s strength could still be considered passable.","“That’s right. Being able to block a strike from me, you can be considered an elite among those in the Foundation Building Tier,” he said proudly, “I am ranked 290,000 th in the Galaxy Network Tournament, ranked in the top three of the younger generation of Linyang Planet.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, “Ranked over 200,000, and you still dare to call yourself an elite?”","Are you an idiot!","Zhan Hong shook his head, “Truly an ignorant native from a backward place! You have absolutely no idea how colossal the whole galaxy is, and how many cultivators there are. Foundation Building Tier is the first tier of the Celestial Path, so naturally, they have the most numbers.","“I might as well give you a general introduction. The total number of Foundation Building Tiers is about ten billion. As long as you can rank in the top one million, you would be a one in ten thousand prodigy!” “just how many Foundation Building Tier cultivators are there on a planet? No more than 100,000.”","Hence, though he was ranked in the 200,000s, on some planet, this result would be enough to squeeze into the top three, and he could be considered a prodigy among prodigies.","Ling Han sighed, and looked at him with pity, “I didn’t realize that you were ? also a chatterbox. I didn’t askyou, and you just spouted a bunch of nonsense.” Zhan Hong’s mouth was half-gaping. Are you a f****** idiot?","Didn’t you hear my commentary? I am an existence ranked in the top 200,000 in the universe. On some planet, that would be a super genius ranked in the top three. Who would not feel deep veneration or be scared out of their wits when they heard this?","You actually call me a chatterbox?","He had lost all patience, and once again brandished his saber as he charged out. This time, he was going to crush Ling Han into dust.","Ling Han smiled calmly, and used the Demonic Monkey Fists. Instantly, it was as if they had returned to the primitive era. A Demonic Monkey appeared, wanting to pierce a hole into the skies.","Peng!","His fist was enshrouded in the Heavenly Dao Flames, and he greeted the saber’s blade, using his bare fists to take on the Spirit Tool head-on.","“You’re seeking death!” Zhan Hong smirked coldly. Even if your battle prowess is higher than mine, using your physical body to clash head-on with a Spirit Tool was still an incredibly stupid move.","However, he immediately paled, because when the saber’s blade struck his fist, there was actually no splash of blood. Instead, an incredibly deep power assaulted him, penetrating directly into his body, as if it wanted to shatter his internal organs.","What was even more frightening was the fact that a scorching flame was also burning over. In front of this flame, his mystical power defense was completely useless.","He hurriedly retreated, but it was already too late. The flames had melted his protective shield, and the power of Ling Han’s punch was endlessly surging over, causing direct damage to him.","“Wa!” He opened his mouth, and spat out a mouthful of blood, but before it had even landed on the ground, it had already turned into steam, and evaporated completely.","Hiss, he had already dodged fast enough. He had only suffered a little bit of the power of the flames, and it actually still had such terrifying might?","“This is the battle prowess of the top three of that whatever planet?” Ling Han’s expression was filled with disappointment.","Though it was just a simple sentence, for Zhan Hong, these words were like knives, stabbing directly into his heart, causing blood to flow.","Damn it, damn it!","He stared at Ling Han, “Then come and experience my Blood Demon Saber!” “Three seals, fully open!” He shot out three consecutive fingers at the sanguine saber in his hand. Boom, instantly, this originally very ordinary sanguine saber immediately shone with a sanguine light, soaring into the skies. A frightening murderous aura spread out like a tidal wave."]},{"number":3712,"title":"Chapter 3712: Emperor of Tools","paragraphs":["Chapter 3712: Emperor of Tools","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The blood saber’s seal was fully opened, and the murderous aura surged, soaring straight into the clouds.","A haughty expression appeared on Zhan Hong’s face. This was a precious tool that had been passed down through the generations of the Zhan Clan. Though its grade was not high, the most outstanding members of the Zhan Clan of every generation would use it, beheading their enemies and the blade drinking the blood of their enemies.","After countless years of slaughter, this saber had consumed who knew how many people’s blood, which had also formed an endless murderous aura.","Usually, it would be sealed to prevent the murderous aura from seeping out. It looked very ordinary, but once the seal was removed, this would be the strongest weapon within Foundation Building Tier.","However, after opening the seal, the murderous aura would disperse, and this was something that could not be helped.","Zhan Hong felt a bit of pity, but also a bit of pride. He was the most outstanding heir of this generation of the Zhan Clan, and that was why he was qualified to use the Blood Demon Saber.","“Being able to force me to open the Blood Demon Saber’s seal, you would die without regrets.”","He did not waste any time, and immediately charged towards Ling Han. Boom, the murderous aura circulated, and even if Princess Bixiao was not facing him directly, her pretty face was still pale, and it was as if her heart was being pulled by a large, cold hand, making her feel incredibly terrible.","Even she was like this, so what about Ling Han?","Princess Bixiao couldn’t help but feel anxious. Concern would cause confusion, and her slender hand couldn’t help but clench into a fist, extremely nervous. Yet Ling Han did not take it to heart at all. His willpower was incredibly firm, and his Celestial Foundation was also incredibly sturdy. Only he was qualified to intimidate others, so how could others possibly affect him?","Hong, hong, hong! However, the might of the Blood Demon Saber was really not to be underestimated. As the saber slashed over, blood shadows surged, incredibly terrifying.","The murderous aura of this kind of Blood Demon Saber increased the sharpness of the saber, and even Ling Han did not dare to use his bare fists to parry the saber’s blade. He could only avoid a head-on confrontation.","“Hahaha, die! Die!” Zhan Hong laughed wildly.","Now that the Blood Demon Saber’s seal had been unlocked, not only did the murderous aura suppress his opponent, even he himself would be affected. It was hard to say now whether he was controlling the Blood Demon Saber, or the Blood Demon Saber was controlling him.","Ling Han humphed. He had a considerable number of ways to defeat Zhan Hong.","For example, if he used the technique of setting up formations with steps, added with the help of formations, he had full confidence that he could suppress his opponent.","For example, he could summon the Heavenly Dao Flames and directly burn his opponent to death.","This was a flame that even Saints would frown at. How easy would it be to burn a mere Foundation Building cultivator to death? However, he would exhaust a whole floor with a single use, and Ling Han only had eight chances left to use it, so he was naturally unwilling to waste it on Zhan Hong.","Another method would be if he used the Imminent Skyline, then used the Heavenly Dao Flames and Destructive Energy to attack a weak point, he could also succeed, though this would take a little bit of time.","Ling Han set all these plans aside. The other had a precious tool, so how could it be that he didn’t have one?","Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, out!","Weng, this precious treasure appeared, and floated above Ling Han’s head. Multiple flashes of Primal Chaos aura descended, and lightning flickered. This time, the precious tool did not keep a low profile, exuding a supreme aura.","The aura emanating from the Blood Demon Saber was immediately suppressed, continuously shrinking the area of murderous aura surging out. Finally, it actually retreated completely back into the saber’s blade.","F***, hat was going on here?","Zhan Hong was transfixed with shock. It was as if he had just started peeing, when he suddenly encountered a peerless elite walking in front of him, scaring him to the point that he sucked his pee back in.","But that was the Blood Demon Saber, which had drunk endless blood. In the first place, it was an existence with a murderous aura soaring sky-high, and it was actually afraid?","This, this, this, this was unimaginable!","That precious tower... the atmosphere was too shocking. What kind of aura was that? It was dripping down in shreds, yet felt heavier than even a planet, and that lightning; he felt that if one was struck by it, even he could only be shattered into pieces.","“What kind of treasure is this?” Zhan Hong stared at the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower with greed in his eyes.","“A dead man, where does he get so much curiosity?” Ling Han charged over, his fists firing out rapidly.","Zhan Hong hurriedly brandished his saber to parry, but the Blood Demon Saber in his hand was restrained, and he could not release the slightest bit of might. Furthermore, when the saber’s blade struck the Primal Chaos Qi, it could not penetrate it at all. Just how heavy was that existence?","Zi, zi, zi! Multiple bolts of lightning shot out from the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, dazzling and blinding.","This was a future Imperial Weapon. Even if its might was only at the level of the Foundation Building Tier, it was still an overlord of Foundation Building Tier. Multiple bolts of lightning shot out, and it was not something that Zhan Hong could dodge at all. Instantly, he screamed in pain from being electrocuted, and the aroma of meat quickly wafted out.","“Yo, it’s a little burnt.” Ling Han was still teasing.","Zhan Hong was both furious and anxious. He, a dignified prodigy, was actually going to be killed by someone?","However, though he still had a great many secret techniques that he had yet to use, the Blood Demon Saber was his strongest trump card. Even this was already suppressed by Ling Han, so what was the use of using other techniques? If they continued fighting, he would definitely die.","An expression of heartache appeared on his face, but he still took out a talisman paper without hesitation, and slapped it onto his body.","This was the Ten Thousand Mile Escape Talisman, which could instantly send him thousands of miles away. It was his life-saving trump card.","“Want to flee?” Ling Han’s eyes were sharp, and he humphed. Boom, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower spun lightly, and multiple flashes of Primal Chaos Qi instantly pressed down on Zhan Hong.","Ka, the sound of bones cracking was immediately heard from Zhan Hong’s body. His whole person shrank, and then with a bang, sprawled out on the ground.","The true Primal Chaos Qi was as heavy as a planet, and now, because of Ling Han’s cultivation level, it was unable to reach such a terrifying extent. However, it was still not something that a Foundation Building cultivator could contend against, at least Zhan Hong could not.","“Ah—” Zhan Hong screamed tragically, all the bones in his body were still crackling. This pressure was too terrifying, causing his internal organs to feel a strong pressure, and it was possible that they would explode into mush at any moment.","Ling Han easily confiscated the Ten Thousand Mile Escape Talisman and Blood Demon Saber. He couldn’t help but smile and say, “Don’t you know that I’m a famous thief?”","There should still be legends about him among those who participated in the Metal Element Fruit Gathering, right?","Of course, everyone thought that the masked man was Niu Jianhua.","“I admit defeat,” Zhan Hong said through gritted teeth. This was a great humiliation to him. He was a young prodigy ranked in the top three of Linyang Planet, and he had actually lost so terribly.","“All right, then just accept your fate.” Ling Han threw a punch. Peng, Zhan Hong’s head exploded. The Heavenly Dao Flames curled up, and Zhan Hong’s corpse was also instantly burned to ashes.","Zhan Hong would definitely die with remaining grievances. 1 1 have already admitted defeat, so why are you still so ruthless?’","Ling Han naturally would not leave any future troubles. Towards this kind of person that wanted to kill him, what need was there for him to be polite? In any case, this was a Mystery Realm, so even if he died, he could only resign himself to his fate.","“When it gets dark, if Zhuang Bufan still hasn’t come, we won’t wait for him,” Ling Han said.","Princess Bixiao and Sixth Baby recounted their experiences—after walking a long way ahead, they entered an ancient battlefield, and at night, those corpses came back to life, launching attacks at them.","Princess Bixiao charged back at the first instant, and with Sixth Baby’s unique attributes, she could directly enter into the Void and wouldn’t be attacked at all. If it weren’t for the fact that they agreed to meet back in one day, she could completely advance easily."]},{"number":3713,"title":"Chapter 3713: Formation versus Skeleton Soldiers","paragraphs":["Chapter 3713: Formation versus Skeleton Soldiers","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","Three different directions, and they had all set foot on the ancient battlefield? Ling Han could only conclude that their current location was within the ancient battlefield. It was just that there were no corpses in this area.","“Forget about it. Well just find a random direction and continue onwards,” he said very irresponsibly.","“What an unreliable father.” Sixth Baby shrugged, looking very helpless. They waited until night fell, but still did not see Zhuang Bufan return.","“Hehe, Father, looks like your little lackey has run away!” Sixth Elder laughed at Ling Han.","Ling Han rubbed his nose. It was rare that he wanted to take in a lackey. Logically speaking, with a tremor from his powerful body and the exuding of a domineering aura, shouldn’t he be able to instantly make others prostrate themselves in admiration?","The next time he saw that brat, he would definitely beat him into a pig’s head. “Let’s go.”","They set out, and after walking for a few hours, they arrived at the border of the ancient battlefield.","At this time, all the corpses had already stood up, but within the range of Ling Han and his group’s vision, no cultivator had entered. These corpses were all standing blankly, as if they were statues.","But when Ling Han and his group approached, these corpses seemed to have become excited. They all turned their heads, and looked towards the three of them.","What was it? Were the three of them very special?","Thankfully, the army of corpses was strictly restricted within the ancient battlefield, and could not possibly escape.","“How do I get out of here?”","These damn things are all around us, surrounding us.”","“Though we can pass through by day, there is only half a day’s time. With the size of this battlefield, there is no way to pass through at all.”","“I’ve seen the information left behind by predecessors, and weneed to travel three days at least to be able to pass through this area.”","“Three days! In other words, we have to hold on for at least two nights, and be ganged up on by these skeleton soldiers.”","“How is this possible?”","“I can’t even last ten minutes.”","There were quite a number of people in the surroundings, and they all looked disappointed.","They had come with enthusiasm and full of confidence, but in the end they had not even managed to take the first step, and were already defeated. How could they not feel dejected?","“Why don’t we join forces to barge in?”","“All right, the more the merrier.”","“Who knows, we would have to work together to be able to pass.”","Someone suggested joining forces, which gained the agreement of the others.","A small-scale alliance was soon formed.","Initially, some people had already formed teams with others outside, but after entering this place, they were teleported to different places. Thus, they could only temporarily form another team.","“Ling Han, join us.” Someone came to find Ling Han.","He had a tone of charity. If it was not for the fact that Ling Han was a","Formation Master, he wouldn’t even bother to invite someone from a backward place.","Who knows, he may not be able to help in any way, and would only be a burden.","Ling Han shook his head, “No need. I like to move alone.”","That person was startled. He had not thought that Ling Han would actually refuse, and couldn’t help but show a hint of anger in his expression. “I gave you face, yet you still refuse. You really don’t know what’s good for you. Do you think that just because you are a Formation Master, you consider yourself high and important?”","Forget it, forget it. Everyone has their own aspirations!” Another person came over, and he advised the first person.","That person thought for a moment, but did not flare up. After all, there were a great many people recruiting Ling Han in this place, and there were some that he really could not afford to offend.","Aside from Ling Han and the others, the others had all formed teams. They wouldn’t charge into the ancient battlefield at this time; wouldn’t that be asking for trouble? However, in order to get used to it, they still barged in and stayed on the fringes.","They mainly wanted to practice their coordination, as well as get used to the strength. If even they could not hold up like this, they would not have to go in tomorrow. Who knows, they may not even be able to charge back, and die inside.","They battled for over half an hour, and very soon, their cooperation was well coordinated. After all, they were all prodigies, so as long as they set aside their arrogance and cooperated sincerely, they would still be very effective Meanwhile, Ling Han and the others rested. Tomorrow, as soon as the sun rose, they would immediately set out.","The night passed, and the sun had just risen.","“Let’s go.” Two groups of people moved out at the same time, entering into the ancient battlefield.","They were heading in the same direction, and in order to travel as much as possible during daytime, they did not stop to eat, but rather rushed on with all their might. However, the killing intent in the ancient battlefield was like blades, and their speed was not very fast. At most, it was only one third to half the speed of sound.","Half a day later, the sun set in the west, and the skies darkened.","When the last corner of the sun disappeared into the horizon, an endless darkness suddenly surged over.","Ka, ka, ka! Those corpses all got back to their feet, dark flames burning in their eye sockets. It was as if they had suddenly entered into the ghostly realm.","“Stop, and prepare for battle.”","Those who had formed teams immediately stopped. They were divided into a total of three groups, and took turns to rest.","Ling Han, Princess Bixiao, and Sixth Baby also stopped, advancing against the attacks of the skeleton soldiers. This was an unwise move.","“What do we do?” Princess Bixiao asked. Actually, she was in favour of forming a team with others. This way, they could share the pressure on the defense, and they could also take turns to rest and reorganize.","“Let nature take its course,” Ling Han said with a smile. As he walked, he set up the formation foundations.","Boom, but the army of skeletons would not give him the chance to calmly set up the formation. They all charged over. Strangely, the majority of the skeleton soldiers actually charged towards them, while the number that charged towards the other group was much lesser.","What, was there any such thing as being biased?","Ling Han was astonished. He continued to set up formations as he threw punches.","Princess Bixiao and Sixth Baby hurriedly helped, battling fiercely with the skeleton army.","Ling Han could see very clearly that the reason why the skeleton army was so “warm” towards them was completely because of Sixth Baby. That was because these skeleton armies had practically ignored Princess Bixiao, and were simply attacking Sixth Baby madly.","He hurriedly said, “Sixth Baby, turn invisible.”","Yes, Father.” Sixth Baby immediately dove into the void.","With her disappearance, the skeletal army instantly returned to normal. The corpses that had initially been sent over rushed towards another group of people.","“F***, what’s going on here?”","“Why have there been more skeleton soldiers?”","“Could it be that the three people on the other side have been completely annihilated?”","The pressure here increased greatly, so they were naturally complaining endlessly.","“Don’t panic. We have already rehearsed it yesterday, and there is absolutely no problem,” a man in red robes said. He had the highest cultivation level in this team, so he was duty-bound to bear the burden of captain.","This person was called Jin Jingtian, and he was a one-star genius of Ultimate","Dao Foundation. His abilities were quite extraordinary.","Everyone nodded, calming themselves down. Following yesterday’s drill, one group rested, while the other group battled.","Once the situation had stabilized, they turned to look in the direction of Ling","Han and the others. These three people should have all died, right? Sigh, it was","a pity about that beautiful girl. She was very uniquely beautiful.","‘Huh? F*ck!’","This glance swept over them, and they were all stunned.","What had they seen?","Ling Han and the others were actually sitting upright, and were just starting a fire to cook rice. Meanwhile, one after another, the skeleton soldiers rushed over, and they were all struck by the light pillars that surged out, exploding in an instant.","The formation was formed!"]},{"number":3714,"title":"Chapter 3714: Shameless","paragraphs":["Chapter 3714: Shameless","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The unique trait of the Skeleton Soldiers was that they were unafraid of death. Their battle prowess was very strong, but their disadvantage was that they were very stubborn, and were especially stupid. They only knew how to attack. In any case, so what if they were destroyed? On the second night, they were still a “good skeleton”.","Additionally, the defenses of these skeleton soldiers were extremely weak, and could be considered trash-level.","This caused them to appear especially dazed and fragile when they encountered a formation. When a pillar of light shot over, they were completely unguarded. Pa, pa, pa, a good number of skeleton soldiers were destroyed by a flash of light.","Ling Han’s formation was capable of shooting out thirty-six pillars of light at the same time, and with a sweep, at least a hundred skull soldiers would be destroyed, which was extraordinarily efficient.","This allowed Ling Han to have time to prepare dinner. Meanwhile, Princess Bixiao’s beautiful figure danced around, and she only needed to destroy some that had slipped through the net. The intensity of this kind of battle was completely within her abilities.","Sixth Baby naturally did not appear. The moment she appeared, she would attract a large number of skeleton soldiers, greatly increasing the burden on them. After all, though the might of the formation was extraordinary, there was also a gap in the sweep of the light pillars, and they would only fire one round every second or so.","Even so, in comparison, the two sides could be said to be on two completely different levels.","Ling Han and the others were extremely relaxed. They actually had the leisure to prepare dinner, and on the other side, it was a tough battle! The remaining people also had to hurry up and take alchemical pills to recover their mystical power, so how could they have the mood and time to do other things?","Was this the effect of a Formation Master?","A considerable number of people felt regret. If they had known earlier, they would have formed a team with Ling Han.","No wonder he was so confident. It wasn’t that he was too proud, but rather that Formation Masters were truly extraordinary.","Actually, Ling Han still had other ways to resist these skeleton soldiers, and that was the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. This future Imperial Weapon only needed to release Primal Chaos Qi, and what corpse would be able to barge through?","However, there were too many outsiders now, so Ling Han naturally wouldn’t expose the secret of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","“Come, let’s eat.” Ling Han had already prepared the food, and called over Sixth Baby and Princess Bixiao.","Sixth Baby immediately appeared. Eating was one of her hobbies.","But the moment Sixth Baby appeared, it immediately drew out the madness of the nearby skeleton soldiers, surging over like a tidal wave.","Princess Bixiao was instantly flustered. Though she was also a one-star genius, she had not advanced into Heavenly Dao Foundation yet, after all.","Ling Han smiled, and casually tapped out a finger. The Celestial Crossing Finger was shot out, and there was some Heavenly Dao Flames imbued within. The destructive power of the finger was astonishing. Pa, pa, pa, it destroyed at least a dozen skeleton soldiers along the way.","“Come eat, don’t worry about it,” he said. His fingers moved, and multiple flashes of energy shot out. No matter how many skeleton soldiers attacked him, he would be able to easily block them.","After all, he still had the help of the formation.","Princess Bixiao also began to eat. For Celestial Path cultivators, eating was not necessary, but if they were constantly assailed by hunger, it would definitely affect their battle prowess.","Seeing how relaxed these three people were, Jin Jingtian and the others felt like they were about to go crazy.","This was too much, wasn’t it? Have you guys come for a camping trip?","“Come, let’s go over,” Jin Jingtian immediately came to a decision.","“That’s right. With the help of formations, we can decrease the pressure by a lot.” The others nodded respectively.","This group of people slowly moved in the direction of Ling Han’s group. Their speed could not be too fast. Once they lost their footing, they would suffer heavy losses.","However, battling a defensive battle against the assault of the skeleton army and facing the assault of the skeleton army head-on were two completely different matters. The difficulty level was completely on two different levels.","Thus, it was difficult for them to advance. After spending close to twenty minutes, they finally charged to the vicinity of Ling Han and his group.","Zi, zi, zi! However, formations didn’t differentiate between human and skeletal soldiers, so barging in naturally meant getting shot.","Those people dispersed in a sorry state, but there were still many of them, after all, so they still forced their way in.","Furthermore, they had shared a portion of the firepower, and the number of skeleton soldiers that managed to charge through the formation also soared all of a sudden.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel furious. These people were really selfish.","“Get out of here,” he shouted, launching an attack at Jin Jingtian and the others.","“Ling Han, you are truly selfish. Faced with such a dangerous obstacle, you are not working together to overcome it, and still want to attack us!” Jin Jingtian took the initiative to attack first, and reprimanded Ling Han.","Everyone nodded. You clearly have the ability to help everyone, and furthermore, you have already set up the formation, so there is no need for you to expend any energy.","This was a win-win situation, so why not?","Too petty, too selfish.","Who exactly was the selfish one here?","What reason did Ling Han have to help these people?","They were completely unrelated. Previously, when he had been setting up the formation, why had he not seen these people step out to help him? Oh, now that he had set up the formation, these people saw that there was a chance for them to take advantage of him, and crowded over one after another, their expressions filled with righteousness.","Pei, could they be even more shameless?","Ling Han humphed and said, “Since you people aren’t getting lost, I’ll kill you until you’re terrified!”","Boom, he used the Three Styles of the God of War. The power of heaven and earth instantly centered around him, surging endlessly towards him. However, this power of heaven and earth could not be used to cultivate, and could only stay in his body for a short while. Then, it was all blasted out.","This was not only a burst of power from him, but also boosted by the power of heaven and earth, so his power was incredibly boundless.","Instantly, figures flew and danced, filling the skies.","“Ahhh!” someone wailed in agony. The skeletal army wouldn’t hold back when they fell into the sea of skeletal soldiers, and they would directly slash them to death with their ice-cold blades.","In this short while, five people had already died.","“Ling Han, you are practically deranged!” Jin Jingtian rebuked angrily.","Ling Han merely smirked coldly. Was it his duty to protect others?","Not at all!","Moreover, this was a contest for treasures in a Mystery Realm, and everyone was fighting over that sliver of fated opportunity. In the first place, they were competitors. He had already clearly stated that they would not be forming a team. If you guys wanted to bask in his glory, and were rejected by him, and still wanted to force your way in, could it be that he should just accept being taken advantage of?","He once again used the second form of the Three Styles of the God of War. A vigorous power swept out. Pa, pa, pa! Instantly, figures were seen flying, like a celestial maiden scattering flowers.","Screams rang out again, and this time, another three people were sent flying and killed by the skeleton soldiers.","“Ling Han, you’ve gone too far!”","“Kill him!”","Everyone’s eyes were bloodshot, as they charged towards Ling Han.","Actually, if they didn’t come, they could completely block the combined attacks of the skeleton soldiers. However, they would also expend a lot of energy, yet they wanted to take advantage of the situation. In the end, they did not manage to take advantage of the situation, but instead caused themselves to suffer heavy losses.","Ling Han’s eyes were cold. These people disgusted him.","“I’m about to die from fury!” Sixth Baby said in a childish voice as she launched an attack at the others.","She was born with a Divine Physique, and her battle prowess was naturally powerful. More importantly, she could enter the Void, and no attack would be able to hit her. This was something that would render one extremely speechless.","Only Princess Bixiao’s abilities were the weakest. She had already put on the Battle Armor to increase her defenses, so as to avoid causing trouble for Ling Han.","However, everyone present was smart, and immediately saw this weakness.","“Capture this woman!” Jin Jingtian commanded.","If they could capture Princess Bixiao, they would be able to threaten Ling Han.."]},{"number":3715,"title":"Chapter 3715: Trump Card fully unleashed","paragraphs":["Chapter 3715: Trump Card fully unleashed","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","“Despicable,” Princess Bixiao said through gritted teeth.","Yet Ling Han’s expression was natural, “This is their nature, and that is how vile they are.” In the Genesis World, he had spent epochs, so he naturally did not lack a deep understanding of the human heart.","What kind of ugly face had he not seen before?","It was fine to just kill them.","As he protected Princess Bixiao, he attacked madly. The Heavenly Dao Flames and Destructive Energy were used in turns. His offensive power was incomparably violent, and no one dared to take it head-on.","The scene was extremely chaotic. At present, there were three parties, Ling Han and his group, as well as Jin Jingtian’s team and the skeleton soldiers. All three parties were presently in an opposing state. However, Ling Han, Jin Jingtian and the others were intelligent, after all. If they encountered danger, they would first give up the battle among themselves, and concentrate on dealing with the skeleton soldiers. Only then would they target each other.","The formation was also showing its might, and pillars of light danced madly, as","if it was creating a dazzling stage.","Time passed continuously, and Jin Jingtian and the others finally couldn’t hold on any longer. They had to face the attacks of Ling Han and the skeletal soldiers at the same time. This was much more dangerous than facing the skeleton soldiers alone.","“Retreat! Retreat! Retreat!”","Jin Jingtian issued a command, and everyone hurriedly retreated out of the formation circle. They re-formed their ranks, blocking the attacks of the skeleton soldiers.","There was lingering fear in their hearts, and they were filled with fear of Ling","Han’s battle prowess.","Who would have thought that a Formation Master would actually possess such terrifying battle prowess, blasting them into submission? Of course, this was also related to the environment. With so many skeleton soldiers joining in on the excitement, they had to divide their united battle prowess considerably.","“When the sun rises, we’ll definitely kill this person,” Jin Jingtian said balefully.","“En!” Everyone nodded. As they saw it, Ling Han was really despicable. He clearly had a formation that could resist the army of corpses, yet forcibly kept them outside, and caused quite a number of them to die.","Who were they?","Which one of them was not an outstanding successor of a great sect or noble clan? Even if they were not the best, they were still one of the very best. A mere native actually dared to screw them over? This naturally could not be tolerated.","Just wait.","The long night finally ended. The first ray of sunlight shone down, and instantly, all the skeleton soldiers lost their power all of a sudden. They all crashed onto the ground.","immediately, Jin Jingtian and the others leaped out, surrounding Ling Han and his group.","“You guys still haven’t learnt your lesson?” Ling Han swept an eye over these people, his killing intent surging.","“Humph, this time, there are no foot soldiers around to help you. Furthermore, we would not be so foolish as to step into the formation.” Jin Jingtian stated calmly. In his eyes, Ling Han’s battle prowess was indeed extraordinary, but the real threat still came from his formation.","Thus, if they didn’t step into the formation, Ling Han’s battle prowess would be halved.","“You guys stay here,” Ling Han said to Princess Bixiao and Sixth Baby as he strode out of the formation.","Yi?","Jin Jingtian and the others faltered upon hearing this. What was going on? Ling Han had actually walked out by himself?","If you were in the formation, then we would still have some reservations, and would only launch long-distance attacks, but if you came out, then what else would we have to be wary about?","“You’re truly seeking death!” Jin Jingtian said balefully.","“Attack together, and kill him!” Everyone was filled with killing intent. Ling Han shook his head, and said, “A bunch of weaklings. I’ll send you on your way to the afterlife, lest you tarnish my eyes.”","“Impudence!” Seeing that Ling Han was getting closer and closer, and had already left the formation far behind, Jin Jingtian’s heart was also becoming more and more certain. In his eyes, Ling Han was already a corpse.","“Charge!” These people all shouted loudly, and charged towards Ling Han. So what if you were a prodigy? There were still more than 30 of them, and there was no shortage of Ultimate Dao Foundation cultivators among them. Each of them could defeat you with a single move.","Jin Jingtian also felt that Ling Han was purely seeking death. No matter how he thought about it, he could not think of any other chance for Ling Han to turn the tables.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and drew out his own cornerstone of the Celestial Path.","En, the cornerstone of the Celestial Path?","Everyone faltered slightly. ‘What do you mean by that?’","Do you think that you are an Ultimate Dao Foundation cultivator, so you can use the cornerstone of the Celestial Path as a deterrent? Too naive. There was no shortage of elites that had attained Ultimate Dao Foundation here.","Weng, a frightening aura spread out, and everyone’s faces turned pale, feeling a strong suffocation.","They couldn’t move anymore. It was as if they were being suppressed by heaven and earth. If they advanced a single step further, it was as if the cornerstone of his Celestial Path would crush them.","What was going on here?","Could it be because of that foundation stone of the Celestial Path?","Everyone stopped. They did not want their foundations of the Celestial Path to shatter for no reason, even if it was only a possibility.","Different, it was really different.","Everyone stared at Ling Han’s celestial foundation stone. The veined patterns were different from their celestial foundation stone, exuding an aura that surpassed the ancients, as if it was eternal.","How could there possibly be such a terrifying cornerstone of the Celestial Path? Ling Han had even taken out the cornerstone of the Celestial Path, so he naturally had the determination to annihilate all of them. Weng, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower also appeared above his head, sending down streaks of Primal Chaos Qi that could suppress the heavens and the earth.","“W-what kind of precious tool is this?”","“My Three Star Whip is trembling, as if I have encountered the empero of all tools.”","“Heavens, first there is the cornerstone of the Celestial Path that has the ability to suppress, and then there is this terrifying precious tower. Who exactly is this brat?”","“A backward land? Pah, a backward land. How could a backward land possibly nurture such a prodigy, and birth such a treasure?","Everyone was astounded. Whether it was Ling Han’s foundation stone of the Celestial Path, or the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, they both made them feel endless fear. This was a suppression from a higher level.","Yet Jin Jingtian humphed, and said, “What are you panicking about? There are over thirty of us here. Furthermore, just think, what if we could obtain this kind of treasure, and form this kind of foundation stone of the Celestial Path? Everyone’s eyes immediately lit up, feeling incredibly greedy.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower could only be obtained by one person, but Ling Han’s foundation stone of the Celestial Path should have been formed by cultivating some kind of secret technique. Then, as long as one cultivated this secret technique, that wouldn’t be too awesome.","Once the cornerstone of the Celestial Path appeared, who could match it?","Jin Jingtian was right. There were more than 30 of them, so they could take this opportunity to capture Ling Han. Otherwise, if it was a one-on-one battle, would they still have a chance of winning?","With this in mind, their fighting spirit soared, and they were completely influenced by greed.","Ling Han shook his head, saying, “You’re already at death’s door, yet you’re still filled with greed. How foolish!”","He strode forwards. The cornerstone of the Celestial Path and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower unleashed their might at the same time. Two types of existences that could be considered paramount were exuding their might at the same time. One was suppressing others, while the other was suppressing tools. Under the double pressure, even if they were limited by his cultivation level and could only unleash the might of Foundation Building Tier, their opponent was only Foundation Building Tier-level as well.","Everyone wore ugly expressions. Most prodigies couldn’t even condense 10% of their battle prowess. Even prodigies like Jin Jingtian could only unleash one- third of their battle prowess at most.","This was practically fatal."]},{"number":3716,"title":"Chapter 3716: Unparalleled battle prowess","paragraphs":["Chapter 3716: Unparalleled battle prowess","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","The supreme cornerstone of the Celestial Path, the Imperial Weapon that would suppress everything in the future, if the two appeared at the same time, just how overwhelming would it be in the Foundation Building Tier?","Everyone trembled, and felt that even breathing was difficult for them. How could they still fight back?","Jin Jingtian roared loudly, and blasted out at Ling Han. He was the coordinator and commander of this temporary alliance, and now, he definitely had to be the first to step out. Otherwise, this team would be done for.","He held a sword in hand, and with a tap of his feet, his figure streaked through the air.","Unfortunately, he was suppressed by Ling Han’s foundation stone of the Celestial Path, and could not even unleash 30% of his full battle prowess. Furthermore, the sword in his hand was also a Spirit Tool. However, it was suppressed by the Imperial Weapon, and similarly did not have any power at all. It could only be considered a tool.","What battle prowess could this kind of Jin Jingtian have?","Ling Han stepped forwards, and shot out both fists in a furious barrage. Peng, peng, peng, peng! In an instant, he had broken through Jin Jingtian’s defenses, and a dozen over punches landed on his body at the same time.","He didn’t even glance at Jin Jingtian, and continued to rush toward the others. Peng! Peng! Peng!","He killed them one by one with a single punch. As the power of his punch surged past, all of them were sent flying. There was no exception.","The first person had not yet landed, when the second person had already flown up. Instantly, figures danced madly in the skies.","At this time, Jin Jingtian slowly turned around, but because of this action, his whole person suddenly disintegrated, turning into a pile of rotten flesh and shattered bones.","—Just now, Ling Han had shot out a dozen over punches consecutively, and his body had already been shattered. However, he was a prodigy that had built Ultimate Dao Foundation, after all, so his aura was extremely enduring. That was why he had not died on the spot, but the moment he moved, he had shattered.","The others were stunned. This was Jin Jingtian, the strongest elite among them, but even the strongest elite had fallen to such a state. Who would still have the courage to fight Ling Han?","The remaining twenty or so people hurriedly turned around and fled, completely losing their courage.","But this was the ancient battlefield; who could run fast enough?","The killing intent in the air was as sharp as blades, capable of easily slicing through skin and tearing through the body.","Xiu, Ling Han went on a killing spree. The aura of Primal Chaos descended. He completely ignored the existence of the killing intent, and could use his speed to the extreme.","After all, this Mystery Realm was only built by a Saint, and could perfectly suppress most people. However, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was the embryonic form of the Imperial Weapon. It was naturally more than enough to protect one person.","Otherwise, if the Imperial Weapon really came, and shook lightly, this Mystery Realm would probably collapse.","One side could only exert one-third of, or at maximum, half of the speed of sound, while the other side could reach twenty times the speed of sound, so who would be able to flee?","The terrible screams did not cease. Ling Han’s battle prowess was fully unleashed. On his left fist was Heavenly Dao Flames, and on his right fist was Destructive Energy. He did not have a deep grasp of these two high-level energies, and could only stimulate a sliver of them, but a sliver of their might was already terrifying enough.","With this punch, his opponent would either be incinerated into ashes, or be completely annihilated. There was no one that needed him to follow up with another punch.","Princess Bixiao was dumbfounded with shock. Was Ling Han really a Human Dao Foundation cultivator?","No, no, no. Even if it was the Ultimate Dao Foundation, could he be as strong as this?","Freak, monster, supreme prodigy, any kind of compliment could be heaped on Ling Han. There was definitely not the slightest bit of exaggeration.","In just five to six minutes, more than 30 people were completely annihilated.","Only then did Ling Han put away the foundation stone of the Celestial Path and the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and began to plunder the treasures on these people.","He had already killed them, so how could it be that it would be wasted?","Unfortunately, the connection device was tied to the soul. Even if he took it, he would only be able to browse through the Galaxy Network, but would not be able to complete the transaction, and participate in the tournament battles, and such core elements.","“Father, you’re so awesome!” Sixth Baby praised.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Of course.”","This was very arrogant, but Princess Bixiao instead felt that Ling Han was being modest. If this kind of battle merit was known to others, it should be able to shake the universe.","“You’re probably invincible in the Foundation Building Tier!” she said with emotion.","Ling Han shookhis head, “It’s not that exaggerated. If I used all my trump cards, it should be no problem for me to match a four-star genius of Ultimate Dao Foundation. However, if a five-star genius of Ultimate Dao Foundation came, or two, or three four-star geniuses that have achieved Ultimate Dao Foundation, I probably wouldn’t be able to hold up either.”","After all, whether it was him or the Primal ChaosExtreme Lightning Tower, they were still only at the level of Human Dao Foundation.","Princess Bixiao was speechless. This show-off was really high-profile enough.","“Let’s go.”","They hurriedly set off. If they did not rush in the day, they would only be able to fight a tough battle at night, and could not possibly advance any further.","A day passed, and the sky instantly darkened.","Needless to say, all the corpses stood up at practically the same time.","Now that they had reached this place, aside from the ordinary skeleton soldiers, there were also many more of those skeleton riders. They all rode on tall skeletal horses, and pointed at Ling Han and his group. Wu, an ancient battle drum sounded, and a deep horn sounded in the skies.","All the skeleton soldiers moved, launching an attack towards Ling Han and his group.","Since the might of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower had already been exposed, Ling Han might as well not hide it any longer. He summoned it and floated it above his head, sending down streaks of Primal Chaos Qi, while multiple bolts of lightning struck out repeatedly.","Pa, pa, pa! The power of lightning was terrifying. When it landed on the skeleton soldiers, they directly exploded into pieces. It was probably impossible to put them back together tomorrow.","As expected of the Imperial Weapon. Even if it was only in its infancy, its destructive power was still impressive.","There was no need for Ling Han and the others to have any kind of defense. The aura of Primal Chaos descended, and was not something that could be penetrated by any skeleton soldier at all.","According to Ling Han’s estimation, if one wanted to break through the defenses of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower at this stage, they would have to be a four-star genius of Ultimate Dao Foundation, at least. This was also what Ling Han had said before. If he used his trump cards fully, he would be able to battle this kind of super elite.”","In the case of the skeleton soldiers, no matter how many there were, they were useless. The aura of Primal Chaos was continuously seeping out, and there was absolutely no need to worry that it would be weakened before being destroyed. Hong! Hong! Hong!","Heavy footsteps were heard, like thunder. Ling Han looked over, and saw that a skeletal knight was presently charging towards them. The hooves of the skeletal horse landed, releasing a world-shaking sound.","Just how heavy was this man and horse? They had actually caused an earthquake-like sound.","In an instant, the skeletal rider had already rushed in front of Ling Han and the others. Then, he brandished the battle spear in his hands, stabbing towards Sixth Baby.","Peng!","The battle spear arrived, and its power was extraordinarily great, yet it was completely unable to do anything to the defenses of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Under the massive rebound of power, the skeletal knight was instead thrown off its feet, and both man and horse fell heavily onto the ground.","A skull rolled out. That was the fall of the skeletal knight, and its head had directly been knocked off.","However, that headless body very quickly walked towards the skull, picked it up, and placed it on his neck.","“Pu!” Sixth Baby instantly laughed loudly. That was because the skull knight had installed its head the wrong way round, but it immediately twisted its neck 180 degrees. All right.","Ling Han was curious. Why would the army of corpses here target Sixth Baby like this?","She was just a child; was there any need to be so filled with killing intent?"]},{"number":3717,"title":"Chapter 3717: Confirming a conjecture","paragraphs":["Chapter 3717: Confirming a conjecture","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","Though it was completely ineffective, the army of corpses was still barraging them wave after wave, completely lacking the adaptability of intelligent creatures.","This was because they did not have much intelligence in the first place, and had only managed to crawl up under a mysterious power. It would be more appropriate to call them marionettes.","However, though it was safe and there was no need to worry, Ling Han did not dare to advance at this time. It was one matter if he could block them, but to advance while bearing the barrage of countless skeleton soldiers was’another matter.","Rest for a while. We’ll set out tomorrow morning,” Ling Han said.","The night passed, and when the sun rose, the three of them immediately advanced.","Ling Han discovered that there was no mark on his hand.","Previously, after his first bloody battle for a night, he had been stamped by something unknown here, but whether it was yesterday or today, he had not been stamped with a second stamp.","Was it that he only needed to be stamped once, or that he had not managed to survive the night with his own battle prowess, so it did not count?","When day was about to pass, a massive canyon appeared ahead of them.","The three of them adjusted their course, and headed towards the canyon’s entrance. However, they still hadn’t reached the canyon’s entrance even when the sun had set.","The army of corpses had come again.","With a thought from Ling Han, he enshrouded the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower over Princess Bixiao and Sixth Baby. Meanwhile, he charged into the army of corpses, brandished his fists, and massacred them to his heart’s content.","He wanted to give it a try to see if he would be able to get another stamp in this way.","When Princess Bixiao saw this, she was rendered speechless.","What could she say?","However, Ling Han’s battle prowess was truly freakish. She wouldn’t be able to hold on for long under such a siege. Thankfully, she hadn’t gone too deep at the time, and she had worn the Battle Armor, allowing her to escape.","But looking at Ling Han, he was very much at ease.","Moreover, wouldn’t this guy’s mystical power be exhausted? How long had he been fighting for? Could it be that this guy wanted to fight like this for an entire night?","There was no benefit to be gained at all, so why did he have to do it?","A long night passed, and the moment the sun appeared, all the corpse armies collapsed onto the ground.","Er, there was no stamp.","Ling Han sighed. Looks like this mark would only be struck once.","He went to ask Princess Bixiao and Sixth Baby, but neither of them had any experience of being “stamped”.","Yi, then his judgement was still a bit correct. This stamp could only be stamped on those who had battled alone for a night. Take note that it was battle, and not hiding for a night like Sixth Baby.","“This seal... should have some effect,” Ling Han murmured.","The three of them continued to advance. This time, they only spent two hours, and they had already arrived at the entrance to the canyon.","This canyon was colossal, and the entrance was also astonishing. The width of the canyon was as much as 100 km.","“Yi, why aren’t you coming?” Princess Bixiao turned around to look at Ling Han.? s","Ling Han shook his head and said, “We’re not advancing today.”","“Why?” Princess Bixiao was confused.","“I have a conjecture to verify,” he said with a smile.","Sixth Baby naturally would not have any objections. Princess Bixiao also had blind confidence in Ling Han, and actually did not ask what Ling Han wanted to verify, and just let him be.","Since he was free anyways, Ling Han stood outside to observe this canyon.","This canyon should have an extremely ancient history. The mountain walls were mottled, and weathered very severely.","But if one thought that it could not even withstand a single blow, that would be a grave mistake.","Ling Han tried to attack, but the mountain wall didn’t move at all.","He used the Heavenly Dao Flames, but only left behind a slight charred mark. With a rub, it was gone.","If he switched to Destructive Energy, it would finally be effective. The mountain wall had been slightly scraped off.","There really was only a slight scrape.","Ling Han nodded. From this, it could also be seen that the level of Destruction Energy should be higher than the level of the Heavenly Dao Flames.","This was because Ling Han had only comprehended one of the seals of the Heavenly Dao Flames, and though the Destructive Energy was also incomplete, there was at least a scroll of the Spirit Diagram.","If they were both complete versions, Ling Han did not think that the Heavenly Dao Flames would be weaker than the Destructive Energy. Both should be the highest grade of energy.","-Having stolen this Spirit Diagram from the Primordial True Lord, the latter’s heart was probably bleeding.","Sigh, he really wanted to ask him where he had gotten this Spirit Diagram from Who knows, he might be able to get some clues, and obtain the complete Spirit Diagram, thereby grasping the true Destructive Energy.","Perhaps in the future, there would be a chance. If he went to seek out","Primordial True Lord now, that would only be courting death.","This valley had clearly been strengthened by the Ancient Sun Saint. Otherwise how could ordinary mountain rocks withstand the barrage of attacks from Foundation Building Tier cultivators? They didn’t need to use any high-level energy at all.","Princess Bixiao brought Sixth Baby into the canyon for a walk. However, if they really encountered enemies, it would probably be Sixth Baby protecting’ Princess Bixiao.","Ling Han gave Princess Bixiao the Void Beast hide. In this place, even if he wasn’t invincible, he was still one of those with the strongest battle prowess. There was no need for him to use the Void Beast hide to conceal himself.","He sat cross-legged here, adjusting his condition. After all, it had been a day’s journey, and there was expenditure of mystical power. If he continued to extract the power of heaven and earth, he could still replenish some of it even though it was slow.","Not long after, a team walked out of the ancient battlefield. Everyone looked very disheveled. After battling continuously for two nights, it was already very difficult for them to walk out, so they couldn’t have too high a demand.","After all, there was only one Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and in the case of Formation Masters, Ling Han was probably the only one.","“Yi, Ling Han?” When the team saw Ling Han, they all exclaimed in surprise.","Ling Han was actually quite famous now. Previously, he had been invited by a great many people, and enjoyed boundless glory.","“So fast, why has he already appeared here?” someone asked curiously.","“That’s right. We haven’t wasted any time at all, and that’s why we barely made it here.”","“Is he alone?”","“This person is even faster than us. This is too terrifying.”","“But that’s wrong. As long as one can bear the barrage of the army of corpses,","one person would definitely move faster.”","“That’s true.”","“The problem is, can he really withstand the barrage of the army of corpses all by himself?”","“A Formation Master is that powerful?”","Everyone was stunned. This had refreshed their worldview. Could it be that one Formation Master was comparable to so many of them working together?","A young girl walked over, and asked Ling Han, “Brother Ling, how did you get here?” She took advantage of the fact that she was female, and had a sweet appearance, so she could play cute with Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “We’ll set up a formation tonight, so we can naturally sleep in peace.”","F***, this show-off.","Everyone was speechless. You can do that? You can even sleep?","The heavens were truly pitiful. All of them had been fighting so hard that their arms were about to break. They had just barely managed to make it out alive. In comparison, how could they not be envious, jealous, and hateful?","“Then why is Brother Ling still sitting here?” the young girl asked again, looking very innocent and naive.","Ling Han glanced at her, and said, “I’m tired so I’m resting.”","Who would believe that? Didn’t you say that you would sleep at night? Then how could you possibly be tired during daytime?"]},{"number":3718,"title":"Chapter 3718: Meeting Hou Qingbai again","paragraphs":["Chapter 3718: Meeting Hou Qingbai again","Translator: Henyee Translations | Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone had a mindset of blind obedience. When everyone saw that Ling Han was staying here and not leaving, they all thought that there was some kind of treasure here, or that he had found some clue about the inheritance of the Saint, so they all began to search outside the canyon.","But no matter how hard they tried, they did not discover anything.","In truth, there was indeed nothing here.","After a while, this team finally left reluctantly.","When night fell, Princess Bixiao returned with Sixth Baby. Not far away, the army of corpses on the ancient battlefield stood up again.","Ling Han released a battle cry, and charged in.","Princess Bixiao’s mouth was slightly agape. ‘This is what you want to verify?’","She didn’t even have the energy to complain anymore. If Ling Han walked out now, she would definitely touch his forehead. Had he developed a high fever, that even his brain was muddled?","Speechless, she was really speechless.","Ling Han didn’t use any external power, and he simply continued to battle with his fists. Peng, peng, peng! His battle prowess was astounding, and each punch sent at least a dozen skeleton soldiers flying. Bones rained down.","A long night passed, and the army of corpses collapsed at the same time.","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. He had guessed correctly, because he could feel that the power of heaven and earth had given him another stamp.","Could this be related to obtaining the inheritance of the Saint?","Throughout these countless years, there must have been a great many prodigies that had come here, and there was no shortage of supremely talented people among them. Perhaps, they may not be as freakish as Ling Han, but there were definitely seeds that could become Saints.","Why hadn’t any of them obtained the inheritance of the Saint?","This signified that this wasn’t simply a matter of natural talent. Rather, it signified that they did not match the criteria of choice of the Ancient Sun Saint. Thus Ling Han thought that merely having high natural talent was useless. Perhaps, it would be the same for any Great Emperor who entered when he was young. He would still have to return in disappointment.","This “stamp” was very possibly a key point.","“Can we leave now?” Princess Bixiao asked in irritation. She was about to go","crazy from being angered by Ling Han.","Ling Han shook his head, “Let’s wait a few more days.”","Still waiting?","A muscle twitched in Princess Bixiao’s cheek, “You can’t be saying that you want to continue battling there at night, right?","“You’re really smart,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Princess Bixiao instantly felt like she was about to go crazy. ‘Are you a battle maniac? Are you complaining that you didn’t fight enough yesterday?’","Even if she was driven mad, she could not possibly leave Ling Han alone. To her, the inheritance of a Saint did not seem to be all that important. As long as she’had such a person by her side, even if she was angered half to death, she would still have sweet feelings for him.","After an entire day, another seven teams walked out of the ancient battlefield","and entered into the canyon.","Seeing that Ling Han and the others were actually spacing out in the valley,","they all showed expressions of disdain.","How foolish. They had come early, yet did not hurry up and continue onwards. Instead, they were just sitting here and wasting time? They were as stupid as could be.","Ling Han only smiled slightly. There were at least several million people who had entered this space before them, even if not ten million, so why hadn’t any of them succeeded?","Thus, time was not the most important factor, and it would be useless even if","they were faster.","When night fell, Ling Han rushed into the ancient battlefield and continued the","battle.","A night passed, and Ling Han received another stamp.","“Are you still not leaving today?” Princess Bixiao asked weakly.","“Tsk, not only are you intelligent now, you even know how to read minds,”","Ling Han said with a smile.","Princess Bixiao merely rolled her eyes at him, not wanting to speak at all.","These few days were the peak period for passing through the ancient battlefield. Every day, there would be a considerable number of teams passing through, and at most, there would be seventeen in a single day.","It was probably because they had thought of a way to gather the people that had entered this place at such a late time that they had begun to barge into the ancient battlefield.","There was no shortage of teams that had invited Ling Han to join them, but","Ling Han politely refused all of them.","He had already battled here for four days. Every time he battled until the morning of the second day, an additional mark would appear on his wrist, invisible to the naked eye. Furthermore, every mark overlapped on the same spot.","There were already five marks, was that still not enough?","It would only take three days to pass through the ancient battlefield. Even if they walked slowly, four days would be enough to pass. Going by that calculation, they would just have to battle for three nights. Ling Han had already battled for five nights, but it was still the same.","Could it be that his thought process was incorrect, and this mark would be endlessly superimposed like this?","This thought only flashed through Ling Han’s mind for a moment, before he tossed it out of his mind.","Even if that was the case, he would still stick to his initial idea to the end. On the path of cultivation, there would be times when he would not turn back even if he had hit a wall.","From the fifth day onwards, there were fewer and fewer teams passing through the ancient battlefield, dropping to two to three in a day.","On the eighth day, Ling Han encountered a team.","This wasn’t strange. What was strange was the fact that Hou Qingbai was in the team.","Now that enemies had met, both sides were naturally furious.","When Hou Qingbai saw Ling Han, he immediately sneered, and said, “Whoever kills this person for me, I’ll give him 5000 Dao Stones!","All of a sudden, the bounty had increased fivefold. That was because he wanted to personally see Ling Han die in front of him.","However, no one accepted this mission.","The members of their team were all heirs of great sects and noble clans. Though 5000 Dao Stones was tempting to them, they were also people who cared about their pride. No one could afford to lose face like this when they had to obey the commands of others.","When Hou Qingbai saw this, he gritted his teeth and said, “I’ll throw in another Cloudy Smoke Celestial Stone!”","This time, everyone looked interested.","The Cloudy Smoke Celestial Stone was a Two Star material, and not only that, it was also a Spiritual Power Spirit Tool.","Because there were too few ingredients for Spiritual Power, its value was much higher than ingredients of the same level. Furthermore, there was practically no lack of buyers but no one willing to sell.","Hou Qingbai was willing to take out the Cloudy Smoke Celestial Stone; it seemed like he really hated Ling Han to the core.","Under heavy rewards, there would definitely be brave men. The temptation of a Spiritual Power Spirit Tool was really too great.","“I’ll go!”","“1’11 go!”","“Let me doit!”","Immediately, five people scrambled out, then attacked Ling Han together.","So what if he was a Formation Master? He was only a native from a backward place, so they would kill him!","Ling Han moved, only dodging and not attacking.","His reaction was in line with everyone’s understanding oh, with five prodigies working together, how could it be that Ling Han still had the strength to counter? Of course, he could only dodge.","“Since we’ve made our move, let’s hurry up and get rid of him,” a man in white said coldly.","“All right!”","There were a total of 12 people in this team, and immediately, another three charged towards Ling Han, while the other four charged towards Princess Bixiao and Sixth Baby.","“Ling Han, if you continue to flee, these two beauties, one big and one small, will suffer,” the white-robed man said. He held a sword in his hand, his expression filled with killing intent.","“Brother Hai, I took a fancy to this beauty,” Hou Qingbai hurriedly said. He only wanted Ling Han to die, but he hadn’t played with Princess Bixiao yet. Even if he wanted to kill her, it would have to wait until he was bored of playing with her.","“Shut up! Wasting everyone’s precious time for the sake of you, yet your mind is filled with women? Are you a stud pig?!” the white-robed man chided. If it weren’t for the fact that Hou Qingbai had given him a large number of Dao Stones to join this team, he would have definitely thrown him out at this moment."]},{"number":3719,"title":"Chapter 3719: Resolved","paragraphs":["Chapter 3719: Resolved","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","With this shout from the white-robed man, Hou Qingbai could only shut up. He looked somewhat reluctantly at Princess Bixiao. This woman was really very beautiful. Furthermore, she had an elegant temperament, unlike the women that he used to play with. They would all take the initiative to throw themselves into his arms just for the sake of his background. It was really too boring.","The white-robed man pointed the tip of his sword at Princess Bixiao, and said calmly, “I am in Ultimate Dao Foundation. Killing a Human Dao Foundation cultivator would only need one strike. Ling Han, I will count to three. If you continue to dodge, I will draw my sword.”","“Despicable!” Princess Bixiao rebuked angrily. ‘It’s one thing for you people to bully with numbers, but you actually want to use me as a hostage as well? How utterly shameless!’","The white-robed man was unmoved. It was naturally not difficult to kill Ling Han, but he did not want to waste time. He wanted to end the battle as soon as possible.","Since the result was the same, what need was there to be concerned about the process?","Whatever he did, he had never been concerned about means.","Ling Han humphed, and said, “Do you guys really want to seek death?” Hou Qingbai had a Sect Master-level background. Once he was killed, as long as the others were not silenced, it was very possible that he would attract a great elite of Sect Master-level. With the current martial arts background of the Celestial Sea Planet, how could they withstand the might of a Sect Master? The Heavenly Dao Flames could indeed destroy an elite of Sect Master-level, but what if it attracted the attention of the Holy Land of Metal Element? Ling Han naturally wouldn’t be reserved when dealing with Hou Qingbai However, if he wanted to kill the others to prevent them from leaking the secret, in truth, it was not that Ling Han was being soft-hearted, or indecisive. To implicate innocents just for the sake of killing one person, he would definitely feel guilty.","Thus, he had primarily focused on dodging from the very beginning. He wanted to see if these people were worthy of his mercy.","Now, however, the results had already been revealed.","They were seeking death!","Ling Han’s killing intent was firm, and he didn’t dodge anymore. Instead, he faced the attacks head-on.","A cold smile appeared on the white-robed man’s face. One against eight? Immediately, he would see Ling Han being crushed into dust.","Hou Qingbai was also excited. Ling Han had embarrassed him greatly and every time he thought about it, it made him embarrassed and furious. Now, this detestable guy was finally going to die, haha.","Under this kind of excitement, it also diluted his disappointment in not being able to obtain Princess Bixiao.","Boom!","Ling Han attacked with both fists. One of his hands was wrapped with Heavenly Dao Flames, while the other was wrapped with Destructive Energy Using the Demonic Monkey Fists, he blasted out 108 overlapping attacks.","Just how terrifying was the power of this kind of punch?","TWO punches landed, and two of the eight opponents directly collapsed. Their chests were penetrated, and then one was burnt to nothing, while the other had turned into nothing.","F***lf***if***i","The remaining six all stopped attacking at the same time. This opponent was too terrifying. He was practically like a god of death.","The white-robed man’s expression also changed drastically, a powerful chill rising up in his heart.","Only Princess Bixiao smirked coldly. ‘You people are so determined to seek death. Now that Ling Han has unleashed his might, are you satisfied?’ “Capture her! Capture her!” At this moment, it was Hou Qingbai who was the calmest. He pointed at Princess Bixiao.","The white-robed man nodded, and said, “You guys keep him occupied I’ll capture this woman!” He was actually feeling extremely regretful. If he had known this earlier, he would have told Hou Qingbai to shut up. Judging by Ling Han’s initial attitude, it was clear that he had chosen to endure. However, it was them who had sought death, forcing Ling Han to attack them.","This was great. The god of death had already raised his butcher’s knife. He brandished his sword and charged towards Princess Bixiao, wanting to capture this woman as soon as possible. This was their only chance of survival. Peng, peng, peng! The sounds of battle continued behind him, and the white-robed man had no time to pay attention to them. There was only one thing on his mind at this moment, and that was to capture Princess Bixiao. However, though Princess Bixiao’s strength was inferior to his, she was still wearing a Battle Armor, so it would still take some time for him to capture her. His heart was filled with anxiety, and his offensive was as quick as rain.","“H-Brother Hai,” Hou Qingbai said in a trembling voice.","“What is it?!” the white-robed man asked impatiently. ‘Can’t you see that I’m busy right now?’ Moreover, it was all because of Hou Qingbai, and he was cleaning up his mess!","“Brother Hai!” Hou Qingbai cried.","The white-robed man turned around to take a look, yet his expression changed drastically in shock.","That was because aside from him and Hou Qingbai, there was no one else. Of course, they hadn’t fled. Instead, they had been turned into ashes by either Ling Han’s Heavenly Dao Flames or Destructive Energy.","Hou Qingbai’s face was as pale as a sheet. He had personally witnessed how Ling Han had killed one person with a single punch, and a living person had disappeared right in front of him. This kind of shock, this kind of terror directly penetrated into his heart, and could not be erased no matter what.","The white-robed man couldn’t help but stop. Even his body was trembling. Was there even a minute? Ten of his companions had already died in Ling Han’s hands.","“Continue,” Ling Han said calmly to him.","Continue my a*s, how was he supposed to continue like this?","He gritted his teeth, and said, “I admit defeat, and will no longer interfere in the matters between you and him!”","“Brother Hai!” Hou Qingbai’s face turned green. He had already been scared silly by Ling Han. If he were to face him alone, he wouldn’t even have the courage to oppose him.","The white-robed man acted as if he had not heard anything. Between Hou Qingbai’s life and his own, he naturally chose himself without the slightest hesitation.","Ling Han said calmly, “Continue.”","Ling Han, I admit defeat!” the white-robed man shouted loudly, his heart filled with humiliation. He actually had to say these words twice.","“I told you to continue!” Ling Han said coldly.","The white-robed man gritted his teeth, “You are not willing to let me go, are you? Fine!” An expression of madness appeared on his face. Since that was the case, he would give it his all.","Xiu, he charged out, and continued to attack Princess Bixiao. At present, this was his only life-saving trump card.","Weng, an indescribable pressure assaulted him. Involuntarily, all the muscles in his body constricted, and he felt a strong sense of fear.","He turned around in shock, and saw that an ancient stone had appeared on Ling Han’s chest, exuding an endless air of age, as if it had existed since the beginning of time.","This was... the cornerstone of the Celestial Path!","He naturally knew that high grade celestial foundations had a great suppression on low grade celestial foundations, but the problem was that he was also an Ultimate Dao Foundation, so how could he possibly be suppressed by someone else’s celestial foundation?","Absolutely impossible!","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Surprised, right?”","The white-robed man nodded, and asked darkly, “Have you cultivated some kind of secret technique, or have you fused in some kind of treasure when you were forging your Celestial Foundation?”","“Guess!” Ling Han said.","However, even though he said this, he didn’t give the white-robed man a chance to guess at all. Instead, he threw a punch at him.","The white-robed man hurriedly parried. Peng, as a one-star genius of Ultimate Dao Foundation, he was still quite strong. Even if half of his strength had been decreased by Ling Han, he still managed to block this blow.","Of course, he stumbled, and his face was also slightly pale.","Peng, before he could even speak, Ling Han’s second punch had already smashed over.","Then, it was the third punch, the fourth punch. Each punch was faster than the last, and each punch was stronger than the last.","The white-robed man just barely managed to block over thirty punches, and in the end, he was unable to continue. He was forcefully blasted apart by Ling Han. The Heavenly Dao Flames swept past him, and there was not even a corpse left of him.","Hou Qingbai was the only one left.","Hou Qingbai wore a long face. At this moment, he was truly filled with regret.","If he had known that Ling Han was so powerful, he definitely wouldn’t have provoked him here.."]},{"number":3720,"title":"Chapter 3720: How to break through","paragraphs":["Chapter 3720: How to break through","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Hou Qingbai felt extreme regret, but it was already too late.","He hated himself. Why was he in such a rush? Why couldn’t he have others deal with Ling Han? Why did he have to provoke Ling Han here? Why did he have to do it himself?","“Don’t kill me!” he said in a trembling voice. “I can give you money, a lot, a lot of money, as well as treasures! My father is a Sect Master great elite. No matter what treasure you want, he can get it for you.”","Ling Han patted his shoulder, and said, “Don’t be afraid. I’m actually a very easygoing person.”","A look of delight instantly appeared on Hou Qingbai’s face. As it turned out, Ling Han was a money grubber. This made things easier. What he lacked the least was wealth.","“I will definitely satisfy you,” he said.","“En!” Ling Han nodded, but his palm strike used Destructive Energy. It instantly spread from Hou Qingbai’s shoulder to his entire body.","Hou Qingbai’s expression was filled with disbelief. ‘Didn’t you promise to spare my life?’","“I forgot to tell you, I like to joke more,” Ling Han said with a smile. “These ups and downs are very exciting, right?”","Exciting your sister!","Hou Qingbai wanted to curse, yet he couldn’t make a sound. His vitality had already been annihilated by the Destructive Energy, and his body instantly swayed. Before he fell to the ground, his entire body had already disappeared. “Ling Han, I’m sorry,” Princess Bixiao said in a low voice. This was all because of her. Otherwise, Ling Han wouldn’t have faced off against Hou Qingbai. At that time, he wouldn’t have needed to kill so many people.","Everyone here had a very strong background. Once the truth was revealed to the world, Ling Han would be in great trouble.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “There is no need to worry about having too many debts. Furthermore, there is no shortage of this kind of trash.”","He had even done something like burning down a Holy Land. He really did not take a mere Sect Master-level to heart.","Moreover, there was no one alive now. As long as the three of them didn’t say anything, there was no need to worry.","Ling Han put away the Spatial Celestial Tools that Hou Qingbai and the others had left behind. However, there were pitifully few Dao Stones, because these people all had connection devices, and their wealth was all virtual.","From this, it could also be seen just how wealthy the Chang Clan that operated this Galaxy Network was, because every Universe Coin corresponding to every Dao Stone was in their possession.","At night, Ling Han battled the army of corpses again.","He made up his mind. He was going to fight to the death here. Even if he ultimately did not gain anything, he would not regret it.","On the path of cultivation, one needed this kind of determination to not turn back even if they had hit a wall. Otherwise, how would they survive those difficulties? When they encountered setbacks, they would retreat, and find other ways. They were destined to have no chance of becoming the strongest. Eight days, ten days, fifteen days!","Sixteen seals had already been placed on Ling Han’s wrist, but there was still no change.","If there really was one, it was that his cultivation level had finally reached the peak of Human Dao Foundation.","It seemed like this was due to the fact that this was not a real planet. The power of heaven and earth was completely unsuited to cultivating. At most, it could only replenish the mystical power that had been expended, and lacked some kind of key item.","Theoretically speaking, Ling Han’s cultivation should have stagnated.","However, he had eaten a large amount of Silver Dragon Fish before, and he also ingested Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pills every day. Thus, he had accumulated a lot. Most importantly, he had to battle fiercely every night, stimulating all the benefits of the Silver Dragon Fish in his body.","“I can now attempt to form my Heavenly Dao Foundation,” Ling Han murmured to himself.","Breaking through to Heavenly Dao Foundation required the Treasured Fruit of Life. He had long since prepared for this. Previously, when he was still outside, he had bought ten Foundation Building Tier-level Treasured Fruits of Life, and believed that they should be enough.","How did one go from Human Dao Foundation to Heavenly Dao Foundation?","It was simple. On the basis of Human Dao Foundation, the impurities within would be removed, and with the essence as the core, the Celestial Foundation would be rebuilt, and that would be the Heavenly Dao Foundation.","Thus, Human Dao Foundation was definitely more perfect than Human Dao Foundation. This was one level higher, so it naturally had a suppressive effect on Human Dao Foundation.","However, to Ling Han, his Human Dao Foundation were already perfect. He could even suppress those at the Ultimate Dao Foundation level. Even Saints and Great Emperors couldn’t make his Human Dao Foundation bow, so how could he advance any further?","However, what could he do now?","If he did not complete a metamorphosis, his cultivation level would be limited to this place. Whatever Cauldron Forging Tier, Core Formation Tier, Saint Tier, Ancestral King, they all had nothing to do with him.","This cultivation was too perfect; could it be that this was a mistake?","Because the foundation stone of the Celestial Path was too perfect, there was actually no way to improve further. If this was known to others, wouldn’t they laugh themselves to death?","How could this be resolved?","“Since I have already cultivated the cornerstone of the Celestial Path to perfection, and am unable to advance into another level, I will change my angle.”","“I will directly build the Heavenly Dao Foundation Stone!”","Ling Han thought internally. No one had stipulated that there could only be one cornerstone of the Celestial Path, right?","This was really the case of the ignorant being fearless. No matter where they were placed, who did not know that the foundation stone of the Celestial Path was one piece? The Heavenly Dao Foundation, the Ultimate Dao Foundation was merely continuing to transform the foundations of the Celestial Path, and finally reach a “perfect” level.","Two, or even three foundation stones of the Celestial Path?","This was unheard of.","“Just because it hasn’t appeared before doesn’t mean that it’s impossible! Perhaps there are Great Emperors and Saints who have long since formed their three foundation stones, but no one knows.”","“However, even if no one has ever reached the three foundation stones before, so what?”","“I, will create history!”","Ling Han left the canyon entrance far behind. Even if more than ten days had passed, who knew if anyone was especially slow? Who knew if they had just passed through the ancient battlefield?","Building the second cornerstone of the Celestial Path was easy to say, but it had never been heard of in history. Putting aside the question of whether it would work or not, even if it did, the difficulty level would definitely be astonishing.","Ling Han sat down in a cross-legged position, and began to build his second cornerstone of the Celestial Path.","He had already experienced it once. This Celestial Foundation building was naturally a walk in the park for him, but the problem was, the second Celestial Dao Foundation had just condensed into a particle, and the original Celestial Dao Foundation seemed to have been threatened. Immediately, with a light tremor, the second Celestial Dao Foundation was shattered.","This was a replica of the primitive Celestial Gate, and could suppress all the foundation stones of the Celestial Path. This was applicable even for Ling Han himself. The newly born foundation stone of the Celestial Path was no match at all, and would crumble with a single shake.","Ling Han was depressed. The foundation stone of the Celestial Path was so perfect that it could not be transformed. If even the second foundation stone could not be built, could it be that his path of cultivation would really be severed?","No way!","Ling Han immediately gathered his confidence. He had never heard of the logic of not being able to advance because he had cultivated to perfection. The reason why he had not built a second foundation stone was because he had not worked hard enough, or rather, he had not found the right method yet.","At night, Ling Han didn’t have a clue anyway, so he stopped breaking through and continued to battle the corpse army. In the end, by the second morning, he had another stamp.","Another day passed, and no matter how he condensed the foundation stone of the Celestial Path, he would still be unable to escape the fate of it being shattered, and the problem was that condensing the foundation stone of the Celestial Path required the price of his life force. Even if it was broken or shattered, the expenditure was real.","In the past two days, he had used up two Treasured Fruits of Life.."]},{"number":3721,"title":"Chapter 3721: Second Celestial Foundation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3721: Second Celestial Foundation","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Because he hadn’t entered into prime condition, Ling Han would still battle with the army of corpses at night. On one hand, he would continue to “collect stamps”, and on the other, it was also to vent his frustration. After all, anyone would be extremely displeased if this happened to them.","Was it wrong for me to cultivate to perfection?","There was definitely a way. Worse come to worst, he could just demolish the Celestial Foundation, and then cultivate the Celestial Foundation again.","But this would definitely be a great waste.","As Ling Han battled, he thought about how he could build the second foundation stone of the Celestial Path.","In fact, it wasn’t difficult to construct. What was difficult was how to protect it from being shattered by the first foundation stone.","A night passed, and he came up with a bold idea.","‘Let’s try it!’","When the sun shone brightly, Ling Han immediately sat down in a cross-legged position, ingested a Treasured Fruit of Life, and began to break through to Heavenly Dao Foundation again.","Weng, he drew out the foundation stone of the Celestial Path. Since you are affecting me from building my second Celestial Foundation inside my body, then I just have to get you out, all right?","However, in this way, his attention would definitely be divided, but breaking through was a matter that required his full concentration. This would be very dangerous, and he did not want to go mad.","If it was any other person, they would definitely not take such risks like Ling Han. Even if it was a risk, they would definitely find a senior of their sect or clan to watch over them. If they really encountered danger, their senior could also immediately suppress their injuries and treat them.","But where was Ling Han going to find one now?","Even if he returned to Celestial Sea Planet, he could only look for Brother","Monkey and Chen Fengyan.","However, Brother Monkey was suppressed at the foot of the mountain, so he could only produce a spiritual manifestation. It was uncertain whether it would be able to help him or not, and Chen Fengyan kept hiding and cultivating in seclusion. Seeing him was as difficult as ascending the heavens.","Ling Han was also an impatient person. For such a grand feat like building a second Celestial Foundation, since he had already thought of it, and could already begin, how could he possibly restrain himself?","Cautiously, he formed the second cornerstone of the Celestial Path in his mind. The core took form, but even if he had drawn the first cornerstone of the Celestial Path out of his body, when the second cornerstone took form, it still vibrated slightly, releasing an incredibly majestic might.","Pa, the core of the second Celestial Foundation immediately exploded.","It still didn’t work.","Ling Han frowned upon seeing this. ‘I’ve already drawn you out, yet you’re still so ruthless?’","Since that was the case, I would completely suppress you.","Ling Han gritted his teeth and summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, using it to suppress the first Celestial Foundation.","He would never allow his precious tool to clash head-on with the foundation stone of the Celestial Path. He only wanted to use the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to suppress the aura released by the first Celestial","Foundation.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower expanded slightly, sending down streaks of Primal Chaos Qi that completely wrapped around the first Celestial","Dao Foundation.","This looked like protection, but in truth, it was a shield.","All right, again.","Ling Han went to form a second Celestial Foundation, and very quickly, the core was formed.","The first Celestial Foundation seemed to have sensed something, and immediately released a wave, that surged towards Ling Han’s mind.","This was harmless to Ling Han himself, but was enough to destroy the newborn cornerstone core of the Celestial Path.","Weng, the Primal Chaos Qi showed its might, blocking this wave.","It was effective!","Ling Han was delighted, but he had not been happy for too long. Pa, the core of the second celestial foundation had already crumbled.","That was because there was still an incredibly weak wave spreading out, and the core of the Celestial Foundation was really too fragile when it had just formed.","Ling Han tried again, but it was useless. The core of the Celestial Foundation continued to shatter.","And this was still because the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower had been forged from Origin Gold. Otherwise, even if it was a Saint Tool that could crush Ling Han into dust with a light tremor, it was still far inferior to the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower when it came to suppressing the fluctuations of the foundation stone of the Celestial Path.","Even the Imperial Weapon was ineffective, so what else could truly suppress the cornerstone of the Celestial Path?","This was not pure power at all, but rather a fundamental connection. He was originally one with the foundation of the Celestial Path, so how could it possibly be completely severed?","They would live together forever, and they would die together.","Thus the effects of external power were limited. Thankfully, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was forged from Origin Gold. Otherwise, it wouldn’t even have the slightest effect, because this didn’t require any destructive power. Even a Saint Tool wouldn’t be effective.","What could be done?","A thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind. Since external power could not easily restrain it, he would use his internal power.","Power of Dimensions!","With a single thought from him, all the living creatures of the inner world contributed their own spiritual power, turning into a tiny ball of light in Ling","Han’s mind.","Even though it was small, it was condensed from the spiritual power of millions and millions.","He condensed the core of the second Celestial Foundation, while the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower continued to suppress the first Celestial Foundation, weakening the energy fluctuation as much as possible.","Weng, there was still a slight wave of power assailing him, but Ling Han wrapped his spiritual power around his second Celestial Foundation.","The shockwave surged over, and when it touched the ball of light, it was instantly absorbed. However, the ball of light was also being consumed at a very fast speed.","Give me some more power!","Ling Han continued to extract the spiritual power of the beings of the inner worlds, replenishing the expenditure of the ball of light.","On the other hand, his second Celestial Foundation core was rapidly forming and solidifying.","As long as it solidified, then he would have succeeded. Both were of the same quality. Ling Han did not believe that the first Celestial Foundation would be able to shatter the second Celestial Foundation.","Hold on, hold on, hold on!","The first Celestial Foundation was trembling lightly. It was formed from imitating the primitive Celestial Gate, and possessed a supreme status, capable of suppressing all Celestial Foundations. It should have been unique, but now, a second Celestial Foundation that was identical to the primitive Celestial Gate had actually appeared?","This naturally was seen by it as a challenge, that it wanted to suppress and destroy.","Ling Han gritted his teeth, continuously extracting spiritual energy. This wasn’t inexhaustible. In the inner worlds, even for a Seventh Tier Heavenly Venerate, they were slightly weaker than mortals once they came out, so the spiritual energy that each person could provide was truly extraordinarily weak. Thankfully, there were enough of them, and they had condensed and united, which was why they had such amazing effects.","However, extracting too much Spiritual Power could lead to death.","Ling Han made some adjustments. The individual strength was the weakest, so he would no longer extract the essence of the soul.","However, this was actually the largest contribution. With such a stop, the spiritual power that Ling Han extracted instantly decreased by half, and the recovery speed of the ball of light also decreased greatly.","He could clearly “see” that this sphere of light was continuously shrinking, and the core of the second Celestial Foundation was about to be revealed.","However, there was nothing that could be done. Time would not wait for him, so Ling Han could only wait for a second chance. It was impossible for him to sacrifice all the living beings of the inner world.","It should be known that he still had to build his third Celestial Foundation in future, so how could he just kill the goose that lays the golden egg?","Weng, the shockwaves continued, and the ball of light finally dispersed completely.","Ling Han was just about to give up, when an astonishing scene appeared. The second Celestial Foundation also released a wave, which blocked the wave from the first Celestial Foundation.","It didn’t shatter!","Ling Han faltered for a moment, then was overjoyed. As the ball of light continued, he had finally formed the core of his second Celestial Foundation, which had reached a stable enough level. It had finally become the cornerstone of the Celestial Path, and was not just a core.","At present, though it was still very fragile, with the help of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, it was already qualified to stand against the first Celestial Foundation.","Hahahaha!","Ling Han broke into a grin, and hurriedly continued to work hard, continuing to strengthen the second Celestial Foundation. By now, it could only be considered to be in its infancy, and was still far from reaching the stage of taking form.."]},{"number":3722,"title":"Chapter 3722: Covered completely","paragraphs":["Chapter 3722: Covered completely","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han’s spirit was greatly energized, using his own life essence to nurture the second Celestial Foundation.","This had finally passed the most fragile period. Now, it was like a baby that was crying out for food, greedily absorbing Ling Han’s life energy.","Very soon, Ling Han had no choice but to ingest another Treasured Fruit of Life. Otherwise, his life force would be greatly expended.","However, the second Celestial Foundation was like a bottomless pit. It still hadn’t reached the stage of forming, and continued to absorb life energy.","*F*ck! Are you trying to suck me dry?’","Ling Han mocked internally, but he also knew that what he was building now was a flawless foundation of the Celestial Path, so the expense was naturally great. Furthermore, the Heavenly Dao Foundation of others were all built on the Human Dao Foundation, so the expense was naturally smaller, but for him?","Starting from zero, could this consumption be compared in the same breath?","He was going to give it his all.","Ling Han ate Treasured Fruits of Life one after another. In just a few hours, the nine Treasured Fruits of Life had been completely expended, but the problem was that the second Celestial Foundation was still not completely stabilized.","He had already reached this point, so how could he give up halfway? Ling Han could only grit his teeth, and use his own life force to supply it. Worse come to worst, he could live a few less years. In any case, he was still very young, and a Foundation Building Tier had a lifespan of a thousand years.","After advancing into Heavenly Dao Foundation, one could gain another three hundred years of lifespan. He could just give it his all even if it meant sacrificing these three hundred years, all right?","Boom, right at this moment, a powerful life force suddenly surged out of his body, replacing the expenditure of his lifespan.","Yi, what was this?","Ling Han faltered for a moment before coming to his senses. At the Metal Element Fruit Gathering, he had eaten a few Treasured Fruits that were used to heal life force. At the time, he hadn’t felt any change, but now, it had released its effects.","With the addition of this colossal amount of life energy, the second Celestial Foundation finally stabilized after extracting another portion of life energy. It didn’t extract any more life energy.","Ling Han was a little anxious. His two foundations of the Celestial Path were practically as incompatible as fire and water. If he removed the suppression of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and stored the two Celestial Foundations into his mind, would they directly come to blows?","That was his mind, and if it was damaged, something big would happen.","But they couldn’t stay like this forever, right?","Ling Han put away the Primal Chaos Lightning Tower. Then, he also stored the first Celestial Foundation into his mind.","Instantly, the two foundation stones of the Celestial Path both released an extraordinarily domineering, ancient aura, opposing each other.","Ling Han breathed a sigh of relief. Thankfully, they had not come to blows in the end.","It was good that they had not fought.","The second Celestial Foundation was presently only the size of a soybean, and was far from being able to compare to the first Celestial Foundation that was the size of a well’s lid. However, in terms of quality, it was not the slightest bit inferior, and was enough to stand against the first Celestial Foundation.","Fights couldn’t be started. After all, the Celestial Foundation was still a part of Ling Han’s body. At most, it would only cause minor disturbances. However, previously, the second Celestial Foundation was really too fragile. Even the slightest bit of emotional fluctuation could shatter it.","The power of heaven and earth here was extremely thin, and it was practically impossible to cultivate. Ling Han naturally wouldn’t waste time. He stood up and moved his limbs slightly, experiencing the feeling of majestic power.","From Human Dao Foundation to Heavenly Dao Foundation, this was a leap, enough to increase Ling Han’s battle prowess by two stars.","Now, he could even thrash five-star geniuses of Ultimate Dao Foundation.","Looking at the sky, there was still more than an hour’s time until dark. Ling Han was filled with anticipation. Later, he would use the army of corpses to test out his current strength.","Kuang, just at this moment, thunderclouds rolled out in the skies, gathering towards him.","The heaven’s calamity was coming.","As expected, a human figure of lightning entered Ling Han’s mind, wanting to obliterate his consciousness.","“Die!” the internal demon roared.","“An!” Ling Han directly attacked it with the Six Characters Bright King Curse. After a few dozen attacks, the internal demon’s entire body cracked and shattered. A warm power surged out, nourishing his divine sense and suddenly strengthening it.","The internal demon wasn’t completely useless either. Killing it would release pure energy that could replenish one’s divine sense.","“Father!”","“Ling Han!”","Sixth Baby and Princess Bixiao both ran over. They had seen the dense thunderclouds.","“You actually broke through to Heavenly Dao Foundation here?” Princess Bixiao’s expression was filled with shock. This was really too inconceivable. It should be known that the power of heaven and earth here was completely unsuited to cultivating. How did you do it?","Furthermore, this time was really too short, wasn’t it? She had clearly broken through to Foundation Building Tier first, and had even cultivated for a year in the Holy Land of Metal Element. Such good conditions had not allowed her to break through to Heavenly Dao Foundation, and she still lacked some accumulation.","Ling Han smiled and said, “I just felt like I was about there, and just broke through.”","Something like that could be done?","Princess Bixiao was rendered speechless for a moment. After a while, she finally said, “Then you have been battling constantly these few days. Is it for the sake of breaking through?”","In this way, Ling Han wouldn’t be stupid anymore. On the contrary, he was simply extremely smart.","Ling Han shook his head, “No, this breakthrough was just in passing.”","Pu!","Princess Bixiao instantly coughed, feeling a little injured.","She really could not communicate with this kind of freak.","Since Ling Han had said so, it was clear that he was still unwilling to leave.","At night, Ling Han continued to battle against the army of corpses.","He charged over, and he was like a ferocious dragon as he charged forward. The Starlight Screen spread open, and it could be said that it was unbreakable. No matter how many Skeleton Soldiers attacked him, faced with this kind of defense, they would only be defeated.","On the other hand, Ling Han’s punch was extremely powerful.","He summoned the Heavenly Pattern Jade, compressed it with his Spiritual Power, and shot it out. Peng, peng, peng! This was too terrifying. As the attack passed, an absolute space of three hundred meters long and six meters wide appeared ahead of him. All the skeleton soldiers were blasted into smithereens. Though the Heavenly Pattern Jade was small in size, when it shot out at that kind of high speed, the force it brought with it had exceeded the speed of sound several times over. Furthermore, it had the destructive power of a Two Star material. Thus, the force that seeped out was extremely destructive.","Ling Han charged forward, unleashing the Three Styles of the God of War. Boom! With a single strike, the space within 30 meters of him was reduced to a vacuum.","After three moves, he also rushed to the Heavenly Pattern Jade, and stowed it away.","He continued to test out the might of his various techniques, and only when the sun had risen did he stop. There was no more battle left for him.","Just like before, he was placed with another stamp.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He then sat down in a cross-legged position on the ancient battlefield, and began to temper the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","It was naturally impossible for him to change the structure of the Origin Gold, but now that his cultivation level had increased, he could naturally strengthen this future Imperial Weapon and increase its strength slightly.","-The starting point for the precious tool was too high. If he advanced a minor level, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower’s improvement would only be negligible. Unless he advanced into the Cauldron Forging Tier, only then would there be a qualitative change.","At night, Ling Han battled again.","By the morning of the second day, he had already accumulated 21 stamps. However, as this night passed, and when the sunlight shone on him, Ling Han was startled. There was no new stamp placed on him.","Yi, he had reached his limit?","Ling Han nodded in understanding. Since that was the case, he would take his leave.","He beckoned Princess Bixiao and Sixth Baby over, saying, “Let s go.."]},{"number":3723,"title":"Chapter 3723 - 3725’A favour from me is more than","paragraphs":["Chapter 3723: Chapter 3725’A favour from me is more than","100 Dao Stones","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Princess Bixiao faltered for a moment before coming to her senses.","Her beautiful eyes were filled with confusion, “We’re leaving? Why?”","■Is there any need to ask why? Haven’t you always wanted to leave?’","After staying for too long, she thought that Ling Han would continue fighting until the Mystery Realm closed.","Ling Han chuckled. Looks like this princess of the Demon Race had been bored silly.","“Let’s go, let’s go. This place is boring. What’s the point of staying here?”","‘Boring, but you’ve already stayed here for 20 days?’","Princess Bixiao was powerless to complain.","“Hehe, Father is so fun,” Sixth Baby said with a chuckle.","Princess Bixiao rolled her eyes. This baby had already been led astray by Ling","Han.","The three of them set out, heading towards the canyon.","The canyon was very long and wide. The mountain walls on either side were more than 50km away, but they were as high as thirty thousand meters, piercing straight into the clouds, making for an incredibly grand sight.","“Father, doesn’t this canyon look like it was cut out with a single slash?” Sixth Baby asked.","Ling Han was taken aback. ‘Oh, that’s right. The passageway to this canyon is a little too straight, isn’t it?’ Furthermore, looking at the mountain walls on either side, though they had been corroded by the winds and frosts of time, and were mottled, it could still be seen that they should have been incredibly smooth all those years ago.","Though the power of creation of nature was amazing, to create this kind of canyon was really too inconceivable.","It would be more logical to say that it had been manually excavated.","Was it the Ancient Sun Saint?","With a slash of the sword, a majestic great mountain was severed in half. Ling Han couldn’t help but sigh in admiration. The power of a Saint was truly extraordinary. The power of a single slash had actually reached such a level.","No wonder it was rumored that Saints could easily shatter the stars in the skies. This should not be an exaggeration.","The three of them walked for a while, and saw that a crowd had appeared ahead of them.","Yi, why were these people still here?","Previously, Ling Han had been at the canyon entrance, but after seeing wave after wave of people enter into the canyon, the latest batch to enter was also quite a few days ago, but now, they were actually all here.","Was there any treasure?","Ling Han was instantly in high spirits. After entering into the Moon Occult Mystery Realm, he still hadn’t obtained a single treasure. This made him slightly displeased.","And this was a Mystery Realm built by a Saint? How stingy.","He approached, but was soon disappointed.","These people had gathered here not because of some treasure, but because there was a formation of rocks ahead of them. It was very, very difficult to pass through.","It wasn’t that it couldn’t be passed. Many people had already passed, but it would take a long time to sort out the routes inside. This involved a very complicated deduction and took a very long time. Thus, those who came later were stuck here.","Was it a formation?","Ling Han’s interest was piqued. Ordinarily, there were two ways to break through a labyrinth. The first was to deduce all the variations, and one would naturally be able to walk out. The second was to directly suppress the formation.","The first method was suitable for cultivators with lower abilities, and the second method was suitable for Formation Masters and cultivators with higher abilities.","There was nothing much to say about Formation Master breaking formations, and when one’s strength reached a certain extent, he could break through a planet with a single punch, so what formation would be able to suppress him?","It should be known that formations were meant to manipulate the power of heaven and earth, and make use of the power of heaven and earth. Then, if even the power of heaven and earth could be suppressed, what use would formations be?","However, this was a formation set up by a Saint. Even if it wasn’t Saint-level, it naturally couldn’t be forcefully broken through by a Foundation Building Tier cultivator.","Thus, everyone could only use the first method, deducing all the variations, and then pass.","This required time to observe and grasp all the possible variations. “Brother Ling, you’re a Formation Master, so why don’t we follow you?” someone immediately approached.","“Brother Ling, bring me along.” There were a lot of shameless people, and another person approached.","“Take me too.”","“Me too.”","Although most of the people here were prodigies, and even if they didn’t need the help of others, as long as they were willing to spend time, they would be able to deduce all the variations in this stone formation no matter what.","However, if they could save time, why not?","Ling Han smiled, and said, “Alright, give me a hundred Dao Stones each, and","I’ll bring you along.”","Everyone couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat. ‘Just how greedy are you?","You still want to earn a sum at a time like this?","“Brother Ling the favor I would owe you is not worth just a hundred Dao Stones!” someone immediately said. They felt that Ling Han did not know the rules of the game. A great many of them came from great sects and noble clans, and being able to help them was actually also beneficial to Ling Han. Ling Han glanced at him, and said with a smile, “En, it was my oversight.” That person was instantly proud, and felt that he had gained a lot of face.","-Your favour is worth more than too Dao Stones, so I’ll accept 1000 from you,” Ling Han said.","That person’s expression instantly crumbled, becoming very, very dark.","This was a slap to the face.","‘My favors are valuable, yet you’re charging me more money. What kind of logic is that?’","pu quite a number of people laughed out loud. Their backgrounds were similarly extraordinary, and there was absolutely no need for them to be wary of that person.","That person flew into a humiliated rage, pointed at Ling Han, and said, “Ling Han, I’m giving you face so don’t throw it onto the ground!”","Pa, Ling Han delivered a palm strike, and that person instantly fell onto the ground. “I hate it the most when someone threatens me, and also hate it when someone bargains with me!”","With this palm strike, even those who had been laughing earlier shut their mouths, a powerful chill rising up from the bottom of their hearts.","The guy that had been knocked over was called Zuo Zishi. He had an extraordinary background, and he himself was a one-star genius of Dao Foundation.","But it was this kind of elite that had actually been smacked onto the ground with a single palm strike from Ling Han?","Gasp! Just how powerful was Ling Han?","Previously, everyone had been very cordial and polite. That was because of Ling Han’s status as a Formation Master, but whether it was an alchemist or a Formation Master, they could not possibly win the true respect of cultivators. At most, they could only be polite and cordial.","But now that Ling Han had displayed powerful strength, it was a completely different story.","Cultivators valued abilities the most, and Ling Han’s strength was strong enough. In fact, Ling Han’s strength even made them feel a chill in their hearts. Ling Han swept an eye over the masses, “too Dao Stones, thanks for your patronage.”","“Haha, Brother Ling is willing to lead the way for us, so how could we not be grateful?” Immediately, someone changed his words, and handed over a hundred Dao Stones.","Ling Han stowed the Dao Stones away without any reservations. Though these people all had connection devices, and the majority of their wealth had been converted into the form of Universe Coins, they would definitely still have some Dao Stones on them. There would definitely be places where the Galaxy Network was not connected, or they would need to actually use Dao Stones for transactions.","Furthermore, there were two types of Dao Stones. The first was naturally formed by the power of heaven and earth, and the second was formed by elites using their own comprehension of martial arts to condense the power of heaven and earth, but whichever it was, it could help cultivators cultivate.","Thus, everyone would usually bring some Dao Stones with them, so they could appreciate the power of heaven and earth at any time, as well as the elites’ understanding of martial arts.","Ling Han didn’t ask for too much because he knew that these people couldn’t possibly carry too many Dao Stones with them.","One hundred per person, and if there were many of them, that would also be a considerable gain.","Sigh, he had to quickly get his own connection device and register his own account. Otherwise, even earning money would be difficult.."]},{"number":3724,"title":"Chapter 3724: Swampland","paragraphs":["Chapter 3724: Swampland","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Not everyone was willing to be exploited by Ling Han. Furthermore, some people had also studied it for a long time, and thought that they would soon be able to deduce all the variations in the formation, so there was naturally no need for them to depend on Ling Han.","A total of 72 people handed over their Dao Stones. Going by that calculation, Ling Han had instantly earned 7200 Dao Stones. This speed of earning money was not the slightest bit slower than robbery.","From the look of things, Formation Master was also a good money-making profession.","Ling Han smiled. Since he had accepted the money from them, he still had his own professional ethics.","He entered into the formation, and began to study it.","Even when a Formation Master was breaking a formation, he still had to observe the formation first. Without a clear understanding, how could he possibly break the formation right off the bat?","At present, he only knew how to set up a single formation, but his understanding of formations was already very deep. Furthermore, setting up a formation and breaking it were two different things, because it was always easier to destroy than to construct.","Not long after, he already had a considerable understanding.","He was already confident that he could break the formation, so he said to","everyone, “Come, follow me.”","Everyone followed. After Ling Han had walked for a while, he threw out a formation foundation. Instantly, the area ahead of him that was originally entwined in mist was now clear and bright, and could be seen clearly.","“As expected of Brother Ling’s natural talent in formations.”","“It’s only been a short while, and you’ve already seen through this formation","and deciphered it. We’re impressed.”","Everyone did not hide their words of praise. As for Ling Han, he only smiled upon hearing this. Elites did not need to be praised, because they had enough confidence. It would be more practical to give a few more Dao Stones.","After walking for a while, Ling Han inserted the second formation foundation.","Then, he walked back and put away the first formation foundation.","Right now, formation foundations were extremely valuable, so it was naturally impossible that they could only be used once.","Continuously travelling like this, their speed wasn’t fast, but they didn’t take the wrong path either. In less than half an hour, everyone walked out from the other side of the rock formation.","And this was still within the canyon. This stone formation was like a barrier, stopping a great many people.","Everyone continued onwards. However, the ability to fly was restricted here, yet the speed of their sprint was practically unaffected. Not too long after, they had already reached the end of the canyon. Ahead of them, a precipice appeared, and there was a very large cave on the precipice.","Some people wanted to climb the precipice, but flight was not allowed here, so when they climbed to a higher height, they would be crushed by a terrifying pressure. Even Ling Han announced that he would give up after trying it out once.","This pressure was too terrifying. It was not something that could be endured just by gritting one’s teeth.","Then they would just enter the cave. This should be the next stop.","The cave was large enough, so they didn’t need to walk in a single file. They could walk side by side.","The cave wasn’t pitch-black, as some of the rocks would actually glow.","Although it wasn’t very bright, it was enough to allow one to see.","They were advancing underground, and after advancing for a distance, the mountain cave was becoming narrower and narrower, and the line that they formed became longer and thinner.","Slightly less than half a day later, the line that had initially been parallel had completely become a long line.","Ling Han didn’t stubbornly walk in front. Whoever wanted to take the lead would just have to walk in front. His left hand carried Sixth Baby, while Princess Bixiao followed behind him. They were both in the middle.","After walking for so long, they should have gone deep underground, but there was no obvious change in the temperature. It was just that the humidity had increased, and the walls of the cave were wet. There was water everywhere.","“We’re finally out!” someone cried out, filled with joy.","“Yi, there is actually a moon in the skies!”","“That can’t be, right? We are underground, so how could there be a moon?”","The people in front of him all exclaimed, filled with shock.","Ling Han also walked out. As expected, there was a golden full moon hanging in the skies, decorated with stars, just like a normal night sky.","However, this was impossible.","Ling Han activated his eye technique and looked at the sky. Instantly, he saw something different.","This moon was only tens of thousands of meters away from him, and it was only a massive round rock. There were multiple golden veined patterns on it, as if it was embedded with metal, and that was why it was exuding a golden brilliance.","If it had to be claimed that this was a moon, it was also artificially created.","A Saint’s techniques were indeed extraordinary. Not only could he easily","shatter the stars, he could even create a moon.","“Yi, why is there no way back?” someone asked in surprise.","Ling Han looked back, and sure enough, the cave entrance that they had come out of previously had strangely disappeared.","Was this a smokescreen?","He groped around on the mountain wall, but could not find the cave mouth no matter how hard he tried.","It was useless even if they blasted it. This was a solid mountain, and there was no cave at all.","Everyone clicked their tongues in amazement. It was obviously impossible for them to go back the way they had come, so they could only continue onwards.","“Since we are already here, we’ll take things as they come.”","“With so many people, who should we be afraid of?”","Everyone appeared to be filled with confidence, and walked forwards one after another.","This was a plain, but there was no grass growing here. Instead, there was dark red moss. Under the golden moonlight, it exuded a strange aura.","“Have you guys realized that there is something off about this place?” someone asked.","“That’s right. It’s too quiet here, and there doesn’t seem to be any life here — aside from these mosses.”","“Yes.”","As soon as they finished speaking, they saw the first living being that could move. That was a cockroach.","“I hate cockroaches the most.” A female cultivator raised her foot, and pa, stomped this cockroach to death.","Don’t say, there were quite a lot of cockroaches here, but this thing basically wouldn’t make any sound. Hence, the entire plain was extremely silent.","“Why does this look like a ghost land?”","“That’s right, I think so too.”","Though there were plants here, as well as living creatures that could move, they still gave off a harrowing feeling.","As they walked, the moon gradually set. However, there was no sun, and they could only see the hazy light in the sky.","This was underground, so it was already very impressive that there was such light. How could it be that they would really be hoping to see the sun?","That would be too unrealistic.","They all headed in a certain direction, and after traversing a few mountains, a stretch of waters and meadows appeared ahead of them.","They walked up, and immediately discovered that this was actually a swamp. Thankfully, with their strength, they only needed to channel mystical power, and they would naturally be able to make themselves as light as a feather. There was absolutely no need for them to worry that they would be trapped.","“Wu, so smelly.” Sixth Baby immediately covered her nose.","Although Princess Bixiao didn’t speak, her expression wasn’t any better.","It was indeed smelly. This swamp was practically a smelly pool, and the stench directly seeped into their noses, making them want to vomit.","However, were they going to turn around just because it was smelly? Impossible, and there was no way back either. The path that they had come from did not exist at all.","Everyone could only brace themselves and walk forwards. After walking for more than ten minutes, with a splash, the surface of the water split open, and mud flew everywhere. A smell that was several hundred times worse spread out, instantly causing many people’s faces to turn green.","Right at this moment, a colossal creature also scuttled out of the water, biting towards a cultivator."]},{"number":3725,"title":"Chapter 3725:100 Dao Stones, thanks","paragraphs":["Chapter 3725:100 Dao Stones, thanks","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","What was this thing?","Ling Han activated his eye technique, and in an instant, he had a panoramic view of every single detail of that colossal creature.","Loach?","This thing was definitely a loach. It was completely black, and there wer long whiskers at the corners of its mouth. However, when its mouth opened, it revealed terrifying fangs, exuding a cold glare, as if they were forged from Divine Metal.","“Go!”","Although the loach had caught them off guard, the people here were all prodigy-level, so they could react extremely quickly. Immediately, three people moved together, blasting towards the loach.","The force of the blow landed, but the loach’s skin was extremely slippery. The force of the blow slid away, and could not injure it in the slightest.","However, the loach’s body was still beaten to a slight slant, and did not manage to bite its target.","Shua, the loach suddenly flicked its tail, and with a massive wave of power, the three people that were facing it were instantly sent flying.","Tong! Tong! Tong!","The three of them fell into the water at the same time, and the loach also fell into the water. Immediately, it dived into the water. Gururu, only bubbles appeared, but there was no sign of this big guy.","“Be careful!” someone hurriedly shouted at a person who had fallen into the water.","That person spread out a shield of mystical power to stop the invasion of the dirty water. That would stink for a few days and nights. Just at this moment, an undercurrent surged from below. Hua, that loach appeared again, biting out at him.","With a crack, the entire lower half of that person’s body was bitten into the loach’s mouth. Countless sharp fangs bit onto the mystical power shield, and brilliant light flashed wildly.","Its bite was astonishing, and it was rapidly expending the mystical power shield, and once the mystical power shield disappeared, that person would definitely not be able to withstand those two rows of sharp fangs that seemed to have been forged from Divine Metal.","The loach was still very smart. It kept biting people and dragging them underwater. That was its home ground.","That person hurriedly struggled with all his might. If he was dragged underwater, his battle prowess would definitely drop by another level, and it would be difficult for others to save him. This water was too dirty, and there was mud everywhere, which greatly affected vision.","“Humph!” Ling Han charged over and threw a punch. A terrifying power surged.","The loach tugged twice, wanting to drag its prey into the water, but that person struggled with all his might. After all, he was also a prodigy of Heavenly Dao Foundation. It would be difficult for it to do so in a short while, so it had no choice but to loosen its bite, and turn around and dive.","—It could sense how terrifying the power of Ling Han’s punch was, because the Heavenly Dao Flames were entwined around it.","“Still trying to escape?” Ling Han smirked coldly, and waved his fist on the water’s surface. Boom, a terrifying force broke through the water’s surface. Heavenly Dao Flames was extremely violent, and wherever it touched, large amounts of liquid evaporated, heading straight for that loach.","The loach released a squeak, and tried its best to dodge, yet was completely unable to do so. It was still struck head-on by the Heavenly Dao Flames, and instantly combusted, emitting a charred smell. However, there was no aroma of meat wafting out. Instead, it was extremely smelly.","It lived forever in this kind of filthy water, and the stench had already penetrated deep into its bones and internal organs, and could not be dispersed.","“Thank you.” The person who had been saved hurriedly thanked Ling Han.","“100 Dao Stones, thanks,” Ling Han said to that person with a smile.","That person was instantly dumbfounded. Have you become greedy for money?","“You’re not saying that your life isn’t even worth 100 Dao Stones, are you?” Ling Han said in an exaggerated tone.","That person hurriedly took out a hundred Dao Stones and handed them over. If he didn’t pay these hundred Dao Stones, he would be laughed at by others in future. The only son of the dignified True Lord Ma was actually not worth a hundred Dao Stones?","Ling Han put away the Dao Stones and picked up Sixth Baby again, walking ahead of them.","Hua, the mud split apart, and another colossal loach scuttled out, charging towards Ling Han.","“Are you seeking death?” Ling Han asked coldly. He shot out a punch. It was very simple, but it was entwined with the Heavenly Dao Flames, so its might was incredibly terrifying.","Peng!","The punch landed, and a hole appeared on the loach’s body.","Originally, its body was slippery and unaffected by force, but with the power of Ling Han’s punch wrapped with the Heavenly Dao Flames, this wasn’t a simple power attack. It directly burned through its body, and the terrifying power carried out a second attack. This naturally maximized its destructive power.","Ling Han didn’t even glance at it, and left with his head held high.","The big loach struggled a few times, and soon stopped. It was completely dead.","When everyone saw this, they all looked stunned. This battle prowess was too terrifying, wasn’t it? When others delivered a blow, they couldn’t even break through the big loach’s skin, and this guy had punched a hole in it with a single punch. The contrast was stark.","This was natural. At present, Ling Han was confident that he could completely thrash even a five-star genius of Ultimate Dao Foundation. So, what was a big loach worth?","Some women revealed smitten expressions. A prodigy Formation Master, and astonishing natural talent in martial arts... this was a rising star.","Moreover, Ling Han was a native of this backward place, so his background could be said to be very clean. If he could marry into their clan, their clan would definitely add another helping hand in the future.","With this in mind, the gazes that these women directed at Princess Bixiao were no longer so friendly. They only felt that she was an eyesore. If Ling Han wasn’t here, they would definitely push Princess Bixiao into the water, so that she would drown, or be eaten by the giant loach.","With Ling Han leading the way ahead, the group was naturally unobstructed, and the more time passed, the more stunned they were. What was the Mystery Realm that Ling Han had opened when he was in Mystery Realm Tier? The mystical power that was stored inside was too shocking, wasn’t it?","Some big loaches chose to attack the others, and Ling Han couldn’t be bothered to make a move. He wasn’t a babysitter, and had no obligation to do so.","Of course, if someone was willing to offer a hundred Dao Stones, he wouldn’t mind giving them a hand.","Thankfully, everyone was prepared, so it was not difficult to disperse the attack of the big loach, and there was no mishap.","The day passed, and night fell. They still hadn’t walked out of the swamp, so they continued their journey. There was no way to rest here. As long as they stopped releasing their mystical power, they would fall into the mud. The stench alone was enough to kill.","After walking for another midnight, they finally walked out of the swamp area.","Ahead of them was a rugged stone plain. The rocks rose and fell, and dark moss similarly grew on the rocks.","Everyone also walked over the ups and downs. After walking for over another 50km, a valley appeared ahead of them. Walking in, they discovered that there were stone houses everywhere in the valley.","However, the stone houses were all empty, and had been abandoned for a very long time. There was a thick layer of dust accumulated on the stone tables and beds.","“Logically speaking, someone should have lived here before.”","“Judging by the size of the furniture, this race is extremely tall. The height of adults is at least nine feet.”","“There are too many tribes that meet this criteria, and we can’t determine which tribe it is based on this.”","Everyone searched the stone houses, and then pieced together the clues.","“There’s another question. Those who entered here before us... where did they go?”","That’s right. They were not the first people that had entered here, so what about the people from before?","“Hey, come and take a look!” someone called out.","Everyone followed the sound, and saw a corpse that had already turned into bones lying on the ground inside a stone house. They could clearly see that the skeleton of this corpse was astonishing, and it must have been tall and sturdy when it was alive.."]},{"number":3726,"title":"Chapter 3726: High Priest of the Wolf Tribe","paragraphs":["Chapter 3726: High Priest of the Wolf Tribe","Translator: Henyee Translations Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han also walked over to observe this corpse.","This looked very similar to a human, but was definitely not a human.","It was not because it was too tall, but rather that the details of its head, hands, feet and so on were very far from that of humans.","“Werewolf or Pantherman,” someone said.","The part of the mouth protruded, and the fingernails on his hands and feet were long and sharp. He completely looked like a beastman that had not completely taken human form.","“En.” The others all expressed their agreement.","In the past, there had been many werewolves or panthermen living here. It was also possible that the beastmen had destroyed the residents here. Was this the corpse of an invader?","“Worthless,” someone said with a shake of their head.","The others all shook their heads. Indeed, what did such a corpse reveal? What clues could it give?","“More importantly, where did those people go?” someone asked.","“I took a look. This is a dead end valley, and there is no other way to leave.”","“Moreover, we didn’t find any crossroads along the way.","“That’s strange.”","Everyone was puzzled, and a strong feeling of confusion rose up in them.","“Hehe, are you guys looking for me?” A voice rang out, causing everyone to turn around and look.","A man was striding over, a smile on his face.","“You are Xu Guanglin!”","“Didn’t you pass the formation of rocks long ago?”","“That’s right. You are not from our batch.”","A great many people recognized this man, and immediately called out his identity.","“Xu Guanglin, where did you come from?”","“Where are the others?”","Everyone was talking at once.","Xu Guanglin smiled slightly, “Come with me. I will bring you to a place, and the mystery will naturally be solved.”","Everyone looked at each other, wondering if this was a trap.","However, they hadn’t obtained the inheritance of the Saint, so what was the point of Xu Guanglin harming them? Moreover, their strength wasn’t weak, so what need was there for them to be afraid? Moreover, they had already entered a dead end, so there was nothing better to do here.","“Let’s go.”","Everyone followed Xu Guanglin, and saw that this guy had brought them into a stone house. He moved aside the stone bed inside, and a secret passage actually appeared.","Oh, no wonder this guy had suddenly popped out. As it turned out, it was because there was a secret passage through which they could go.","Xu Guanglin took the lead, and everyone followed behind him.","The tunnel was very long, and after walking for half an hour, they finally walked out of the secret passage. Suddenly, the path ahead of them became clear, revealing a small valley. There was flowing water, and colorful stones were glowing.","“Welcome to... the Holy Land of the Wolf Tribe!” Xu Guanglin turned around and said to everyone.","Holy Land of the Wolf Tribe?","Was that the Werewolf Valley before? Then the one who had died was also a Werewolf?","“Come, follow me. You guys will soon unravel all the mysteries.” Xu Guanglin smiled, and continued to lead the way.","Not long after, they saw a large group of people either sitting or standing, or pacing back and forth.","These were all people who had passed through the stone formation earlier and entered into this space.","Everyone greeted each other. There were a great many people here that knew each other. Some had even formed alliances before, but they had been separated after entering this place, and did not get together.","Ling Han swept his gaze around, but did not see Zhuang Bufan.","Yi, where was this guy?","What exactly is going on here?” someone couldn’t help but ask.","Don’t be impatient. Someone will answer your questions.”","“Who?”","“This old man.” An old voice rang out, causing those who had just arrived to all turn to look at him.","This was a tall, broad-shouldered man. His whole body was enshrouded in a cloak, and he was as tall as ten feet. He was a few heads taller than the majority of people. Wherever he stood, anyone would lose their luster from his brilliance.","His left hand held a black walking stick, which seemed to be extremely heavy. When it landed on the ground, it emitted a muffled ‘tong’, and the whole valley shook.","Ling Han swept an eye over him, and could already see that this man’s left hand that was holding a walking stick was furry, and the tips of his fingers were extraordinarily long, like small knives.","“I am the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe.” This tall man stopped, and used his right hand to remove the cloak on his head, revealing a furry face.","This was basically a wolf’s head, its yellow-green eyes exuding a strange light.","Ling Han activated his ocular technique, yet shockingly discovered that he actually couldn’t see through this wolfman’s cultivation level.","This glance was actually discovered by the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe. He too turned to look at Ling Han, but his gaze did not stop on him. He just swept a glance over Ling Han and then looked away.","“You guys must be very curious. Fine, this old man will explain it to you.”","This High Priest of the Wolf Tribe began to speak.","“Our Wolf Tribe has lived here for generations, but many years ago, a plague swept over, causing almost all the citizens of our Wolf Tribe to die. To preserve the flame of hope, my ancestors sealed the surviving young children, and when we found the solution to the plague, only then would we unseal them.”","“And according to the Divine Decress, the hopes of the Wolf Tribe would be placed on you brave warriors from outside.”","Enter the Sky Suspension Cave and retrieve the Godly medicine!”","Of course, there’s also something you guys need there.”","When Ling Han and the others heard this, tsk, tsk, tsk, asn’t this the standard setting of an ancient site?","What Divine Decree? It must have been the Ancient Sun Saint who had brainwashed them when he had created or drawn in these wolves, and had them act as guides for this place.","This was an arrangement of the script, and the script was written by the Ancient Sun Saint.","They naturally would not reveal it, because the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe may not believe them. Instead, it would destroy the High Priest’s hopes, and cause him to fly into a humiliated rage.","Thus, everyone should act according to the script.","“There’s something that you guys need.” That would definitely be referring to the inheritance of the Saint.","Everyone was eager to give it a try, wanting nothing more than to immediately move out, but the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe told them not to be anxious. According to convention, they would have to wait for a while longer, so that more people could come here, and move together.","Alright, those who entered first indeed did not have much of an advantage.","It couldn’t be helped. One couldn’t hold a saber to the neck of the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe and make him reveal the location of the Sky Suspension Cave right?","Thus, Ling Han and the others were the same as those who had entered first.","They were either sitting, standing, or pacing around. They were extremely bored.","Ling Han wasn’t so worried. He sat down in a cross-legged position and continued to deduce formation patterns. He was still far from grasping all the formation patterns.","Day after day, time passed very quickly.","People came one after another, and the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe would suddenly appear, saying that a new batch of warriors had entered into the Werewolf Valley, and wanted them to go and receive them. Then, what Ling Han and the others experienced previously would be repeated.","And just like that, another half month’s time had passed, and the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe finally walked out again.","“It’s about time,” he said. His yellow-green eyes seemed to be exuding light, appearing to be extremely excited, “Whether our Wolf Tribe can revive or not will depend on you guys.”","Rest assured, High Priest, we will definitely do our best,” someone immediately said. They did not need to expend anything to curry the favour of a storyline character. Who knows, they may be able to gain additional marks, and gain some benefits in future.","“Come with me..”"]},{"number":3727,"title":"Chapter 3727. Obtaining the true inheritance","paragraphs":["Chapter 3727. Obtaining the true inheritance","Editor: Henyee Translations","Everyone followed the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe, and arrived at the end of the small valley. Then, the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe recited something to the mountain wall, and then tapped his walking stick on the mountain wall. A cave was soundlessly created in the mountain wall.","This was the Sky Suspension Cave?","“There are restrictions targeting Werewolves here, and I cannot enter.” The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe sighed, “You all may go. I hope that you can succeed, and save the future of our Wolf Tribe.”","Everyone nodded. This was in line with the settings. Otherwise, if they themselves could enter, what was the point of them being there then?","“Rest assured, High Priest!”","Everyone scrambled over one another. This was the final test. The fact that they could come here meant that they had obtained the approval of the Saint. Then, there was naturally a high chance that they could obtain the inheritance of the Saint.","As expected, they were the true strongest prodigies.","Yet Ling Han was slightly surprised. This was too easy, wasn’t it?","If there were any challenges here, it would be that there was an ancient battlefield before, and there was a formation of rocks behind it. Next, it was a swamp. However, they could all form teams to pass, and the difficulty level was pitifully low.","They were able to gain recognition all the way through like this, and enter into the final stage?","What kind of joke was this?","To say nothing of the inheritance of a Saint, even if any Cauldron Forging Tier had died, they wouldn’t so casually find a successor for themselves, right?","Furthermore, if it was really so easy, why had the inheritance of this Saint not been taken away after so long?","Ling Han kept feeling like there was something off. Hugging Sixth Baby in his arms, he turned to Princess Bixiao and said in a low voice, “Be careful, there might be drastic changes.”","Princess Bixiao was confused, and then came to a “realization”. Could it be that Ling Han was afraid that the inheritance of the Saint would appear, and cause a great fight?","“All right,” she nodded.","Ling Han knew that she didn’t understand what he meant, but it didn’t matter. It was fine as long as she was vigilant.","They walked and walked, and it was only a matter of ten minutes at most. A massive karst cave suddenly appeared ahead of them. It was more than ninety meters tall, and the widest point was about three thousand meters, while the narrowest point was also six hundred meters.","In the middle of this karst cave, there was a stone pillar. It was nine meters tall, and appeared very abrupt.","And now that they had reached this place, it was also the end of the whole cave.","“Where’s the inheritance from the Saint?” someone called out, filled with defiance.","This was already the end?","No wonder no one had gained anything in these countless millenia. As it turned out, this was a scam.","Everyone had been deceived by the Ancient Sun Saint, so how could there be any inheritance from the Saint? They had been tricked, scammed.","This caused a great many people to fly into a thunderous rage.","“Come, let’s go back and interrogate that High Priest. Who knows, it may be him that is deceiving us.”","“That’s right. Let’s go back and find that old geezer.”","Some people wanted to return, but there would always be curious people. They walked to the stone pillar in the middle, and stretched out a hand to touch it.","Weng, this stone pillar actually lit up. Then, pa, a book appeared out of thin air.","“The inheritance, the inheritance of the Saint!” That person said shakily, incredibly excited.","He could see clearly that there were four words on the book: “Ancient Sun Divine Scroll.”","Wasn’t this the inheritance of the Saint?","As it turned out, the inheritance of the Saint was real.","All of a sudden, everyone’s eyes were focused on him. A great many people’s eyes were blazing with ferocity.","“Hand it over!” someone immediately shouted.","This was the inheritance of a Saint. To say nothing of them, even if Venerate Tiers came, they would still fight to the death over it.","How could that person be willing to listen? He hurriedly stored the book into his Spatial Tool. There was no way he would hand over such an inheritance.","“You are really courting death!” Xiu, someone immediately charged towards that person.","Where there was one, there would be two. Xiu, xiu, xiu! More and more people couldn’t help but make a move. Even those people who had wanted to leave earlier returned one after another, joining the battle.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","A chaotic battle broke out, and it was incredibly intense. For the sake of obtaining the inheritance of the Saint, none of them would show any mercy. They were all attacking with their full strength, wanting to defeat all of the others, and obtain a great opportunity for themselves.","However, there were still some people who did not join the battle. Instead, they walked towards that stone pillar, and also stretched out their hands to press down on it.","Pa, another book appeared out of thin air.","“Ancient Sun Divine Scroll!”","That person was overjoyed, and hurriedly put away the book.","However, though his movements were covert, they were still seen by others.","Those people did not fight over it. Instead, they all stepped forwards, and stretched out their hands to touch the stone pillar. In the end, pa, pa, pa! One after another, book after book appeared. They were all the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll.","This book had appeared too many times, and even those who were battling fiercely saw it. Involuntarily, some people retreated from the battle, and then more and more such people appeared.","The battle royale ended, but seventeen corpses were left behind. How could no one die from such an intense battle?","Everyone was speechless, and they all went up to touch it. However, not everyone would be able to obtain the “Ancient Sun Divine Scroll”. Some people stretched out their hands to touch it, but there was no reaction at all.","“It seems like we’ve been tricked again.”","Everyone made a comparison of the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll, and the result was that every copy was different.","Perhaps one of them was real, or perhaps all of them were false.","“Hehe, Father, let’s give it a try too.” Sixth Baby brandished her small white hands.","“All right,” Ling Han said with a smile.","He walked forwards with Sixth Baby in his arms. First, Sixth Baby stretched out her hand and pressed down. A pillar of light flashed, and pa, a book appeared out of thin air.","‘Ancient Sun Divine Scroll’, En, who knows how many books there were already.’","Ling Han smiled, and also stretched out his hand to press down.","Yi?","He shockingly discovered that the “stamp” on his hand suddenly lit up, and then a feeling of vicissitudes instantly surged into his mind.","“Descendant of many generations after, you have finally come.”","“I have been waiting for you for a very, very long time. Since you can hear these words, it means that you have passed through the first stage of my test, and may obtain the cultivation technique of Foundation Building Tier of the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll.”","“There are still three Mystery Realms waiting for you, corresponding respectively to the Cauldron Forging Tier, the Core Formation Tier, and the True Self Tier.”","“Only if you pass all the tests, will you be able to obtain my complete inheritance.”","Instantly, a large amount of information surged towards Ling Han. This was a cultivation technique, but there was only the cultivation technique for the Foundation Building Tier. Then, there were three coordinates, as well as the method to open the three Mystery Realms.","Ling Han distinguished it slightly, and he immediately confirmed that this should be the real Ancient Sun Divine Scroll, which was broad and profound. Even if he had not cultivated this technique yet, Ling Han was sure that this was definitely ten to twenty times better than the Great Sun Lotus Technique that he was presently cultivating.","This Ancient Sun Saint really knew how to play. He actually gave them a pile of fake cultivation techniques, and furthermore, they were divided into parts one, two, three, and four. There were also three Mystery Realms that they had to pass before they could obtain the complete Ancient Sun Divine Scroll.","However, in this way, no one would know that the true inheritance of the Saint had actually fallen into his hands — it was actually in his brain.","Indeed, those bloody battles previously had not been wasted. His persistence, and his efforts had paid off.","From this, it could also be seen how a Saint’s mindset was when selecting his successor. Not only did he require powerful strength, he also required a strong enough determination.","Perseverance was indeed an invaluable quality on the path of cultivation. Oftentimes, one would have to have the determination not to turn back even if they were to hit a wall.."]},{"number":3728,"title":"Chapter 3728: High Priest with a story","paragraphs":["Chapter 3728: High Priest with a story","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han remained calm and collected as he stepped back.","Princess Bixiao stood in his place. She too stretched out a hand and pressed down. Pa, another “Ancient Sun Divine Scroll” appeared. En, practically every person had a copy, and none of them missed.","The remaining people also stepped forward to give it a try. They were already here, so how could they be satisfied if they didn’t give it a try?","Some people didn’t obtain anything, while others obtained a cheap version of the “Ancient Sun Divine Scroll”.","More than an hour had passed, and everyone had tried once. A total of 739 Ancient Sun Divine Scrolls had been unearthed, and as for whether there was a real copy among them, Ling Han knew that there definitely wasn’t one but the others were not so sure. They all swept their gazes over the others, wondering if they should make a move to snatch it.","Though he had already obtained the inheritance of the Saint, a suspicion rose up in Ling Han’s heart.","Wasn’t this too smooth?","His true sacrifice was that he had battled on the ancient battlefield for 21 days. This was indeed something that the prodigies of the past eras might not have been able to persist in. However, the problem was that the subsequent stage was too simple.","According to the Ancient Sun Saint’s personality, the complete Ancient Sun Divine Scroll still had to be passed down four separate times. The Foundation Building Tier chapter of the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll was actually so easily obtained?","Why did he keep feeling that something was off?","“Gagaga, this day has finally come.” An old voice rang out, and the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe strode over with his walking stick, “The inheritance of the Saint has finally appeared!”","Yi, old geezer, what are you talking about?","Didn’t you want some Godly medicine for the sake of the future descendants of the Wolf Tribe? Didn’t you say that the Wolf Tribe couldn’t enter here?","Why had his persona suddenly collapsed?","Furthermore, how do you know about the inheritance of the Saint? As a chess piece, shouldn’t you know nothing, and could only act according to the script? The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe laughed loudly, and said disdainfully, “Do you all think that you are the high and mighty gamers? Wrong, if it was not for the fact that I have omitted countless steps for you, you all would have to experience various difficulties, and would only be able to come here after at least a few months.”","“And there is only one person that can come here!”","“However, if it’s just one person, the chances of obtaining the inheritance are too low. Thus, I’ll save you some time, and while I’m at it, allow everyone to enter this place. At the same time, I can also increase my chances of success.” “Heavens have mercy, I have finally succeeded!”","When everyone heard this, they were all at a loss.","Had the character in the script suddenly awakened, and thus decided not to act according to the script?","“There’s no hurry. We have a lot of time. I’ll also explain everything to you from beginning to end. After holding it in for so many years, if I don’t say it, I’ll really feel too terrible,” the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe said.","“Let me tell you a story first.”","This High Priest did not care whether the masses were willing to listen or otherwise, and had already started to speak on his own.","“A very, very long time ago, this Mystery Realm opened, and a large number of cultivators entered, coming to the Werewolf Valley.","“At that time, the Werewolf Valley wasn’t like it is now, but there were a lot of Werewolves living here. Only if outsiders won the trust of the Werewolves would they be qualified to have an audience with the High Priest, and the High Priest would arrange a lot of missions and tests, which were very, very difficult to complete.”","“Only the first person to succeed would be qualified to enter into the Sky Suspension Cave. The others would not have the chance.”","“This is only a microcosm of how the Mystery Realm has opened countless times over the generations. However, something different happened that time.”","“Because a female adventurer actually fell in love with a Werewolfn from the Werewolf Valley.”","“She stayed behind, and spent her whole life in this filthy, narrow place.”","She had no regrets, but after she told everything to her son, her son was extremely defiant.”","“Why am I trapped in this place?”","Why do I have to become a chess piece?”","“Thus, after learning of all this, I began to make plans. All of this should have been mine! However, I have half of the bloodline of a Werewolf, so it is eternally impossible for me to leave this godforsaken place.”","“Unless... the inheritance of the Saint is taken away, and this Mystery Realm shatters.”","Unfortunately, I do not meet the Saint’s requirements, and am unable to obtain the inheritance.”","“Thus, I have simplified all the procedures. As long as anyone comes to the Werewolf Valley, I will allow you to enter here.”","“When there are too many people, there will always be one or two that will be able to obtain the inheritance of the Saint.”","“And I will snatch this great opportunity!”","The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe declared proudly, appearing to be filled with confidence.","Everyone smirked coldly, looking pitifully at this High Priest of the Wolf Tribe. You ve been tricked. Who obtained the inheritance of the Saint?’ It was all a lie. “Bunch of idiots!” The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe scoffed, “How many years have I been living here? How could it be that I am not aware whether this Mystery Realm is about to collapse and crumble or not? It would only be a single day, and this place would disappear forever. Thus, the inheritance of the Saint has definitely been obtained.”","When these words fell, everyone was moved.","The inheritance of the Saint had appeared?","Who had it?","Meanwhile, Ling Han gritted his teeth internally. At first, he had thought that no one knew that he had obtained the inheritance of the Saint, but he had never imagined that this High Priest of the Wolf Tribe would actually not act according to the script.","Humph, who are you trying to fool?” someone immediately said. “This Mystery Realm would only open once every 10,000 years, and even if it was a True Self Tier, he would only have a lifespan of 10,000 years. And from your tone, it is clear that you have already experienced the opening of the Mystery Realm many times, but don’t tell me that you are at the fourth level of Venerate Tier, or even the pinnacle level of Saint Tier!”","Everyone shook their heads. In this Mystery Realm, to say nothing of becoming Venerate Tier, even becoming Cauldron Forging Tier was impossible.","“Good question.” The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe put away his walking stick and removed his cloak, “Though millions of years have passed in real time, to’ me, it is only a few hundred years.”","“That’s because I’ll only awaken every time the Mystery Realm opens. At other times, I use the power of heaven and earth here to suppress myself. I’m constantly in a sealed state, and the loss of my life has almost stopped.”","“Thus, I am presently in my prime!”","He tossed away his cloak, revealing a burly, majestic middle-aged man. He was filled with heroic spirit, his vitality surging.","Sure enough, he wasn’t old at all.","Pa, pa, pa! A young man clapped his hands, strode out, and said with a smile, “You are indeed very good at scheming. However, you have overlooked one ’ thing. The power of heaven and earth here is extremely scarce, so what heights can you cultivate to?”","“To say the least, even if you can cultivate to the Cauldron Forging Tier or even in fact the Core Formation Tier, so what? This place suppresses cultivation level, and one can only unleash the battle prowess of the Foundation Building Tier!”???????????????????????? &","“Humph, kneel!”","This young man moved, grabbing out at the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe.","Pa!","The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe only gave a casual swat, and that young man collapsed onto the ground. Blood flowed from his head, and he had actually been smacked to death.","Hiss, that young man was a prodigy of Ultimate Dao Foundation. Though he was only a one-star genius, he had been killed with a single strike. Just how wide was the gap in strength between them?","“Idiot!” the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe said coldly. Weng! A small bronze cauldron materialized above his head.","“Cauldron, Cauldron Forging Tier!” someone exclaimed in shock.","“Hiss, the aura hasn’t weakened in the slightest. This is a true Cauldron Forging Tier!”","“How is this possible?!”"]},{"number":3729,"title":"Chapter 3729= All suppressed","paragraphs":["Chapter 3729= All suppressed","Editor: Henyee Translations","The Moon Occult Mystery Realm suppressed cultivation level. To say nothing of the Cauldron Forging Tier, even if a Sect Master came, he would have to obediently become a Foundation Building Tier.","This was the power of a Saint, and even a Sect Master great elite was no match","for it.","Thus, very few elites entered this place. If they were unlucky, and encountered a hot-headed fool, who beat them up, or even killed them in fact, where would they go to complain about the injustice?","However, the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe in front of them was not only at the Cauldron Forging Tier, but he was also able to channel the cultivation level of","Cauldron Forging Tier.","Although there was only one cauldron, and it was only the first step of the Cauldron Forging Tier, against Foundation Building cultivators, this was a crushing advantage.","However, how was this possible?","The Werewolf High Priest was extremely intelligent, and he felt as if everything was under his control. He laughed loudly, and said, “I was born here so the suppression of heaven and earth has no effect on me. Moreover, I’ve massacred all of my clansmen, and through devouring their bloodlines, I’ve successfully broken through to the Cauldron Forging Tier!”","“If that wasn’t the case, why would I be so confident?","When everyone heard this, they all frowned, their hearts incredibly heavy.","It was clear that the Werewolf High Priest had planned everything carefully. He would make use of them to obtain the inheritance of the Saint, and then kill them all in one go. With the strength of Cauldron Forging Tier, it naturally wouldn’t be a problem for him to accomplish this.","To say nothing else, once the Celestial Cauldron appeared, it would be able to suppress the Foundation Building cultivators in terms of aura, preventing them from unleashing even 10% of their true strength.","What could be done?","Even if one of them really obtained the inheritance of the Saint, and was willing to hand it over, would they still be able to live?","Once he had obtained the inheritance of the Saint, he would definitely kill them to prevent them from leaking the secret.","How were they supposed to resolve this dilemma?","Everyone was basically prodigy-level. Some were even four-star geniuses. If they were outside, they would not even cast a second look at the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe. His natural talent was too poor.","But now? A Cauldron Forging Tier elite had appeared, completely breaking the balance of strength.","If all of them joined forces, could they defeat a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator?","No matter what, they had to give it a try. Otherwise... they would definitely die. “Hand over my inheritance!” The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe looked down arrogantly, his eyes focused on a woman, and stretched out a hand to grab her. He was half-human and half-wolf, and his hands were also like wolf claws. They were thick, and his fingernails were long and sharp, like blades.","That woman was a one-star genius of Heavenly Dao Foundation, and she was originally quite extraordinary, but in front of a Cauldron Forging Tier elite, how could she compare?","Being suppressed by the Celestial Cauldron, she couldn’t unleash 10% of her battle prowess at all. Her entire body was trembling, and she couldn’t even parry.","“He!” The people beside her hurriedly moved in unison, greeting the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe.","Without the lips, the teeth feel the cold?. They had to work together.","However, the gap in strength was really too wide. Even if they joined forces, it was useless. With a swipe of the claw from the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe, those people were sent flying at the same time.","“A bunch of trash actually dares to contend with me!” The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe smirked coldly. He humphed, and drew out his walking stick again, tapping it on the ground. Instantly, everyone felt a massive power pressing down on them, making it difficult for them to even move.","“At first, this mountain cave suppressed the bloodline of the Wolf Tribe, but I modified it slightly. Now, it has become an existence that suppresses all other beings except for the bloodline of the Wolf Tribe.","p*** how were they supposed to continue like this?","in the first place, they were no match for the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe, and now, it was difficult for them to even move. This was undoubtedly adding fuel to the fire.","Even if they joined forces, so what? What use would it be?","Oh no, they was completely done for now.","The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe laughed loudly, “Now, hand over my inheritance! It’s fine even if you don’t hand it over. I have a soul searching technique, and I can search your souls one by one. Don’t think of hiding anything from me!”","He grabbed a person. Pu, his sharp claws directly pierced through that person’s skull. Then, his fingernails were all exuding green light, and that person was trembling all over. Not long after, that person’s limbs drooped, completely lifeless.","“Useless trash.”","The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe humphed coldly, and tossed that person aside.","His figure was over three meters tall, and if he threw someone down, it would be like an eagle throwing away a chick.","Everyone was trembling in fear. What could they do?","Ling Han was also thinking of a way, thoughts flashing through his mind. It was actually very simple to eliminate the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe. He only had to summon the Heavenly Dao Flames contained in the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","The question was, would this reveal that he was the culprit who had set fire to the Holy Land?","Though this would make him very famous, Ling Han clearly did not like this kind of reputation now.","Thus, unless absolutely necessary, Ling Han didn’t want to use the Heavenly Dao Flames.","Then was there any other way?","With a thought from Ling Han, he took out the Ghostly Underworld Light. This was a tool that he had obtained from Luo Xuan. It had been personally refined by a great elite of Sect Master-level, and the lamp oil had also been refined from the corpses of at least Cauldron Forging Tier elites.","He would give it a try.","His Celestial Foundations were built from imitations of the primitive Celestial Gate Furthermore, they were two Celestial Foundations, which allowed him to have a strong immunity against suppression. He was completely unlike the pitiful others.","He silently activated the Ghostly Underworld Light, and instantly, an incredibly evil aura circulated. Ghostly flames suddenly gushed out, burning towards the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe.","“En?” The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe showed a hint of surprise. There was actually someone that could activate a precious tool?","just at this moment, shua, shua, shua! Multiple streaks of light lit up, and there were actually n people that moved, launching attacks at the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe. Some shot out sword light, some shot out Saber Qi, some drew out an ancient mirror that shone with divine light, and some drew out the Heavenly Parasol, which cast down multiple terrifying auras.","As it turned out, Ling Han wasn’t the only one who could resist the pressure here. There was no shortage of supreme prodigies here, so they definitely had a shocking trump card.","However, previously, no one knew if there was anyone else that could cooperate with them, and just how much damage could a strike from a Foundation Building Tier cause to a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator? Thus, they all endured silently, waiting for the best opportunity to make a move.","Now that Ling Han had taken the initiative to attack, it was equivalent to blowing the horn of war. Those who had the spare energy to attack all attacked at the same time.","The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe showed a hint of seriousness. At this time, those that still had the ability to make a move on him were all prodigies of Foundation Building Tier.","If it was a one-on-one battle, he could completely ignore them, but now, he was a little careless, thinking that he could rest easy after turning around the suppressive power of this place. He had already put away the Celestial Cauldron. Without this layer of suppression, these 12 opponents had at least retained 70% of their battle prowess.","Twelve Ultimate Dao Foundation cultivators, who were at least two-star geniuses, unleashed their Spirit Tool and attacked at the same time. Even a Cauldron Forging Tier had to be careful. Otherwise, it was extremely likely that they would fail miserably.","He humphed, and struck the walking stick heavily. Weng, a wave of energy spread out with him at the centre, pushing out in all directions.","Twelve attacks came from different directions, but when they came into contact with this energy wave, they immediately stopped.","It still wouldn’t work. Cauldron Forging Tier was too powerful in this place, even if the other had only formed one cauldron.","Shua, a streak of white light streaked past, shooting towards the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe at more than thirty times the speed of sound, like it was leaving behind a trail of dust, like a strong man that would not turn back."]},{"number":3730,"title":"Chapter 3730: Turning the tables","paragraphs":["Chapter 3730: Turning the tables","Editor: Henyee Translations","At first everyone was already in despair, but when they saw this white light, they immediately felt their hearts that had fallen to rock bottom rise up again.","Could it succeed?","The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe smirked coldly. A mere concealed weapon wanted to wound him?","Too naive.","He very casually raised his hand and pressed down, wanting to grab the white light that was attacking him. He could already clearly see that this was a white jade-like rock.","However, just as his hand touched the rock, his expression changed drastically.","So heavy,too heavy!","How was this possible? It was clearly only the size of a fist, so how could it","have such a terrifying weight?","Moreover, how could such a heavy thing be shot out at such a high speed?","To say nothing of Foundation Building Tier cultivators, even Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators like him wouldn’t be able to do it.","He had been too careless. He was going to be in deep trouble.","However, it was already too late for regrets. With a pa, his right hand instantly exploded, turning into a rain of blood. Then, the jade did not stop at all, and continued to crash forwards. Pa, pa, pa! The bones in his forearm exploded one after another, and blood rained down.","This still wasn’t the end. Next, his upper arm was also shattered by the rock.","This rock itself weighed 5,000kg, and added with the fact that it was smashing towards him at more than 30 times the speed of sound, its weight was overwhelmingly heavy in an instant.","So what if he was a Cauldron Forging Tier? His protective mystical power couldn’t block it at all, and the entire right arm of the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe turned into a rain of blood. Even half of his upper body was missing, revealing a large gash that was bleeding. This scene was terrifying beyond the imagination.","The Heavenly Pattern Jade was extremely powerful!","However, this also showed how powerful Cauldron Forging Tier was. In a moment of carelessness, he had used his physical body to face the Heavenly Pattern Jade head-on. Surprisingly, he had only lost his right arm, and half of his body was missing.","If this was a Foundation Building cultivator, his whole person would probably","be turned into a rain of blood.","At more than thirty times the speed of sound, the Heavenly Pattern Jade was extremely destructive.","Everyone was overjoyed. Though they had not been able to kill the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe, he had already lost half of his body, so the latter must have been severely injured.","“Ah!” The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe released a shrill roar. There was fury, defiance, as well as deep regret.","He had been too careless. He had thought that these people were all under his control, and added with the fact that he was about to obtain the inheritance of the Saint, his millions of years of waiting had finally paid off. It was inevitable that he would feel excited, and lose the cautiousness that he should have had. Additionally, though his mother was an outsider, he had never been out before, after all, so how would he know that there was still a Spiritual Power Spirit Tool like the Heavenly Pattern Jade?","Or rather, it was possible that he knew, but it had never left an impression in his mind.","In short, all of this was the bitter fruit that he had no choice but to swallow","now.","“You, it’s you!” He set his eyes on Ling Han. It was this brat who had thrown out that jade, causing him to be severely injured.","If he lost an arm, or a smaller half of his body, this would leave behind an eternal disability. Unless he could obtain a Saint Grade Celestial medicine, only then would he be able to regrow his severed limb, or he would have to cultivate to an incredibly high level, and at that time, he could even regrow a lost limb with a drop of blood.","However, these two things were still too far away for the present him.","Kill this damn brat!","One two three. Those who had attacked together with Ling Han previously all walked out. At present, the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe was at his weakest. If the twelve of them joined forces, it was very possible that they would be able to take him down.","“Bunch of ants!” the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe said balefully. Bearing with the agonizing pain, he summoned the Celestial Cauldron and floated it above his head. Instantly, a higher level of pressure overflowed, causing everyone’s Celestial Foundations to be restricted, and they could not unleash their full power.","He was filled with resentment. If he had stayed vigilant all this while, and used the Celestial Cauldron to suppress them, how could this accident have happened?","“Die!”","Ling Han was the first to pounce. His figure was like a dragon, and his fists danced furiously as he blasted towards the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe.","Ordinarily speaking, he was definitely no match for a Cauldron Forging Tier elite, but now, this Cauldron Forging Tier elite had only formed a single cauldron, and had also grown up in this kind of Mystery Realm that was cut off from the rest of the world. His battle prowess was definitely inferior to an ordinary Cauldron Forging Tier.","Most importantly, his opponent was still heavily injured, and his battle prowess had dropped drastically.","This made Ling Han believe that he could fight him.","“Die!” The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe swiped out a claw at Ling Han. Five flashes of energy swept past, like Sword Rays.","Pu, blood immediately spurted from Ling Han’s fist. At the same time, a deep power also blasted him backwards.","Ling Han couldn’t help but sigh. He had already activated the Starlight Screen and used the Demonic Monkey Fists. However, he was still no match for the heavily injured High Priest of the Wolf Tribe. In fact, he had even slashed open the Starlight Screen with a single strike, which was enough proof of the gulf between the Foundation Building Tier and the Cauldron Forging Tier.","The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe took advantage of the victory to follow up on his attack. He hated Ling Han to the core.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The other eleven people also launched an attack. They naturally would not just stand by and watch as Ling Han was killed. Otherwise, Ling Han’s fate would be something that they could foresee for themselves.","Now, they had to go through thick and thin.","Fight, fight, fight. Twelve extremely talented Foundation Building cultivators joined forces to fight a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator.","Even so, the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe was still completely on the upper hand.","Under the suppression of the Celestial Cauldron, aside from Ling Han, no one could unleash more than half of their battle prowess. Even if the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe was severely injured, they could only just barely parry his attacks","However, this caused everyone to be overjoyed. That was because the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe had sustained severe injuries, and was constantly bleeding. If he could not be treated, even if he was a Cauldron Forging Tier, so what? He would definitely die.","Thus, as long as Ling Han and the others could hold on, the one to fall at the end would definitely be the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe.","Moreover, the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe had also said that after a day, the Mystery Realm would shatter, and they would be able to leave.","As long as they could leave, then what was a mere Cauldron Forging Tier worth?","Thus, they definitely had to hold on.","The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe clearly knew this as well. His attacks became even more frenzied, wanting to kill these twelve people in front of him.","As long as he could do this, he would still be in charge here, and the inheritance of the Saint would eventually fall into his hands.","“Werewolf Transformation!”","He roared loudly, and large amounts of black hair grew from his whole body. He was also rapidly expanding, as if he had grown larger.","He had completely turned into a wolf.","The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe roared in fury, and with another wave of his claws, his attack power increased explosively.","He wasn’t a pure wolf, so he couldn’t maintain his werewolf form forever. However, during his transformation, his battle prowess had been astonishingly strengthened.","Ling Han humphed upon hearing this. He unleashed the Three Styles of the God of War and clashed head-on with the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","He delivered three consecutive moves, and every move exploded with destructive power that far surpassed his present battle prowess. Though this was still no match for the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe, he had forcefully withstood the latter’s initial burst of power, causing the High Priest’s fighting spirit to decrease drastically.","The other eleven people also used their ultimate moves, reducing the pressure on Ling Han. In this way, they finally managed to withstand the explosive burst of power from the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe.","“No!” the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe roared in fury, filled with defiance. He had painstakingly prepared for who knew how many millenia, and just when it looked like the inheritance of the Saint was about to appear, he was actually going to die.","He couldn’t accept this. He couldn’t accept this.."]},{"number":3731,"title":"Chapter 3731: Decapitation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3731: Decapitation","Editor: Henyee Translations","The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe put his life on the line, but he was half a native, so the techniques he had grasped were really limited. Even if he wanted to throw everything on the line, there was not much he could.","He brandished the walking stick. This was indeed a Spirit Tool, but that was a tool that the Ancient Sun Saint had set for him to control the formation restrictions here. In terms of battle prowess... its help was very, very small. Thus, though he was fighting with his life on the line, his battle prowess did not increase much.","“Go, he’s already at the end of his line.”","“Kill this old b@stard!”","“You actually want to kill us? How laughable!”","Everyone smirked coldly. Which one of them did not come from a noble background? Yet now, they were actually almost completely wiped out by an old Werewolf with a lowly status. This naturally was great hatred.","■■All of you deserve to die! All of you die!” the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe roared in fury. He continued to brandish his walking stick, sending out bursts of black energy that possessed extremely strong destructive power.","He was a Cauldron Forging Tier elite, after all. Not only could the Celestial Cauldron suppress all the Foundation Building Tiers, but the destructive power of his mystical power was also considerably higher.","Under such desperate attacks, no one dared to face him head-on. They all avoided him temporarily, and only trapped the other party, slowly exhausting him.","In any case, whether it was waiting until the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe died, or the Mystery Realm collapsing so that everyone could leave, it was good news for everyone.","He went all out for three times, and the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe no longer had any remaining courage.","His injuries were far too severe. He hadn’t simply lost a small half of his body. Instead, he had been wounded by the Heavenly Pattern Jade, a Two Star Spiritual Power Spirit Tool. Thus, the damage caused by the weapon would naturally prevent his wounds from healing.","Thus, the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe was bleeding endlessly. With every second that passed, his injuries would become heavier.","Once this desperate struggle was over, he would be at a disadvantage. “Die with me, b@stard!” The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe set his eyes on Ling Han. If it was not for the fact that this person had destroyed half of his body, how could he have fallen to this state?","It was all because of this person!","Thus, if he was going to die, he would drag Ling Han down with him.","He charged over, his speed extremely fast. He was incomparably furious, causing him to burn his potential again.","Ling Han was calm and composed as he unleashed the Imminent Skyline. Xiu!","He rapidly retreated.","The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe gloomily discovered that this Foundation Building Tier cultivator actually possessed speed that was not inferior to his own.","How was this possible?","He was a Cauldron Forging Tier! Even if he was severely wounded, he was still a Cauldron Forging Tier! How could he be unable to suppress Ling Han in terms of speed?","This human was practically a freak. Not only had he severely injured him, he had even prevented him from exacting revenge.","He helplessly watched as Ling Han maintained a distance from him. Meanwhile, he could clearly sense that his vitality was continuously declining, and his life force was presently draining away at an extremely fast pace.","He was about to die.","-No! No! No!” he shouted at the sky. He had schemed and prepared for so many years, but in the end, it was all for naught?","He was really unwilling to accept this.","But what was the use of being defiant?","Peng, he could no longer steady his footing. He staggered, and fell heavily onto the ground.","Shua, shua, shua! One after another, attacks slashed over. Everyone was experienced in battle, and not one of them approached personally. They only attacked from afar. Though the destructive power had been weakened, the advantage was that they were safe.","Pu, pu, pu! The High Priest of the Wolf Tribe endured all the attacks, and multiple wounds appeared on his tall body, tearing his body apart, revealing his eerily white bones and internal organs.","He really couldn’t take it anymore.","“Old geezer!” Someone walked forwards, and delivered a slash with his saber. Pa, the head of the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe was instantly severed.","This time, this old Werewolf was definitely dead.","Everyone finally breathed a sigh of relief, feeling a layer of cold sweat on their backs.","After all, it was a Cauldron Forging Tier that wanted to kill them. Furthermore, the timing and location were both beneficial to the High Priest of the Wolf Tribe. If it was not for the fact that Ling Han had made the beautiful first move, it was probable that they would have all died here today.","“Brother Ling, thank you.”","“Ling Han, I owe you my life.”","A great many people were magnanimous, and nodded in acknowledgement towards Ling Han, but there were also some that were feigning ignorance, and did not have the slightest reaction.please visit ” sitestorys(.)c0m ” maybe y0u will enj0y the captivating sh0rt st0ries.","Princess Bixiao was feeling very pleased. The more others praised Ling Han, the happier she was.She felt even happier than if they were praising her. “This is sister-in-law, right?” someone greeted Princess Bixiao with a smile. “Yo, Brother Ling, your daughter is already so big?” He turned around and said to Ling Han with a smile.","Ah, someone had misunderstood.","Princess Bixiao felt her pretty face flush hotly all of a sudden, but for some reason, she did not intend to argue. Instead, she tacitly agreed.","Ling Han wanted to clarify further. After all, Princess Bixiao was still a virgin, so how could her reputation be ruined?","Boom!","But he had not even opened his mouth, when the whole cave trembled, and then the violent tremors could not be stopped.","“The Mystery Realm is about to collapse?”","“Could it be that that old Werewolf wasn’t lying? Someone really obtained the inheritance of the Saint, so the Mystery Realm is about to collapse?” “That may not be the case. That old Werewolf may only think that he has everything under his control. Who knows, it may be the Ancient Sun Saint that caused him to think that way. Just think, practically everyone has a copy of the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll. Just how much of a troublemaker is this Saint?”","“... True.”","As they conversed, boom, a powerful force spread out, and no one was able to match it at all. Xiu, they only felt their vision blur, as if they had entered into a strange passage of illusions. There was a dazzling, magnificent light flashing before their eyes.","Before they could see clearly, they had already fallen out of this passageway. Yi, they had already left the Moon Occult Mystery Realm and arrived at the place where they had entered.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Immediately, a great many people shot over.","■?Have you obtained the inheritance of the Saint?” someone asked, standing in midair.","“Seventh Senior Brother, we’ve all been tricked.” A young man who had come out of the Mystery Realm took out the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll and handed it over.","The person in the sky descended, picked up the «Ancient Sun Divine Scroll» and flipped through it, not knowing whether to laugh or cry. “This is a widely circulated cultivation technique called «Universal Yang Techmque». Its grade is extremely low.”","“I also have one here.” Another person that had come out of the Mystery Realm took out the <<Ancient Sun Divine Scroll>>.","■■This is the Eighteen Styles of the Forest, a very low-level celestial technique.” Everyone took out the “Ancient Sun Divine Scroll” that they had obtained to give to their sects or the seniors of their clans. The result was the same. They were all an extremely ordinary celestial technique.","Ling Han was naturally making a fortune in secret. If he said that the real Ancient Sun Divine Scroll was actually in his head, he would probably be captured by a great elite in the next instant, and brought back to cast the Soul Searching Technique.","He quietly retreated, bringing Princess Bixiao and Sixth Baby back to the Imperial Capital.","This was the territory of the Dark North Nation, Chen Fengyan’s territory, so these people probably wouldn’t dare to use force. After all, among those who had come from other planets, the strongest was only the Core Formation Tier. Ling Han safely returned to the Imperial Capital. He immediately began to switch to cultivating the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll, and instantly felt as if he had been reborn.","As expected of the cultivation technique of a Saint. It was too awesome.."]},{"number":3732,"title":"Chapter 3732: Number One in the Galaxy","paragraphs":["Chapter 3732: Number One in the Galaxy","Editor: Henyee Translations","Compared to before, Ling Han’s cultivation speed had increased by at least 50 times.","Originally, if he crossed over a minor cultivation level, he would need about ten years or so without relying on external power. Now, it was only two to three months.","The cultivation technique of a Saint was so awesome!","In fact, Ling Han had relied on the Silver Dragon Fish and Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pills to cultivate to the peak stage of Human Dao Foundation in just a few months. From this, it could be seen just how inferior the Great Sun Lotus Technique was. It was actually so much inferior to alchemical pills and natural treasures.","Now that they were compared, it was clear just how powerful the cultivation technique of a Saint was.","Good news came one after another. Lin Luo, Zhou Heng and the others all leaped over the Celestial Gate and advanced into the Foundation Building Tier.","Ling Han made some queries. They had all crossed over the bronze, silver and gold Celestial Gates, but did not see the primitive Celestial Gate.","As expected, without the Power of Dimensions in his body, it was impossible to go to the fourth Celestial Gate.","Even so, the battle prowess of Lin Luo and the others was still extremely shocking. They were at least four stars in battle prowess.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then taught the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll to Lin Luo and the others. These were truly his own people. Ling Han hoped that they would be strong, and in future, every single one of them would be of help to him.","Lin Luo and the others didn’t stand on ceremony either. In any case, they had already accepted too many favors from Ling Han, so it didn’t matter if they received one more.","They were truly a family, so what need was there for them to be polite?","Ling Han smiled faintly. The Ancient Sun Divine Scroll thad come at just the right time. Lin Luo and the others were all prodigies among prodigies. With the cultivation technique of a Saint, their future prospects were limitless.","The empress, Hu Niu, and the large black dog had also reached the Mystery Realm Tier. As long as they unlocked all the apertures in their bodies, they would also be able to break through to the Foundation Building Tier.","Everything was so wonderful.","The little loli had also returned. In a single stroke, she had bought over a hundred connecting devices. In her words, she had already made a trip anyways, so if she only bought a few, it would really be too unfair to her.","It would be good if there were more.","Ling Han took one for himself, then distributed one to Lin Luo and the others. The empress and Hu Niu naturally had one as well. However, they had not advanced into Celestial Path yet, and could not use it yet. That would need the support of an incredibly powerful Spiritual Power. Thus, it would at least have to be a Foundation Building Tier.","In high spirits, he put on the connection device. It was extremely small, only the size of a rice grain. It could be hidden in his hair, or even in his eyes, which was very convenient.","After putting it on, a cold voice suddenly sounded. “This connection device is currently not connected to any living being, and the soul of the wearer has not been tagged with any account number. May I ask if I need to create a new account number?”","“Yes,” Ling Han said mentally.","“Connecting to the Galaxy Network platform to create an account,” the voice said. After a while, it rang again. “The account has been established. You can set up a name for yourself.”","Ling Han pondered for a moment, before replying, “Number One in the Galaxy.”","The voice actually didn’t respond at the first instant. Instead, after a while, it asked in confusion, “Do you really want to use this name?”","“Of course,” Ling Han said with a smile. In any case, this was only a codename. As long as he didn’t say that “Number One in the Galaxy” on the net was Ling Han, it was fine.","“I hope you are worthy of this title.” The voice actually said something quite humane.","Ling Han was surprised, “Yi, you actually have emotions?”","The voice had already regained its coldness, “I am the soul of the Galaxy Network. I was created by the Four Directions Great Emperor, and possess absolute fairness. The information of every connecting user is absolutely classified. As long as you do not choose to make it public, it will definitely not be leaked.”","Ling Han chuckled. He believed in the secrecy of the Galaxy Network. After all, the Galaxy Network had operated for so many years, and he had never heard of anyone being leaked by the Chang Clan, leading to trouble.","This was also one of the reasons why everyone chose to connect to the Galaxy Network. This was absolutely private.","However, this Galaxy Network soul only spoke of fairness, but avoided the topic of “emotion”. It was quite interesting.","Ling Han didn’t pursue the matter. He finally had his own Galaxy Network account, and could get rich.","“I want to go to the Galaxy Network Tournament,” Ling Han said through his consciousness.","Xiu, it was as if his consciousness had instantly leaped countless distances, and a majestic giant city appeared in front of him.","“Because entering into the tournament requires the physical manifestation of the soul, which expends energy, so we have to collect fees.” The voice of the Galaxy Network’s soul sounded again, “Every day that you stay here will be charged one Universe Coin. If there is less than a day, it will also be charged as a day.”","‘F*ck! This is daylight robbery!’","Ling Han did not lack Dao Stones in his possession, but without going to the redemption points set up by the Chang Clan to trade for Universe Coins, he could be considered extremely poor.","“Add a friend for me,” Ling Han said. He recited Lin Xiu’s account number.","“A friend request has been sent. Please wait.”","It wasn’t long before Ling Han received a notification. His friend request had been approved.","“Brother Ling, is that you?” Lin Xiu’s voice was heard.","This was naturally his consciousness. Through the Galaxy Network, he had traversed who knew how far.","Ling Han nodded, “It’s me.”","When he had applied for a friend request, he had chosen to hide his name. Thus, on Lin Xiu’s side, only Ling Han’s account number could be seen. That was a series of extraordinarily long numbers, because from ancient times until now, who knew how many people had connected to Galaxy Network. This account number was naturally chillingly long.","However, Ling Han also added a note to his application: “I am Ling Han.” It was because of this that Lin Xiu had approved at the first instant.","Of course, Lin Xiu still had to confirm it.","The two of them turned on the video communication. Instantly, the two of them were in the same room, and could clearly see each other, but they were in a virtual room.","“Now that you have your own Galaxy Network account, I’ll immediately transfer the money to you.” Lin Xiu was still very smart. He didn’t need Ling Han to explain his intentions.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Thanks for the trouble.”","“Don’t stand on ceremony with me,” Lin Xiu said. Then, he transferred all of Ling Han’s money over.","It wasn’t much, just a few hundred Universe Coins. However, as the starting capital, Ling Han felt that it was enough.","“Then I’ll get busy first. Let’s talk later.” Ling Han was in a rush to go to the competition ground.","“Alright.” Lin Xiu nodded.","Ling Han cut off the connection, then said, “Send me to the Tournament.”","This time, he was rich. After deducting a Universe Coin, he entered into the tournament.","He arrived at a room. There were no walls on the other side of the room, and he could clearly see the outside. However, it was an empty tournament ground.","“Newbie, familiarize yourself with the rules first,” The voice of Galaxy Network’s soul sounded. Pa, pa, pa! A pile of books fell from the sky and landed on the table.","This Galaxy Network soul definitely had its own willpower. Otherwise, it wouldn’t be so proud.","‘Aren’t I a manifestation of consciousness now? Can’t you directly transmit the rules to me?’","Ling Han mocked for a while, then picked up a book and flipped through it. Instantly, this information turned into a stream of consciousness that entered into his mind.."]},{"number":3733,"title":"Chapter 3733: Battle begins","paragraphs":["Chapter 3733: Battle begins","Editor: Henyee Translations","In the tournament, there were three types of spectator mode, tournament stage mode, and Galaxy Network Level Battles.","In the spectator mode, you could just sit in your room, and then you could browse through all the lists of battles that were taking place, or were about to take place. If you wanted to watch, you could just choose directly.","If this battle was not set up as a fee-paying mode, they could watch as they liked, but if it was set up as a fee-paying mode, they would have to pay to be able to watch.","If you retreated after watching half of it, you would have to pay a new fee for entering again.","There were two types of tournament stages. The first was defending champion mode, wherein you would set up your own tournament stage and allow challengers to enter. The second was challenge mode, wherein you would seek out defending champions to issue challenges.","Whether it was defending champion mode or challenge mode, there were a great many different types, such as matching of similar cultivation level, a one-on-one battle, a one-on-many battle, or a battle royale.","Of course, for everyone, the most important thing was still the Galaxy Network Level Battles, because they could only obtain points through this kind of battle, and be ranked accordingly.","Previously, it was said that someone was ranked 8o,oooth and 200,000th on the Galaxy Network, and that was through the Galaxy Network Level Battles.","With a thought from Ling Han, a virtual screen instantly appeared in front of him. There were three options on it, and they were spectator mode, tournament stage mode, and Galaxy Network Level Battles.","The Galaxy Network soul would only guide him at the entry level, and he could only operate on his own at other times. Thankfully, this was a completely mature virtual world. Even if there had been some small problems in the past, they would definitely have been fixed long ago.","Ling Han couldn’t possibly spend money to watch people fight. He was here to earn money.","Thus, he resolutely chose the tournament stage mode.","He chose to become the defending champion, and set the price for coming in to challenge him. A challenger would have to pay a Universe Coin, and if he lost, he would have to pay another ten Universe Coins.","Of course, it was the same if Ling Han lost. Ling Han would compensate the challenger with 10 Universe Coins.","The stakes were directly taken by the Galaxy Network platform. Whoever came in would immediately have ten Universe Coins taken, and whoever won would get it.","What was worse was that no matter who won or lost, the Galaxy Network platform would collect a service charge of ten thousandth the stakes.","It didn’t seem like much, but who knew how many people were fighting like this every day and every moment. That was a terrifying amount.","Moreover, Ling Han’s Universe Coins had been docked when he opened the tournament stage. This could not be refunded.","Ling Han waited and waited, but he kept seeing no one come in to challenge him.","He called up the tournament forum, and planned to ask what was going on.","Yi?","He was astounded, because he saw a main theme post that wrote, “An idiot has shockingly appeared, setting up a tournament stage and actually asking for money.”","Er, this wasn’t talking about him, was it?","Ling Han stretched out a hand and tapped on the virtual screen. This thread immediately opened.","Someone wrote a few words, and sure enough, they were targeting him. They mocked him mercilessly, and said that a rookie actually wanted to collect money for setting up a tournament stage, and was just thinking about money.","Actually, it was not inconceivable that one would have to pay to challenge others. Otherwise, the tournament would not have such a setting.","Most importantly, he was a pure rookie, and did not have any battle merits. Who would challenge him?","So that was the case.","Ling Han nodded. He turned off the defending champion mode, and entered into challenge mode.","He began to look for a suitable opponent.","“Welcoming Cauldron Forging Tier.”","“Looking for fellow cultivators of Core Formation Tier to spar with.”","“Are there any friends at the peak stage of True Self Tier? Waiting.”","On the virtual screen, there were multiple stage numbers that set the conditions for accepting challenges, such as cultivation level, fees, bets, and whatnot.","Ling Han made his choice. He chose Foundation Building Tier, and instantly, the information of the challenges from the other cultivation levels was no longer displayed.","“Welcoming a Foundation Building Tier cultivator, let’s spar.”","“Foundation Building Tier, ranked around 30 million.”","“Ranking of around 50 million may enter.”","Ling Han took a look. F***, they basically all required a ranking.","Then let’s fight the Galaxy Network Level Battles first.","Ling Han summoned the virtual screen and chose the level battle. He immediately received a notification that an opponent was being searched for. He estimated that he would have to wait for an hour.","F***,so long?","“Forget it, I’ll go and challenge first.”","Ling Han chose a tournament stage that didn’t require levels. He stretched out a finger and pressed down on the virtual screen. Instantly, his figure turned into bits of light and disappeared. When he reappeared, he was already in a massive tournament ground.","On the other side, there was a tall, broad-shouldered young man. He looked quite handsome. However, the appearance that he showed here could all be disguised. Ling Han, for example, had completely become a different person.","Otherwise, merely using a code name would definitely not be enough to completely conceal his identity.","“Haha, Number One in the Galaxy?” That person was stunned. He had also discovered the code name that Ling Han had come up with. This was really daring, and looking at Ling Han’s past battle merits.","— Galaxy Network Rankings: Zero, ranked 1,286,753,433.","—Battle experience, zero.","Number of victories: zero wins and zero losses, zero draws.","‘Oh, so he’s a pure rookie. This is his first battle in the tournament.’","“Haha, what shameless boasting. A rookie actually dares to come up with such an exaggerated name.” That person laughed loudly, and charged towards Ling Han. “Today, let me teach you a lesson, and let you know the cruelty of the world.”","Ling Han moved. He had never battled in Galaxy Network Tournament before, so he needed to familiarize himself with it first.","At present, he was purely a soul, but he felt that his battle prowess had been completely replicated. Whatever celestial technique or whatever other technique, he could use it as normal, and there was no problem at all.","The power of a Great Emperor was truly kickass.","“Brat, aren’t you Number One in the Galaxy? What is it? Do you only know how to dodge?” That person laughed loudly, closing in on him with every move.","Ling Han felt that he was more or less familiarized now, so he raised a fist, which directly penetrated the other’s defense. With a peng, the other was instantly sent flying.","Pa, that person fell onto the ground, and his figure instantly turned into bits of light that disappeared.","This was the Galaxy Network’s judgement that he had already been “killed” by Ling Han, and had lost the right to continue fighting.","Xiu, Ling Han also retreated out of the battle area, and entered into the room from before — perhaps it had been changed, and the arrangements here were all the same. Who knew if he had entered into the same room.","He looked at his battle merits, which had become one win, zero loss and zero draw. However, Galaxy Network’s ranking was still a pitiful zero.","He hadn’t participated in the ranking battles yet, so he naturally wouldn’t have Galaxy Network’s rankings.","Again.","He searched again. As long as there was no requirement for rankings, he would enter and begin the battle.","In the Foundation Building Tier, he was already rarely matched. Once he familiarized himself with his current battle style, he instantly displayed an invincible battle prowess.","Peng! Peng! Peng!","He crushed everything in his path, and no one could withstand a single punch from him. In a short ten minutes, he had already defeated thirteen opponents.","This time, he had also gained some fame in the tournament forum.","—A mysterious elite had shockingly appeared, and had won all eleven battles.","Someone posted a thread, which instantly caused a great many people to discuss spiritedly.."]},{"number":3734,"title":"Chapter 3734: A good start","paragraphs":["Chapter 3734: A good start","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han clicked open the forum thread and looked at it. This was indeed talking about him..","Aside from the fact that he had won all eleven battles, his name had also been used to stir up the flames. After all, he was Number One in the Galaxy. This was really too much of a mockery.","■?What kind of person is he? He has only won eleven consecutive battles, and he dares claim to be Number One in the Galaxy?”","“Hehe, he came up with such a name before battling.","“In terms of showing off, I am impressed!","“Haha, winning eleven consecutive battles doesn’t mean anything. After all, this isn’t a ranking battle. If it’s just winning against some random people, that wouldn’t have much meaning either.”","“All right, let me make a list. Everyone, come and see who this Number One in the Galaxy has defeated, and who he will defeat next.","Everyone replied one after another, and it was very lively.","Ling Han also stepped forward, and said, “If you’re not convinced, then come","fight me. I’ll open the tournament stage.”","Since his reputation had already been established, it was time for him to reap his rewards.","Ling Han reopened the tournament stage. After having one Universe Coin taken, he still set up a wager, but cancelled the fee for going up to the tournament. In the setting for watching the battle, he chose to make watching the battle free of payment.","This was naturally temporary. When he made a greater name for himself, if they wanted to watch him fight, they would have to pay.","“If anyone is dissatisfied, come fight me.” He created a new post on the forum, and began the path of mass ridicule.","It wasn’t long before someone chose to battle him.","After receiving a notification from the Galaxy Network platform, Ling Han accepted the challenge. Instantly, his figure turned into bits of light, and when he reformed, he had already entered into the tournament grounds.","His opponent was a young man filled with heroic spirit. The other party had not hidden his battle merits, and it was clear at a glance.","“Ceng Huayun, Galaxy Network’s ranking is 975,884,250. He has participated in 1006 battles, winning 305 battles, lost 701 battles, with 0 draws.” Looking at the spectators’ seats around them, more than twenty people had entered, which could be considered pitifully few.","Though Ling Han had become slightly popular on the forums, there were still not many people that were willing to “waste” time to watch a rookie battle.","“Number One in the Galaxy, haha, brain muddled—","Peng!","That opponent was just about to laugh at Ling Han, but Ling Han had already rushed in front of that person in an instant. With a punch, that person was sent flying. While his body was still in midair, it turned into light fragments and dissipated.","Resolved.","Clean, decisive, and relaxed.","p***l","When the twenty over spectators saw this, they all looked incredibly stunned.","They had to be seeing things. This was too fast. He had resolved it with a single punch?","“Hurry up and watch the replay.”","we haven’t paid to record it yet.","If one was battling or watching the battles in the tournament grounds, they could pay the platform to record the battles, especially for the side that was battling. If one was to watch after their own battle, they could summarize their own shortcomings and make corrections.","“We can only wait for the next battle.”","Ling Han continued to wait for another challenge. This time, he had earned 10 Universe Coins. Very good, he finally had a good start.","In just a short while, another person came in to challenge him, and because of the previous battle, the spectators called their friends over, and a dozen over people surged in. At the first instant, they paid to have the tournament platform record the battle.","This time, Ling Han’s opponent was a middle-aged man. Without another word, he immediately charged towards Ling Han.","Ling Han didn’t hold back either. He simply threw a punch. Peng! The battle was over.","In the spectators’ seats, though everyone was already mentally prepared, they still could not hide their shock.","“This guy’s strength can definitely rank in the top 100 million.”","“Hence, those ranked below 100 million should not come here to ask for a","rebuff.”","Everyone was making their judgements.","Someone immediately went to post, directly posting the battle video that had just been recorded. This quickly attracted the attention of a great many people, and they all replied with posts, expressing their admiration for Ling Han s strength.","“I boldly predict that this will be a new star, destined to dazzle the universe in future.”","“Hehe, do you really think that he is Number One in the Galaxy?”","“Now, his opponents are all ranked below 800 million, so it’s naturally difficult for them to block a punch from him. Let’s wait until his opponents charge into","100 million first.”","“That’s right. 100 million is the first dividing line. Being able to rise above ten people within 100 million, he is qualified to be called a prodigy.","Most of the people who replied thought that Ling Han was far from being a supreme prodigy, what more the Number One in the Galaxy.","However, there were more and more people challenging Ling Han, but every single one of them was instantly “killed” with a single punch, causing Ling Han’s reputation to become greater and greater.","Someone posted on the forum: “I beg the top 100 million elites of the Foundation Building Tier to appear and teach a madman a lesson.” In the post, there was a detailed list of the opponents that Ling Han had defeated, and some were even accompanied by battle videos.","“Heh, who dares to use the title of Number One in the Galaxy? Let me teach him a lesson, and tell him to immediately scram and change his name!” someone replied.","“Yi, this is Almighty Guan!”","“He’s an elite ranked above 90 million.”","“Haha, it’s assured now.”","Ling Han received a notification from the tournament platform. Someone was challenging him, and just as he was about to confirm it, he received another notification.","He had finished queuing up, and it was time for the level battles.","Without the slightest hesitation, Ling Han chose the level battle. He waited for this for an hour, so its priority was naturally high.","“Yi?”","“Why hasn’t the battle begun yet?”","“That’s not right. There isn’t even a tournament stage left.”","“Has this guy fled?”","‘■Haha, what a joke. He ran away the moment he saw Great God Guan.” “It can’t be helped. Guan Xuan is an elite ranked above 90 million, so it’s normal that he doesn’t dare to accept the challenge.”","“Sigh, I’ve been anticipating for nothing.”","When everyone saw that the battle had not begun for a long time, they all shook their heads repeatedly, and Guan Xuan, who had issued a challenge to Ling Han, smirked coldly. He immediately went to the forum to post a post, mocking Ling Han.","At this moment, Ling Han was currently spacing out in a tournament hall in boredom. This level battle was different from the tournament stage mode. After entering into the tournament hall, he had three minutes to adjust his condition, and this was compulsory.","How depressing. No matter what, he could still fight two to three tournament battles in three minutes, and earn twenty to thirty Universe Coins.","Finally, the three minute countdown had passed, and the invisible barrier that had been restricting his movement area had disappeared, allowing him to move unhindered in this massive tournament area.","Of course, his opponent had also left the space that bound him, and strode out. In these three minutes, Ling Han naturally looked at his opponent s information as well, but very coincidentally, the latter was also a rookie of Galaxy Network, just like him. This was his first tournament battle.","“You are really unfortunate.” The person on the other side was called Zhao Yongsi. It was unknown whether it was his real name or just a random name. He was tall and slender, and had a handsome face. It was also unknown whether it was his true appearance.","He crossed his arms behind his back, and looked towards Ling Han, “Though like you, this is the first time that I have connected to the Galaxy Network, I had previously been cultivating in seclusion, and had absolutely no chance to obtain the connection device.”","“I’m a four-star genius of Heavenly Dao Foundation!","His expression was filled with arrogance. This was definitely not faked.."]},{"number":3735,"title":"Chapter 3735: Being looked down on","paragraphs":["Chapter 3735: Being looked down on","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself. How could this Zhao Yongsi have imagined that he wasn’t some rich second-generation young master who had only gotten a connection device right after advancing into the Foundation Building Tier?","They were both Foundation Building Tier cultivators, and he was confident that he could completely thrash even five-star geniuses of Ultimate Dao Foundation. Then what was this Zhao Yongsi worth?","“Come, you win if you can block ten moves from me.” Ling Han crooked a finger at him.","Zhao Yongsi couldn’t help but feel enraged. He was a well-known existence among the younger generation of the Flying Origin Planet, and came from an extraordinary background. It was also because of this that the rules of his clan were very strict. Only after passing the mental trial, was he allowed a connection device and come into contact with the wider world.","The reason why he was not allowed to come into contact with Galaxy Network at the first instant was because he feared that his Dao Heart would be unstable, and he would lose all confidence from being beaten by an even stronger prodigy.","After this mental trial, his Dao Heart had stabilized. No matter how badly he was thrashed, he would not be so dispirited that he would lose his fighting spirit, that he would become a piece of trash right after losing a battle.","Thus, even though he wasn’t ranked in the Galaxy Network, in terms of true strength, he could be ranked in the top 20 Foundation Building Tiers on the Flying Origin Planet. This was still because he was a Heavenly Dao Foundation.","When he advanced into Ultimate Dao Foundation, he should be the top elite. After all, he was a four-star genius, and only one would appear in each generation.","Of course, in the universe, there were quite a number of four-star geniuses, and there were even freakish geniuses surpassing four stars.","A great prodigy like him, a great elite, and someone actually said that he would be defeated within ten moves?","Hehe, what a joke, the biggest joke in the world.","“Shameless boasting!” he smirked coldly. Then, with a leap, he charged towards Ling Han, “Brat, today, I will let you know what the difference in strength means. Remember this lesson and my name. Very soon, I, Zhao Yongsi, will become famous throughout the world!”","Ling Han stood still, waiting for his opponent to reach him. Only then did he throw a punch.","Zhao Yongsi faced the attack head-on. Boom! The two powers collided, and his expression immediately changed drastically. However, the majestic energy had already surged over, sending him flying.","Actually, there was no real clash of power. It was just that the Galaxy Network platform had simulated their mystical power, Spiritual Power, and corresponding techniques.","Why did it seem so real?","That naturally was the power of the Great Emperor. Every Ancestral King stood at the pinnacle of the world, and had been invincible for an era. Aside from being unable to attain immortality, they were definitely omnipotent.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Is that all you’ve got? Then you mightn’t even be able to withstand three moves.”","He did not use his full strength, but even so, the power of that punch was still not something that Zhao Yongsi could contend against.","Zhao Yongsi was slightly taken aback. If it was not for the fact that the number of Ling Han’s battles could not be faked, he would really suspect that this was a Cauldron Forging Tier or even stronger prodigy that had suppressed his cultivation level and was battling him.","Why was he so strong?","He was already a super rookie, so how could there be anyone more outstanding than him?","Zhao Yongsi did not believe this. He roared loudly, and charged towards Ling Han again.","Ling Han was completely unconcerned. He stretched out a hand to press, lay, control and parry, yet easily blocked all of Zhao Yongsi’s attacks. Furthermore, after each time he had defended, he still had excess power to blast towards Zhao Yongsi, causing him to feel incredibly terrible.","“Nine moves?” he asked with a smile.","Zhao Yongsi did not speak. He already knew that it was impossible for him to defeat Ling Han. His only hope was to withstand ten moves from Ling Han. In that way, at least he would not lose completely.","“Ah!” he roared loudly, channelling his strongest celestial technique. High- level energy surged, and his right hand actually turned into a green dragon’s head, which blasted towards Ling Han.","Ling Han also became slightly more serious as he unleashed his Demonic Monkey Fists at Zhao Yongsi.","Peng!","The Demonic Monkey Fists gave rise to boundless might, and was not something that Zhao Yongsi could stand against at all. With a single strike, he was sent flying, and his body turned into bits of light that immediately disappeared without a trace.","“Congratulations on obtaining your first victory. In this battle, you have obtained ten points. Seven hours later, the rankings will be updated according to the points.”","The basis for matching for the level battles was points. It was always those who had about the same points that would be exchanging blows with each other. Those who were stronger would rapidly rise, and those whose abilities were weak would be stuck at a certain point range, neither high nor low.","Because a loss would result in a deduction of points.","—Of course, for example, Zhao Yongsi had zero points in the first place, so there were no points to be deducted. There would not be any situation of negative points.","Ling Han also left the battle area. He returned to his “room” and continued to line up for the ranking battles. Another hour or so passed.","According to the rules of the tournament, the ranking battles would only be effective for the first three battles every day. Afterward, in any consecutive battle, and no matter who won or lost, there would be no points added or subtracted — the same was true for the opponent.","The ranking battles would be matched according to points. If one defeated someone who was ranked higher than himself, the points they would obtain would correspondingly be slightly more, and if they lost to someone who was ranked lower than themselves, the points deducted would also be slightly more.","Some people had calculated that even if they maintained a battle merit of complete victory, and fighting three rounds every day, it would still take at least a year to be able to enter into the top 1000.","If they could directly issue a challenge, perhaps a rookie would immediately become the strongest person in the rankings, but that was too exaggerated, and the current level battles could guarantee those in the top 1000 or top 10,000 were definitely true prodigies.","Ling Han went to the forum to take a look, and discovered that there were a great many additional posts on it. They were all directed at his “fleeing before battle”, expressing strong disdain towards him.","He went to open the tournament stage again, but no one came to accept the challenge. Instead, they sent him private messages, and insulted him for a while, forcing Ling Han to activate the function of only receiving private messages from his friends. Only then did the commotion finally calm down.","Yi, previously, he had only gone to participate in the level battle, and that was actually seen by others as abandoning the battle and becoming a deserter?","Forget it. He had also earned a considerable amount of Universe Coins today. Furthermore, as an elite, he could not stay at this level all the time. That was beneath him, and it would not be easy for him to earn a lot of money in future.","Ling Han didn’t exit the Galaxy Network platform. Instead, he went to the Alchemical Pill Hall.","Here, there were a great many alchemists selling alchemical pills. As long as you paid, you could directly get someone to pick up the goods. Of course, you could also choose to have the goods sent over, as long as the place you were at had a galaxy-level Transfer Formation.","—The transportation fees would be covered by the buyer.","Alchemists were a very rare profession, and the appearance of the Galaxy Network was extremely beneficial for alchemists. It could allow more people to fight over limited resources, which naturally doubled the status of alchemists.","What Ling Han wanted was not alchemical pills, but rather suitable pill recipes.","Pill recipes were unique. As long as they appeared once on the Galaxy Network platform, only the first seller would be able to continue selling them. The others would be counted as pirated copies, and if they were discovered, the culprit would be heavily punished.","Ling Han searched for the pill recipe that was most suited to him at this moment.","Firstly, he was presently only Foundation Building Tier, so his spiritual power was limited. At most, he could only concoct Two Star alchemical pills, which was also applicable to those in Cauldron Forging Tier. This was a very large restriction.","Secondly, he wanted to find a pill recipe that few other alchemists could concoct. This way, he could also concoct a cauldron’s worth of alchemical pills, but the profits would be ten times or even a hundred times that of alchemists of the same level.","“It’s you!”"]},{"number":3736,"title":"Chapter 3736: Foundation Dissolution Pill","paragraphs":["Chapter 3736: Foundation Dissolution Pill","Editor: Henyee Translations","Foundation Dissolution Pill.","Ling Han chose this pill recipe. He was sure that this pill recipe would generate astonishing wealth for him.","What was the Foundation Dissolution Pill?","After consumption, it could melt the foundations of the Celestial Path.","Yi, then wasn’t this thing akin to poison to cultivators? Why would Ling Han still choose it?","That was because when a Foundation Building cultivator broke through, he would first have to melt his own Celestial Foundation, and the Foundation Dissolution Pill would be of great help.","For example, if a Human Dao Foundation wanted to break through to Heavenly Dao Foundation, they would first have to disintegrate the Human Dao Foundation, remove the impurities and preserve the purities. Then, with this as their core, they would be able to forge a new Celestial Foundation.","There was a problem with this. The foundation stones of the Celestial Path were incredibly sturdy, and some people did not have the ability to destroy it on their own.","This was not a fight, where the cornerstone of the Celestial Path could be forcefully shattered.","Thus, the Foundation Dissolution Pill could be of great help. Furthermore, the Foundation Dissolution Pill could also remove impurities, and further extract the purity of the foundation stones of the Celestial Path.","The Foundation Dissolution Pill could be ingested many times, purifying the foundation stone of the Celestial Path gradually. In this way, the Heavenly Dao Foundation that was molded would definitely be even more flawless and perfect.","The more perfect the foundation stone of the Celestial Path was, the more effective it would be in suppressing other foundation stones of the Celestial Path, and the higher the immunity to high-level foundation stones of the Celestial Path, or even the Celestial Cauldron.","For example, Ling Han. His Celestial Foundations were extremely perfect, and even Saints could not possibly suppress him. And once his Celestial Foundation was unleashed, which Foundation Building cultivator would not have their abilities decreased drastically?","After saying so much, the effects of the Foundation Dissolution Pill were naturally clear, but the problem was, since this alchemical pill was so effective, then there should be a lot of alchemists refining it, right? Once there was a large number, wouldn’t they still be worthless?","Hehe, this was linked to one of the ingredients in the Foundation Dissolution Pill.","Actually, it could not be considered raw ingredient, but when concocting the Foundation Dissolution Pill, an alchemist needed to infuse a sliver of power from his own Celestial Foundation into it. This was extremely important. Without this sliver of power from the Celestial Foundation, the Foundation Dissolution Pill would be a useless pill.","This decided that only alchemists at the level of Foundation Building Tier could concoct Foundation Dissolution Pills.","However, there was another problem. The difficulty level of refining this Foundation Dissolution Pill was extremely high. Usually, only Earth Tier alchemists would have enough skill to refine it.","Alchemists also had the requirement of cultivation level. For example, Ling Han was freakish in alchemy, but now, at most, he could only concoct Human Tier Medium Grade Celestial pills, and if he wanted to become an Earth Tier alchemist, he would have to at least have the cultivation level of Core Formation Tier,","If an Earth Tier alchemist did not have the power of the Celestial Foundation, how could he concoct the Foundation Dissolution Pill?","The Foundation Dissolution Pill was very expensive, and there was no lack of buyers but no one willing to sell it. This was because only a limited number of alchemist prodigies that could refine it. Moreover, the Foundation Dissolution Pills that they refined were not sold at all. Their own forces were already short of supply, so how could they possibly sell them?","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face, “I am the only one who can earn this money.”","He bought the pill recipe for the Foundation Dissolution Pill. This pill recipe wasn’t too expensive. It only cost 500 Universe Coins.","Looking at the ingredients he needed, Ling Han gritted his teeth slightly. This could not possibly be gathered on the Celestial Sea Planet.","Thankfully, wasn’t there the Galaxy Network?","Ling Han could purchase it on the Galaxy Network, and have someone send it directly to Celestial Sea Planet via a Transfer Formation.","However, there were two problems with this. Firstly, would the seller not deliver the goods after receiving the money? Secondly, even if the seller delivered the goods, the Transfer Formation wasn’t his, so what if someone else took it?","Of course, Ling Han could also use the Transfer Formation or the shuttle to directly retrieve the goods from the seller’s planet. However, if he did this, it was either that the fee would far exceed the value of the Foundation Dissolution Pill or it would take too long, and it would be completely not worth it.","“Though the Celestial Sea Planet has awakened, it has been destroyed in the ancient times. In the end, it can’t compare to the real great planets.”","Ling Han sighed. Furthermore, now that the various great forces were entrenched here, they were storing all the Celestial medicines themselves, and could not be taken out to be sold at all. Even if they had the ingredients he needed, it would be useless.","By the looks of it, the Celestial Sea Planet was still unsuitable for cultivation — those below the Celestial Path could still be quickly promoted, but after coming to the Foundation Building Tier, the shortcomings were obvious.","The Galaxy Network Platform did have a mechanism to ensure the safety of goods, and that was after the buyer chose to buy, he would first have to transfer the money through the Galaxy Network Platform, and then the Galaxy Network Platform would be responsible for delivering the goods. When the goods had arrived for inspection, and after they had passed the inspection, only then would the money be transferred to the seller.","During this process, the Galaxy Network Platform would not collect service fees, but would collect transportation fees.","However, this method was only limited to those forces of the Chang Clan on various planets, because goods could only be delivered through a Transfer Formation. They only had to accept delivery of goods from this side of the formation.","Why was there no one to rob the goods of the Chang Clan?","Hehe, what kind of existence was the Chang Clan?","An Imperial Clan!","Furthermore, who would dare to rob the goods of the Chang Clan? Wouldn’t they be afraid that the Chang Clan would ban them, so that you would never be able to connect to the Galaxy Network, and truly become a native?","There were no forces of the Chang Clan on the Celestial Sea Planet, so it was a pity.","Ling Han could only make a trip to other great planets in the future, and purchase all the ingredients in one go. Then, he would concoct the Foundation Dissolution Pill there, and sell it through the Galaxy Network and the like. In any case, he did not have to bear the problem of the transportation fees.","In that case, he only had to teleport himself twice, and the fee would decrease greatly. No matter what, he would still have a profit.","After browsing for a while, an hour finally passed. He had joined the queue, and entered into the tournament grounds to begin the second ranking battle.","The opponent this time was not a pure rookie, but with such a low ranking, how could he possibly be a match for Ling Han?","With a light wave of his hand, Ling Han ended the battle.","This time, he received eleven points.","The opponent this time was clearly weak, so why had Ling Han obtained even more points?","That was because this second opponent had higher points.","Wasn’t this unfair?","It was slightly unfair, but compared to the overall justness of the points system, this little bit of unfairness had absolutely no effect.","Ling Han continued to line up. There were three rounds in a day, and he had to fight until the limit was reached.","He had time again, and came to the training hall.","This was a place to test one’s power. As mentioned before, Heaven Crushing, Origin and Myriad Dao, these three supreme prodigies, had repeatedly broken records in history, which included the limit of power in the training hall.","Entering here, one would have to pay an additional fee, because the test required the soul to take form first, and they would have to simulate the power and moves of the cultivator. This would consume additional energy, so there was naturally a fee.","So be it.","This was the same as the tournament. It cost one Universe Coin a day, which was very expensive.","After Ling Han paid, he entered the training hall.","The Celestial Path had nine levels, but there were only eight branch halls here, which corresponded to the cultivation level of the eight cultivation levels from Foundation Building to Silent Destruction Tiers. The only one missing was the Ancestral King level.","After becoming the Ancestral King, Galaxy Network couldn’t simulate the power of the Great Emperor at all.","Furthermore, the Ancestral King was already invincible, and could only appear once in an era, so what need was there for him to test his power?","He was number one in the world.","Even if all the Ancestral Kings in history were added together, just how many were there in total?","Ling Han naturally entered into the Foundation Building branch hall.","He took a look. Though this was a training hall, the power of the test was also varied.","Punch power, kick power, explosive power, and so on.","The least restricted was explosive power. No matter what method you used to blast the strength tester, it was fine. As long as the value was high enough, it would appear on the leaderboard.","And in this area, the name of Origin was high on the leaderboard."]},{"number":3737,"title":"Chapter 3737: On the Roll","paragraphs":["Chapter 3737: On the Roll","Editor: Henyee Translations","It was Origin, a rookie that had suddenly appeared. No one knew his origins, and he was extremely mysterious.","However, it was this kind of person who had have the top explosive power in history at the Foundation Building Tier.","Ling Han stopped to watch. Aside from the lofty name of Origin, there was also a virtual screen beside him, on which a hundred names were listed.","These were the cultivators who had broken through to the Foundation Building Tier and entered the top 100 in terms of explosive power.","The first place was naturally still held by Origin, the record holder of the first place in all of history. Even if he died or his cultivation level increased, the position of first place would not change. As long as the Galaxy Network was not destroyed, and no one had surpassed it, his name would remain in this position forever.","Second was... Heaven Crushing, and third was Myriad Dao!","Origin, Heaven Crushing, Myriad Dao, these three people were all rookies that had suddenly appeared, yet all of them had broken records of all eternity. This was practically enough to make one speechless.","Yi?","This explosive power ranking was actually further divided into three, corresponding respectively to the Human Dao Foundation List, the Heavenly Dao Foundation List, and the Ultimate Dao Foundation List.","Of course, the first place on the Ultimate Dao Foundation Leaderboard was definitely the first place on the general leaderboard, because through the ages, there were innumerable prodigies. Was it possible to surpass the Ultimate Dao Foundation in terms of explosive power when one was in Heavenly Dao Foundation or Human Dao Foundation?","—If it was only limited to Celestial Sea Planet, Ling Han already had the confidence that he was the strongest in Foundation Building Tier when he was in Human Dao Foundation. However, in the entire universe, or even in fact compared to the prodigies of all eternity, he naturally wouldn’t be so blind.","He swept an eye over them. The name of Origin was shining above all the strength testers on the three leaderboards, and on the detailed leaderboard, Heaven Crushing and Myriad Dao were ranked second and third on the Ultimate Dao Foundation Leaderboard.","It wasn’t that they didn’t have enough explosive power when they were in Human Dao Foundation or Heavenly Dao Foundation, but rather that they had already advanced into Ultimate Dao Foundation. Unless they were the strongest in history, they couldn’t possibly leave their names on the Human Dao Foundation Leaderboard and Heavenly Dao Foundation Leaderboard.","On the other side, there were a few people testing their strength.","“Brother Ma has broken through to Heavenly Dao Foundation this time, and has also fused with an ancient Celestial stone, so his abilities have improved drastically.”","“This time, Brother Ma will definitely make it into the rankings.”","“Not only is he going to make it into the rankings, but he’s also going to become the number one person in history!”","“The so-called Origin, Myriad Dao, Heaven Crushing, all of them can only become stepping stones for Brother Ma.”","Those people were all cheering on the young man who was about to begin testing his strength. The person called Brother Ma looked to be in his mid-twenties. He had a handsome face, a slender figure, and had a kind of pride.","Towards his companion’s flattery, this Brother Ma chose to accept it completely, without the slightest bit of modesty.","His name was Ma Ning, and he was the true disciple of a great sect. He was quite valued by his sect.","And not too long ago, he had accidentally obtained a Celestial stone. It actually sank into his body when he had broken through to Heavenly Dao Foundation, and fused with the cornerstone of the Celestial Path, causing his strength to improve greatly.","“If Brother Ma makes it into the rankings this time, he would definitely be able to replace the current Dao Child.”","“That’s right. Even if this leaderboard is only focused on current Foundation Building cultivators, to be able to squeeze into the top 100 in the entire universe, that is definitely a prodigy among prodigies.”","“Brother Ma, we’ll all follow you in the future.”","Everyone continued to flatter him.","Ma Ning smiled proudly. He made his preparations. There was no time limit to this.","Ling Han also crossed his arms over his chest as he watched from the sidelines. He wanted to watch the excitement.","“Brat, you are really lucky to be able to witness this historical moment!” Someone saw Ling Han and immediately said to him.","Ling Han mocked internally. The people on the leaderboard were all in the Foundation Building Tier, so what kind of historical moment was this?","Unless one could overwhelm the ages and become the first in history, that would be the true historical moment.","He couldn’t be bothered to lower himself to the same level as these people. Furthermore, battling through the Galaxy Network would not hurt, so there was no need to waste his energy.","Ma Ning naturally saw Ling Han as well. He showed an expression of pride. Come, witness the moment of his rise.","He moved. Boom, his whole person rushed out, like a wild bull.","Peng!","His whole person had really crashed into the strength tester. The surface of the force he exerted was as big as a wall, so there was absolutely no need for him to worry that he would miss.","After the collision, numbers immediately flashed on the wall-like surface of the impact point, and finally stopped.","Six, six, seven, five.","“What, only the standard strength of 6650?”","“It can’t be, right? Previously, the Dao Child even shot out standard strength of more than 7000.”","Ma Ning’s companions were all whispering among themselves. Though power could not represent everything, it was the most direct embodiment of battle prowess.","Meanwhile, Ma Ning flew into a humiliated rage. This time, he was filled with confidence and planned to make it into the rankings first. In fact, he might even become number one in history. Then, becoming a Dao Child would be a sure bet.","However, he had never imagined that reality would be so cruel.","He... was still a long way off.","“I didn’t perform well just now,” he said.","He began to make preparations again. He was going to do it again.","Ling Han was displeased. ‘This training hall isn’t owned by you, so you can’t always occupy it all by yourself, right?’","He walked up, his attitude very obvious.","“Get lost!” Ma Ning shouted.","“That’s right. In front of my Brother Ma, what right do you have to step forward?”","“Obediently watch from the sidelines. There’s a gap of a few stars between you and Brother Ma. Don’t hinder Brother Ma!”","“Scram.”","Those people also shouted one after another. Some of them even came over to shove him.","Ling Han humphed. The souls here had taken solid form, so force could be used.","He shook lightly, and peng, that person was sent flying.","“How dare you!”","“You actually dare to make a move on us!”","“Are you tired of living?”","Everyone shouted. They were overlords on their own planets, and following Ma Ning around to strut around, they were used to being fearless.","Ling Han ignored him, and strode forwards.","Ma Ning wanted to stop him, but Ling Han had already shot out a punch at the strength tester.","He didn’t use any techniques, and it was just an ordinary punch.","Peng!","The strength tester trembled violently, and then numbers appeared. They flashed continuously, and soon stopped.","37,588.","Hiss!","In that instant, Ma Ning and the others all gulped. Though they were actually soul form, and did not have any saliva to swallow at all, they had only subconsciously made this action.","Over 30,000, close to 40,000.","In comparison, what was standard strength of over 6000 that Ma Ning had blasted out worth?","Strength was indeed not the only thing that battle prowess counted for, but it was the most important component. With a power gap of six times between the two sides, battle prowess would also be overwhelming.","Moreover, they suddenly recalled that Ma Ning had prepared for a long time for this attack, and what about Ling Han? A casual punch.","“Look, he’s on the leaderboard!” someone whispered.","As expected, there was another person in the top hundred, and he was ranked seventy-sixth.","In other words, Ling Han’s explosive power could be ranked 76th among all the Heavenly Dao Foundations in history. This result was enough to cause a commotion in the universe, and whichever great sect he went, there would be a fight to take him in as disciple.","“Number One in the Galaxy!” someone murmured. This was Ling Han’s name in Galaxy Network. No matter what record he broke, this was his name on the leaderboard.."]},{"number":3738,"title":"Chapter 3738: Second","paragraphs":["Chapter 3738: Second","Editor: Henyee Translations","“What arrogance!” Ma Ning said through gritted teeth, filled with jealousy.","He didn’t break records, and in fact, he was still very far from making it into the rankings. However, Ling Han easily fought his way to the seventy-sixth place. Even if he spoke arrogantly, his abilities were still clear for all to see. There was no real battle here, so Ma Ning didn’t need to be afraid that Ling Han’s strength would crush him.","‘What? You think you can hit me?’","Ling Han couldn’t even be bothered to pay attention to him. He was slightly surprised. Although he hadn’t used his full strength in this punch, he had only ranked 76th?","-If this thought of his was known to others, they would definitely rain insults on him.","Just a casual punch, and you got into the 76th place of the Heavenly Dao Foundations, what else do you want? Do you have to get first place?","Ling Han accumulated power slightly and channeled out the Demonic Monkey Fists. Peng, he delivered another blow onto the strength tester.","98,634.","On the strength tester, a terrifying number froze, and Ling Han’s name also shot up from 76th to 9th.","This was crazy!","Ma Ning and the others were all gaping, completely rendered speechless.","Though this was only the current leaderboard of Heavenly Dao Foundation, to be able to make it into the top nine, what kind of astonishing result was that?","“Come and see, a super awesome person has appeared at the Foundation Building training hall.”","Ma Ning and the others weren’t the only ones here. It was just that the others weren’t testing their explosive power. However, Ling Han had made it into the rankings twice. With such a large number, how could no one have seen it?","Perhaps someone had missed the first time, but the second time would definitely be witnessed by a great many people.","Calling for friends, one after another, people appeared.","This was the Galaxy Network, and through the means of the Great Emperor, it had connected the souls of countless people across the universe. Naturally, this could be done with a single thought, and there was no sense of distance at all.","In just a short while, countless people had appeared here. Thankfully, this was a virtual reality. Once there were too many people, the venue would automatically enlarge, so there was no need to worry about feeling crowded. “Number One in the Galaxy?”","“F***, what bold words.”","“Yi, I know this person. Just now, he was still fighting on the tournament stage.”","“That’s him.”","“Yi, didn’t this guy flee before the battle?”","“That’S right. He encountered Guan Xuan, and did not even dare to fight.”","Hold on, that Guan Xuan who is ranked more than 90 million?”","“That’s him.”","“Til be the one chuckling. This guy’s explosive power has already charged into ninth place on the Heavenly Dao Foundation Leaderboard, and you’re actually telling me that he’s afraid of someone who’s ranked more than ninety million on the Galaxy Network Leaderboard?”","“Er...”","Being able to charge into the top nine in terms of explosive power in Heavenly Dao Foundation, this kind of battle prowess could be ranked quite high even in Ultimate Dao Foundation. There was definitely no problem for him to battle against someone who was ranked above ninety million.","Fled before battle?","What kind of joke was this?","“Yi, this guy seems to be about to try again.”","Everyone could see that Ling Han had raised his fist again.","“No way, he is still not satisfied with the ninth place?”","Boom!","Ling Han threw a punch. This time, he wrapped the Heavenly Dao Flames around his fist. Galaxy Network would simulate it.","His fist landed on the strength tester, and the numbers flashed madly again. 138,621.","It had reached a new height again.","“Heavens, close to 140,000.”","This guy’s battle prowess can probably crush 99% of those in Ultimate Dao Foundation.”","“If anyone says that he’s afraid to fight that Guan Xuan, I’ll drown him with a mouthful of saliva.”","“This is too terrifying. Standard strength of 140,000. Even in Ultimate Dao Foundation, this could probably advance into the top 1000.”","“Yes, someone has done an experiment. The standard strength of 100,000 of Heavenly Dao Foundation is equivalent to standard strength of 10,000 of Ultimate Dao Foundation. His results can definitely rank him in the top 1000 of the Ultimate Dao Foundation Leaderboard.”","Everyone cried out, feeling their scalps go numb.","Ma Ning and the others were already completely silent, and dejectedly retreated to the side.","In front of them was a rising star that could illuminate the universe. Relatively speaking, they were nothing.","“What rank is this?”","“Second, second!”","“Heavens!”","First place was impossible, because first place was first place for all eternity. Whether the record holder was now in the Foundation Building Tier or had already become an Ancestral King, his name would not be removed.","After countless years, who knew how many prodigies were pushing up this record? If one wanted to reach the top, they would have to surpass all the prodigies in history.","Was this possible?","A super monster had just appeared, and in fact, hr had surpassed many Ancestral Kings in the past. Could it be that an even more freakish person would appear?","“What a pity.”","“En, if this person appeared before Origin, it’s really possible that he could suppress eternity and obtain first place.”","“But now?”","“He can only be ranked second.”","However, being ranked second in the galaxy is also incredibly awesome.”","His fate was not good, and he encountered Origin.”","Hehe, there’s also Myriad Dao and Heaven Crushing. Although they’re suppressed by Origin in terms of power, their speed and comprehension ability have each broken an eternal record. Their overall strength isn’t weak at all.” “Being born in the present era is the tragedy of every prodigy. Three such monsters have appeared.”","Everyone shook their heads. Ling Han’s results were indeed astonishing, but with the existence of a monster like Origin, he was firmly suppressed.","-In the past, it was already enough to fight for second place, because the first place had long since belonged to the great elite who had passed away countless years ago.","But this time was different. Origin was still alive and well, and was even only in Ultimate Dao Foundation.","Ling Han was also slightly surprised. He had used the Demonic Monkey Fists and the Heavenly Dao Flames, yet he had actually failed to get first place?","This Origin was truly powerful.","Again.","Ling Han used the Demonic Monkey Fists again. This time, it was a series of","108 attacks, and added with the Heavenly Dao Flames, the Demonic Monkey Fists landed heavily on the strength tester.","195,574-","Everyone was once again petrified, unable to say a single word.","As it turned out, standard strength of over 130,000 was still not Ling Han’s limit. This guy had almost blasted out standard strength of 200,000.","“This kind of explosive power... even in Ultimate Dao Foundation, he can be ranked around 800th.”","“Heavens, a Heavenly Dao Foundation is actually so strong?”","“Naturally. Could it be that you don’t know that when Origin blasted out close to 300,000 in standard strength, it was enough to rank in the 120s and 130s on the Ultimate Dao Foundation leaderboard?”","“In comparison, this person is still considerably inferior.”","“En, indeed.”","Everyone regained the ability to speak, but even if Ling Han was no match for Origin, he was still terrifying to the extreme.","It was also because of this that even more people appeared, and all of them had gone crazy.","Guan Xuan had also arrived, yet he continued to spout nonsense, using the matter of Ling Han’s previous “cowardice” to exaggerate the matter. He was trying his best to flatter himself.","Yet Ling Han was internally stunned. This Origin was actually so powerful, blasting out close to 300,000 in standard strength?","This was 50% more than him.","Ling Han took a deep breath. By the looks of it, he needed to unleash his full strength.","The fact that Origin could surpass the prodigies of all eternity was definitely not because the prodigies of all eternity were weak, but rather because he was too freakish.","Ling Han unleashed the Three Styles of the God of War. At the same time, he stimulated the Destructive Energy. The two foundation stones of the Celestial Path were simulated in his body, and power was simultaneously released.","He channeled the power of the eye technique, and searched for the weak points on the surface of the strength tester. This could allow his battle prowess to unleash even greater destructive power.."]},{"number":3739,"title":"Chapter 3739: Number one in all eternity!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3739: Number one in all eternity!","Editor: Henyee Translations","‘Let’s try it!’","Ling Han charged out, delivering his strongest three strikes.","The Three Styles of the God of War, first attack.","Boom, Ling Han’s palms slammed down furiously, landing on the strength tester.","A number jumped, but it only showed over 200,000. Before it had completely stopped, Ling Han once again blasted out the second form of the Three Styles of God of War.","Peng!","This time, the number on the strength tester directly soared above 290,000.","”N-number one!”","“F*ck! He’s surpassed Origin!”","“The strongest in all of history!”","“My goodness, I must be dreaming. The record of Origin has been broken, and a new number one has been born!”","“Holy f*ck! It should be known that records become harder and harder to break as one progresses. Origin broke a record from 300 million years ago, but now, his record has actually only been maintained for a year.”","“Number One in the Galaxy!”","“Number One in the Galaxy!”","Everyone was beside themselves with excitement. Even though Ling Han had only surpassed Origin by a tiny bit, he had still surpassed him.","This was the strongest record in history, so it definitely could only be surpassed by a sliver. Otherwise, what would all the prodigies of the past generations be worth?","However, this was not the end.","Ling Han unleashed the final strike of the Three Styles of the God of War. The instant his palm struck the strength tester, he opened his mouth and spat out a golden sword, which he struck at the same time.","Boom! It was as if heaven and earth were shaking. It was as if the entire Galaxy Network was trembling.","A higher number jumped out, 312,526.","‘Holy f*ck!’","In an instant, those who had just been numb with excitement and incoherent were once again frozen, unable to say a single word.","The record had once again been broken.","Ling Han had broken the record that he had just created himself, and that previous record was definitely the shortest-enduring record in history. It had only existed for a mere second.","It had exceeded 300,000!","Throughout history, those who wanted to be ranked number one in Heavenly Dao Foundation would have to blast out more than 200,000 in standard strength. However, the record was getting higher and higher, and harder to break. Even the previous number one in history, Origin, could only blast out more than 290,000 standard power.","However, Ling Han suddenly pushed this record up to 300,000.","Everyone looked at Ling Han with admiration. He was number one in all of history, and even the Ancestral Kings and Saints had all been surpassed by Ling Han.","“Che, the first place of the Heavenly Dao Foundation doesn’t mean much. It should be known that many Ancestral Kings have never broken the record of first place. In fact, they are only ranked in the top ten or so, but in the end, they suppressed all prodigies and became the rulers of an era.”","Someone was deliberately belittling Ling Han.","“Hehe, if you can, go and set a record.”","“If you’re not capable, don’t blabber nonsense. This is the number one prodigy in history, surpassing all the prodigies in history. No matter what, hedeserves respect and praise.”","“That’s right.”","There was no need for Ling Han to speak. Immediately, there were a great many people targeting him, causing the face of the person from before to turn red with embarrassment.","On the strength tester, Ling Han’s name replaced the name of Origin. The “Number One in the Galaxy” was shining brightly.","There was no need for anything else. Just these words were enough to explain everything.","“Number One in the Galaxy has broken the record for explosive power of Heavenly Dao Foundation, and is specially rewarded with 1000 Universe Coins.” A cold voice rang out, yet it instantly spread throughout the entire Galaxy Network.","It was Galaxy Network’s soul.","“What?”","“The record of explosive power of Heavenly Dao Foundation has been broken?”","“You’ve got to be joking. Wasn’t it broken just over a year ago?”","“Even Galaxy Network’s soul has announced it on the entire platform, so it definitely can’t be fake.”","“Hiss, this Number One in the Galaxy is really awesome — come to think of it, this guy’s self-confidence is really bursting, to actually dare call himself Number One in the Galaxy?”","“In terms of explosive power alone, he is indeed the strongest in Heavenly Dao Foundation.”","This caused a great commotion on the Galaxy Network. Everyone began to investigate. Who was this “Number One in the Galaxy”? He could actually break the eternal record.","Though it was only one record, it encompassed the universe. If nothing unexpected happened, Ling Han’s record would be able to last for a few hundred million years, or even longer.","Upon investigation, everyone was dumbfounded.","As it turned out, Number One in the Galaxy had just entered the Galaxy Network.","Comparisons were truly infuriating. They didn’t know how long they had worked in the Galaxy Network, yet they hadn’t broken even half of a record. However, just look at Ling Han. He had entered the Galaxy Network the first day, and his name had already spread throughout the world.","Yet Ling Han gritted his teeth. If he was exposed like this, how would he be able to open tournament stages to earn money in future?","Who would still fight him?","En, he could only depend on those in Ultimate Dao Foundation.","However, the Chang Clan was really stingy. To break a record, they actually only gave him 1000 Universe Coins.","—It was he who had wrongly blamed the Chang Clan. The various settings of the Galaxy Network had all been decided by the Four Directions Great Emperor all those years ago. The Chang Clan only had ownership, but could not interfere with the operations of the Galaxy Network. The Galaxy Network soul was the true ruler.","In the eyes of the Four Directions Great Emperor, the glory of breaking records naturally surpassed everything else. 1000 Universe Coins was merely a token.","Who knew that Ling Han was a poor man? As he saw it, the most important thing was to give him more Universe Coins.","However, small amounts would make a lot. If he broke a few more records, his gains would not be small either.","He left the strength tester, and went to look for a new opportunity to earn money.","If others knew what he was thinking, they would definitely curse.","No matter what kind of record you broke, in the real world, as long as your identity was exposed, what great sect would not rush over to take you as disciple?","Even an Imperial Clan would be moved by such a prodigy.","Ling Han arrived before the record of power.","The Three Styles of the God of War was a palm technique, and if he used the Demonic Monkey Fists now, would he be able to break the record again?","The holder of this record was also Origin.","Ling Han hadn’t even made a move, when he saw a person stride over. The others all separated, clearing a path for him.","That was because this person was a True Self Tier elite.","“Li Leidong of the Li Clan of the Fengnan Planet, a true elite of True Self Tier!”","“The Li Clan is a Sect Master-level force.”","“Wrong, that prodigy from the Li Clan just broke through to the fourth pinnacle level not too long ago, and became a Venerate Tier elite. Now, the Li Clan is a Venerate Tier-level force.”","“No wonder he dared to come and recruit him. I was thinking that a Sect","Master probably wouldn’t dare to recruit this person now.”","Everyone nodded. A Sect Master-level force was indeed extraordinary, but it was still not qualified to take the most prodigious prodigy that had broken the ancient record under its banner. Even if this kind of existence could not become an Ancestral King, there was still a very high chance that he could become a Saint.","A Sect Master-level force? That was not enough.","Li Leidong arrived in front of Ling Han, smiled, and said, “Young man, are you interested in joining our Li Clan?”","“Hehe, how could the Li Clan compare to our Wang Clan!” Another voice rang out, and a middle-aged man walked out from the crowd.","“Wang Jian!” Li Leidong’s eyes narrowed. The Wang Clan was a noble clan of the Eternal Ray Planet. They had a veteran Venerate Tier, who had advanced intothe fourth pinnacle level tens of thousands of years ago.","“Li Leidong, your Li Clan has just become a Venerate Tier-level noble clan. Compared to our Wang Clan, you are too weak!” Wang Jian declared proudly.."]},{"number":3740,"title":"Chapter 3740: Recruiting","paragraphs":["Chapter 3740: Recruiting","Editor: Henyee Translations","Li Leidong was naturally unconvinced. He humphed, “The Venerable Tier elite of our Li Clan is a supreme prodigy. Though he has just become a Venerable Tier, his future prospects are boundless. It is not impossible for him to become a Saint in future! 1 ‘","“Hahahaha!” Wang Jian roared with laughter. “I’m about to laugh myself to death! Do you think Saints are as common as cabbages? Even prodigies have to bow their heads before the doors into Saint Tier. Not only does one need natural talent to become a Saint, but they also need to possess good fortune.” “Wang Jian, do you dare to look down on our Venerate Tier?” Li Leidong said balefully, his killing intent cold.","Wang Jian didn’t reply. The Wang Clan was able to oppose the Li Clan, and in fact, they were even slightly more powerful. However, he definitely couldn’t speak rudely about a Venerate Tier elite. Otherwise, if that great elite of the Li Clan made a move and killed him, no one would be able to avenge him.","Elites needed to be respected, especially those from Sect Master Tier onwards. Weaker cultivators were definitely not allowed to slander such elites.","“Young man, what’s your choice?” Wang Jian looked towards Ling Han. What was there to compete with Li Leidong?","“Join the Li Clan, and I guarantee that there will be no shortage of cultivation resources for you!” Li Leidong hurriedly said.","“Hehe, how could the background of a newly advanced Venerate Tier-level clan compare to the background of our Wang Clan?” Wang Jian humphed.","However, Ling Han ignored both of them. He yearned for freedom, and it was definitely impossible for him to join any force.","How could it be that the resources of forces like this could be taken for free?","There was a price to pay for everything. There was no free lunch in this world.","He channeled the Demonic Monkey Fists and fused it with the Destructive Energy. Then, he suddenly charged forward and threw a punch.","Peng, the strength tester immediately showed the value, and it began to jump rapidly.","More than 280,000.","He had made it into the rankings, but had not broken any records. First place was still Origin.","“Hehe, Origin broke the record with his fist technique, reaching as high as 290,000 in standard strength,” someone said.","So that was the case. Though Ling Han had broken the record for explosive power, it did not mean that he was number one in all aspects throughout history.","“Young man, we were talking to you!” Li Leidong shouted loudly, appearing slightly furious.","This mere Heavenly Dao Foundation actually dared to ignore him. He was truly outrageously bold. Who did he think he was? So what if he had broken an eternal record? After all, his cultivation level was still too low.","In this world, no matter how prodigious you were, you still had to respect elites.","Ling Han merely glanced at him before turning around to leave. Since he couldn’t break this record, he would break other records. In any case, there were all kinds of records here.","“Stop right there!” Li Leidong roared.","Ling Han acted as if he had not heard anything, and continued onwards.","“I told you to stop!” Li Leidong spat out word by word. He had been angered by the young man in front of him.","Ling Han had that kind of ability, easily angering others, even if this person was here to recruit him.","Ling Han still ignored him. He had seen the record of speed, but the creator of this record was not Origin, but rather a person called “Across Mountains”.","Across Mountains was a Saint, but he had long since passed away.","It was rumored that he had been a supreme prodigy all those years ago, and was a strong competitor for the position of becoming an Emperor, becoming an Ancestral King. From the fact that he had created an eternal record in terms of speed, it was clear that this person indeed possessed astonishing talent.","Unfortunately, being momentarily stunning did not mean that he would be stunning forever. In the end, the Across Mountains Saint still lost, and stopped at Saint Tier.","Then let’s test out this record.","Ling Han made an attempt, but though he easily made it into the list, he was still unable to break the record.","He sighed. Though he had broken the historical record of explosive power, but in terms of fist power, kick power, and so on, he was still not strong enough to become the strongest in all aspects in history.","Firstly, it was because he hadn’t reached the peak stage of Heavenly Dao Foundation yet, and secondly, his fist techniques and foot techniques weren’t powerful enough.","Yes, take it slow. Breaking all the records in a single day would be quite boring. “You!” Li Leidong roared from the sidelines, already in a thunderous rage.","Ling Han glared at him, and said, “What are you shouting for? If you’re not convinced, in a battle of equal cultivation levels in the tournament, it’s your win if you can block ten moves from me.”","Li Leidong wanted to agree, but just as he opened his mouth, he forcefully swallowed his words.","In a battle of equal cultivation levels, who could match this guy who had the strongest explosive power in history?","He wasn’t just the number one in the world, but the number one in all of history. The value of both was completely different.","If he stubbornly agreed, he would only be seeking his own humiliation.","Yi?","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. He had received another notification from the Galaxy Network. The hour-long queue had ended, and he could now participate in the level battles.","Confirmation.","Xiu, Ling Han instantly disappeared into thin air, and appeared in the tournament grounds.","His opponent was a young girl. When she discovered that her opponent was Ling Han, she couldn’t help but scream in shock.","“You’re Number One in the Galaxy, the one who just broke the record for the explosive power of Heavenly Dao Foundation!” The young girl was so excited that she was almost incoherent, her eyes shining. ”1 admire you so much, you’re my idol!”","Ling Han couldn’t help but sweat. “We’re fighting now!”","“Idol, how could I possibly be a match for you?” the young girl hurriedly said. “Idol, let’s take a photo together!”","She approached, and issued a payment that allowed Galaxy Network to activate its recording function. Then, she posed in various positions around Ling Han.","After a long while, she was finally satisfied. She took the initiative to admit defeat, and her figure instantly disappeared from sight.","In this battle, Ling Han still obtained eleven points.","He thought for a moment, then exited the Galaxy Network platform.","Hu, Ling Han stood up, pushed open the doors and left.","Only a short two hours had passed, and he had already caused a storm on the Galaxy Network. Now, everyone would remember “Number One in the Galaxy”, and there would definitely be countless forces that would begin to search for him.","Ling Han found Lin Luo and the others, and made friends with them on the Galaxy Network. Then, he transferred some Universe Coins to each of them. Next, he was sure that Lin Luo and the others would also make a name for themselves on the Galaxy Network, and become the generation of super rookies.","The connection device itself had the function of a optical computer, and could store information. As long as the information was downloaded, even if one couldn’t connect to the Galaxy Network, it could still be viewed.","However, with Ling Han’s memory, there was naturally no need for him to deliberately turn on the optical computer to look at the recipe for the Foundation Dissolution Pill. He merely recalled it in his mind, and the pill recipe clearly appeared in his mind, allowing him to simulate the concoction process.","After an hour, Ling Han believed that as long as he was given the raw materials, he would only fail once or twice, at most, and summarizing his experience, he would be able to concoct a successful pill.","The night passed quietly. On the morning of the second day, after Ling Han finished cultivating, he began to practice the Demonic Monkey Fists.","Brother Monkey’s ancient ancestor was an Ancestral King, and had been invincible for an era. The Demonic Monkey Fists that he had created was naturally a noble Imperial Technique.","Among the Great Emperors of the world, who was weaker than the other?","He could break records with the Three Styles of the God of War, but why couldn’t he do the same with the Demonic Monkey Fists?","It wasn’t that the Demonic Monkey Fists were weak, but rather that he couldn’t unleash the true might of the Demonic Monkey Fists.","“I’m going to find Brother Monkey,” Ling Han murmured. “Firstly, I’ve already advanced to the Foundation Building Tier, and my formation abilities have also improved greatly. I’m now qualified to try to decipher Celestial level formations. Secondly, I still have the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. I should be of some help to Brother Monkey.”","“Let’s see if I can help Brother Monkey escape this time..”"]},{"number":3741,"title":"Chapter 3741: Preparing to Break the Seal","paragraphs":["Chapter 3741: Preparing to Break the Seal","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han left just like that. This time, he didn’t bring Princess Bixiao with him. Instead, he brought the empress, Hu Niu, and the large black dog. Tang Yun’er naturally couldn’t be left behind, so Ling Han decided to simply use her shuttle. In just a few hours, they had already arrived near Haiping Mountain.","They landed, and then Ling Han used his movement technique, bringing them along with him.","Second King!” When they saw Ling Han, the monkeys called out one after another. Their advancement was very fast, and a great many of them had already advanced into Foundation Building Tier. In fact, the one who advanced the fastest was already in Ultimate Dao Foundation.","Ling Han’s expression darkened, “I already told you, don’t call me Second King, I am not the slightest bit stupid!?”","“Then what about Second Leader?” a monkey asked tentatively.","“Hahahaha!” The large black dog rolled around on the ground and laughed, “You idiot, so even monkeys know that you are stupid.”","These words offended the monkeys. Immediately, a few baboons jumped out, each grabbing onto one of the large black dog’s legs and lifting him up.","We can eat dog meat today.” These monkeys were also gluttons, and began to drool.","“Little Han, save me, save me!” the large black dog hurriedly shouted.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Forget it, spare its wretched life.”","Only then did the monkeys toss the large black dog onto the ground. Some of their eyes were shining, clearly not giving up on the idea of eating dog meat, scaring the large black dog so much that it clamped its tail between its legs, and followed closely behind Ling Han.","“Second Leader, please,” the monkeys called out.","The corners of Ling Han’s mouth twitched. Why couldn’t these monkeys learn?","“Call me Leader Ling!” he emphasized.","Alright, Second Leader!” The monkeys readily accepted.","Forget it. Ling Han sighed.","He arrived at the depths of the Monkey Valley, and saw Brother Monkey. This great elite from the ancient age had still been suppressed at the foot of the mountain, and had not escaped.","“Brother Monkey,” Ling Han called out.","Second Brother, you’re here.” Brother Monkey glanced at him, and couldn’t help but nod in gratification. “You’ve broken through to the Foundation Building Tier.”","Weng, a divine light actually shot out of Brother Monkey’s eyes, sweeping over Ling Han. Then, he revealed an expression of shock, and said, “Second Brother, you have actually formed two foundation stones of the Celestial Path!”","Was this a kind of eye technique? So powerful, it could actually see into his mind.","This is the Fiery Golden Eyes Mystical Power of my race, created by Old Sun’s distant ancestor. It can only be cast with the power of bloodline,” Brother Monkey explained.","Oh, so it was passed down from the Ancestral King, Brother Monkey’s ancestor. Ling Han couldn’t help but feel curious, and asked, “Brother Monkey, what’s that old senior’s name?”","Brother Monkey was proud, “Ancestor was a Stone Monkey nurtured by the spirit of heaven and earth. When he was young, he travelled all over the universe, and secretly learnt from others. In the end, he walked his own path, and became the Ancestral King of his generation, known respectfully as the Battle Saint Emperor!”","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel engrossed. When he channeled the Demonic Monkey Fists, he discovered that there would be a rebellious Demonic Monkey that would appear, striking the heavens above and shattering the depths of hell below. That aura was truly unprecedented and domineering.","Presumably, this was the Battle Saint Emperor, but his fist technique would definitely only be able to outline a sliver of the might of the Ancestral King. It would not be able to simulate even a sliver of his Dao. Otherwise, this kind of Demonic Monkey Fist would be able to kill even Saints.","“Brother Monkey, the lifespan of an Ancestral King is also limited. Furthermore, there is no sign of an Ancestral King. I heard that the most recent Ancestral King is the Great Emperor of the Human Race.” Ling Han was slightly puzzled.","Brother Monkey nodded, “Now that the Ancestral King has achieved Dao, the fortune of the whole world will be absorbed into him alone. He is Dao, and Dao is him. Thus, as long as the Ancestral King is still alive, no one, no matter how heaven-defying his fortune is, would be able to become an Emperor and become an Ancestral King.”","Ling Han found this strange. Brother Monkey had only been suppressed, but had not been killed. That was because the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire feared that the Battle Saint Emperor was still alive, but logically speaking, this Demon Race’s Great Emperor should have long since died.","In his later years, my ancestor went to a dangerous place to seek the path of immortality. From then onwards, he has never returned,” Brother Monkey said. “That was at the edge of the universe. When he got there, my ancestor’s suppression of the fortune of heaven and earth also dropped to the weakest level. After millions of years, heaven and earth also returned to normal, and there would be another person who could become an Emperor.”","‘However, many great elites have deduced that my ancestor did not die. Instead, he was battling in that danger zone, because there would occasionally be world-shaking battle scenes flashing in some corner of the universe.”","Brother Monkey looked at the sky, and said, “After Old Sun becomes a Saint, I’ll go find my ancestor. If he’s trapped in that desperate situation, Old Sun will save him no matter what!”","Ling Han nodded and said, “Brother Monkey, I’ll go with you.”","Brother Monkey laughed loudly, “All right!”","If it was another person saying this, Brother Monkey would definitely treat it as a joke.","Wasn’t it?","Even an Ancestral King could possibly be trapped. Even if he became a Saint, it would still be extremely dangerous for him to go to that danger zone. Ling Han was presently only a mere Foundation Building Tier, and could not even be considered a speck of dust.","However, Brother Monkey believed in Ling Han’s potential.","Having cultivated two foundation stones of the Celestial Path, just how amazing was that?","Unprecedented!","Ling Han picked some interesting things to share with Brother Monkey, including the fact that he had broken the record of power for Heavenly Dao Foundation in Galaxy Network.","Brother Monkey laughed loudly. “Second Brother, you’re really impressive. Although Old Sun managed to make it into the leaderboard back then, I was still a little short of breaking the record of being the strongest in history. Haha, as expected of Old Sun’s brother!”","“Brother Monkey, I’ve come to see if I can help you escape,” Ling Han said.","Though Brother Monkey only had to advance into the fourth pinnacle level, and become a Venerate Tier, he would be able to escape, Brother Monkey had also said that this could possibly take a few years, or even over a hundred years. After all, he had never stepped onto this level before. Everything was only his own deduction.","What if?","Moreover, how could the difficulty of breaking through while being suppressed be the same as breaking through normally? It would also be much more dangerous.","Ling Han first went to check on this formation, but the formation that suppressed Brother Monkey was too high-level, and he had nowhere to start. “Second Brother, your cultivation level is not high enough. No matter how talented you are in formations, it is useless.” Brother Monkey shook his head. He looked in a certain direction in the skies, “That old b@stard from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, suppressing Old Sun for more than two thousand years. When Old Sun breaks free, I will beat you to death with a single staff strike!”","There was nothing else that could be done. He could only use this move.","Ling Han took out the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. He hadn’t even opened his mouth to speak, when Brother Monkey was immediately moved.","“This is... Imperial Weapon!” Brother Monkey blurted out. Then, he shook his head repeatedly, “No, no, the might of the Imperial Weapon should far surpass it. A wisp of aura would be able to turn Old Sun into dust. This is only forged by Origin Gold, a the future Imperial Weapon.”","As expected of Brother Monkey, his insight was extremely sharp.","“Brother Monkey, can this help you?” Ling Han asked.","“There should be hope.” Brother Monkey was also a little eager to give it a try, and looked excited.","If he could do anything about it, how could he be willing to be trapped?","“Second Brother, Old Sun has instilled the Mystical Power into the Imperial Weapon. You control it and bombard the mountain above Old Sun,” Brother Monkey said.","“All right!” Ling Han nodded vigorously."]},{"number":3742,"title":"Chapter 3742: Brother Monkey returns","paragraphs":["Chapter 3742: Brother Monkey returns","Editor: Henyee Translations","Brother Monkey roared loudly, and a golden light appeared above his head, turning into a small monkey that flew towards Primal Chaos Extreme","Lightning Tower.","Ling Han suddenly recalled, and hurriedly said, “Brother Monkey, there are still Heavenly Dao Flames in this tower.”","This fire could burn even Venerate Tier elites to death. He didn’t want to accidentally screw Brother Monkey over as well.","Zhi!","Brother Monkey hurriedly braked. The little monkey flashed. Xiu, it surged back into Brother Monkey’s body.","“Really?” Brother Monkey asked.","Ling Han nodded earnestly, “When I was refining the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, I went to the site of Heavenly Dao Flames.’","“That’s right. Without the Heavenly Dao Flames, there is absolutely no way to shape the Origin Gold.” Brother Monkey nodded.","“After I refined the Imperial Weapon, I also used the internal space of the Imperial Weapon to retrieve some Heavenly Dao Flames. However, after I stowed the Heavenly Dao Flames, its might decreased greatly. It can only burn Venerate Tiers to death,” Ling Han continued.","Brother Monkey couldn’t help but grimace at this show-off.","He was only at the level of Sect Master. Even in front of a weaker version of the Heavenly Dao Flames, he could only kneel.","“It’ll be easy if you have the Heavenly Dao Flames. Second Brother, go to the mountain peak and pour out the Heavenly Dao Flames,” Brother Monkey said.","Ling Han was astonished, and he asked, “Will that hurt you?","“It’s fine. The Heavenly Dao Flames can easily incinerate this formation. Without waiting for the flames to burn down, Old Sun has already escaped,” Brother Monkey said proudly, but changed the topic, and continued, “However, just in case, let the monkeys retreat first.”","“All right.”","Ling Han began to evacuate the monkeys, leaving the Monkey Valley far behind, and that included the empress, the large black dog, and the others.","Then, he returned to the Monkey Valley all by himself, and flew up to the summit.","“Brother Monkey, I’m about to begin.”","“Let’s begin.”","With a thought from Ling Han, boom, the Heavenly Dao Flames immediately surged out from the eighth level of the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, burning at the summit and rapidly spreading, burning towards the waist of the mountain.","He hurriedly controlled the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to fly away.","When Brother Monkey appeared, it would definitely be world-shaking.","Boom, the Heavenly Dao Flames spread very quickly, surging all the way down the mountain, burning everything and nothing could not be destroyed.","This was an extreme flame that could burn even Venerate Tiers to death, and could be considered Pseudo Saint-level.","Ling Han was slightly anxious. Why hadn’t Brother Monkey appeared yet?","If the Heavenly Dao Flames really reached the foot of the mountain, that wouldn’t be a joke.","He had best head to the foot of the mountain to take a look. If Brother Monkey couldn’t do it, he would then withdraw the Heavenly Dao Flames. Of course, it was impossible to withdraw all of them, but it should be no problem to only withdraw the flames around Brother Monkey.","However, before Ling Han could make a move, peng, an earth-shattering bang was heard, and the great mountain beneath suddenly exploded. A figure that looked like a streak of light shot out from underneath, shooting straight into","the horizon.","“I, Old Sun, have come out!”","In the blink of an eye, that streak of light shot down from the skies again, turning into a furry monkey.","This monkey’s body was covered with golden fur, and he was as tall as three meters. His golden eyes were filled with fire, and they exuded a ferocious might as he looked around. It was as if even heaven and earth was beneath his notice.","It was Brother Monkey.","Ling Han felt that it was a little blinding. That was because Brother Monkey was completely naked. Thankfully, it was covered with fur. Otherwise, it would really leave a psychological scar on him.","“Come!” Brother Monkey shouted lightly. Xiu, xiu, xiu! Countless golden shadows flew towards him. Pa, pa, pa, they continuously stuck to his body, turning into a dazzling golden armor.","Then, he stretched out a hand and dug in his ear. Instantly, a golden needle was taken out.","Yi, such a mighty and domineering Brother Monkey was actually using a golden needle as his weapon?","This, this, this, this, so feminine, his eyes were about to pop out of his head.","“Change.”","With a soft exclamation from Brother Monkey, the golden needle enlarged continuously, turning into a staff. It was completely golden, and there were also veined patterns on it, exuding a majestic and domineering aura.","As it turned out, this could be shrunk and enlarged.","The material that could become bigger and smaller had to be at least of the level of the Minor Advanced Tier. However, Brother Monkey was a Sect Master elite, so it was naturally very normal for him to possess such a treasured staff. “This is Saintly Material, and it’s also a replica of Ancestor’s Wishful Golden Cudgel,” Brother Monkey explained. He stood proudly in the sky. As a Sect Master-level, he naturally didn’t need to wield a Tool to stand in the sky.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and said, “Congratulations, Brother Monkey!” Brother Monkey nodded, “Thanks to Second Brother’s heaven-defying good fortune, not only did you obtain Origin Gold, but you also forged an Imperial Weapon and absorbed the Heavenly Dao Flames. Otherwise, Old Sun would have to endure for a while longer.”","“Come, let’s go down and talk.”","The two of them landed on the ground. However, the Monkey Valley had already been completely destroyed, but since Brother Monkey had already escaped, he was presently the strongest on the Celestial Sea Planet, so where could he not go?","After reuniting with everyone and the monkeys, Brother Monkey used his great power and brought them to a place of natural beauty. He first settled the monkeys down, then the monkeys took out the fine wine they had brewed and began to celebrate.","Ling Han let go of his worries. He didn’t think about anything else, and simply drank fine wine with Brother Monkey every day.","Seven days later, the banquet finally ended.","■■Second Brother, do you find it strange that the Demonic Monkey Fists are inferior to the Three Styles of the God of War?” Brother Monkey took the initiative to talk about this matter.","Ling Han hadn’t mentioned it before because he didn’t want Brother Monkey to think that he was using his action of rescuing him to coerce him. Although Brother Monkey wasn’t a petty person, he didn’t want there to be any misunderstanding between the two of them.","However, since Brother Monkey had taken the initiative to mention it, Ling Han nodded.","The Demonic Monkey Fists was created by an Ancestral King. Logically speaking, even if it wasn’t the strongest in the world, it should still be ranked among the strongest.","Brother Monkey smiled, and said, “That so-called Three Styles of the God of War should have been left behind by the Battle God Palace. The Battle God Palace is a Holy Land, so how could a mere Saint-level technique possibly compare to an Imperial Technique?”","“Moreover, the Three Styles of the God of War isn’t the ultimate technique of the Battle God Palace. It’s just that your cultivation level is still too low, so the difference isn’t very obvious.”","Ling Han was extremely curious, and he asked, “Then why?","“That’S because the Demonic Monkey Fists that I taught you were only suitable for you to cultivate in the mortal level. Now that you’ve advanced into the Celestial Path, it’s naturally different,” Brother Monkey said with a smile.","It was that simple!","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel surprised. A fist technique that was used by mortals could still unleash a powerful might when used on Celestial Path. It was only slightly weaker than the Three Styles of the God of War, so how strong would the Celestial Path-level Demonic Monkey Fists be?","“Come, Old Sun will teach you.”","Ling Han began to cultivate the Demonic Monkey Fists with Brother Monkey. This was an Imperial Technique, and it wasn’t something that he could slowly analyze with a tap of the finger and some teachings from Brother Monkey.","This was the world’s highest grade celestial technique. Not only did it need to be taught by example, it also needed to be carefully comprehended. Those with poor aptitude could not possibly learn it in a hundred or a thousand years.","Even if Ling Han’s comprehension ability was so nature-defying, he would not be able to grasp it in a short period of time.","A whole month had passed, and he had finally grasped the Demonic Monkey Fists... It was only at the superficial level, and he was still far from grasping the core.","Ling Han planned to return to the Imperial Capital to take a look. Brother Monkey was also quite interested, so he decided to go with Ling Han to the imperial Capital to see his junior, Chen Fengyan. Then, he would leave the Celestial Sea Planet, and only go to the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire after he had become a Venerate Tier.","En, he wondered if Chen Fengyan would call him uncle this time.."]},{"number":3743,"title":"Chapter 3743= Time Chamber","paragraphs":["Chapter 3743= Time Chamber","Editor: Henyee Translations","After only a few hours, Ling Han returned to the Imperial Capital.","Brother Monkey walked casually, while Ling Han logged into Galaxy Network.","In this one month, he had been earnestly cultivating the Demonic Monkey Fists. He had completely forgotten to eat or sleep, and rested no more than an hour every day. He was really just resting his brain.","In this state, he naturally didn’t have time to log onto Galaxy Network.","The moment he logged into the Galaxy Network, he immediately received a","large number of friend requests.","“Friend, we have important matters to discuss.”","“Young man, I am from the Nine Winds Holy Land.","“Brother, please approve my friend request.”","Most requests had side notes. Ling Han only looked through a few before choosing to ignore them. The reason why he had logged into the Galaxy Network this time was not for the sake of ranking or earning money, but rather because he had heard from Brother Monkey that the Galaxy Network had a function called the Time Chamber.","In the Time Chamber, the flow of time would be many times faster than normal, similar to the Reincarnation Tree, which only targeted the soul.","However, the fee for the Time Chamber was very high, extremely high.","It used one day’s time as an example. Acceleration of two times would require a payment of 100 Universe Coins. Three times would mean 500 Universe Coms, ten times would mean 10,000 Universe Coins, and a hundred times would mean five million!","Though Ling Han had also earned a little money, he could only choose to cultivate at twice the speed for a few days, at most.","However, Brother Monkey was rich and imposing, and told Ling Han to choose the best Time Chamber because he had money.","In the past, he had been a Sect Master great elite. This kind of existence could be called an elite anywhere in the universe, so his ability to earn money was naturally very strong.","Something like the Universe Coins could not possibly be snatched away by the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, even if Brother Monkey had been captured and suppressed years ago.","After befriending Brother Monkey, a transfer message was immediately sent","over.","“You earned 100 million Universe Coins.”","p***","Ling Han gritted his teeth. Brother Monkey was indeed rich. Fine, he was in desperate need of Universe Coins now. It wouldn’t be too late to repay him in the future.","He asked for a Time Chamber where time flowed 100 times faster, and had the platform automatically deduct his payment, right until he walked out, or right until all his Universe Coins were expended.","In the Time Chamber, Ling Han continued to cultivate the Demonic Monkey Fists. This required a large amount of time to practice. Under normal conditions, it was very normal to only grasp the core after too or 1000 years.","However, Ling Han couldn’t wait for that long. He wanted to master this fist technique as soon as possible.","Thankfully, he had Brother Monkey.","Ling Han entered the Time Chamber and started to practice his fist technique.","This was time acceleration of too times. Very quickly, a year had passed, and then another year had passed. His mastery of the Demonic Monkey Fists was getting deeper and deeper.","Why had he only just begun to enter the Time Chamber to cultivate? It couldn’t be helped. Previously, he hadn’t grasped the superficial details. He had to have Brother Monkey give him pointers step by step. Now that he had finally grasped the general idea, he could practice on his own.","Three years, five years, time flew by. Ling Han was now a pure spirit form, so he could focus all his energy on practicing his fist technique.","He still wanted to continue cultivating, but was forced to leave the Time","Chamber.","100 million Universe Coins had already been deducted.","Already?","Ling Han thought for a moment. 100 million Universe Coins could only allow him to cultivate here for 20 days in real time. Then, even if it was sped up a hundredfold, it would only be 2000 days, which was slightly over five years.","His money... was not enough.","The Chang Clan was truly black-hearted, charging such a high fee. However, he finally mastered one of the moves of the Demonic Monkey Fists. There was only one style, and the real Demonic Monkey Fists was made up of nine styles. The first style was also the simplest.","It had been five years, and he had only mastered one move, and it was the simplest move at that.","Ling Han sighed. This was an Imperial Technique!","Let’s go and test out the might of the new Demonic Monkey Fists.","Ling Han went to the reaining hall, then came to the fist strength tester.","“Yi, Number One in the Galaxy is here again.”","‘Almost two months have passed, and his level ranking is actually still just","over 1.1 billion.”","“How strange. With his strength, he can be ranked in the top 200 even among Ultimate Dao Foundation. Why isn’t he fighting in a level battle?”","Someone discovered Ling Han’s presence, and immediately began to send out messages, summoning friends. And friends called friends, and more and more people ran over.","Ling Han didn’t accept private messages, so those noble clans and sects could only personally come over to recruit him.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! One after another, mighty figures appeared. They were all True Self Tier-level elites, and there were even Spirit Transformation True Lords.","Ling Han ignored everyone else. Instead, he channeled the Demonic Monkey Fists and entwined them with the Destructive Energy before launching an attack at the strength tester.","Hong, his body exuded golden light, as if there was a Demonic Monkey that had fused with him, exuding an aura that would make one tremble.","“This, this is an Imperial Technique!”","“Only Imperial Techniques can possess such might!”","“Heavens, this is the heir of an Imperial Clan.”","“Forget it, let’s all go back. He is the heir of an Imperial Clan, so how could he possibly be recruited?”","There were great elites observing in secret, and when they saw Ling Han’s punch, they immediately exclaimed in surprise. Furthermore, there was not just one such great elite, and they all voiced their agreement.","This was a descendant of an Imperial Clan. Even the Holy Lands were not qualified to recruit him.","Peng!","Ling Han’s fist landed on the strength tester, and instantly, a terrifying number popped up.","“349,426!”","“Heavens, he broke his own record!”","Ling Han had broken the record for the maximum power of a punch, but it was equivalent to breaking the record for explosive power as well.","Everyone was astounded. This wasn’t just breaking the record by a little bit, but raising the record by a whopping 30,000.","Youf****** freak.","Yet Ling Han sighed. Imperial Techniques were definitely not just 10% stronger than Saint Techniques. However, his cultivation level was too low, so there was no fundamental difference in the might of an Imperial Technique and a Saint Technique.","This was really the limit of his battle prowess, unless he could also grasp the other eight moves of the Demonic Monkey Fists.","Ling Han was already queuing up for the level battles. This would take some time, so he first contacted Lin Luo and the others.","Close to two months had passed, and Lin Luo and the others had also made a name for themselves on the Galaxy Network. Their rankings had increased very quickly, and were currently ranked in the 80 millions respectively. Compared to Ling Han’s 1.1 billion, they were on two completely different levels.","After conversing with Lin Luo and the others, Ling Han also finished queuing up and began the level battle.","The battle soon ended. Ling Han had just exited the tournament hall when he received a friend request, and the person who had sent the request was... Origin!","The mysterious prodigy, Origin, had created a record for pinnacle strength. At present, there were still a great many records that he had created in the training hall.","Ling Han pondered for a moment before accepting the friend request from Origin.","“Battle?”","The other party sent a simple and direct message.","“All right,” Ling Han replied.","In just a short while, Origin sent him a tournament stage number.","Ling Han took a look. This tournament stage was set with Absolute Cultivation Level. In this kind of tournament battle, not only would the major tier of cultivation level be pulled into the same level, even the minor tier of cultivation level would be equal. It could be claimed that it was an absolute battle between equals.","There were no conditions for the battle. It was only set that only Ling Han could enter into the tournament stage.","However, while the tournament stage had a rule about who to battle against, there was no restriction on the spectators. Everyone could enter to watch the battle.","A single stone would give rise to a thousand ripples.","“Everyone, come quickly.. Origin is going to fight with Number One in the Galaxy!”"]},{"number":3744,"title":"Chapter 3744: First battle with Origin","paragraphs":["Chapter 3744: First battle with Origin","Editor: Henyee Translations","Origin versus Number One in the Galaxy.","This was an incomparably explosive piece of news. These two people had both set a record for the highest limit of strength, and the gap between the two records was only over a year.","In the same era, two such prodigies actually appeared?","When Ling Han broke the record of explosive power created by Origin over a month ago, some people were guessing who would win if Origin and Ling Han battled at the same cultivation level.","A great many people also posted on the forum, egging on Origin to issue a challenge to Ling Han, or Ling Han to issue a challenge to Origin.","However, Origin remained silent the entire time, and Ling Han hadn’t logged into the Galaxy Network for more than a month. Thus, passersby could only feel excited for nothing.","And now, Origin finally moved, issuing a challenge to Ling Han.","Would Ling Han agree?","A great many people had already entered into that tournament stage at the first instant, and were waiting for Ling Han to appear.","However, Ling Han still hadn t appeared.","“He doesn’t dare to fight?”","“That’s right. The news should have spread long ago, but Number One in the Galaxy still hasn’t appeared. He must be afraid of battle.","“F***, and he calls himself Number One in the Galaxy? He really dares to","boast.”","“He doesn’t even dare to fight at the same cultivation level, so how can he be called Number One in the Galaxy?”","Everyone was filled with disdain, but just as they were talking excitedly, they saw that they had all been forcibly pushed out of this tournament area.","Yi, what was going on here?","They immediately discovered that Origin had already canceled this tournament","stage.","Origin had been angered into leaving?","No!","“Look, Number One in the Galaxy has set up another tournament stage, issuing","a challenge to Origin.”","“Origin has already entered.”","“Quick, let’s go too.”","“Yi, there’s a fee for entering to watch the battle?","“F***, he actually wants 1000 Universe Coins?”","“This is screwing me over!”","“It’s a robbery!”","Everyone was making a big fuss. There was actually a fee? There was no fee for","Origin’s tournament stage.","Hiss, a guess rose up in all of them. Could it be that it was because Ling Han had not accepted the challenge previously, not because he was afraid of battle, but because he wanted to create a tournament stage himself to collect money?","‘This money grubber, are you f*cking greedy for money?’","In the battle between two ultimate elites in history, what kind of sacred and dignified matter was this? You f****** actually charged? Charged a fee!","It could not be helped. No one wanted to miss out on this kind of battle. Even if there were people who could record it, the majority still wanted to witness it at the first instant.","Wasn’t it just 1000 Universe Coins? Just give it to him!","Everyone couldn’t suppress their urge to “see” with their own eyes. They all chose to have Galaxy Network deduct 1000 Universe Coins, and entered into the tournament area.","1000 Universe Coins to watch a battle was truly exorbitantly expensive. However, the two people battling were the two most powerful elites in history, so who would be willing to miss such a battle?","There was no shortage of true disciples of great sects, and important heirs of noble clans. Gritting their teeth, 1000 Universe Coins was not something that they could not afford.","Of course, Ling Han would definitely be hated by them. This person was really too good at earning money, wasn’t he?","Yet Ling Han was completely unconcerned. In such an incomparable battle, if he did not collect some money, how would he be able to forgive himself?","He was very poor now.","“You have obtained 999 Universe Coins.”","“You have obtained 999 Universe Coins.”","“You...”","Ling Han continued to receive notifications from Galaxy Network, and his wallet quickly filled up.","“Hurry up and start!” Opposite him, Origin appeared to be very displeased. ■For better or worse, you have broken an eternal record, but now, for the sake of earning some money, you actually dragged me into your tournament stage.’ This was supposed to be a battle of the strongest, yet it had actually become so filled with the smell of money?","It’s your business whether you want to be shameless or not, but you can’t drag me down with you.","“Hold on, hold on.” Ling Han waved his hand. He listened to Galaxy Network’s notifications, and felt very pleased.","Let the Universe Coins fly for a while longer.","Origin had no more patience. He roared loudly, and charged towards Ling Han. How could this kind of money grubber stand side by side with him?","Origin’s figure was extremely tall and sturdy, as if he was the embodiment of a primitive giant. Even if he was a spiritual manifestation, there was still an image of a dragon and phoenix wrapped around each of his arms.","“Innate Divine Physique, Dragon Phoenix Everlasting Saint Physique. Everyone was exclaiming in shock Origin was an Innate Divine Physique. This wasn’t a secret, but most people didn’t have the chance to se Origin. They had only heard about it, and now that they had seen him, it was indeed true.","What was a Saintly Physique?","Only those who possessed a first-class Innate Divine Physique were qualified to be called Saint Physique. In itself, they were synonymous with power.","Boom, Origin shot out a punch, and the power of two punches blasted out, turning into a dragon and a phoenix respectively, that charged towards Ling","Han.","Ling Han was naturally unafraid. Using the Three Styles of the God of War, he charged towards Origin.","The Three Styles of the God of War was a powerful move that he had used to break the record of all eternity, so its might was naturally astonishing. The ultimate power was even superior to Origin.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The two of them exchanged blows. They were both people who had broken the record for the highest limit of power. Both of them had astonishing power. Not only were they standing at the highest limit of Heavenly Dao Foundation, they were also the strongest in history.","Multiple attacks exploded, and the whole tournament hall seemed to be trembling, with endless shards of seals flickering.","“Too terrifying, this is really too terrifying.”","“Although I’m a Ultimate Dao Foundation cultivator], I’m sure that I’ll be shattered if I come into contact with it.","“Two monsters.”","“The power of Heavenly Dao Foundation is already this strong, so how on earth have they cultivated this kind of power?”","Everyone’s eyes were bright, and they couldn’t help themselves.","However, Ling Han discovered that even though the Galaxy Network was constructed by a Great Emperor, it still had some shortcomings.","If he were using the Three Styles of the God of War in reality, his body would definitely be flooded by the power of heaven and earth once the three Styles of the God of War were used and he wouldn’t be able to channel it again.","Otherwise, his body would definitely explode and die.","However, he was a pure spiritual manifestation now, so he didn’t need to worry about any physical burdens at all. He unleashed the Three Styles of the God of War over and over again, and there were no side effects at all.","Additionally, he had absolutely no need to worry about the problem of exhausting his mystical power. He could use any kind of powerful move as much as he liked.","Thus, Ling Han believed that elites were indeed powerful when battling on the Galaxy Network. However, when there was a gap of 10 or even under 100 ranks between elites. If they were battling in real life, perhaps those who were ranked lower would win.","Taking into account all kinds of realistic problems, it would cause a change in the strength of the cultivators, and even cause a great change in fact. Additionally, in this place, no one would have to worry about the problem of exhausting their mystical power, but in the real world, probably only Ling Han would not have to worry about this. Thus, battling in the Galaxy Network, this advantage of his was completely concealed.","There was also the Spirit Tool. Ling Han had a future Imperial Weapon, but in the Galaxy Network, a Spirit Tool would not be simulated as well.","Of course, in the tournament, one could also choose to use weapons in battle, but it would only have the basic attributes, and would not have any additional effects.","Ling Han nodded internally. The fact that the Galaxy Network could connect everyone in the universe was already incredibly amazing. It definitely could not be perfect and flawless.","Even so, this still couldn’t conceal the strength of Origin.","It was really powerful. His fist technique was like a violent storm, and Galaxy Network had perfectly manifested the power of his Innate Divine Physique. The two great Divine Beasts, the Dragon and Phoenix, were both releasing powerful might, as if he was not fighting alone, but rather had the Immortal Dragon and the Immortal Phoenix joining forces with him.","As expected of someone who had broken the record for the pinnacle of strength.."]},{"number":3745,"title":"Chapter 3745: A tie?","paragraphs":["Chapter 3745: A tie?","Editor: Henyee Translations","Origin was unbelievably powerful. Moreover, he didn’t need to worry about the burden on his body at all. He could use all kinds of powerful techniques and repetitively.","For example, his Innate Divine Physique, logically, couldn’t be channeled continuously, but it was possible here.","Of course, this was also because Ling Han was too strong. Otherwise, if it was any other opponent, Origin would have been able to deal with him in a single move. What need was there for the battle to be so drawn out?","The two of them battled fiercely, and it was hard to decide the victor.","This was the first time Ling Han had encountered such a powerful opponent. In a battle of equal cultivation levels, he had always been invincible, but Origin could completely contend against him.","That’s right. His explosive power was indeed slightly stronger, but if he didn’t use the Demonic Monkey Fists, his advantage wouldn’t be very obvious.","Most importantly, Origin was not a strength tester, and would not allow him to attack as he liked.","Strength was indeed the most important element of battle prowess. However, strength definitely didn’t guarantee victory, unless it reached a crushing level.","This kind of battle was completely based on individual strength. If they were battling in the outside world, Ling Han wouldn’t believe that there would be a second Foundation Building cultivator who could possess an Imperial Weapon.","For Ling Han, this kind of opponent also filled him with endless fighting spirit.","Only by relying on one’s own strength to defeat such an opponent could one truly achieve victory.","He channeled out the Demonic Monkey Fists. Instantly, a Demonic Monkey fused with him, causing his aura to suddenly soar greatly.","This was an Imperial Technique, and merely its aura alone was enough to suppress 99% of Foundation Building Tier cultivators. They were completely unqualified to oppose it.","However, Origin was completely unaffected.","Ling Han was astounded. Could it be that the foundation stone of the Celestial Path that he had cultivated was also a replica of the primitive Celestial Gate?","Otherwise, the spiritual body could not possibly rely on any kind of Spirit Tool, so how would it be able to resist the intimidation of an Imperial Technique?","He remembered that when he had been leaping over the Celestial Gates, he had seen a figure at the end. Was that Origin?","But if that was Origin, it would not match in the timeline.","Unless... one more person had come to the primitive Celestial Gate!","Hiss, what was wrong with this world? A freak like Ling Han and Origin should only appear once in several great eras, but now, they appeared one after another.","Don’t forget that there was also Heaven Crushing and Myriad Dao. The strength and talent of these two people should not be inferior to Origin, and added with that mysterious prodigy, the number of super freaks was as many as five people.","Ling Han withdrew his idle thoughts, and continued to battle fiercely with his strongest opponent.","The two of them were like peacocks, bursting forth with the brightest light, causing every single member of the audience to be unable to take their eyes off them. In fact, even their breathing had stopped.","Thankfully, they were spiritual manifestations now, so even if they didn’t breathe, it wouldn’t affect them at all.","“Who can win?”","“It seems to be a complete tie.”","“This is really too shocking. Aside from Origin, Myriad Dao and Heaven Crushing, another incredibly freakish guy has actually appeared.”","“What kind of era are we living in now? In the past few great eras, it was rare for even one such prodigy to appear, and now, all of a sudden, four of them have appeared.”","Everyone sighed ruefully. Being born in this kind of era was practically the tragedy of all prodigies.","It was now the Foundation Building Tier, and in future, it would be the Cauldron Forging Tier. Then, it would be the Core Formation Tier. Whichever cultivation level Ling Han and the others advanced into, it would cause chaos among the prodigies of that cultivation level.","Ling Han believed that if he continued to use the Demonic Monkey Fists, even if it was only the first style, he should still be able to defeat Origin.","However, he could channel the Demonic Monkey Fists continuously now, but in the real world, he could only use it once in a short period of time. A powerful secret technique naturally had harsh conditions for casting, so how could he channel it continuously?","Ling Han didn’t need to win in this way.","Furthermore, once he defeated Origin, that would be one less gimmick. How would he be able to earn money from ticket fees in future?","Yes, he could not win, but he could not lose either.","Ling Han maintained his battle prowess the entire time, and it did not change. When a day had passed, the tournament authorities forcefully interfered, and ended the battle between the two of them.","A tie?","No, Ling Han had been judged to have won.","Why?","Because Origin’s cultivation level was higher, even if the two of them were at the peak stage of Heavenly Dao Foundation, Ling Han still hadn’t reached the peak stage of Heavenly Dao Foundation yet. He was at a disadvantage.","Fighting to a tie in a disadvantageous situation, it was naturally his victory.","Origin was defeated.","“Unfair, this is too unfair!”","“One isn’t weak at all!”","“Completely biased!”","This caused a great many people to protest, because everyone was already very dissatisfied with the fact that Ling Han was charging fees in the first place, so it naturally exploded.","However, this rule had been set by the Four Directions Great Emperor in the past, so what was the use of protesting? The Galaxy Network soul completely ignored it.","Ling Han was extremely satisfied with this result. Not only had he won, but he had also drawn the displeasure of many people. They were defending Origin. In this way, when he and Origin battled again, more and more people would definitely come to watch the battle.","He took a look. The battle he was fighting had actually attracted 730,000 people to watch the battle. Each of them had paid 1000 Universe Coins, which was a total of more than 700 million!","Heavens, he had earned too million Universe Coins in one go, and there was still a lot more than that.","Too bad, this kind of battle could not be carried out continuously. If there was too many of such battles, it would not be so attractive. No one would complain about having too much money.","After battling for three ranking battles, he exited the Galaxy Network.","Now, he had a lot of money, but the problem was how to spend it.","On this planet?","Hehe, there was not much difference between having money and not having money.","However, he was so hungry!","Ling Han immediately felt an intense hunger. After cultivators advanced into Celestial Path, they would be able to survive as long as they could absorb the power of heaven and earth. However, this wouldn’t be able to eliminate their hunger.","Previously, he had stayed in the Galaxy Network for a consecutive twenty days, and his physical body had not eaten the slightest bit of food all this while. That must mean that he was extremely hungry.","Hurry up and go eat.","He pushed open the doors and left. Hu Niu immediately jumped over. When she found out that he was going to eat, she naturally went with him happily.","“Yi, you’ve broken through to the Foundation Building Tier?” Ling Han was surprised.","“That’s right, bad Ling Han. When I broke through to Foundation Building Tier, you weren’t even by Niu’s side!” Hu Niu humphed.","“Hehe, Grandpa Dog has also broken through!” The large black dog appeared, exuding the unique aura of a Foundation Building cultivator.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel rueful. Having someone fully support him and fighting alone were two completely different things.","Previously, he had worked so hard, and had many fortuitous encounters, but that was also because he had spent a very long time to finally break through to Foundation Building Tier. How could it be as easy as Hu Niu and the others?","However, he had cultivated each cultivation level to the pinnacle, so he naturally had to spend even more time.","“Ling Han! Ling Han!” Xuanyuan Dingguo’s voice traveled over from afar.","Ling Han sighed. Why was this guy always panicking?","It wasn’t long before Xuanyuan Dingguo charged through the door, panting and looking like the sky was about to collapse.","“What is it? Does your father want to force you to marry some ugly woman?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“You’re still in the mood to laugh? Something big has happened!” Xuanyuan Dingguo said loudly to Ling Han after taking two deep breaths.","“What’s going on?” Ling Han didn’t think much of it. Brother Monkey had returned now, and he was the descendant of a genuine Imperial Clan. His battle prowess was definitely one of the strongest among Sect Masters.","With Brother Monkey standing guard, who would he be afraid of?","“Someone from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire has come!” Xuanyuan Dingguo said.","Er, this was really shocking news.."]},{"number":3746,"title":"Chapter 3746: Visitors from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire","paragraphs":["Chapter 3746: Visitors from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire","Editor: Henyee Translations","The Azure Dragon Majestic Empire could be considered the culprit behind the Celestial Sea Planet’ s difficulties.","In the past, this Majestic Empire was worried that the Chen Clan’s Royal Empire would rise up and threaten their orthodox status, so they casually gave the Chen Clan a crime of treason and sent out an army to besiege them, leading to the destruction of the Chen Clan and the massacre of tens of thousands of living beings. Afterwards, they even used the Celestial Sea Planet as a prison to imprison those who could not be easily killed.","Previously, when the Dark North Nation rose up, the prison was also opened. The Azure Dragon Majestic Empire actually did not have the slightest reaction, and only now did they send someone over.","They had really come slowly.","In the past, Ling Han didn’t know the reason, but now that he was connected to the Galaxy Network, it could be said that even on the other side of the universe, no matter what happened, he would be able to react at the first instant.","The Azure Dragon Majestic Empire couldn’t even take care of themselves during this period of time, because they were invaded by the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire. A great many planets had fallen, and those were all bountiful resource planets. In comparison, how could they possibly take the Celestial Sea Planet, a prison, to heart? Where would they find the manpower to handle this matter?","It wasn’t until not too long ago that news of the inheritance of the Saint spread far and wide. Even the Azure Dragon Empire Majestic Empire had heard about it, and finally sent an envoy over.","“Oh, what did that envoy say?” Ling Han asked.","Xuanyuan Dingguo shook his head and said, “How would I know?”","“Then has His Majesty stepped out?” Ling Han asked again.","“Not yet. The Second Prince, the Third Prince, and the Council Chairperson have all gone to receive them. I am sure that not too long after, His Majesty would also be alerted,” Xuanyuan Dingguo deduced.","Ling Han nodded. An envoy from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire had come. Such an important matter would definitely alert Chen Fengyan.","Though now that the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire was being invaded by an external enemy, they would definitely be hard-pressed and severely short of manpower, if they squeezed out some of their manpower and sent out a Sect Master, that would be enough to sweep aside all opposition in the Celestial Sea Planet – of course, this did not take into account Brother Monkey.","“Then what do the four great sects say?” Ling Han knocked on the table.","“What can they say?” Xuanyuan Dingguo sneered. “They’re staying here for the inheritance of the Saint. Now that it is proven that the so-called Saint’s inheritance is a lie, they can run at any time. The reason why they haven’t left immediately is because they’ve occupied some bountiful sites, where they can harvest high-level Celestial medicines. That’s why they are staying here as long as they can.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh. “You’ve seen things quite thoroughly.”","“Of course.” Xuanyuan Dingguo was a little proud.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then said, “His Majesty will definitely step out on this matter. Let’s just wait and see.”","Sure enough, only a day later, Chen Fengyan appeared and met with this “envoy from the superior empire”.","Brother Monkey had also returned, and said that he was about to leave Celestial Sea Planet. He was going to break through to the fourth pinnacle level, and in the current environment of Celestial Sea Planet, he would need a very long time. He had to go to a great planet.","“Brother Monkey, have you seen Chen Fengyan?” Ling Han asked.","Brother Monkey nodded. “That brat is actually hiding in the restrictions on the 18th underground level. He’s really as cowardly as a mouse. However, Old Sun swept aside all obstacles along the way, so what use are these restrictions?” Ling Han couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat. The reason why Chen Fengyan had set up this kind of restriction should be to prevent Primordial True Lord and the others from sneak attacking him while he was in seclusion, but what kind of existence was Brother Monkey?","Sect Master-level, and furthermore, he was a descendant of an Ancestral King, a great demon that possessed a Saint Tool, so it was natural that he could destroy everything in his way.","Sigh.","Lmg Han silently mourned for Chen Fengyan in his mind. Who told him to have such a senior?","“This brat is really too useless. So many years have passed, and his cultivation level is actually still the same as before. I’m so angry that I beat him up.” Brother Monkey humphed, “Also, Old Sun asked him before, and he actually didn’t call Second Brother uncle. Old Sun was so angry that he beat him up again.”","Er... Chen Fengyan actually didn’t die. He was quite durable.","“Old Sun has already told that brat that he has to listen to you in everything in the future,” Brother Monkey said.","Under Brother Monkey’s violent attacks, perhaps even Chen Fengyan wouldn’t dare to say no.","“Second Brother, the path of martial arts is long, and you need to advance with determination. You’re too sentimental, and this will probably delay your cultivation,” Brother Monkey continued. A vicious glint flashed in his eyes, “Old Sun will help you kill those women!”","F***, what kind of thought process is going through your head?","Ling Han hurriedly waved his hand and said, “Brother Monkey, don’t be rash. I know what I’m doing, and I definitely won’t delay my cultivation. Look, haven’t I formed two foundations of the Celestial Path, which is an unprecedented feat?”","To form two Celestial Foundations, there were two conditions, and neither could be missing.","Firstly, life had to be nurtured in dimensions within one’s body. This was something that no one in the entire galaxy could do. Secondly, even if there really was someone who could do the same as Ling Han, they would still have to use an Imperial Weapon as suppression. Otherwise, the second Celestial Foundation would still be impossible to form.","Hence, it was not an exaggeration to say that it was an unprecedented feat.","Brother Monkey nodded, “Forget it then.”","That was close. Ling Han breathed a sigh of relief.","The next time I see you, Second Brother, if your cultivation level doesn’t reach Old Sun’s expectations, then Old Sun will still decide to sever your mortal bonds for you,” Brother Monkey continued. Then, with a leap, xiu, he directly pierced through the heavens, turning into a streak of light that disappeared.","This... the pressure was huge!","Brother Monkey, you didn’t say when you would return, nor did you say what cultivation level I should reach to satisfy you, making me feel very uncertain.","Forget it, he’d just work hard on cultivation.","Ling Han pondered for a moment. Chen Fengyan had come out of seclusion so quickly. Had he simply come out because he had been dragged out and beaten up by Brother Monkey?","Otherwise, he would probably still be diligently cultivating in seclusion, right? Ling Han was just thinking about this, when Imperial Guards suddenly came over. They came to announce an imperial decree that decreed that Ling Han should enter the palace immediately.","On the surface, Ling Han was naturally Chen Fengyan’s subject, so he naturally had to comply with the emperor’s decree.","Thus, Ling Han set out with the Imperial Guards, heading towards the Imperial Palace.","Today, the Imperial Palace was really bustling with noise and excitement. Not only were the Imperial Princes present, but there were also the Four Great Generals, the Council Chairman, and the likes. Because of Hong Tianbu, Grand Tutor Hong had long since fled the Imperial Capital and gone to the Nine Spirits Sect.","Ling Han swept an eye over him. Chen Fengyan was naturally seated high up on the throne, but beneath him, a green-robed man was also seated. He was still sipping tea, looking very relaxed and carefree.","This must be the envoy of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. Otherwise, why would he dare to be so arrogant?","—In front of the Emperor, everyone could only stand solemnly.","“Is this Ling Han, one of the two prodigies of the Imperial Capital?” The envoy from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire glanced at Ling Han and asked.","All the officials looked furious. This was the Imperial Palace, and Chen Fengyan hadn ‘t even spoken yet. What right did he have to speak?","However, this person was the envoy of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. Even if he was slightly arrogant, what could they do about it? Moreover, he was an Ultimate Dao Foundation cultivator, so who here could compare?","Could it be that Chen Fengyan, the emperor, had to personally teach this rude guy a lesson?","That would really be hilarious. There was no one in the massive Dark North Nation that could compare to him, and they actually wanted a Spirit Transformation True Lord to personally teach a mere Ultimate Dao Foundation a lesson.","Wasn’t it embarrassing?"]},{"number":3747,"title":"Chapter 3747: Beating up the envoy","paragraphs":["Chapter 3747: Beating up the envoy","Editor: Henyee Translations","Ling Han strode toward the envoy from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. There was a disdainful smile on the envoy’s face. This Royal Empire was truly waning. Up until now, he had actually not seen anyone that could match his cultivation level — not counting Chen Fengyan, he should have escaped from the prison. Actually, he did not know at all how many people and elites were actually imprisoned inside.","However, he wasn’t afraid of Chen Fengyan. This time, he had come on behalf of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. So what if he was only an Ultimate Dao Foundation? Who would dare to touch him?","Touching him would be disrespecting the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, and it would draw out the great elites of the Majestic Empire to move and flatten the","Dark North Nation.","Moreover, aside from Chen Fengyan, who else could rival him?","Ling Han was already approaching, and he raised his hand.","Hiss!","Everyone couldn’t help but widen their eyes in shock. ‘It can’t be that you want to slap him, right?’","To be honest, they too wanted to, but firstly, they did not have the ability, and secondly, even if they did, they would not dare. That was the envoy of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. Hitting him would mean great trouble.","“Impudence!” The envoy from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire was enraged. To say nothing of the fact that Ling Han hadn’t hit him yet, he was already enraged by the fact that Ling Han was standing in front of him in such a position.","Didn’t he know the rules?","I am an envoy to the imperial court!","“I’m beating a b@stard like you!” Ling Han said, and delivered a slap.","He had not struck suddenly, but rather made his stand clear. I have come to thrash you, frank and forthright.","It was precisely because of this that the envoy from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire was naturally enraged. ‘You really dare to slap me?’","“You’re seeking death!” he said with a cold chuckle. This person was far too stupid. Did he really think that he could act as arrogant as he liked just because he was one of the two prodigies of the Imperial Capital?","This was a backward and primitive planet. The path of martial arts had just begun here, so what kind of prodigy could emerge?","Because he was the tallest among the dwarves, he thought that he was taller than anyone else?","He also moved, and delivered a palm strike right at Ling Han’s face.","He was going to kill Ling Han with this strike.","Pa, a slap landed, unstoppable.","The envoy from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire was instantly sent flying. Peng, he fell heavily onto the ground, blood seeping out.","Hiss, everyone inhaled sharply. He had beaten an envoy, and the matter had blown up.","“Good, good, good!” The envoy flipped over and got back to his feet, blood all over the corners of his lips. He pointed angrily at Ling Han, then pointed at the others, “You guys are done for, you’re all done for, all of you are going to die, all of you!”","Ling Han scoffed, “Haven’t you learnt your lesson yet?”","He strode over. Pa, pa, pa, he greeted the envoy with a series of slaps.","All the ministers, including those Imperial Princes, were dumbfounded. If you want to die, don’t drag us down with you.","Why didn’t His Majesty stop him?","It was naturally satisfying to vent anger, but the consequences still had to be considered. It couldn’t be done at the expense of lives, right?","En, His Majesty is not in a position to advise against it, is he?","You see, he was arrogant, and His Majesty couldn’t make a move directly, making others laugh at the Dark North Nation for having no one to rely on. Then, Ling Han stepped out, and won back some face for the Dark North Nation. That naturally was a merit. If it was a merit, how could His Majesty reprimand him?","They understood.","Some subjects immediately felt that they had touched the point of issue for Chen Fengyan, and thought that this was a good opportunity to curry his favor.","“Ling Han, that’s enough. Stop!”","They all called out. It was not convenient for His Majesty to speak, so it was naturally up to them to do the job.","Yet Ling Han did not even cast a look at them. He was just here to thrash this envoy from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire.","He did not have the sligthest bit of positive feelings towards the members of the Meng Clan. Previously, he had competed with Meng Yangcheng over the Buddhist Race’s fated opportunity, and added with the crime that Azure Dragon Majestic Empire had committed on the Celestial Sea Planet, Brother Monkey had suffered for more than two thousand years because of this. This had determined that Ling Han and Azure Dragon Majestic Empire would definitely end up on opposing sides.","As for today? He would beat up the envoy first and collect some interest.","“Ling Han, you’ve gone crazy!”","“Stop!”","All the ministers shouted loudly, and even a few Imperial Princes almost rushed over. However, Chen Fengyan did not speak all this while, so how could the others have the courage to come to blows with Ling Han in this palace?","The envoy finally understood Ling Han’s determination. Although his heart was filled with fury, a wise man doesn’t fight when the odds are against him.","He obediently shut his mouth.","“Do you know where you’ve gone wrong?” Ling Han asked.","He hadn’t done anything wrong!","The envoy thought, but how could he possibly dare to be stubborn with Ling Han? Hurriedly, he said, “I should not have gone out of line in front of the Dark North King.”","Ling Han patted his head and said, “You still know where the line is?” The envoy muttered internally. This was only a primitive land, so what was it worth in front of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, which was at its peak? If it was not for the invasion of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire, they would have directly mobilized an army of elites to flatten this planet completely.","“I know my mistake,” he said obediently.","When he returned to the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, he would definitely add fuel to the fire and egg on the imperial court to send elites to destroy the","Dark North Nation.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Are you thinking that when you return, you will definitely exaggerate today’s matter a hundredfold, and then ask the elites to destroy us?”","When everyone heard this, they wanted nothing more than to rush over and beat Ling Han up.","‘Aren’t you teaching him what to do?’","The envoy hurriedly shook his head, and said, “How could that be? Impossible!” His expression was filled with righteousness.","Ling Han chuckled and said, “It’s fine even if you say it. However, you’re just a Foundation Building cultivator. So what if you’ve been wronged? Who would take it to heart? Our Dark North Nation is a loyal subject of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. Do you think the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire will raise its butcher’s knife against loyal subjects?”","“Fool, there are so many people in the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, so why did they send you over? Don’t you have any idea?","The envoy’s heart skipped a beat. That’s right, why had they sent him?","He was merely in the Foundation Building Tier, and in the galaxy, he was not even worth a fart. Who would take him seriously?","Yet he had been beaten silly by Ling Han. The reason why the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire had sent him here was firstly, because the front lines were really in dire straits, and they could not spare any elites. After all, the internal strife in the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire was also very great, and a great many great forces were no longer very obedient. Furthermore, the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire still considered themselves as one of the superior nations, and looked down on the Celestial Sea Planet 100 times over, so they naturally did not think that there was any need to send elites over.","They were just a bunch of prisoners. I did not mobilize troops to destroy you, but rather asked you to surrender. Naturally, you should be crying in gratitude. What else do you want?","The envoy had completely lost his pride. At present, the front lines were in dire straits, and Spiritual Transformation True Lords like Chen Fengyan and the others would be fully assisting. In comparison, what was he worth?","Only then did Ling Han smile. He tossed the messenger back onto the chair, and clasped his hands respectfully at Chen Fengyan, saying, “Greetings, Your Majesty.”","Chen Fengyan suddenly stood up. ‘F*ck! This is my youngest uncle! Not long ago, he was thrashed by Uncle Monkey and scolded for disrespecting his elders. He was beaten to the point that he couldn’t bear it anymore!’ Now, however, Ling Han was actually paying respects to him? This was truly going to kill him. Where was Uncle Monkey? Was Uncle Monkey here?","He couldn’t help but look around, his heart thumping wildly.","All the ministers were surprised. What was going on here?"]},{"number":3748,"title":"Chapter 3748: Self-recommendation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3748: Self-recommendation","Editor: Henyee Translations","A subject bowed, and Chen Fengyan actually stood up.","Hiss, this was too exaggerated, wasn’t it?","Chen Fengyan also realized that he had lost his composure. It couldn’t be helped. He had been beaten to the point of doubting life by Brother Monkey previously. He sat back down, waved his hand, and said, “My dear subject, there’s no need to be so polite.”","Ling Han nodded, and retreated among the ministers.","Shua, every minister involuntarily took a few steps back, maintaining an absolute distance from Ling Han.","No one wanted to have anything to do with this troublemaker.","Ling Han was rendered speechless. Was he that scary?","Chen Fengyan looked at the envoy and said calmly, “You’ ve come on behalf of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, so what’s your intention?”","That envoy finally recovered a little of his pride, but when he discovered that Ling Han was staring at him, this little bit of pride immediately vanished without a trace.","Others might have reservations, but this guy didn’t. Others didn’t dare to touch him, but this guy did.","The envoy hurriedly said honestly, “Our Imperial Majesty, requests the Dark North King to deliver your letter of surrender, and send an envoy to represent the Dark North Nation to stay eternally in our Empire.”","It was very much in line with the rules to present a surrender letter. The Azure Dragon Majestic Empire could not possibly allow an uncontrollable force to appear in their territory, but they still needed the Dark North Nation to send out an envoy?","Wasn’t this clearly a hostage?","All the Imperial Princes looked livid. This envoy was definitely going to be chosen from among them.","Among them, the ten eldest Imperial Princes were the most nervous. They had the best natural talent, and had the highest cultivation level. Thus, they would definitely be the first to be chosen.","-The more important this hostage was to Chen Fengyan, the more obedient Chen Fengyan would be. This was a simple logic that could be understood just by thinking about it.","However, who would want to become a hostage?","To put it nicely, they would be an anvoy, but in truth, they were a hostage, and what good treatment could a hostage get?","They were all Imperial Princes, and able to command so many people at once now, so how awe-inspiring was that?","However, if he went to the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, he would be like an insect that wouldn’t get any response no matter how much he called out.","All the Imperial Princes turned to look at Chen Fengyan, hoping that their father’s love for them would be as great as a mountain. They hoped that he wouldn’t choose them.","“I’ll go.” A voice rang out. In the silence, it seemed very abrupt.","Shua, all eyes turned towards Ling Han.","It was Ling Han who had spoken just now.","All the subjects shook their heads. ‘You are really too f****** good at sucking up, but the problem is, no matter how much His Majesty dotes on you, what right do you have to be a hostage?’","One couldn’t become a hostage so easily. One had to have a high enough status. Before Chen Fengyan could speak, the messenger interrupted, “Er... it’s best that the messenger is the son of the Dark North King. Otherwise, it might be useless even if you go.”","He was scared off by Ling Han’s beating, and his words were very careful, fearing that Ling Han would come and beat him up again in anger. Ling Han cracked a smile, “Don’t worry, my weight is enough.","He paused for a moment before turning to Chen Fengyan and asking, “Isn t that right, nephew?”","Shua! Everyone turned to look at Chen Fengyan.","Nephew?","‘Hmm?’","Chen Fengyan felt extremely vexed. What would come eventually would come. This relationship couldn’t be concealed! However, he was also grateful that Ling Han was willing to stand up for the Chen Clan.","He nodded, “Subject Ling is indeed my elder.”","A single stone caused a thousand ripples!","What? Ling Han was actually Chen Fengyan’s senior?","Heavens, how was this possible?","Meanwhile, the Second Imperial Prince and the others suddenly recalled that when Ling Han had been teaching them a lesson, he had indeed said that he was their grand uncle. At first, they had thought that Ling Han was deliberately taking advantage of them, but they had not thought that it was actually true.","The envoy was also surprised.","Chen Fengyan was the ruler of a nation, and he was more so a mighty Spirit Transformation True Lord. If he dared to recognize a random person as elder, he would definitely lose all face.","Thus, Ling Han was genuinely Chen Fengyan’s senior.","No wonder Chen Fengyan didn’t stop Ling Han from acting so arrogantly just then. Wasn’t that treasonous?","“This nephew of mine has over a hundred sons. He would not take any one of them to heart at all,” Ling Han said. “However, it is different for me, his uncle. There is only one, and the significance is completely different.”","Yi, why are you still promoting yourself?","Everyone was speechless. You are going to be a hostage, not to enjoy life. Why are you so proactive?","The envoy couldn’t help but nod. That’s right. He had over a hundred sons. Whichever one he chose as hostage, would they be able to use him to threaten Chen Fengyan?","Moreover, once Ling Han went to the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, wouldn’t it be his territory?","It was now possible for him to exact revenge.","When he thought of this, his heart involuntarily thumped.","“All right, it’s you then,” he nodded.","Everyone was speechless. This was such a big matter, and Ling Han had decided with just a single word of self-promotion and a nod from the envoy?","This was too childish, wasn’t it?","“Ling Han!” Chen Fengyan said. This was Uncle Monkey’s sworn brother. If he sent Ling Han to the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, Uncle Monkey would definitely beat him to death.","Ling Han smiled and said, “I’ve made up my mind!”","Chen Fengyan could only keep his mouth shut. Ling Han had already put on the airs of an elder, so if he dared to disobey, he would also be beaten up by Uncle Monkey.","Sigh, it was really difficult to be a nephew these days.","It wasn’t long before Chen Fengyan issued the imperial decree. Three days later, Ling Han brought the imperial decree with him and set off for the Moonlight Planet with the envoy from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. Was Ling Han really so righteous, and was making sacrifices for the Chen Clan? Of course not. This was a decision that he had made after careful consideration. Firstly, on the Celestial Sea Planet, Ling Han’s alchemy abilities could not be used at all, which was equivalent to them being wasted. He had to go to a planet that was rich in resources.","Secondly, he was now connected to the Galaxy Network, and he wasn’t short of money at all. He could buy whatever he wanted, but if he was on the Celestial Sea Planet... hoho, there would be no postage.","Thirdly, he wanted to probe the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire first, to prepare for the future.","Thus, he would rather take the risk to become a hostage.","-If he was really angered, he could just release the Heavenly Dao Flames, and turn the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire upside down. Then, he could call Brother Monkey to come and provide support, and leave the Holy Land of Metal Element far behind.","After returning to the Foreign Affairs Department, Ling Han made arrangements.","He was going to be a hostage this time, so he definitely couldn’t bring the empress and the others with him. However, the empress and the others had also advanced into the Foundation Building Tier, so it would be too slow for them to advance if they stayed on the Celestial Sea Planet. Thus, the empress and the others had to set out soon after, and he had Tang Yun’er send them off with a shuttle. In any case, with the Essence Nurturing Gourd, it could hold a lot of people.","It was needless to ask the empress and the others. They were all his wives. Meanwhile, Lin Luo, Zhou Heng, Karmic Life Heavenly Venerable, and the others also expressed their willingness to go to the Moonlight Planet.","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. When Brother Monkey advanced into the fourth pinnacle level and became a Venerate Tier, these people should have grown and become Brother Monkey’s powerful helpers, defeating the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire in a single stroke.","This trip to the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire would bury countless seeds of hope.","The empress was still fine, but Hu Niu wasn’t a reasonable person. She acted spoiled and wanted to go with Ling Han. In the end, she was suppressed by the empress, and could only cry out loudly.","Three days later, Ling Han left the Foreign Affairs Department and boarded a warship with the envoy from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. They set off for the Moonlight Planet.","And he was accompanied by the large black dog and the perverted pig."]},{"number":3749,"title":"Chapter 3749: Jia Yuan Manor","paragraphs":["Chapter 3749: Jia Yuan Manor","Editor: Henyee Translations","After boarding the warship, Ling Han stayed alone in the cabin.","Of course, there was also the large black dog and the perverted pig.","Though he was going to be a hostage, and could not possibly bring his whole family with him, there was no rule against bringing “pets”, was there?","The envoy from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire was called Ge Shuang. He thought that Ling Han was scared of leaving home, and ignored this. His mind was filled with thoughts of how he was going to vent his anger after returning to the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire.","—At present, he definitely did not dare to kill Ling Han. This was a hostage from the Dark North Nation, but if he embarrassed Ling Han a little, or even gave him a good thrashing, that was fine.","“Let’s go.”","With a wave of his hand, the warship began to traverse through the galaxy.","Ling Han naturally didn’t feel any grief. He had experienced this kind of situation many times before, so he only had ambitions of conquering new territory. How could he worry about personal gains and losses?","He connected with Galaxy Network and began today’s level battles.","After a few days, his ranking was also shooting up.","At the lower levels, if one maintained a winning streak, their ranking would increase very quickly. Lin Luo and the others had only fought for less than two months, yet they had already entered the top 100 million, which was proof enough of this.","He had already mastered one form of the Demonic Monkey Fists, and from the second form onwards, there was still a requirement for cultivation level. It was not something that could be achieved simply through hard cultivation. Thus, Ling Han did not waste any more Universe Coins to go to the Time Chamber to cultivate. Instead, he went to the training hall to break records.","He would experience great improvement every day, and his power was naturally increasing as well. However, he had not broken through to the next cultivation level, so this kind of improvement was naturally limited. There would not be any sudden qualitative change.","However, he wasn’t far from those records in the first place. Slowly, he broke records one after another. Although he didn’t obtain many Universe Coins, his reputation became more and more renowned.","There were too many people who wanted to defeat him, and make a name for themselves in a single stroke. Regarding this, Ling Han was also very willing to oblige them. He clearly stated a price of 10,000 Universe Coins per battle.","At this point, the strength of Ling Han’s talent had indeed shocked the universe. At the same time, his reputation for being a money-grubber was not to be outdone either, causing many great forces to come to recruit him. The first words they said were, ‘As long as you join us, you can ask for as many Universe Coins as you want.’","Ling Han indeed needed money very much, but he would definitely not sell himself off to any force.","Moreover, if he wanted money, couldn’t he earn it himself?","He tried to find Origin to fight again, but Origin would refuse every time. When he was annoyed enough, he replied that there was no meaning to continue fighting now. He would fight again after Ling Han had a breakthrough in strength, or Ling Han had advanced into Ultimate Dao Foundation.","Sigh, wasn’t this cutting off his source of income?","Ling Han was in high spirits, and went to contact Myriad Dao and Heaven Crushing. He wanted to befriend them, then open a tournament stage to collect fees for tickets, but the two of them actually ignored him.","F***, had he become notorious now?","He patiently and continuously issued his friend request, and the two of them finally replied. They said that Ling Han had to be ranked in the top ten of Galaxy Network, at least, before they could exchange blows with Ling Han.","There was nothing else that could be done. He could only find another way to earn money.","Don’t say, there were really people who refused to believe it, and came to challenge Ling Han. However, Ling Han’s strength could be ranked around a hundredth even among those in Ultimate Dao Foundation, and how could those who were ranked so high take the initiative to challenge someone with such a low point level like Ling Han?","Winning would not bring them any glory, but losing would mean losing face. What was the point?","Ling Han would participate in the level battles every day, and earn some extra income from accepting challenges from others. He didn’t feel that his days were difficult. However, he couldn’t absorb the power of heaven and earth in the heaven and earth, so he could only rely on the Azure Wood Restore Spirit Pill to improve. This caused his advancement to become very slow.","It couldn’t be helped. The Silver Dragon Fish’s effects were more or less digested.","The warship passed through one wormhole after another, and after a whole two months, they finally arrived at Moonlight Planet.","“We’ve finally arrived.” Ge Shuang smirked coldly. This was his territory. Now that they were here, even if Ling Han was a dragon, he would have to coil himself up. He would slowly deal with Ling Han.","The warship landed, and Ge Shuang was the first to disembark. He glanced at Ling Han, who was behind him, and saw that the latter had a relaxed expression on his face. He did not have the slightest bit of unease and anxiety that came from having just arrived here, which made him feel slightly displeased.","In his eyes, Ling Han had suddenly come to the territory of the Majestic Empire. He was all alone, with no one to rely on at all, so he would definitely be in a state of anxiety.","Just how thick was this guy’s brain?","He wanted to “remind” Ling Han and wake him up a little, but before he could speak, he saw Ling Han looking at him with a faint smile, causing his heart to involuntarily tremble. He swallowed the words that were about to come out of his mouth.","He was already traumatized by Ling Han.","Ling Han stepped onto the ground. He looked around. Hehe, Moonlight Planet, he was here again.","“Come with me,” Ge Shuang said. He was extremely displeased with his own performance. They were already in his territory, yet he was still as afraid of Ling Han as if he was a snake.","The two of them strode forwards, and soon arrived at the Clan Mansion?.","“This guy is the uncle of the Dark North Nation’s leader?” When the person-in-charge saw Ling Han, he couldn’t help but ask in surprise, “Ge Shuang, are you joking?”","This person looked to be in his twenties, and it was not that he looked young, but that he was really young. That flame of life blazed brightly, and he definitely could not be over a hundred years old.","But what about Chen Fengyan?","Being able to become a Spirit Transformation True Lord, which one of them wasn’t an old monster?","Ge Shuang hurriedly nodded, and said, “That’s indeed the case. I saw Chen Fengyan admit it with my own eyes. Also, this is the surrender letter that Chen Fengyan handed in. It also clearly states that his uncle, Ling Han, is to stay eternally in our Empire.”","The person-in-charge still couldn’t believe it. He stared at Ling Han repeatedly, and after a long time, he finally made a record of Ling Han’s identity, allowing him to enter into the Jia Yuan Manor.","The Jia Yuan Manor was also known as the Political Hostage Manor, because the people who lived there had the same nature as Ling Han and were hostages of the extraterrestrial forces that were subordinate to the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. Thus, they were all hostages, so what else could they be called if not the Political Hostage Manor?.","Now that they were here, this was no longer a place that Ge Shuang could touch. He watched Ling Han leave, while he was already planning in his heart who he should ask to give Ling Han a harsh beating.","He definitely could not swallow this humiliation.","Ling Han followed a servant into the Jia Yuan Manor. This was a very large place, with multiple courtyards, and there was a hostage living in each courtyard. The conditions were not too bad, and they were all equipped with servants.","“Young Master Ling, this is your residence.” The servant led Ling Han into a courtyard, then nodded at Ling Han before turning around to leave.","Ling Han walked in, and immediately, three servants approached him. They bowed and said, “Greetings, Lord.”","These three servants were two men and one woman respectively. All of them looked to be over forty years old. Their looks were ordinary, and possessed a slight cultivation level. They were all at the level of Blood Transformation Tier.","Ling Han nodded, “My surname is Ling, and my name is Ling Han. You guys can just call me Young Master Han.”","“Young Master Han!” the three servants said at the same time. Their attitudes were extremely respectful.","Even though Ling Han was a hostage, he was still a special envoy representing a nation, so how could he be disrespected?","Ling Han waved his hand, indicating for them to leave. Then, he planned to go out and buy the ingredients for concocting the Foundation Dissolution Pill.","However, when he arrived at the entrance of the Jia Yuan Manor, he was stopped.","“Without special permission, you are not allowed to go out!”"]},{"number":3750,"title":"Chapter 3750: Concocting the Foundation Dissolution Pill","paragraphs":["Chapter 3750: Concocting the Foundation Dissolution Pill","Editor: Henyee Translations","It was not that someone was deliberately targeting Ling Han, but rather that this was the rule of the Jia Yuan Manor. A hostage could not be allowed to leave as he willed it.","Tsk, did they really think of him as a prisoner?","Ling Han didn’t argue. Although the guards here were only at the cultivation level of the Foundation Building Tier, and he could deal with them with a single finger, if he really made a move, he would attract the suppression of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. For the current Ling Han, this was a colossal giant that he couldn’t oppose yet.","Thus, he turned around and returned. However, he asked, “I can’t go out. Is there any problem with my dog going out for a walk?”","Walking the dog? Oh, no, the dog was walking itself?","The guard at the door thought for a moment, then said that there was no problem.","As long as there was no problem.","After Ling Han returned, he called the large black dog over.","“What’s wrong? Can’t you see that I’m busy right now?” The large black dog was presently sprawled out on the ground. Ever since he had equipped the connection device, it was as if he had obtained an incredibly interesting toy. He had been immersed in that world all this while, and was having a great time playing with it.","Ling Han chuckled, “Alright, then from now onwards, I won’t give you any more Universe Coins.”","“Hehehe!” The large black dog immediately got up, and said with an obsequious smile, “Little Han Han, Grandpa Dog was just joking with you. Don’t take it seriously. Quick, tell me what’s the matter. Grandpa Dog is juat about to bring a girl to barge into a place of extreme frost. We agreed that after we barged in, the girl would show Grandpa Dog her underpants.”","Ling Han almost gave him a slap. ‘What are you thinking about all day?’","In the Galaxy Network, in addition to sparring and shopping, there were also some virtual Mystery Realms that could allow people to enter for training and increase their experience. The reason why people died time and time again in virtual Mystery Realms was actually so that they would not die in real Mystery Realms, or even be injured in real Mystery Realms.","But when it came to the large black dog, it actually became a tool for him to pick up girls?","“You damn dog, can’t you show some promise?” Ling Han sighed.","“Heng, heng!” The pervert pig also mocked from the sidelines.","“You’re not much better either,” Ling Han glared at him.","The perverted pig gave him a disdainful look. If it was not for this guy, it would definitely be in the arms of different beauties by now, enjoying all the luck with women.","“Little Han, why are you calling Grandpa Dog over?” the large black dog asked.","Ling Han looked at it. Now, he was slightly hesitant. Would it be reliable to hand this matter over to the large black dog? Would this guy embezzle his funds to court women?","However, if he didn’t send the large black dog, could it be that he should let the perverted pig go?","Ling Han glanced at the perverted pig, and shook his head. Sigh, why was there only this unreliable pig and dog by his side?","The pervert pig was instantly enraged. What kind of gaze was that?","It was one thing for you to look down on that perverted dog, but why did you have to sweep your gaze over Lord Pig as well, b@stard?","There was nothing else that could be done. He had best let the large black dog do the job.","“Help me buy some medicinal ingredients,” Ling Han said seriously.","The large black dog faltered for a moment before cocking its head to one side to look at Ling Han. “Little Han, you actually delayed Grandpa Dog’s time to court women for such a small matter?”","“Here, I’ll transfer 200,000 Universe Coins to you. Buy me 10 portions of the medicinal ingredients listed here, and I’ve marked the price for each of them. If you can buy them back at a lower price, they’ll be considered your errand fee,” Ling Han tempted.","“I’ll go! I’ll go!” The large black dog immediately stood up on his hind legs, one arm wrapped around Ling Han’s shoulder, “Little Han, if anything like this happens in the future, just send Grandpa Dog over. Who are we to each other!” “Get lost!”","After Ling Han transferred the money, the large black dog fled in a flash.","After half a day, he finally saw the large black dog slowly return. He had thrown all the ingredients on the ground, and then disappeared in a flash. He had probably embezzled a lot of money, and feared that Ling Han would go back on his word.","Unfortunately, it didn’t know how much money Ling Han had earned from the tickets for his battle with Origin. Otherwise, it would definitely strangle Ling Han’s neck and demand a dividend.","Ling Han smiled, and after counting the ingredients, nodded.","Though the large black dog was unreliable, the medicinal ingredients he had bought this time were not too bad. There were no cases of inadequacy of age, or of medicinal effects being lost after being left for too long.","On this point, the large black dog still had some sense of propriety. He knew the importance of Ling Han’s alchemy skills, so he should have only made some money from getting good bargains. Otherwise, if he had just bought some medicinal ingredients, he should not have spent practically half a day’s time. He had probably worn out his mouth, and dumbfounded the shop assistant.","In this aspect, Ling Han was far too confident in the large black dog.","Ling Han then set up the formation. He frowned slightly. The heaven and earth here had been changed, and used to build the defensive formation of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. That was a very high-level formation, which also made Ling Han’s desire to stimulate the heaven and earth here, and form an alchemy formation became a very troublesome task.","Simply put, he was no match for that great formation in the Imperial Capital.","There was nothing else that could be done. Ling Han could only use the Dao Stones as replacement, and burn the energy of the Dao Stones to replenish the power of heaven and earth.","This consumed a lot of Dao Stones, but there was nothing that could be done.","Ling Han began to concoct alchemical pills. He tossed the medicinal ingredients into the cauldron, and used his Spiritual Power to stimulate the power of heaven and earth, blending and improving the essence of the medicinal ingredients.","Pa, a crisp sound rang out, and the alchemy cauldron shattered.","Ling Han couldn’t help but frown. There was nothing wrong with his concoction technique, but concocting alchemical pills above Celestial Path, the power of heaven and earth stimulated was extremely shocking. This ordinary alchemy cauldron could not withstand the pressure of this kind of energy, and easily shattered.","Could it be that he would have to use the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower again?","This was the Imperial Capital of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. Ling Han didn’t want to expose his treasures. Although he could keep have the Imperial Weapon keep a low profile, this wasn’t enough for greedy people.","He had to get a better alchemy cauldron. He couldn’t keep using the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to refine pills in the future, right?","He took out the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and began to refine it again. This time, he would use the future Imperial Weapon to make up for it.","The concoction of the Foundation Dissolution Pill was extremely complex, and it also required a sliver of power from the alchemist’s Celestial Foundation, which directly affected the quality of the completed pill. Even Ling Han had to be very careful, even if he had already rehearsed it many times in his mind.","However, a drill was a drill. In the end, all of it was only plans, but he needed to execute these plans in real life.","Failure, failure, failure.","This was more difficult than Ling Han had imagined. He had actually failed seven times in a row. To the Alchemy Emperor, this was an inconceivable feat.","He adjusted his condition, and was not in a rush to begin concocting the eighth cauldron. Instead, he began to recall in his mind, summarizing his own shortcomings.","After half an hour, Ling Han finally started again.","This time, he was successful.","Three hours passed, and he revealed a smile. The concoction of the alchemical pill was close at hand.","He suddenly snapped his fingers. Xiu, xiu, xiu, he shot out seven flashes of power. This was the power of his Celestial Foundation, and was also the catalyst for the Foundation Dissolution Pill. It was extremely important.","Seven flashes of power shot into the alchemical pills, causing the seven alchemical pills to dance in the air like fairies.","Ling Han focused his full attention. He was presently fusing the power of the Celestial Foundation with the medicinal effects.","One second, two seconds... ten seconds.","The time was very short. Ling Han stretched out a hand, and xiu, the seven alchemical pills were all taken into his palm.","Pa, pa, pa! Applause rang out.."]},{"number":3751,"title":"Chapter 3751: Small Force in the Political Hostage Manor","paragraphs":["Chapter 3751: Small Force in the Political Hostage Manor","Ling Han raised his head, only to see a woman in purple standing atop the wall.","This woman looked to be in her early twenties. She was extremely beautiful, and had a","graceful figure. She stood at a high place, her dress fluttering in the wind, clinging tightly to her body, outlining her captivating curves.","“Miss is?” Ling Han asked.","“My name is Liu Xunyu,” the woman said, “Are you the new arrival, Ling Han?”","“I am.” Ling Han nodded, still looking at her with a questioning expression.","‘What’s the meaning of you standing on the wall of my courtyard?’","Liu Xunyu giggled, and leaped down from the wall. “I’m really sorry. Smelling the fragrance of alchemical pills, I couldn’t help but want to take a look. I really didn’t expect that you are actually an alchemist as well!”","However, Ling Han was slightly apprehensive. He hadn’t discovered when she had leaped onto the wall. Although he was fully focused on refining pills here, even so, no Foundation Building Tier cultivator could possibly deceive his divine sense. Ling Han still had that much confidence.","Thus, there was only one possibility, and that was this Liu Xunyu was not in the Foundation Building Tier. At least, she was in the Cauldron Forging Tier.","“Thank you for the compliment.” Ling Han smiled faintly.","Yet Liu Xunyu was very cordial, “You are too modest. Though there are a great many hostages here, and there is no shortage of those with astonishing natural talent in cultivation, but as far as I know, you are the only alchemist here.”","“All right.” Ling Han nodded honestly and without reservations. His talent in alchemy was indeed amazing.","Liu Xunyu smiled beautifully, “You have just arrived, so you should not have much understanding of this place, so I have come to tell you.”","“All right.”","Liu Xunyu gave Ling Han an introduction. There were a total of 23 hostages here, representing the 23 forces that were subordinate to the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. Some forces had already existed for tens of thousands of years, but there were also some forces that had just been established not too long ago.","The Azure Dragon Majestic Empire allowed their subordinate forces to compete in private. For example, if another force appeared on the Celestial Sea Planet and destroyed the Chen Clan, replacing them, then the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire wouldn’t send troops to avenge the Chen Clan. As long as that force obediently paid their tribute, then there wouldn’t be any problem.","Of course, this force definitely couldn’t affect the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire’s own rule. Otherwise, it would be unavoidable that they would be destroyed, just like the Chen Clan’s Royal Empire. In fact, they didn’t do anything treasonous. It was only because the Meng Clan felt that if this continued, the Chen Clan might become uncontrollable, powerful enough to threaten the existence of the Meng Clan.","Because they were all hostages, the members of Jia Yuan Manor all united, and Liu Xunyu was the “captain” of the hostage group.","“Ling Han, we’re all living under someone else’s roof, so we have to help each other, right?” Liu Xunyu asked in the end.","Ling Han naturally agreed, and replied, “Yes.”","Liu Xunyu cast a meaningful look at Ling Han, “If you encounter any difficulties in future, remember to look for me. If the conditions permit, I will definitely help you resolve them.” “I’ll keep that in mind.”","Liu Xunyu left gracefully, while Ling Han stroked his chin, deep in thought.","In a small place like the Political Hostage Manor, the residents were actually uniting together to form their own forces.","According to Liu Xunyu, there were a total of three Cauldron Forging Origin Tier cultivators here. One was her, and the other two were Han Bing and Zhao Xiao. The others were only in the Foundation Building Tier.","It wasn’t that the people here were weaker in talent, but rather that they usually wouldn’t be hostages for more than a hundred years. At that time, they would be replaced by new hostages, and it was extremely difficult to break through to the Core Formation Tier. Those who could cultivate to this cultivation level were basically old monsters who were hundreds of years old, and those who could break through to the Core Formation Tier before a hundred years old probably wouldn’t exceed ten people per planet.","Theoretically, Ling Han only had to stay here obediently for a hundred years, and he would naturally be “released after serving his sentence”, but the problem was that he had to lose his freedom in this Jia Yuan Manor for a hundred years?","What a joke.","How could he leave?","Ling Han naturally had no intention of becoming a hostage at all. He had only come here because there was a station of the Chang Clan on the Moonlight Planet. Furthermore, he could not leave, and could only depend on the large black dog to move on his behalf. This was too inconvenient.","En, Ling Han immediately thought of his alchemy skills.","For a prodigy alchemist like him, he could become an esteemed guest no matter where he went. Thus, as long as his reputation was raised, it would not be a problem for him to leave","this place.","Undoubtedly, the Foundation Dissolution Pill was the best proof.","Ling Han decided to concoct more Foundation Dissolution Pills. This not only represented wealth, but also symbolized status and identity.","Thus, he had to calm down first. He didn’t believe that the people from the Political Hostage Manor had never had the chance to go out-prisoners would go out for a walk, and in name, they were the envoys of various forces, not prisoners.","Ling Han continued to concoct alchemical pills. He had just concocted a cauldron, and his technique had not reached a state of perfection yet. There was still a lot of room for improvement.","He was quite low-key, and did not leave his residence, concocting alchemical pills every day.","The name of Political Hostage Manor was an unofficial one. In reality, the residents of Jia Yuan Manor were the envoys of various forces. Thus, the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire naturally had to express its interest. Every month, they would provide Jia Yuan Manor with a large amount of cultivation resources, but the right to distribute them was in Liu Xunyu’s","hands.","As expected, as a “captain”, she was not really doing this for the pleasure of helping others and uniting them. Instead, she possessed considerable power.","-I don’t like the look of you, so what if I give you a little less? You can’t even leave, so who are you going to complain to?","Furthermore, the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire delivered cultivation resources every month, but Liu Xunyu distributed them every day, so if one offended her, the speed of retaliation would also be very fast.","A day passed, and Ling Han stopped concocting alchemical pills. Then, he opened the connection device.","Recently, he had not been able to contact Brother Monkey. It should not be that he had turned off the connection device, but rather that he was adventuring in some Mystery Realm. Usually, in Mystery Realms, the Galaxy Network could not be connected.","Ling Han sent a message to Brother Monkey as usual, and switched to the trading interface. He hung up the news of the sale of the Foundation Dissolution Pill, and then queued up to","fight in the ranking battles.","Almost in an instant, someone sent him a message.","“F*ck, aren’t you the guy who broke Origin’s record? Why are you selling alchemical pills","now?”","“Psst, have you gone mad from wanting money? You want to sell fake alchemical pills to earn money?”","Numerous messages were sent over. Some were curious that Ling Han was actually doing the business of a peddler, while others questioned whether the alchemical pills that Ling Han was selling were real or fake.","It could not be helped. Previously, the matter of tickets had already tagged Ling Han with the label of being greedy for money, and now seeing him selling alchemical pills, there would naturally be people who would be suspicious.","Ling Han couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat. Was his credibility really that low?","He added another line to the sales information, “You can use Galaxy Network’s delivery service. Return any fakes that you discover.”","This time, there were finally much fewer people who doubted him, but there were still a few scattered people who doubted him, and they did not believe him at all.","Ling Han couldn’t even be bothered to reply. He was selling Foundation Dissolution Pills, so what need was there for him to beg others to buy them?","After he put on an aloof attitude, a considerable number of people actually believed him. Moreover, with Galaxy Network as guarantor, if they really encountered a fake, they could still get their money back."]},{"number":3752,"title":"Chapter 3752: Sell Me Ten","paragraphs":["Chapter 3752: Sell Me Ten","Ling Han only accepted ten orders, and then withdrew the orders for the sale of Foundation Dissolution Pills.","The rarer something was, the more valuable it would be. After all, he was the Alchemy Emperor, and the alchemical pills he took out would naturally have to be sold for an astronomical price. How could he sell them cheaply? That would be too embarrassing. Ling Han had the large black dog make another trip to the Chang Clan’s office to deliver goods. This postage fee was naturally borne by the buyer, but it was now frozen by Galaxy Network. If it was proven that Ling Han was selling fake goods, then not only would he not be able to sell the goods, he would also lose a huge sum in postage fees.","After waiting for a while, he began the ranking battles. After three rounds, he had spent more than four hours.","It was mainly because he had waited for too long.","No wonder some prodigies didn’t participate in the ranking battles. For those who weren’t patient enough, this would drive them crazy from waiting.","A night passed, and Ling Han cultivated as usual in the morning.","After advancing into Celestial Path, one could actually cultivate at any time. It was just that the efficiency was the highest in the morning. In fact, it was a hundred times more efficient than at other times.","After he finished cultivating, Ling Han began to eat breakfast, planning to continue concocting alchemical pills later.","Peng, peng, peng! At this moment, a knock sounded from outside.","The servant went to open the door, but when he returned, he did not report who had come, but rather directly brought him in.","Ling Han was instantly displeased. He hadn’t decided whether to see the visitor or not, so how could he directly bring the person over?","He turned to look at the person who had arrived. This was a young man with a domineering aura. He had a dignified appearance, and there was also an air of arrogance about him.","Hehe, they were all just hostages. Was there any need to be so overbearing?","When he looked at the servant again, there was an obvious look of fear on his face.","The young man was in the Foundation Building Tier. If he forcefully barged in, even the servants wouldn’t be able to stop him.","“You know how to concoct alchemical pills?” the young man asked directly. “My name is Tan Zhengjie, and you can call me Brother Tan. If you need anything in the future, you can look for me. In this manor, I still have some face. I heard Sister Liu say that you have also concocted Foundation Dissolution Pills. Give me a few, and you can give me your Galaxy Network account. I will transfer the money to you later.”","If this person was more polite, Ling Han would still consider it. However, from the very beginning, he was already showing such a condescending attitude. Ling Han was displeased. Who are you?","What Tan Zhengjie, do I know you?","Ling Han smiled, “Can I look for you for anything?”","“Of course,” Tan Zhengjie nodded proudly.","Ling Han nodded, “All right, then I’ll have to trouble Brother Tan to help me to leave this place immediately.”","‘Hah?’","Tan Zhengjie’s expression instantly froze. ‘You want to leave this place? Pei, I want to too, but the crux of the matter is, is this realistic?’","They were all hostages, and even if they had some ability, it would only be limited to a small place like Jia Yuan Manor.","“Are you deliberately toying with me?” His expression immediately darkened.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Didn’t you say yourself that you could help me with anything?”","Of course, even so, you can’t make such an exorbitant demand.","Tan Zhengjie suppressed his anger, “All right, I will now discuss business with you. One Foundation Dissolution Pill for 10,000 Dao Stones. Give me ten of them.”","10,000?","Ling Han almost laughed in spite of himself. The market price of the Foundation Dissolution Pill was 50,000 per pill, and there was no lack of buyers. For example, he had put up a price of 100,000 per pill on the Galaxy Network Trading Platform, but what was the result? There was no one bargaining at all, and it was directly bought at the first instant.","You want to take it away with just 10,000 Dao Stones?","What a colossal joke.","“I’ll offer 20,000 Dao Stones for one. I’ll take however many you have,” Ling Han replied.","“Ling Han!” Tan Zhengjie raised his voice a notch higher, “Don’t think that there is anything special about being able to concoct alchemical pills. This is Jia Yuan Manor, and you are only a prisoner!”","“You speak as if you’re not.” Ling Han shook his head.","“You—” Tan Zhengjie pointed at Ling Han, “I will give you one more chance! You have to know, if you offend me, you would not be able to move a single step here.”","“Oh, you have that much ability?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","Tan Zhengjie declared proudly, “The Vanguard Planet that Sister Liu is from has been on good terms with the Dong Yuan Planet that I am from for generations. Furthermore, they are in- laws. Thus, if I say a few words to Sister Liu, I guarantee that you will not have a good time!” Ling Han sighed and said, “You’re a man, after all, so why don’t you have any accomplishments at all? You still need a woman to stand up for you?”","Tan Zhengjie’s face instantly flushed red. He appeared to be very furious. These words were really too hurtful.","“Humph, do you think I can’t deal with you?” he asked coldly.","Ling Han chuckled, shook his head, and said, “It’s really not that I’m looking down on you, but for someone like you, I can fight ten single-handedly.”","“Arrogant! You are really arrogant!” Tan Zhengjie said coldly, “Come out, and let’s go to the battlefield for a spar.”","The battlefield was a place that was specifically used for martial arts and sparring in the Jia Yuan Manor, because the destructive power of the Foundation Building Tier was too great. If they really went all out and sparred, this Jia Yuan Manor would be shattered in a few moves. “There’s no need to go to so much trouble. It’s just a matter of stretching out a hand,” Ling Han said with a smile. As expected, he stretched out a hand towards Tan Zhengjie. “Impudence!” Tan Zhengjie was furious. This brat was really arrogant, to actually dare to take the initiative to make a move on him. Furthermore, who did he think he was? He would be able to take him down in a few moves, so there was no need for him to even go to the","battlefield?","But he had just stretched out his hand, when his expression changed drastically.","When Ling Han stretched out this hand, it was like the suppression of heaven and earth,","causing him to actually feel that he was no match.","This was too terrifying. They were both in the Foundation Building Tier, so why was the gap between them so wide?","He wanted to put his life on the line. If he exploded with power, he would at least shatter this courtyard. That way, he would attract the attention of others, and they would save him.","However, when his power surged out, he shockingly discovered that his power was actually","limited to a very small range.","How was this possible?","Though he was only in Heavenly Dao Foundation, even if he was facing an Ultimate Dao Foundation, it was impossible for him to have such a powerful suppressive ability.","Could it be that he was in the Cauldron Forging Tier?","No, no, no, that was definitely impossible.","He hurriedly shook his head in his mind. The aura that Ling Han was exuding was definitely","only that of a Foundation Building cultivator. It was impossible that he was a Cauldron","Forging Tier elite.","However, they were both in the Foundation Building Tier, so how could the gap be so wide?","How high was his ranking in the Galaxy Network? Top 10,000? Or even top 1000 in fact?","He had not even finished this thought, when he was already captured by Ling Han.","Ling Han carried him all the way to the main doors. Then, with a toss, pa, Tan Zhengjie was","thrown onto the ground.","He did not even cast a second look, closed the doors and walked back.","“In future, without my permission, no one is allowed to enter,” he said calmly to his three","servants.","This was the first time, so he would let it go for now.","“Yes, Young Master Han!” The three servants were all trembling.","That was Tan Zhengjie, and he had actually been kicked out like a dog. This guy was really too","awesome.","“However, Young Master Han, that Tan Zheng-”","One of the servants wanted to remind Ling Han of Tan Zhengjie’s background, yet when Ling","Han glanced coldly at him, he immediately shut his mouth obediently, not daring to say","another word."]},{"number":3753,"title":"Chapter 3753: Dazzling Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 3753: Dazzling Battle","Outside the door, Tan Zhengjie got up, his face filled with fury and shame.","He had actually been thrown out the door!","This was a great humiliation.","Though no one outside had witnessed his humiliating scene, Ling Han and his three servants had seen it, and he too would remember this scene forever.","He definitely had to get his revenge!","However, how was he supposed to get his revenge?","“Oh, that’s right. The Dazzling Tournament will be held in nine days’ time. At that time, I will ask a few people to join forces to deal with him!” Tan Zhengjie’s eyes turned, and he had already thought of an idea. He chuckled coldly, “So what if you are strong? I am no match for you in a one-on-one battle, but if I get ten people to gang up on you, I don’t believe that you won’t collapse!”","...","Ling Han wasn’t worried about Tan Zhengjie’s revenge. This was the Political Hostage Manor, so who would dare to mess around?","Moreover, he did not take Tan Zhengjie seriously at all. In his eyes, what was Tan Zhengjie worth?","Two days later, Liu Xunyu ran over again, and told Ling Han to attend an event.","“Seven days later, the Dazzling Tournament will be held,” she said.","“What is the Dazzling Tournament?” Ling Han asked.","“Oh, this is an event organized by our Jia Yuan Manor. The main purpose is to promote everyone’s friendship,” Liu Xunyu said with a smile. “It’s a competition for a colourful ball. Whoever can snatch it will be the winner.”","“How much is the prize money?” Ling Han asked again.","Liu Xunyu’s expression involuntarily darkened. Are you a money grubber?","‘I’ve already said that the main purpose is to promote the friendship between us. Why are you suddenly thinking about money?’","“There is no prize money.” She shook her head, then continued, “However, the prize of the winner surpass all other treasures. Every time it is held, it would be fought over extremely fiercely.”","“Oh, what is it?” Ling Han’s interest was piqued.","Liu Xunyu first kept him in suspense, and merely pursed her lips in a smile. After a while, she said, “The person who finally wins the colourful ball will be able to leave Jia Yuan Manor, and gain a day of freedom.”","A day’s freedom?","This sounded very pitiful and cheap. When had the value of a day of freedom surpassed all other treasures?","However, for hostages like Ling Han, a day’s freedom was a valuable prize.","No wonder they would fight tooth and nail every time.","Ling Han glanced at Liu Xunyu. There were three Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators in this Jia Yuan Manor, so who would be able to compete with the three of them? Though Ling Han was very confident in himself, he did not think that he could defeat a Cauldron Forging Tier.","This wasn’t the Werewolf High Priest. In order to survive, he had gone all out.","Furthermore, there had been a great many people helping at the time, impeding the attention of the Werewolf High Priest, which allowed the Heavenly Pattern Jade to succeed.","Under normal circumstances, no matter how freakish a Foundation Building cultivator was, they wouldn’t be able to rival a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator.","-Perhaps, after Ling Han had reached the Ultimate Dao Foundation, he could challenge the impossible.","Liu Xunyu smiled, shook her head and said, “Don’t worry, the three of us Cauldron Forging Tier elites won’t even participate.”","This made things easier. In the Foundation Building Tier, Ling Han was invincible.","However, Ling Han was pondering the hidden meaning of these words.","For hostages like them, freedom was an incomparable luxury, even if it was only a short day. However, the three Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators actually gave up such an opportunity? Why?","This meant that they should have other channels to leave Jia Yuan Manor.","Then, since this was an event hosted by hostages like them, what right did they have to obtain the right from the Clan Mansion to let the victor leave the manor?","Interesting.","Ling Han nodded, and said, “Alright, I’ll participate then.”","Liu Xunyu smiled beautifully, then suddenly paused, “Is there some kind of conflict between you and Tan Zhengjie?”","“No.” Ling Han pretended to be surprised, “I have always been very concerned about the relationship between myself and my teammates, so how could there possibly be any","conflict?”","“That’s good.” Liu Xunyu nodded, turned and left.","Ling Han stroked his chin as he watched her leave.","Liu Xunyu had suddenly asked him if there was any conflict between him and Tan Zhengjie, so it was obvious that she was already aware of the enmity between him and Tan Zhengjie. After all, Tan Zhengjie kept calling her Sister Liu, but Liu Xunyu did not expose him. Why was that?","Thinking about it, it should be related to his alchemy skills.","An alchemist who could concoct the Foundation Dissolution Pill, Ling Han’s future prospects were definitely boundless.","What Ling Han needed was only an opportunity. He would take the Foundation Dissolution Pill and walk around, and he would definitely be able to form a network, and soon be able to walk out of Jia Yuan Manor.","On the other side, the empress, Lin Luo, and the others had also arrived at the Moonlight Planet. They had communicated with Ling Han through the Galaxy Network, and informed Ling Han of where they had settled down.","They would think of a way to join some sects, and get themselves a “legal” identity. Theoretically speaking, they were all unregistered, and needed to use this to clear their name. Moreover, they couldn’t always rely on Ling Han to obtain cultivation resources. One had to know that they were all true overlords in the Genesis World, and which of them wasn’t extremely proud and arrogant?","Ling Han waited patiently. He concocted alchemical pills every day, concocting at least four cauldrons a day, and had already saved up a great many Foundation Dissolution Pills. Furthermore, the Foundation Dissolution Pills that he had sold through the Galaxy Network had also gained the approval of those ten customers. Thus, aside from the nickname of a money grubber, Ling Han also gained the title of a prodigy alchemist on the Galaxy Network, and this title was quite positive.","In the blink of an eye, seven days had passed.","The Dazzling Tournament was about to begin.","There were a total of 20 Foundation Building cultivators in the Jia Yuan Manor, and they were all participating in this competition.","This naturally was set on the battlefield, and a colourful ball was placed right in the centre. There were rules in the Dazzling Tournament. Firstly, one was not allowed to fly on a Spirit Tool, and was not allowed to leap over 30 meters in a single bound. Secondly, snatching the colourful ball did not mean that one had won, but rather had to be brought out of the battlefield. However, others could snatch it, and could even destroy the colourful ball. Once the colourful ball was destroyed, the tournament would be paused, and a new one would be substituted before starting again.","In principle, deliberate injury was not allowed, but since this was a contest, there would definitely be a fierce clash, and it was inevitable that they would suffer some injuries.","Ling Han swept an eye over, and saw that Tan Zhengjie was presently looking at him coldly, killing intent seeping from him.","He, looks like this person had not learnt his lesson, and still wanted to cause trouble. Whatever. Worse come to worst, he would just give him a beating.","Liu Xunyu, Han Bing and Zhao Xiao had also come. The three of them had also taken on the role of referees, and were standing at three corners of the battlefield respectively.","“Begin.” Liu Xunyu waved her hand.","Instantly, everyone rushed towards the centre of the battlefield. There was presently a","colourful ball of bright red there.","Ling Han’s speed was the fastest. He had no time to dawdle. Shua, shua, shua! His feet flew,","and he was the first to arrive at the side of the colourful ball. Then, he crouched down, and was","just about to pick up the colourful ball.","Yi?","He shockingly discovered that the colorful ball seemed to have been rooted into the ground. If","he forcefully pulled it up, this ball would definitely explode.","This was made from very ordinary materials, so how could it withstand the power of a","Foundation Building cultivator?"]},{"number":3754,"title":"Chapter 3754: Armor Penetration","paragraphs":["Chapter 3754: Armor Penetration","Formation technique.","Ling Han came to his senses at the first instant. This colorful ball was protected by a formation. If he were to use brute force to retrieve it, the only result would be that the colorful ball would explode. That would be equivalent to having fought for nothing.","He swept an eye over it, and saw that there were a few veined patterns glowing underneath the colourful ball. Instantly, multiple corresponding formation patterns appeared in his mind.","This was a very simple formation. Even if it wasn’t a Formation Master, he could still easily break through it, because there were too many loopholes left behind.","In truth, it was meant for others to break through the formation, and its purpose was only to drag out the time, so that others could catch up to them and launch an attack.","However, to Ling Han, this formation was too simple.","It should be known that he had already crossed the threshold of Formation Master level, and could even set up formations with steps, so how long would it take to resolve this kind of practically child’s play formation?","He only stretched out a hand to touch it, and the light of the formation dimmed. The weak aura of heaven and earth was changed by him.","Ling Han grabbed out at the air again. Xiu, the colorful ball flew up by itself, and fell into his hand.","This action took a long time to describe, but it actually happened in an instant. Merely less than a millisecond had passed.","If Ling Han was willing, he could completely charge back, and it was guaranteed that no one would be able to stop him.","However, on second thought, since Tan Zhengjie was unwilling to learn his lesson, he would teach him a lesson today.","“Yi?”","Liu Xunyu and the other two Cauldron Forging Tier elites all exclaimed in surprise. Being able to unravel the formation on the colorful ball was really too easy. Anyone could do it, but to undo the formation with a single wave of their hand, wasn’t that a little too easy?","Unless... Ling Han was a Formation Master!","How was this possible?","Wasn’t this guy a prodigy alchemist? Who would be freakish enough to be skilled in both formations and alchemy?","Right at this moment, Tan Zhengjie and the others had already charged over.","Ling Han’s left hand gripped the colorful ball, and he placed it behind his back. He faced 19 aggressive opponents all by himself.","Tan Zheng Jie showed a hint of ruthlessness. In his plan, he would ask his other nine companions to join forces with him, and gang up on Ling Han together. However, if Ling Han didn’t get the colourful ball, it would be too obvious if the ten of them went to fight a person that didn’t have a colourful ball.","Now, everything was fine. Ling Han had obtained the colourful ball, so even if they ganged up on him, it was reasonable. The only difference was that the previous ganging up on him was for the sake of snatching the colourful ball, but now? They were naturally targeting Ling Han himself.","“Charge!” Tan Zhengjie roared loudly, and was the first to charge over.","Ling Han shook his head and said, “You still haven’t learnt your lesson. How stupid.” Xiu, xiu, xiu! The others also attacked one after another, all of them aiming for Ling Han. Ling Han was completely unafraid. He had a considerable number of ways to insta-kill these nineteen people in an instant, but after some thought, he activated the Starlight Screen, and then began his counterattack against Tan Zhengjie.","He suppressed his power for a while, and showed that he was just barely able to suppress Tan Zhengjie.","Peng, peng, peng! Over a dozen attacks landed on the Starlight Screen, yet they were completely unable to penetrate the Starlight Screen. Meanwhile, Ling Han’s counterattack was something that Tan Zhengjie couldn’t withstand. He continued to retreat continuously, appearing to be in an extremely sorry state.","Tan Zhengjie felt extremely vexed. Why was he only targeting him?","He just barely managed to parry, but he was completely unable to withstand Ling Han’s attacks. One punch after another landed on his body, causing him to feel extreme pain.","“Interesting,” Zhao Xiao said calmly. There was a sliver of a strange light in his eyes. Was the Secret technique released by Ling Han a cultivation technique or a rare treasure?","If it was a rare treasure, what level would it be?","If it was a One Star Celestial Tool, he naturally would not take it to heart. It was no longer suitable for him, but if it was a Two Star Celestial Tool or even a higher level Celestial Tool, his heart would naturally throb wildly.","And if it was a cultivation technique... then he would use all means necessary to obtain it. The strength of one’s own body surpassed the strength of external objects.","For example, in the ranking battles of the Galaxy Network, no treasure could be relied on. Even if he had an Imperial Weapon, it was useless.","“Hehe.” Han Bing also smiled. His thoughts were more or less the same as Zhao Xiao’s. Even Liu Xunyu was very surprised. She only knew that Ling Han was an alchemy prodigy, and could concoct Foundation Dissolution Pills. Furthermore, he was not weak in martial arts either, and could even suppress Tan Zhengjie. However, when she saw Ling Han’s Starlight Screen, she was still extremely shocked. This guy seemed to have mastered an incredibly awesome cultivation technique.","She sneered internally. Since he had entered into Jia Yuan Manor, it was equivalent to falling into her hands, and there was no way he could escape.","Peng, peng, peng! The attacks transformed into brilliant light that continued to strike the Starlight Screen. However, even though the Starlight Screen was on the verge of collapse, it didn’t shatter at all. One couldn’t help but sigh at the tenacity of its vitality.","This rendered the people who were ganging up on him speechless. They only felt that Ling Han was like a turtle shell. No matter how many of them there were, and how explosive their attacks were, they were completely helpless.","Tan Zhengjie was even more miserable. Others could only feel depressed because they were unable to blast through Ling Han’s defenses, but he was constantly being beaten by Ling Han. Every punch and palm strike landed on his flesh, and the pain was agonizing.","Finally, he could no longer bear it, and turned to flee.","He was done fighting, all right?","He wanted to flee?","Ling Han, on the other hand, chuckled. He shot forwards like an arrow, and gave Tan Zhengjie a violent beating. Though he had only used his right hand, the speed at which he delivered his punches was even faster than the speed at which most people swung their fists continuously. Every punch landed heavily on Tan Zhengjie’s body. Pieces of cloth flew in the air, and Tan Zhengjie’s clothes were forcefully torn apart by Ling Han.","“This is called... Armor Penetration!” Ling Han said with a smile.","Armor Penetration?","When everyone heard this, they all had strange expressions.","Armor Penetration, shouldn’t be something that could break through one’s opponent’s defenses, such as armor, Battle Armor, and other defensive items. You shattered his clothes, and this was called Armor Penetration as well?","“Ah-“Tan Zhengjie released a terrible scream of shame. He had actually been beaten naked by Ling Han in public. What kind of humiliation was this?","“Tsk, tsk, tsk!” Someone’s eyes swept over his crotch, and couldn’t help but look surprised.","This was a colossal creature.","Ling Han also felt that it was a little blinding, so he raised a foot. Peng, his foot landed on Tan Zhengjie’s behind, kicking the latter out of the battlefield.","He turned around and looked at the others. “Who was the one who hit me the hardest just","now?” Everyone was astounded. This guy withstood their firepower, and forcibly beat Tan Zhengjie to the point of tearing his clothes apart and leaving the arena in shame, and now he had his","eyes on them... who could bear that?","This was a monster.","Ling Han’s eyes swept over them, and all of them revealed expressions of fear. If they were targeted by Ling Han, they would be in deep trouble.","You b@stard, you’ve already gotten the colourful ball, so why aren’t you leaving quickly?","“You!” Ling Han pointed at a person.","“No, no, no, it wasn’t me.” That person’s face turned green with fear, and he hurriedly turned around and fled.","I won’t fight anymore, all right?","You are deluding yourself! Ling Han caught up to him with a single step and gave him a good beating.","After he had had his fun, he turned to look at the others, and instantly, those people had all","turned pale with fear.","‘You’re f*cking invincible, and your skin is as thick as can be. How am I supposed to fight","you?’","Without another word, they all turned around and fled.","Ling Han caught up with one of them, grabbed hold of one, and thrashed them, but the others","had all fled.","Hehe, you guys are too naive.","With a pa, Ling Han crushed the colourful ball.","According to the rules, the tournament had to be restarted.","F***, everyone was about to break down."]},{"number":3755,"title":"Chapter 3755: One day of freedom","paragraphs":["Chapter 3755: One day of freedom","At this moment, everyone’s hearts were about to collapse.","You are too f****** ruthless, aren’t you?","Hadn’t thrashed them enough, so he deliberately tore the colourful ball and started again?","F***, this was really not just a bit black-hearted.","However, the rules were the rules. If the colorful ball exploded, this round would be equivalent to having been for nothing. They would have to start again.","Everyone looked as if they had eaten dead children, their expressions ugly to the extreme.","Even Liu Xunyu and the others bore strange expressions. The victor himself had crushed the colourful ball. It was only today that such a strange event had happened.","‘Fine, let’s start again.’","The Dazzling Tournament began again, but not one person walked into the battlefield.","Who wanted to be beaten? Were they stupid?","Ling Han crossed his arms behind his back, and slowly walked forwards. His appearance was extremely aggravating. He was basically mocking all of them.","But no matter how much they hated him, so what? Which of them could match Ling Han? “Sigh, it’s really lonely to be invincible.” Ling Han shook his head, walked into the middle of the battlefield, and picked up the colourful ball. Then, he slowly walked back.","Everyone was furious, especially Tan Zhengjie. This time, he had been beaten harshly. The old grudge had been added onto the new grudge.","One step, two steps, though Ling Han was walking slowly, the battlefield was only so big. After a few minutes, he still walked out.","The victor was Ling Han.","This result was the same as the last time, but if this happened again, everyone would grit their teeth in hatred, wanting to swallow Ling Han whole and skin him alive.","“Congratulations, Ling Han, for winning this competition,” Liu Xunyu said with a smile. There was a meaningful look in her eyes as she looked at Ling Han.","Ling Han smiled at the people around him, “Thank you for your generosity.”","Being generous your sister. If I could beat you, I would definitely skin you alive.","Everyone was already in a bad mood in the first place, and when they saw Ling Han mocking them, they were all furious. They felt like how could there be such a toxic person in this world?","Ling Han turned around and asked Liu Xunyu, “Captain, when can I go out?”","“Tomorrow.”","Ling Han nodded, and strode off.","“Hehe, this person seems to be a bit of a troublemaker.” Zhao Xiao walked over, and looked at Ling Han’s receding back.","“Very unruly,” Han Bing said as well.","Liu Xunyu showed a smile filled with confidence, “I will make him do as I say!”","When these words fell, Zhao Xiao and Han Bing revealed jealous expressions at the same time, their expressions extremely strange.","Zhao Xiao couldn’t help but say, “Xunyu, that’s merely a Foundation Building Tier cultivator. Give him a little lesson, and he’ll listen obediently.”","“That’s right. To be more realistic, this place is a prison. As long as no one is killed, who would care about a hostage from another country?” Han Bing nodded as well. “Let me deal with him first.”","Liu Xunyu shook her head, “Nothing good comes out of forceful persuasion. That guy is an alchemy prodigy, so he must be arrogant and domineering. If we coerce him, his heart must be resistant, so how could he possibly do things seriously?”","“But!” Han Bing still wanted to persuade her further.","“I know what I’m doing,” Liu Xunyu said calmly.","Han Bing and Zhao Xiao did not speak further, but there was a hint of hatred in their","expressions. It was unknown what they had to hate Ling Han for.","This night, Ling Han was slightly excited. Although he had only entered Jia Yuan Manor for a few days, this was prison, so he naturally felt a sense of repression.","The night passed, and after Ling Han finished cultivating, he immediately walked towards the main doors.","This time, the guard did not stop him. Instead, he said, “You must return before midnight. Otherwise, we will report this to the Clan Mansion, and place you on the wanted list as a fugitive.”","Ling Han nodded. This was the rules, and he had no intention of arguing with such a minor character. He strode out of Jia Yuan Manor.","He was still under the same sky, but after walking out of the high walls, Ling Han’s mood suddenly relaxed.","Time was short, and Ling Han had a clear goal. He did not reunite with the empress and the others, but rather headed directly to the Saint Pill Hall.","This was the Moonlight Planet’s Holy Land of alchemy, which gathered the highest level alchemists of the entire planet. Meanwhile, the senior elder of the Saint Pill Hall also had an official rank bestowed on him by the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. He was a dignified first rank duke, and this was the highest official rank that non-royalty could obtain. Naturally, this boosted the status of the Saint Pill Hall to an extremely high level.","Because this Three Herbs Elder was an Earth Tier High Grade alchemist, even Sect Master- level great elites had to ask him to concoct alchemical pills for them, so his status was","naturally revered.","In the city, movement techniques naturally couldn’t be used, and flying on a tool was even more impossible. This would be seen as great disrespect, so Ling Han walked on foot. In any case, his speed was also very fast.","Twenty minutes later, he arrived at the Saint Pill Hall.","This was a glorious group of buildings, occupying an extremely large area. There were multiple towers standing tall, some silver, and some gold.","Ling Han found out from the Galaxy Network that the silver tower was where Human Tier alchemists lived, and the golden tower was where Earth Tier alchemists lived. Whether it was martial arts, alchemy, formations, or so on, the hierarchy was strict.","He strode into the Saint Pill Hall. After entering, there was a large hall, and there was a large volume of alchemical pills for sale.","The shop assistants here were all very proud. Though Ling Han was looking around, not one of them asked him if he needed alchemical pills for certain areas, looking like it was up to him whether he wanted to buy them or not.","Ling Han had no intention of communicating with the staff either. He directly passed through the lobby, planning to enter the area further inside.","“Unauthorized personnel are not allowed.” Immediately, someone stepped out to stop him.","Ling Han smiled, “I want to be certified as an alchemist.”","“You?” That person looked at Ling Han in surprise, because Ling Han was too young. He looked to be in his early twenties; how could there be such a young alchemist? However, the alchemist certification was open to all. As long as you prepared your own ingredients, the Saint Pill Hall would provide an alchemy chamber.","“All right, come with me.” That person led Ling Han towards the back, “Don’t look around. There are a great many alchemists here, and they very much dislike being stared at. That","would be very rude,” he reminded.","Ling Han nodded in understanding.","They arrived at a very large room. There were a great many people inside, and they were all","staring at a wall.","This was a projection wall, and there was an alchemist presently concocting alchemical pills. Ling Han could confirm with a single glance that this cauldron of alchemical pills was about to be successfully concocted.","The person who had led Ling Han in hurriedly ran to the front, muttering to someone. After a while, he returned, and said, “Just wait here. Someone will arrange for you to be certified.”","“All right.”","Ling Han sat down and closed his eyes to rest. He was completely uninterested in the alchemy","process that was underway.","“Tsk, what are you acting for? You’ve already come all the way here, and you’re actually still resting with your eyes closed!” someone sneered.","Ling Han was astonished. ‘Am I bothering you by closing my eyes to rest?’","“That’s right. Our Saint Pill Hall’s number one prodigy, Luo Jun, is trying to break through to become an alchemist today, and has deliberately invited everyone to come and observe, and you are actually not taking it seriously?” Another person said to Ling Han, his tone slightly","stern.","Luo Jun was only 29 years old this year, but he was talented and intelligent. In 15 years, he had advanced from an Elementary Level alchemy apprentice to a High Level alchemy apprentice, and now, he was even breaking through to become a Human Tier Low Grade Alchemist. This natural talent was practically astonishing.","And now, Luo Jun was willing to let everyone observe his alchemy techniques, and you","actually closed your eyes to rest?","Was he showing off or deliberately mocking them?"]},{"number":3756,"title":"Chapter 3756: Prized Son of the Tang Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3756: Prized Son of the Tang Clan","Hehe, he had just closed his eyes and rested for a while, and the issue had actually risen to such a height?","Ling Han shook his head, and couldn’t be bothered to pay attention to these people.","However, even if he didn’t drop down to the same level as these people, these people wouldn’t give up. Moreover, the news spread like wildfire, and many people knew that there was someone here who actually didn’t take Luo Jun seriously and closed his eyes to rest while he was being certified as an alchemist.","-Since you have come here, and you are not properly watching others concoct alchemical pills, wasn’t that a deliberate mockery?","“Who is this person?”","“I don’t know him.”","“Perhaps it’s some newly promoted apprentice that still doesn’t know Luo Jun’s name, right?”","“En, that must be the case.”","Everyone nodded one after another, certain that Ling Han must be some rookie that had just advanced into the threshold of alchemy, and did not even recognize an incredibly dazzling new star like Luo Jun.","Ling Han acted as if he had not heard anything. Did he need to take the words of others to heart?","Moreover, once he began concocting alchemical pills later, he would be able to slap their faces with reality.","“It’s done!”","“Luo Jun has formed his alchemical pill.”","“Heavens, a twenty-nine-year-old Human Tier Low Grade alchemist, this is a new record!”","“En, previously, the youngest alchemist on the Moonlight Planet was 31 years old. This time, not only has he broken a new record, he has also pushed the limit of the youngest alchemist to the level of twenties in age.”","“As expected of Luo Jun. He will definitely have boundless future prospects.”","Everyone exclaimed in shock, all of them incredibly excited, as if they were the ones who were concocting alchemical pills inside.","At this moment, the alchemy chamber opened, and a young man walked out. It was Luo Jun, who had just been concocting alchemical pills.","“Congratulations, Alchemist Luo!”","“Congratulations!”","“He’ll definitely become a Grandmaster in the future.”","There was a round of congratulations, and everyone squeezed in. At this time, they naturally had to show themselves. If Luo Jun remembered them, they may be able to worm their way into being friends with this prodigy alchemist.","“Haha, Brother Luo, congratulations!” There was a long bout of laughter, and a man strode in. He was striding and leaping like a dragon, exuding an astonishing aura.","“Hiss, Little Marquis Tang Yan!”","“He’s the son of the Tang Clan, a prodigy of martial arts. When he was born, he attracted the senses of heaven and earth. He’s an Innate Divine Physique!”","“The Tang Clan is a force on the level of Spirit Transformation True Lord. Furthermore, they are deeply favoured by His Majesty. Tang Yan has been conferred the title of Marquis since birth. Though it is because he has an Innate Divine Physique, it is also because the Tang Clan is presently flourishing in imperial favour.”","Everyone exclaimed in shock. This young man that was walking over was really too extraordinary.","A thought flashed in Ling Han’s head. The prodigy of the Tang Clan?","He also walked up. Of course, he was not heading for Tang Yan. He was going to immediately begin the verification of alchemist.","“Yi, who is this brat?”","“What are you squeezing in for?”","Some people still didn’t recognize Ling Han, and when they saw him force his way forwards, they were all very displeased.","Ling Han squeezed forward. Most of the people here were Foundation Building cultivators, so who could stop him?","“Can I begin?” he asked.","There were three Human Tier alchemists in charge of witnessing here, and they naturally knew that there was another person who wanted to be certified as an alchemist. The","expressions on their faces were all not very pleased.","F***, they had just stared fixedly for an alchemist verification for three hours, and he still wanted them to continue?","However, for such a young guy, it was very likely that his cauldron would soon explode and fail.","“All right, begin.” One of them nodded.","“What pill will you concoct?” another person asked.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Foundation Dissolution Pill.”","Instantly, the surroundings fell silent, and then raucous laughter arose.","Hahaha, this was really too funny. An alchemist that had not even advanced into the Human Tier actually said that he wanted to concoct the Foundation Dissolution Pill?","Where did he get such courage from?","Tang Yan and Luo Jun had already walked some distance away, so they did not hear Ling Han’s words. They only discovered the laughter of the masses, which made Tang Yan appear slightly curious. He asked, “What’s going on?”","“Oh, there’s an idiot here to verify that he’s a Human Tier Low Grade alchemist. He actually said he wanted to concoct the Foundation Dissolution Pill,” the alchemy apprentice beside","him replied with a smile.","Luo","instantly snickered. This was the Foundation Dissolution Pill. Even he didn’t dare to think about it, because prodigies who could concoct the Foundation Dissolution Pill could","possibly become Heaven Tier alchemists.","“Just grandstanding. Brother Tang, let’s go,” Luo Jun said.","Yet Tang Yan’s interest was piqued, “There is no harm in taking a look.”","Since he had already said so, Luo Jun naturally could not say anything else.","Though he was a prodigy alchemist, the extent of his prodigy talent was completely incomparable to Tang Yan’s background. Thus, in their interactions, he was naturally in a","disadvantageous position, and needed to submit to Tang Yan’s will.","Meanwhile, the alchemy apprentice beside him continued to add fuel to the fire as he recounted how Ling Han had purposefully closed his eyes to rest just then. He had","deliberately drawn animosity toward Ling Han.","Luo Jun’s expression was dark, but he said calmly, “Everyone has their own freedom. No one","begs him to watch.”","Tang Yan laughed loudly, “This guy seems to have quite a personality.”","Luo Jun had not thought that Tang Yan would make such a comment about Ling Han. He","faltered for a moment, then answered sheepishly, “Yes, that’s right.”","There was a ball of fire burning in his heart, and he wanted nothing more than to drag Ling","Han out and give him a good beating.","Who was he?","The prodigy alchemist Luo Jun, the person who had created the record for the youngest alchemist on Moonlight Planet. You, a nameless nobody, actually dare to be so","condescending!","On the other side, Ling Han also began to concoct alchemical pills.","There was a ready-made formation and alchemy cauldron here, which saved Ling Han some","trouble. He stimulated the formation, then with a wave of his hands, medicinal ingredients","were thrown into the alchemy cauldron.","Boom! The power of heaven and earth surged over.","For Ling Han, he had been concocting Foundation Dissolution Pills all these days, so he","couldn’t be too proficient.","His movements were like flowing water, incredibly smooth.","Outside, everyone had initially wanted to watch a joke, but as they watched, they were","dumbfounded.","F***, so smooth?","Are you really here to be certified as an alchemist? Are you sure that you are not a veteran alchemist that has long since crossed over into this threshold?","But looking at Ling Han’s expression, everyone shook their heads. He was so young, and was definitely even younger than Luo Jun. How could he possibly be an experienced alchemist? Everyone couldn’t help but turn to look at Luo Jun. This person had just created the record for the youngest alchemist on Moonlight Planet. How could it be that it would be broken in the blink of an eye?","If such a thing really happened, then Luo Jun would become a joke. In future, he would also become nothing more than a background for another, and it might be that this story would be passed down through the ages.","This was the shortest-lived record holder in history, and it was a humiliating sight.","Luo Jun’s expression was extremely ugly. If Ling Han had really succeeded, to say nothing else, just the fact that he had concocted the Foundation Dissolution Pill alone was enough to insta-kill him into dust.","Foundation Dissolution Pill, it was a sure bet that he could become an Earth Tier High Grade","alchemist. Throughout history, there has never been an exception, and there was even a portion of them that became Heaven Tier alchemists, who would be known for generations. Meanwhile, Tang Yan looked expectant. If Ling Han could really concoct the Foundation Dissolution Pill, he was very willing to become friends with Ling Han.","He did not know how to concoct alchemical pills, but looking at Ling Han’s proficient handiwork, he was naturally filled with confidence in Ling Han. This person... may really","succeed.","An hour passed, and Ling Han was still refining in an orderly manner.","Two hours later, the situation was still the same.","Everyone could no longer sit still. This was really the rhythm of an alchemical pill being","completed.","F***, they had still been mocking Ling Han just now, but now that they had turned around, were they about to be slapped in the face?"]},{"number":3757,"title":"Chapter 3757: Goodwill from everyone","paragraphs":["Chapter 3757: Goodwill from everyone","“Can he really succeed?” someone mumbled.","“If he really succeeds, this guy will become the youngest alchemist in history.”","“Uh, Luo Jun hasn’t even warmed up this position, and he’s already giving it up?”","“Where did such a monster come from? I don’t believe that such a prodigy would appear out of thin air.”","Everyone was about to go crazy. Though there was a large number of alchemy disciples in the Saint Pill Hall, there were only a few hundred alchemists. It was clear how difficult it was to become an alchemist. Thus, every alchemy disciple that had hopes of advancing to become an alchemist was well-known, and their names could be counted on the fingers of one’s hand. There were just a few of them.","Now, however, a completely unfamiliar guy had suddenly appeared, and it just so happened that he was overwhelmingly freakish. From the very beginning, he was concocting a Foundation Dissolution Pill, showing the potential of becoming a Heaven Tier alchemist. Tang Yan’s interest was piqued even further. He was the son of the Tang Clan, and it was destined that he would inherit the position of clan leader of the Tang Clan in the future. Thus, he had long since placed himself in the shoes of the future clan leader of the Tang Clan, Ling Han. In his eyes, Ling Han was a rare commodity.","He didn’t understand alchemy, but he wasn’t deaf, so he could naturally hear the words of others. He knew what concocting the Foundation Dissolution Pill meant.","If the Tang Clan could be on good terms with an Earth Tier High Grade alchemist, or even a Heaven Tier alchemist, they would naturally be even steadier and stronger.","The reason why he wanted to be on good terms with Luo Jun was naturally because of this.","Time continued to pass, and Ling Han was still stabilizing the situation. There was no sign of the furnace exploding at all.","Luo Jun’s expression was livid. He had a premonition that Ling Han would really succeed. He was filled with hatred.","For a prodigy like you, which planet couldn’t you go to? No matter where you went, you would be able to become a prodigy, an incredibly dazzling star, yet he just had to come his, causing his glory to go from brightness to dimness. In fact, he was about to become a joke.","Why? Why? Why?","He clenched his fists tightly. If he could, he would definitely charge into the alchemy chamber and kill Ling Han.","Three hours were about to pass, and Ling Han suddenly stretched out a hand to grab at empty air. Instantly, eight alchemical pills floated into the air. He immediately injected the power of the Celestial Foundation into them, and then fused them in. This was the final step of concocting the Foundation Dissolution Pill.","For others, this was a difficulty in concocting the Foundation Dissolution Pill, but for Ling Han, this was a piece of cake, easily completed.","“The pill is completed!”","“The cauldron didn’t explode, it really succeeded.”","“Foundation Dissolution Pill!”","“A prodigy, a supreme prodigy!”","Everyone exclaimed in shock, as if they had seen a ghost.","In truth, that was indeed the case. In the history of the Moonlight Planet, there had really never appeared one that could concoct the Foundation Dissolution Pill – by the time some alchemist had the ability to concoct it, he would have already surpassed the Foundation Building Tier in terms of cultivation level. Without the power of the Foundation Building Tier, how could he concoct the Foundation Dissolution Pill?","This was unprecedented, and was extremely awesome!","When Ling Han came out, a dead silence fell. Everyone looked at him with a sliver of admiration.","No one was an idiot. Though Ling Han and Luo Jun had both become alchemists for the first time, and had broken the record for the youngest alchemist, the comparison was very clear. Ling Han was younger than Luo Jun, and Ling Han had concocted the Foundation Dissolution Pill, and could at least become an Earth Tier High Grade alchemist in the future.","Who else would dare to offend Ling Han?","“Congratulations!”","“A super genius, he’s too young!”","“There’s a chance he’ll become a Heaven Tier alchemist in the future.”","Everyone praised him one after another, daring to say such disgusting words. They had completely forgotten how they had previously mocked Ling Han.","“Congratulations,” an alchemist clasped his hands and said in congratulations to Ling Han. “I still don’t know your name.”","“Ling Han.”","The alchemist nodded, then asked, “And where did Alchemist Ling come from?”","“Jia Yuan Manor.” Ling Han smiled faintly.","Yi?","Everyone was stunned upon hearing this.","No wonder they ad never heard of Ling Han before. It was clear that his natural talent in alchemy was absolutely terrifying, but they had never heard of him and that was because Ling Han was a hostage of Jia Yuan Manor.","Yet Luo Jun’s eyes lit up. Immediately, he walked forwards, and exclaimed harshly, “How dare you. You are clearly a hostage, yet actually dare to come out without permission. This is practically treason!”","This was a very big crime. If Ling Han was really implicated, then not only would Ling Han not be able to become an alchemist, he would not be able to become an Alchemy Grandmaster in future, and would even be executed.","Ling Han glanced at this person. Was there any need to be so resentful? His limelight had been stolen, so what need was there for him to be so resentful?","How petty, how intolerant.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Don’t rush to pin the blame on others. Firstly, I am an envoy from the Dark North Nation, yet you keep saying that I am a hostage. Are you stoking the flames of anger in the relations between the two Majestic Empires? Hehe, in my opinion, you are the one who has committed treason, and should be punished for such motives.”","Speaking of bickering, who had he ever been afraid of?","These words caused Luo Jun to be stupefied. That was because the words ‘political hostage’ was spoken in private. On the surface, the people of the Political Hostage Manor were all envoys from various nations. Furthermore, they were not called Political Hostage Manor, but rather Jia Yuan Manor, in all seriousness.","He had only spoken in a moment of carelessness. Who asked this matter to be too ridiculous? A hostage was actually an alchemy prodigy?","“Secondly, I didn’t run out on my own volition. Instead, I walked out in broad daylight. What is it? I’m not a prisoner, so can’t I come out for a stroll or something?” Ling Han said slowly. He did not weaken his aura at all. I am here as envoy, and my status is even higher than yours. “You’re spouting nonsense!” Luo Jun came back to his senses and immediately rebuked. He didn’t believe that anyone could come out of the Political Hostage Manor. Who didn’t know that it was a prison?","“Hehe, Grandmaster Ling, was is it?” Tang Yan walked over, and with a casual push, Luo Jun","was pushed aside.","He was at Cauldron Forging Tier, so how could Luo Jun, a Foundation Building cultivator,","possibly rival him?","The reason why Ling Han had begun to verify his status as an alchemist so quickly was naturally so that he could attract Tang Yan’s attention.","He smiled, “I dare not be called Grandmaster. You can just call me Ling Han.”","“My name is Tang Yan, and you can also directly call me by my name.” Tang Yan appeared very amiable, but if these words were heard by his friends, their eyeballs would definitely pop","out of their sockets.","Who did not know that Tang Yan was proud and arrogant? It was difficult to befriend him, and it was even more difficult to become a friend that could gain his approval.","Yet now, Tang Yan actually had Ling Han address him directly by name. This was the kind of treatment that only his closest friends would receive.","How could it not be frightening?","But in Tang Yan’s eyes, this was a very natural thing to do.","That was because Ling Han’s lowest accomplishment would be Earth Tier High Grade alchemist, at least. This was completely equivalent to elites of Sect Master-level, or even slightly superior to that. That was because there were really too few alchemists at this level. There was only one such alchemist on Moonlight Planet. All the Sect Master-level elites would have to ask Three Herbs Elder for help when they needed him to concoct alchemical pills for them.","If the Tang Clan could make such a friend, the significance would naturally be extraordinary. Furthermore, Earth Tier High Grade alchemist was Ling Han’s lowest accomplishment. If he could take another step further, and become a Heaven Tier alchemist, then no matter where he was in the universe, Ling Han would still be greatly respected.","So, how could Tang Yan not be polite?"]},{"number":3758,"title":"Chapter 3758: Discovered","paragraphs":["Chapter 3758: Discovered","Ling Han smiled faintly, “No problem.”","“You really are from the Jia Yuan Manor?” Tang Yan was still in slight disbelief. What force would be so willing to hand over an alchemy prodigy as hostage?","It should be known that a genius that could concoct the Foundation Dissolution Pill would at least be able to become an Earth Tier High Grade alchemist in the future, and what kind of concept was this kind of existence?","Even a Sect Master great elite had to treat him as an esteemed guest!","This was truly strange, and completely baffling.","Indeed, if Ling Han was really just an ordinary alchemist, then he would definitely be protected by Chen Fengyan at all costs. Even if he had to hand over his own son as a hostage, he could not possibly hand Ling Han over.","An alchemist with boundless future prospects had too great an influence on a force.","However, who told Ling Han to have such a powerful identity? He was Chen Fengyan’s uncle. If he said he wanted to come here, would Chen Fengyan dare to stop him? Wouldn’t he be afraid that Brother Monkey would come back and beat him to the point of doubting life?","Ling Han nodded, “That’s right. I only arrived about ten days ago.”","“Which planet did you come from?”","“Celestial Sea Planet.”","“Oh.” Tang Yan nodded. As it turned out, it was that declining planet. The natives had just stepped onto the path of cultivation. If it was not for the fact that the criminals that were originally imprisoned had all escaped, this planet would still be in a state of confusion about cultivation.","He thought for a moment, then said solemnly, “Don’t worry, I will definitely have you brought out of Jia Yuan Manor as soon as possible.”","What Ling Han wanted was precisely these words from him. He did not deliberately try to be polite, but rather nodded, “Thank you.”","The two of them exchanged a smile, and there was a kind of tacit understanding between them.","Tang Yan immediately said what Ling Han wanted, and Ling Han didn’t pretend to be polite either. Although thanking him was simple, how could it be that Tang Yan wanted to listen to Ling Han’s tirade?","What he wanted was Ling Han’s favor. While Ling Han was still only a Human Tier Low Grade alchemist, he wanted to lay the foundations of their friendship, especially when Ling Han was presently in dire straits. If he lent him a helping hand now, the significance would naturally be different.","-The significance of sending coal in the snow and adding icing on the cake were completely different.","A rookie alchemist had concocted the Foundation Dissolution Pill. This naturally alerted the entire Saint Pill Hall. No matter what level of alchemist it was, as long as he was in the Saint Pill Hall, they all came out upon hearing the news, and congratulated Ling Han.","Though Ling Han was presently only a Human Tier Low Grade alchemist, Ling Han’s future prospects were too bright, and they had no choice but to swallow their pride.","Ling Han didn’t put on airs. Firstly, he wasn’t that kind of person, and secondly, he only had high potential. However, there were many people in this world with high potential who died early. Thus, it was best to keep a low profile, because there would always be those who were short-sighted. Even if they didn’t have any enmity with him, he would still step on others out of jealousy.","Thus, before he had powerful strength, he had to keep a low profile.","Conversely, Ling Han had concocted the Foundation Dissolution Pill right off the bat. In fact, this was already extremely high-profile. If it weren’t for the fact that it concerned his freedom, he actually didn’t want to expose it. Wouldn’t it be better to silently make a fortune?","In this manner, Ling Han only managed to deal with all of them by night. And this was still because Tang Yan was speaking up for him from the sidelines. Otherwise, he would probably be busy until late at night.","Ling Han made an agreement with Tang Yan. After a few days, Tang Yan would go to Jia Yuan Manor to visit him.","It was not that Ling Han was putting on airs, but rather that he only had one day of freedom. How was he supposed to meet Tang Yan?","“Heh, we’ll meet again some other day!” Tang Yan said with a chuckle. He was in an extremely good mood.","Ling Han nodded, “See you another day.”","He exited the Saint Pill Hall, and returned to Jia Yuan Manor. He had to return before midnight, or he would be considered as disobeying the laws of the nation.","As he walked, he suddenly saw someone staring at him from the corner of his eye. He didn’t take it to heart. After all, he was a rising star of alchemy, so it was normal for others to","recognize him.","However, that person’s behavior was a little strange. After glancing at Ling Han a few times, he suddenly turned around and ran. Very soon, there was no sign of him.","Yi?","Ling Han couldn’t help but mumble internally, ‘This reaction isn’t right.’","Forget about it. He would return to the Political Hostage Manor first.","After walking for a while, he entered into a small street. Because it was already late in the night, and because it was remote here, everyone closed the main doors, appearing to be extremely quiet. There was not a single person in sight.","Ling Han was naturally unafraid. He strode forwards, but after taking a few steps, he stopped.","Xiu, a figure rapidly pursued him from behind, leaping over his head, and landed in front of him, blocking his path.","Ling Han activated his Eye Technique, and with a single glance, he immediately understood the cultivation level of his opponent.","He was merely an Ultimate Dao Foundation.","“I’ve finally found you!” the person said balefully through gritted teeth.","Ling Han was surprised, “I killed your father?”","“My father is perfectly fine!” That person immediately rebuked.","“Then I have killed your son?” Ling Han asked again.","“I still haven’t had children yet!” That person had been led astray again.","Ling Han shook his head, “Since there is no hatred of killing a son or your father, I can’t understand why you look like you want nothing more than to skin me alive.”","“Humph, my surname is Pang!” That person declared harshly.","“Oh!” Ling Han finally understood.","Previously, when he had been concocting the Five Elements Karmic Pill, he had killed a great many members of the Pang Clan, and had even killed a Foundation Building cultivator of the","Pang Clan.","He broke into a grin, “That genius prodigy from your clan, yi, what was his name again, but after ingesting the Five Elements Karmic Pill, he advanced into Foundation Building Tier?”","It would have been fine if Ling Han hadn’t said this, but once he did, that person became even more furious.","The Pang Clan gad spared no expense and paid an astonishing price to gather the ingredients for the Five Elements Karmic Pill. In the end, after concocting it, Pang Yunfei ingested it. Not only did it not allow Pang Yunfei to advance further, it even caused a huge problem.","They looked for alchemists to study the dregs of the medicine, and finally found the source of","the problem.","-There was a material that was not up to standard in quality, and it was precisely the Water Element Crystal that they had forcefully obtained.","They were extremely depressed. In order to get a small advantage, they had bought the Water Element Crystal at an extremely low price, thinking that they had taken full advantage. Who would have thought that this would lead to disaster?","Now, the Pang Clan had paid a huge price, and Pang Yunfei’s body was in great trouble. Who","was he going to complain to?","If this person knew that the main culprit was the Ling Han in front of him, he would probably","want to eat him alive.","“Die!” That person moved aggressively, grabbing out at Ling Han.","Ling Han shook his head, and said with a smile, “Before you attacked, did you forget to","investigate my strength first?”","“You are only in the Foundation Building Tier,” the person said in disdain. Was there any need to investigate? He understood with a single glance.","Boom, his hand had already grabbed out, but in order not to alert others, he compressed his","power as much as possible, and practically did not seep out any sliver. Otherwise, the houses","here would all collapse in an instant.","Ling Han stretched out a hand, and grabbed out at the other’s wrist.","“You bit off more than you can chew!” That person smirked coldly, but his expression","changed drastically in an instant, because his wrist had really fallen obediently into Ling","Han’s hands.","He struggled for a moment, and felt as if his hand had been cast together with top grade","Divine Metal, and could not be pulled out at all.","How was this possible?","He was numb with shock, and felt an indescribable fear."]},{"number":3759,"title":"Chapter 3759: The funeral bells of the Pang Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3759: The funeral bells of the Pang Clan","“Do you regret it now?” Ling Han asked.","That person gritted his teeth, and did not answer.","He did indeed regret it. He had only thought that Ling Han had just entered the Foundation Building Tier and was an easy target to bully. After receiving the news, he had come alone. He had not thought that he would actually be no match for Ling Han.","“If I told you that I was the one who sold you the Water Element Crystals, would your eyeballs pop out?” Ling Han said with a smile.","That person was startled, and his first reaction was naturally that it was impossible. However, upon further thought, the fact that the Pang Clan had been screwed over had not been leaked out, and only a limited number of people knew about it. More importantly, only the higher- ups of the Pang Clan knew that the problem lay with the Water Element Crystal. He had only found out by chance because his grandfather was a Cauldron Forging Tier elite.","If Ling Han was not personally involved, how could he possibly know a secret that even the majority of the Pang Clan did not know?","“It’s you!” His eyes were spitting fire.","Originally, Pang Yunfei should have already leaped into the Foundation Building Tier by now. With his freakishness, Pang Yunfei would definitely be ranked in the top 100,000 of Galaxy Network in the future. On the Celestial Sea Planet, he would definitely be one of the top existences.","However, the Pang Clan’s hopes for the future were forcefully extinguished by Ling Han. “You’re despicable! You’re shameless!” he roared in fury.","Ling Han shook his head, “Before you insult others, reflect on whether you have such a position or not. What is it? Only you people are allowed to hunt me down, and I am not allowed to counter? Don’t worry, the Pang Clan will not exist for too long. I will personally destroy them!”","“You’re dreaming!” the person said with his head held high. Even though he couldn’t withstand a single blow, Ling Han was only a mere Foundation Building Tier cultivator. Just what kind of existence was the Pang Clan?","A clan with a Core Formation Tier grand elder.","“Come on, let’s see how you’ll die!” he provoked Ling Han.","“Don’t be anxious. This day won’t be too far away.” Ling Han stretched out a hand and placed","it on that person’s forehead. A massive mystical power immediately surged in, heading straight for his mind.","“What are you trying to do?” The person was shocked.","Ling Han ignored him completely, and merely shook the two Celestial Foundations in his body lightly. Pa, the effects were immediately apparent. Cracks appeared on that person’s Celestial Foundation, as if it had been in disrepair for too long.","‘What?’","That person’s expression was ashen. How was this possible? He had not released the Celestial Foundation at all, so how could it possibly collapse?","This must be an illusion!","However, this was not the case.","Ka, ka, ka! The cracks on the Human Dao Foundation became more and more severe, and finally, it could no longer hold on, turning into pieces. Immediately, it crumbled, turning back into the energy of heaven and earth and the mystical appreciation of martial arts. “No-” he screamed tragically. Once the Celestial Foundation was broken, he had directly fallen from the Foundation Building Tier to the mortal level. He had to leap over the Celestial Gate and build a Celestial Foundation again.","However, this wasn’t the end. Ling Han’s mystical power was still surging through his body, shattering his meridians, Mystery Realms, and apertures.","In this way, that person was a complete mortal, aside from having a slightly longer lifespan.","However, his cultivation level was completely gone, so his lifespan wouldn’t be much longer than ordinary people. Moreover, he had already lived for more than 200 years, so he could only live for another 10 years at most.","He was originally in his prime, but now, he had to count the days and wait for death. Furthermore, he was a cripple. How could he accept this in this moment?","He was in a daze, appearing extremely confused.","“Don’t worry. In your lifetime, the Pang Clan will definitely be destroyed,” Ling Han said.","Through these words, he expressed a strong confidence.","What force was the Pang Clan?","Core Formation Tier-level.","Thus, to destroy the Pang Clan, the cultivation level of Core Formation Tier would naturally be needed, and how many more years could the Pang Clan have left to live? More than ten","years.","In other words, Ling Han was confident that he could advance into the Core Formation Tier within ten years.","If others knew this, they would definitely say that he was too conceited. What Core Formation Tier cultivator hadn’t reached this level when they were several hundred years old? To complete such a leap in just over a dozen years, wasn’t that too conceited?","Ling Han patted that person’s shoulder, “Take care.”","After saying this, he leaped into the distance.","The person from the Pang Clan instantly collapsed onto the ground. His name was Pang Feiran, and in the Pang Clan, he could not be considered a prodigy, but being able to advance into Celestial Path was naturally already very impressive.","“Did you all see and hear that?” he asked, his voice carrying a sobbing tone.","Just now, he had activated the recording function of the connecting device. Everything he saw and heard would be simultaneously transmitted to the Pang Clan.","At first, this was to allow the members of the Pang Clan to witness the death of their enemy, but they had never imagined that things would actually develop in the opposite direction.","On the other side, the Pang Clan had naturally exploded long ago. Previously, they had taken the video, and allowed their own juniors to watch through the projection. They naturally had to participate in such a matter to vent their anger. Just when Pang Feiran was crippled, the Pang Clan had already gone to inform the Cauldron Forging Tiers and the only Core Formation Tier elite in the Clan, their Ancestor.","In a virtual space of the Galaxy Network, the members of the Pang Clan were all seated, their expressions cold, extremely furious.","“Who can tell me why that brat has such high battle prowess?” The Core Formation Tier grand elder of the Pang Clan slammed his hand on the table, so angry that even his beard was","trembling.","This brat had already caused the Pang Clan to lose two Foundation Building Tier cultivators. One was killed, and the other was crippled. If Pang Yunfei was taken into account as well,","there would be a total of three people.","How many Celestial Path elites did the Pang Clan have in total?","Everyone was speechless. Previously, Ling Han was only an Enlightenment Tier, but how much time had passed? Not only had he advanced into the Foundation Building Tier, he could even easily insta-kill an Ultimate Dao Foundation cultivator.","One of them revealed a focused expression, then opened his mouth and said, “I just received news that the despicable brat is a member of the Political Hostage Manor. His name is Ling Han, and he comes from the Celestial Sea Planet’s Dark North Nation. Previously, he even concocted the Foundation Dissolution Pill in the Saint Pill Hall, and became an alchemist there. He is greatly revered.”","“What!” Everyone exclaimed in shock.","This brat was actually an alchemist? No, no, no, was he an alchemist prodigy?","“So what if you are an alchemy prodigy? Since you are a great enemy of our Pang Clan, your only fate would be destruction,” the ancestor of the Pang Clan said balefully.","Everyone’s discussions stopped one after another, and they all nodded.","Ling Han had also made his stand clear. He wanted to destroy the Pang Clan. The two sides","were already in a situation where neither side would rest until the other was dead.","“We definitely can’t give this brat any more room to grow,” a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator from the Pang Clan said. His name was Pang Tong, and he was Pang Feiran’s grandfather. Thus, he was naturally even more resentful of Ling Han.","“That’s right.” Another white-haired elder nodded. “That despicable brat is ab alchemy prodigy. If he becomes an Earth Tier alchemist, then as long as he stands and raises a hand, there would definitely be a great many True Self Tier elites willing to work for him. At that time, our Pang Clan would really be in danger.”","“But our Pang Clan does not have any force in the Imperial Capital, so what can we do to","him?” One of them raised the most realistic question.","The Pang Clan was not even in the Imperial Capital.","“Go and ask the Tang Clan for help,” the ancestor of the Pang Clan suddenly said. “In the past,","the Tang Clan was once a member of the Pang Clan. When the Pang Clan declined, the Tang Clan’s ancestors traveled to the Imperial Capital. Although there hasn’t been much improvement, there are still elites at the Core Formation Tier. I’ll ask the Tang Clan for help and have them send elites to kill that despicable brat.”"]},{"number":3760,"title":"Chapter 3760: Revenge","paragraphs":["Chapter 3760: Revenge","The members of the Pang Clan all nodded, but their expressions were very solemn.","The Tang Clan owed the Pang Clan a favor, so as long as the Pang Clan spoke up, and that was only to deal with a Foundation Building cultivator, the Tang Clan would definitely be too embarrassed to say no.","However, favors would be decreased every time they were used. In the future, if they wanted to trouble the Tang Clan to do something for them, it would not be something that could be done with just a word.","“Detestable brat!” The elites of the Pang Clan said hatefully.","“Go and retrieve Feiran first.” The ancestor of the Pang Clan continued, “If the conditions permit, we will capture him alive. I have a premonition that there may be a colossal secret hidden on that brat. This time may be a turning point for our Pang Clan.”","Hearing these words, the members of the Pang Clan finally showed an expression of delight.","That’s right. Ling Han’s strength was a little inconceivable. This boy must be hiding an astonishing secret. If the Pang Clan could obtain it, the Pang Clan might be able to profit from","this misfortune.","“We definitely can’t let the Tang Clan know about Ling Han.”","“En, then ask them to capture him alive. Even if they can’t capture him alive, they have to get the corpse back.”","They all chattered among themselves, appearing to be very excited. However, they had forgotten one thing, and that was Ling Han himself was in the Jia Yuan Manor. Even if it was the Tang Clan, would they dare charge into the Jia Yuan Manor to commit murder and","kidnapping?","This was practically a great humiliation to the Majestic Empire of the Meng Clan. Just thinking about it, the Tang Clan would not dare to do such a thing.","They were only repaying a favor, so how could they be willing to involve their clan in this matter?","...","Ling Han returned to Jia Yuan Manor. At this time, there was still some time until midnight. He stood at the door for a while before stepping into the manor.","Though Tang Yan had promised that he would soon get him out of here, that was a matter for the future, after all.","Ling Han returned to his quarters. He had not even gone to rest, when he heard a servant report that Liu Xunyu was requesting an audience.","En, so late?","Ling Han pondered for a moment, before saying, “Show her in.”","He sat down in the living room, and in a short while, he saw a servant leading Liu Xunyu over.","“Greetings, Captain Liu.” Ling Han stood up and clasped his hands in greeting.","Liu Xunyu smiled beautifully, “How does it feel to be free?”","“Very good.” Ling Han nodded. Indeed, those who had not lost their freedom could not imagine how precious freedom was.","Liu Xunyu was very satisfied with Ling Han’s answer, and asked again, “Then do you want to continue possessing your freedom?”","Ling Han’s eyes twitched. What was the meaning of this?","“As long as you sincerely work for me, I can guarantee that you will be granted the privilege of going out for a day every month,” Liu Xunyu said slowly, having a strong confidence in herself.","For people like them who had lost their freedom, they had a short taste of freedom, and their yearning for freedom naturally surpassed all else.","This was a massive temptation. Liu Xunyu did not believe that Ling Han would be able to resist.","Ling Han smiled faintly, “What is considered sincere?”","“Concoct ten Foundation Dissolution Pills for me every day.” Liu Xunyu finally revealed her true colors, “Don’t worry about medicinal ingredients. I will prepare them for you. You only have to concoct alchemical pills.”","For her, the Foundation Dissolution Pill was too useful.","She had no plans to sell it, but rather wanted to use it to befriend those true second- generation young masters and enter into the highest social circle in the Imperial Capital. Ling Han shook his head, “Apologies, I am unable to accept this condition!”","Liu Xunyu smiled faintly, and did not seem to be angry, as she asked, “Then what if the conditions include me?”","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han looked at Liu Xunyu in surprise. What was the meaning of this?","“As long as you work for me, I am yours,” Liu Xunyu said in a seductive tone, her peach blossom eyes seeming to be covered with a layer of mist.","Ling Han seemed to understand slightly. Why was it that it was she who had become the leader when there were clearly two Cauldron Forging Tiers here? Furthermore, they were all hostages, so what right did she have to fight for a chance for everyone to have a day of freedom? Previously, she had even said that as long as Ling Han listened to her, he could go out once a month.","-Was she the one who owned the Clan Mansion?","She was only a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator. On the Moonlight Planet, such a person couldn’t even be regarded as an elite, so how could she be so confident?","However, if one used beauty as bait, it would be a different story.","So dirty.","Ling Han felt disgusted, and said calmly, “Please behave yourself.”","Liu Xunyu was surprised. She had not thought that Ling Han would actually reject her.","It should be known that firstly, she was a beauty among beauties in the first place, and secondly, they were all imprisoned here, and could not come into contact with women. How could it be that they would make a move on those forty-year-old aunties?","Now, she was willing to take the initiative to throw herself into his arms, and you are actually not the slightest bit moved?","“I’m at the Cauldron Forging Tier. Have you played around with women who are at the same cultivation level as me?” Liu Xunyu tried to tempt him.","Ling Han scoffed. This woman still had the face to say that she was a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator? She was practically a prost!tute that was still trying her best to promote herself. “I’m going to rest now. Please leave.” He stood up and walked straight to his bedroom. Liu Xunyu did not move, but her pretty face had become incredibly cold.","She had been rejected, she had actually been rejected!","This was something that had never happened before. Furthermore, the person who had rejected her was actually only a Foundation Building Tier cultivator.","“Humph, if it was not for the fact that you still have value to exploit, just because you have humiliated me, I will not spare you!” she said through gritted teeth, “From tomorrow onwards, you will know the consequences of opposing me. I don’t know how long you can last,”","She humphed, and strode off.","The next morning, Ling Han started to cultivate under the sunlight.","He discovered that cultivating under the sunlight would speed up his advancement slightly, though it was only a slight bit.","Under the sunlight, the energy of heaven and earth would be even more energetic. However, this had never shown when he had been cultivating before.","Could it be that this was because he had switched to cultivating the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll? After Ling Han finished cultivating, a servant came to find him, his expression very ugly. “Young Master Han, I didn’t get the cultivation resources today. I didn’t even get the food for","three meals a day,” he said.","Yi, it had come so quickly?","Ling Han knew that he had rejected Liu Xunyu, and would definitely suffer her revenge, but he had not thought that it would come so quickly.","Hehe, she had the right to distribute resources in her hands, and she was just going to misuse it?","Ling Han nodded, “I understand.”","“Young Master Han,” the servant couldn’t help but say. “Why don’t you lower your head to","Lady Liu? I heard that Lady Liu has an extremely good relationship with a mighty figure of the","Clan Mansion.”","Ling Han frowned upon hearing this. Since when had those close to him become lobbyists?","“You may leave.” He waved his hand.","“Han-“The servant still wanted to persuade him further.","“Leave!” Ling Han’s voice became harsh.","The servant was exasperated, and could only step back. However, the gaze he directed at Ling","Han was clearly filled with displeasure.","-You are a Foundation Building Tier, and as long as you absorb the energy of heaven and earth, you would not die, but what about us? We are only mortals, and without food, what","would they eat!","He left resentfully. He was going to join forces with the other two servants to go on strike."]},{"number":3761,"title":"Chapter 3761: Tang Yan is here","paragraphs":["Chapter 3761: Tang Yan is here","Ling Han wasn’t worried about the cultivation resources. He knew how to refine pills himself, and there was no shortage of Dao Stones either. Thus, he didn’t need to worry about Liu Xunyu docking his cultivation resources, at least not for the time being.","To say the least, even if Tang Yan did not manage to get him out of here after so long, he would still be able to obtain what he wanted through the large black dog.","The morning passed very quickly. When it was close to mealtime, Han Bing barged in boldly.","He had really barged in. Without any notification from his servant, he had forcefully barged in just like that, extremely domineering.","“Brat, seeing as you have refused, I won’t hit you today,” Han Han said coldly. “However, you actually not doing as commanded has made me very unhappy. What should be done?”","The first sentence was very contradictory, and when combined with the second sentence, it became even stranger.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then understood. This Han Bing should be in a relationship with Liu Xunyu, so when he refused to become Liu Xunyu’s patron, his jealousy naturally subsided considerably. However, he and Liu Xunyu were on the same team in terms of benefits. Him rejecting Liu Xunyu was equivalent to rejecting him, so Han Bing was still displeased.","“Your circle is really chaotic,” Ling Han said sincerely.","This Han Bing was definitely not Liu Xunyu’s only lover. Judging by the fact that Liu Xunyu did not mind using her physical body just to make a Foundation Building cultivator work for her, it was clear how loose this woman was.","“Ling Han, are you seeking death?” Han Bing raised his voice, looking furious.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “We’re all hostages. We’re brothers in distress, so what’s there to be smug about? If you can, go outside and shout a few times.”","Why should I go outside and shout?","Han Bing felt an urge to rush up and beat Ling Han up, but when he recalled how he had just said that he would not hit anyone today, he couldn’t help but feel depressed. If he had known that this person would not know what was good for him, he would not have sealed his path.","No, if they continued to converse like this, he would go crazy.","“Humph!” He flicked his sleeves and left. The next time he came, he would definitely beat Ling Han to a pulp.","Ling Han’s expression was cold. He was the one being bullied, so why did it seem like Han Bing was the one who had been wronged?","‘Tang Yan, you have to hurry up and get me out of this place.’","However, there were still some worrying matters. In the afternoon, Ling Han had the large black dog buy some ingredients for the Foundation Dissolution Pill for him. In the end, the large black dog was actually stopped. Then, Ling Han was told that as long as it was related to a hostage, even if a mosquito flew in or out, it would have to obtain the approval of the Clan Mansion.","Hehe, why hadn’t he mentioned this a few days ago?","This was naturally Liu Xunyu’s tricks.","Ling Han didn’t argue. He simply had the large black dog put on the Void Beast hide, and quietly exited the Political Hostage Manor.","-If a Foundation Building cultivator were to wear the hide of a Void Beast, then even if a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator was here, it would be very difficult to discover it unless he was particularly close.","The large black dog successfully entered and exited, buying ingredients for Ling Han. However, Ling Han had already become extremely, extremely displeased.","The day passed just like that, and the following days were still the same. Ling Han was strictly confined in the Political Hostage Manor, and continued to have no food or cultivation resources.","Ling Han could endure it, but his servants were all mortals. After barely enduring for three days, they all fled, unwilling to work at his place any longer.","Hadn’t they come here to reap some benefits, so that they could have a chance to break through to the Celestial Path in the future? But now, it was great. The master that they had followed could barely protect himself. He was so poor that he was about to starve them to death, so what was the point of talking about the Celestial Path?","These three people weren’t prisoners, so they naturally could leave as they pleased. Worse come to worst, they could just leave without being paid any wages.","Right now, Ling Han was nothing but a joke in the Political Hostage Manor. Even his servants had fled. As a master, he was truly a failure.","Unfortunately, they did not know that Ling Han knew how to concoct alchemical pills, nor did they know that Ling Han had already gained some fame in the Imperial Capital. After all, the area covered by the Galaxy Network was too large. What was the little incident that had happened on the Moonlight Planet worth in the Galaxy Network?","Liu Xunyu came over again. She smiled faintly at Ling Han, “Have you changed your mind?”","Ling Han ignored her completely. This kind of woman who could be with as many men as she liked was really disgusting. He felt that even taking a second look at her was dirtying his eyes. Liu Xunyu did not force him, and merely revealed a proud expression, “So what if you have natural talent in alchemy? Without the ingredients for you to cast your talent, you would be a cripple. Even if you have outstanding natural talent in martial arts, without cultivation resources, and merely depend on yourself to draw on the power of heaven and earth, you would soon fall from the ranks of prodigies and in the very end, disappear among the masses.”","“Whenever you’ve thought it through, come find me again. The conditions I offer are still valid.”","She turned around and left, leaving Ling Han with an enchanting back view, swaying her hips gently, her grace boundless.","How could Ling Han pay any heed to her? Even without Tang Yan, there was no way he would submit. Worse come to worst, he could just summon the Heavenly Dao Flames, and he would make a big fuss first.","Speaking of which, where the hell had Tang Yan gone?","...","Another day passed.","Tang Clan.","“Brother Pang, it’s not that we don’t want to help, but that person is in the Political Hostage Manor. If we forcefully barge in and kill him, that would be equivalent to making an enemy of the Meng Clan,” a middle-aged man with a large belly complained to Pang Feiran.","Pang Feiran shook his head, “Brother Tang Ming, you have misunderstood. What Ancestor means is that he hopes that the Tang Clan can mobilize elites of Cauldron Forging Tier, and stand guard around the Political Hostage Manor. Once that despicable brat leaves the manor, they would immediately move and apprehend him.”","The middle-aged man with the big belly was called Tang Ming. He was also a Foundation Building Tier like Pang Feiran, but the present Pang Feiran was already a cripple. If it was not for the fact that he had the Pang Clan’s background, Tang Ming would definitely not be calling","him brother.","“Alright, since the ancestor of the Pang Clan has said so, we will definitely help.” Tang Ming nodded, as if he had made an extremely difficult decision.","Pang Feiran naturally knew that this expression was just for show, and also meant that from now onwards, the Tang Clan would no longer owe the Pang Clan anything.","He smirked coldly in his mind. It was just capturing a Foundation Building cultivator, and he had already done them a favor. Yet, they were acting as if they had been taken advantage of. Humph, they were truly taking advantage of the Pang Clan’s decline. Otherwise, how could the Tang Clan dare to disobey the Spirit Transformation True Lord from the Pang Clan?","‘Just you wait. If the Pang Clan obtains a precious technique from Ling Han and rises again, I’ll definitely let your Tang Clan know what regret is.’","The scene switched to Jia Yuan Manor.","A tall, slender, and incredibly handsome man was presently striding over. He was striding boldly, and though he was only one person, he actually gave rise to a powerful aura that even","an army of thousands could not compare to.","Tang Yan had come.","This Little Marquis never brought any servants with him when he came and went. In any case,","in this Imperial Capital, he only needed to show his face. There were many people who would","flatter him.","“Stop right there! Jia Yuan Manor doesn’t allow trespassers!” the guard at the door","immediately shouted.","Tang Yan’s expression involuntarily darkened, and his aura immediately crumbled.","Didn’t he say that it was fine as long as he showed his face?"]},{"number":3762,"title":"Chapter 3762: Try dodging again","paragraphs":["Chapter 3762: Try dodging again","“I am Tang Yan,” Tang Yan said darkly.","“And my name is Liu Yan!” the guard retorted. This was the Political Hostage Manor. He was a guard of the Political Hostage Manor, which meant that he was a member of the Imperial Court. Even if he encountered the Young Masters of some minor clans, he would still dare to rebuke them. Who would dare to make a move on a member of the Imperial Court? Were they planning to rebel?","Pa!","He had just finished his words, when the guard was slapped. He turned around, wanting to rebuke him, but when he saw the appearance of that person, he immediately cowered, and said with a charming smile, “Leader.”","The person who had hit him was the leader of the guards, and also the only Foundation Building cultivator. His face was all smiles, and it was as if flowers were about to bloom. He paid no heed to his underling, and merely smiled apologetically at Tang Yan, “Young Lord Marquis, this guy has just joined the army. He’s just a country bumpkin, so he doesn’t have much insight. Please don’t take it to heart.”","What!","The guard couldn’t help but pale in shock. “Little Marquis”? There was only one Little Marquis in the Imperial Capital, and that was the son of the Tang Clan, Tang Yan.","He couldn’t help but tremble in fear. If Tang Yan wanted to target him, he wouldn’t even know that he had died.","Tang Yan’s expression did not change, and merely asked, “I can’t enter?”","“Of course you can, of course,” the leader of the guards hurriedly said with a smile. To say nothing of the Political Hostage Manor, even if it was the Clan Manor, this little marquis would probably dare to barge in.","Tang Yan flicked his sleeves and strode into the Political Hostage Manor.","Only then did the guard heave a sigh of relief, feeling cold sweat on his back.","The Little Marquis’s aura was really frightening, he thought to himself.","However, why had this person suddenly come to the Political Hostage Manor?","...","“Ling Han!”","A shout came from outside the door. Ling Han had just finished cultivating not too long ago. After so many days, he was about to cultivate Heavenly Dao Foundation to Consummate level. The gap between the second Celestial Foundation and the first was not too big, and he would be able to reach Consummate level in about another ten days or so.","Thus, he was in a good mood. When he was a Heavenly Dao Foundation, he was already able to sweep aside all other Ultimate Dao Foundations. Then, after he advanced into Ultimate Dao Foundation, would he be able to match Cauldron Forging Tier?","Even if it was only the weakest Cauldron Forging Tier.","However, when this shout rang out, it greatly affected Ling Han’s good mood.","Without any servants, Ling Han could only go out. He opened the doors, and saw Liu Xunyu, Han Bing and Zhao Xiao were standing outside, all of them looking at him coldly.","“What is it? You’re here to see me so early?” Ling Han asked calmly.","“It hasn’t been easy these past few days, has it?” Liu Xunyu smiled faintly, “Without the service of servants, without cultivation resources, and without ingredients to concoct alchemical pills, this is what a real prisoner is like.”","Ling Han smiled and said, “It’s very quiet, so there’s no need to worry.”","“You’re just pretending!” Han Bing said coldly. “We don’t have that much patience to wait for you either. You only have two choices today. Either you listen to us obediently, or... we’ll add a scene of us beating you up every day on this basis!”","“I know that you’re invincible in the Foundation Building Tier, but in front of three of us Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators, what are you worth?” Zhao Xiao’s expression was also cold.","“To say nothing else, once our Celestial Cauldron appears, even standing is a luxury for you.” Han Bing continued. He released his own Celestial Cauldron, which appeared above his head. Then, it enlarged. Weng, the bronze Celestial Cauldron was ancient and filled with holiness.","The Cauldron Forging Tier was divided into three minor levels-Human Cauldron, Earth Cauldron, and Heaven Cauldron. It was very easy to distinguish. Human Cauldron was a single cauldron, Earth Cauldron was two, and Heaven Cauldron was three.","However, it was said that this wasn’t the limit of the Cauldron Forging Tier. It was just like how an Enlightenment Tier could break through to Mystery Realm Tier after opening at least thirty-six apertures. Cultivating three cauldrons was indeed enough to break through to the Core Formation Tier. However, a Cauldron Forging Tier elite could also cultivate four cauldrons, five cauldrons... or even nine cauldrons.","Since ancient times, those who could form four cauldrons could be called prodigies. Eight cauldrons was a supreme prodigy, and as for nine cauldrons... hoho, there may not even be one in hundreds of thousands of years. This kind of person possessed the potential to become a Saint.","Han Bing had summoned a cauldron, which meant that he was only standing on the first stage of the Cauldron Forging Tier, the Human Cauldron Tier.","Furthermore, his cauldron only had two legs, which meant that he had not cultivated to Consummate level even in Human Cauldron Tier – Consummate level was three legs.","Where had the Celestial Cauldron come from?","That was the foundations of the Celestial Path. Thus, the Celestial Cauldron looked like bronze, silver, or gold. They were all directly related to the foundations of the Celestial Path that had been formed after leaping over the Celestial Gate.","His Celestial Cauldron was bronze. Hehe, this was the weakest Celestial Cauldron.","However, wasn’t it a one-sided suppression for a Cauldron Forging Tier to face against a Foundation Building Tier?","Ling Han stood upright and proud. Not even the corner of his robes fluttered.","Yi?","Liu Xunyu and the others were all surprised. How was this possible? The Celestial Cauldron actually had no effect on a Foundation Building Tier at all?","No matter how weak the Celestial Cauldron was, it was still a Celestial Foundation. In terms of Celestial Path, it was superior to the Foundation Building Tier.","“Something’s off!” Zhao Xiao said, his eyes burning with greed.","He was sure that Ling Han must be hiding an astonishing secret. Merely that Starlight Screen was enough to make his eyes red with envy, and now added with the fact that Ling Han was unafraid of the Celestial Cauldron’s suppression, it further convinced him that it was very possible that Ling Han had obtained the inheritance of an ancient elite.","“If you don’t listen... I’ll apprehend you directly!” He strode towards Ling Han, wanting to apprehend Ling Han at the first instant and directly search his soul.","This involved the problem of strengthening himself. He naturally cast Liu Xunyu aside, and placed himself first.","Ling Han was solemn. He had not yet advanced into Ultimate Dao Foundation, and was not even qualified to match the weakest Cauldron Forging Tier – even if he had advanced into Ultimate Dao Foundation, whether he could match the Cauldron Forging Tier would only be known after a battle.","Could it be that he would have to use the Heavenly Dao Flames?","Ling Han was slightly depressed. His trump card was really too high-level, being able to burn Venerate Tier elites to death at the drop of a hat. Could it be that there was no trump card that just happened to be enough to deal with Cauldron Forging Tier?","“Humph, what do you want to do?” A cold laugh rang out, bringing with it a baleful chill.","Tang Yan!","When Ling Han saw this, he couldn’t help but smile. Very good, there was no need for him to","reveal his trump card.","“Who do you think you are!” Han Bing rebuked directly.","Liu Xunyu also took a look, and couldn’t help but pale.","Unlike Han Bing and Zhao Xiao, she was a smooth-talker, and had extremely great ambitions.","Thus, she had some understanding of those important heirs of the Azure Dragon Empire, as well as the descendants of the various great clans. Even if she had never met them before, she would definitely have seen their images before. It was not to the extent that she would not recognize them even if they had met.","This was Tang Yan, a top-notch existence among the second-generation young masters of the Majestic Empire. He had been conferred a title of nobility at birth, and this kind of prestige was also unique in the Azure Dragon Empire.","“Shut up!” Liu Xunyu hurriedly rebuked, “This is Young Marquis Tang Yan, don’t be","impudent!”","When Han Bing heard this, his heart instantly trembled. He had never seen Tang Yan, but he","must have heard of such a person in the Imperial Capital.","“I’m sorry, Little Marquis.” He hurriedly put on a humble attitude.","Tang Yan strode over, and suddenly raised his hand, delivering a slap at Han Bing.","Instinctively, Han Bing hurriedly turned his head to the side to dodge.","Tang Yan’s palm missed its target, and a baleful expression appeared on his face as he said,","“Try dodging again?”","After saying this, he raised his hand again."]},{"number":3763,"title":"Chapter 3763: Tang Yan’s Rage","paragraphs":["Chapter 3763: Tang Yan’s Rage","Han Bing couldn’t help but feel angered as well. Though he was a hostage, he was not a prisoner in the true meaning of the word. Furthermore, those that could be hostages were all very important figures in a force. It was very possible that they were princesses, Imperial Princes or the like. Now that someone wanted to slap him, he had to stand up straight and let the other party slap him a little easier. How could that be reasonable?","“Han Bing!” Liu Xunyu called out loudly.","Han Bing’s heart trembled. Liu Xunyu had a very strong influence on him.","Thus, he had initially planned to dodge, but in the end, he still did not move. Pa, a crisp slap landed on his face.","Hiss, how domineering.","Zhao Xiao saw this, and couldn’t help but grimace internally. He was also glad that he had not spoken. Otherwise, this kind of treatment would probably be unavoidable.","However, it was too early for him to feel happy.","Tang Yan had already strode towards him, and as for Han Bing, he was already ignoring him.. Yi, what do you want to do?","Zhao Xiao was slightly flustered. ‘Why are you walking towards me? Why are you so close? F*ck!’","He had not even finished this thought, when he saw Tang Yan raise his hand again.","‘What? I didn’t offend you, so why did you slap me?’","Shua, when Tang Yan delivered a slap, Zhao Xiao hurriedly dodged quickly. Even if Liu Xunyu shouted at him, he would definitely not allow anyone to slap his face.","-He was not a guy with weak willpower like Han Bing, and was completely dominated by Liu Xunyu.","However, Tang Yan was serious this time. With a single palm strike, he immediately launched a series of attacks, unleashing his celestial aura without any reservations. Peng, peng, peng! A great many holes immediately appeared in the surrounding walls.","“You’ve gone too far!” Zhao Xiao roared in fury. He went all out, battling fiercely with Tang Yan.","Tang Yan was neither enraged nor shocked, pressing forwards with every move. In just a few moves, Zhao Xiao was completely at a disadvantage.","The gap in strength between the two of them was too wide, and very soon, Zhao Xiao had lost all ability to resist, and was beaten up madly by Tang Yan.","What made Zhao Xiao even more depressed was the fact that he had absolutely no idea why Tang Yan had hit him.","He had clearly not said anything to offend the other party. Furthermore, Han Bing had only suffered a slap, but he had been completely thrashed.","Oh, the person who scolded you had only suffered a slap, but the person who had not scolded you had been given a good thrashing. What kind of logic was that?","Liu Xunyu naturally could not bear to watch any longer, and hurriedly advised, “Little Marquis, may I know how Zhao Xiao has offended you?”","Tang Yan stopped what he was doing, gave an ‘oh’, and said, “So this person’s name is Zhao Xiao?”","‘F*ck you!’","Zhao Xiao really wanted to cry. You don’t even know my name, and you have already thrashed me so harshly. How wronged am I?","Peng!","Tang Yan’s fist fell, and he began to pummel Zhao Xiao again. Zhao Xiao screamed in pain. Aside from not delivering a fatal strike, he had really pummeled him quite harshly.","It was only when he was tired from the beating that he clapped his hands and stopped. Then, he said slowly, “Do you know why you only suffered a slap, yet he has to be beaten by me?” he asked Han Bing.","‘There’s probably something wrong with your brain.’","Han Bing mumbled internally, but he would definitely not say it out loud. In fact, he did not even open his mouth to speak.","Tang Yan did not want him to answer either, and immediately gave an answer, “Because you have offended me, I will just slap you, and give you a light punishment. But if you have offended my friend, hoho, then I will definitely not be reserved!”","What friend?","An inconceivable guess instantly rose up in Liu Xunyu’s heart, but how was this possible?","Ling Han had clearly only been out for a day, so how could he possibly have a relationship with the Little Marquis, Tang Yan?","The two of them were not from the same world at all!","“Ling Han, it’s been a few days.” Tang Yan greeted Ling Han.","F***, that really was the case.","Liu Xunyu, Han Bing and Zhao Xiao’s hearts jolted. This was not going to be easy. Tang Yan was actually friends with Ling Han, and this kind of person could not even be controlled by the Clan Mansion, so how were they supposed to oppose him?","Would they still be able to bully Ling Han in future?","Liu Xunyu felt even more regretful. If she had known earlier, even if Ling Han won, she would have deprived Ling Han of the chance to go out. Now, what could she do? He actually had a relationship with the Little Marquis, Tang Yan. Who would dare touch a single hair on his head?","But now, it was not the problem of how they were going to deal with Ling Han in future, but rather how they were going to deal with the fury of this Little Marquis if Tang Yan wanted to seek vengeance for Ling Han.","Tang Yan glanced at Liu Xunyu again, and said, “You should feel fortunate that I do not hit women! All of you, get lost!”","Liu Xunyu and the others did not even dare to fart, as they all turned around and left.","Firstly, they were hostages, and were far too inferior to the Little Marquis, who was very influential. Secondly, Tang Yan was at least an Earth Cauldron. Even if the three of them worked together, they would still be no match for Tang Yan.","Then what was the point of not leaving?","Ling Han smiled faintly, “Thank you.”","“What are you thanking me for? Are you treating me like an outsider?” Tang Yan asked,","pretending to be displeased.","“Haha, come, please come in. I’ll make you a cup of Silver Phoenix Tea, the specialty of the Celestial Sea Planet.” Ling Han led him into the house. Though the outer walls were already in shambles, but thankfully, the inside of the house was not damaged.","He returned with two cups of tea. Tang Yan picked up the cup and took a sniff, and couldn’t help but say, “The fragrance of the tea wafts over. Needless to say, the taste of this tea is definitely excellent.”","After taking a sip, he revealed a nostalgic expression, and remained silent for a long time.","He soon finished his cup of tea, and Ling Han picked up the teapot to refill his cup.","“Yi, where are your servants here?” Tang Yan asked in surprise.","“They ran,” Ling Han said with a smile.","“How could they have possibly left?” Tang Yan was even more confused.","Ling Han recounted how his cultivation resources had been docked, causing Tang Yan’s","expression to gradually darken.","“Who would’ve thought? So it turns out that woman is the main culprit!” Tang Yan said with a humph. He was a chauvinist, and he believed that women were the subordinates of men. Thus, he had instinctively believed that Zhao Xiao and Han Bing were the masterminds. “Just bear with it for a few more days. I have more or less established relations, and in a few days, you will be able to move out of Jia Yuan Manor.” He continued, “As for that Liu Xunyu, humph, I will let her suffer the consequences of her own actions.”","Ling Han nodded, but didn’t say thank you. This was a huge favor, and he kept it in mind.","“Come, let’s go out for a walk,” Tang Yan said with a smile.","“Sure,” Ling Han said with a nod.","The two of them walked side by side. When they exited Jia Yuan Manor, the guards at the entrance obviously saw them, but deliberately pretended to be blind.","-Logically speaking, they should have stopped Ling Han from going out, but Tang Yan was right beside them, so how could they possibly dare?","And not too far away, Pang Feiran suddenly became excited.","“Senior Tang Hong, it’s that brat!” he said, pointing at Ling Han. At this moment, he was standing beside the window of a tall building with an old man with a hooked nose. Tang Hong nodded, and was just about to make a move, but when he saw Tang Yan, he was shocked, and his movements naturally came to an abrupt halt.","Pang Feiran, however, did not recognize Tang Yan, because Pang Clan’s base was not here. He","had also come to the Imperial Capital because he had some matters to attend to, and had not come especially for Ling Han. When he saw that Tang Hong had not made a move, he couldn’t help but feel anxious, and urged, “Senior Tang Hong, that is only a mere Foundation Building cultivator. You can easily apprehend him with a stretch of your hand!”","“Apprehend your sister!” Tang Hong immediately glared at Pang Feiran. If it was not for the fact that the latter was already a cripple, he would definitely have delivered a slap.","“You want to harm me and our Tang Clan, right?” he asked harshly."]},{"number":3764,"title":"Chapter 3764: Change","paragraphs":["Chapter 3764: Change","What was going on here?","Pang Feiran’s expression was filled with confusion and grievance. When have I harmed you?","Wasn’t it already agreed upon that you would kill Ling Han or capture him alive before handing him over to the Pang Clan? Why didn’t you make a move and instead act as if you were the victim?","“S-Senior Tang Hong, I don’t understand what you’re saying,” he stammered weakly.","“That person, did you see him?” Tang Hong pointed at Tang Yan.","“I saw him.” Pang Feiran nodded. He had only lost his cultivation level, and had not become blind.","Tang Hong was almost angered to death by his words, and he asked coldly, “You’re not blind yet, are you? If you’re not blind, how could it be that you can’t recognize him? Isn’t that the Little Marquis of the Tang Clan?”","What Little Marquis?","Pang Feiran had not done his research in advance, so how could he know who the so-called Little Marquis was?","“Tang Yan, the most outstanding clansman of the younger generation of Tang Clan. He has an Innate Divine Physique. After he was born, he was bestowed the title of Marquis by His Majesty, and you want me to kidnap and kill someone in front of him?” Tang Hong sneered. If he really dared to make a move, the Tang Clan would probably be destroyed by the Tang Clan tomorrow.","Pang Feiran was given a great fright. He did not know Tang Yan, but he definitely knew of the Tang Clan. That was a clan of Spiritual Transformation Tier elites, and was deeply doted on by His Imperial Majesty, so their force was astonishingly powerful.","But this was too inconceivable. He was only a hostage, so how could he possibly be together with the little Marquis of the Tang Clan?","Now, how was he going to capture Ling Han?","...","On the other side, Liu Xunyu and the others were all seated in their rooms, all of them wearing cold expressions. Aside from them, there was also Tan Zhengjie.","“Sister, that brat actually became friends with Tang Yan?” Tan Zhengjie still felt like he was in a dream, and could not believe it at all.","Han Bing had been slapped by Tang Yan, and was filled with displeasure. Seeing that Tan Zhengjie was still going to bring this up, he couldn’t help but feel angered. He shouted, “Are you retarded? Otherwise, how could we have suffered such great humiliation?”","“You—” Tan Zhengjie wanted to retort, but when he saw Liu Xunyu’s stopping gaze, he obediently shut his mouth.","“We are all a family, so there is no need for internal strife.” Liu Xunyu stretched out a hand to press down on him.","“But that brat has the protection of the Little Marquis, so how are we supposed to deal with him?” Zhao Xiao said hatefully. He was still coveting Ling Han’s secrets, and was very defiant.","“Don’t worry, I won’t let him leave Jia Yuan Manor,” Liu Xunyu said confidently.","“Oh?” Zhao Xiao and the others all turned to look at her.","That was Tang Yan, the son of the Tang Clan, a proper noble Little Marquis.","Liu Xunyu now had to calm the hearts of the army, so she revealed some secrets, and said, “We indeed have no way to contend with Tang Yan, but Jia Yuan Manor is under the jurisdiction of the Clan Mansion, so no matter how long Tang Yan’s influence is, he would not be able to reach in.”","Zhao Xiao and the others all shook their heads. As long as Tang Yan was willing to be Ling Han’s guarantor, then what big deal would it be to take Ling Han out of Jia Yuan Manor? How could it be that the Clan Mansion was willing to offend Tang Yan?","“Believe me, Tang Yan will not be able to save Ling Han! No one will be able to save him!” Liu Xunyu stated calmly, but her eyes were exuding a coldness, filled with maliciousness.","...","Two days passed, and Tang Yan came again. However, this time, his expression was a little ugly, as if he was hiding an extremely great fury.","“What is it? Has the sky collapsed?” Ling Han asked smilingly.","Peng, Tang Yan slammed a hand heavily on the table, and said, “Things have changed. Initially, I had already made arrangements. In these two days, the Clan Mansion will send someone over to announce the news that you can leave Jia Yuan Manor, but today, I actually received a letter from the Clan Mansion, blabbering nonsense about dog-sh*t rules to me. In short, they have changed their minds, and have no plans to let you leave.”","Ling Han was surprised. Since Tang Yan said that everything had been arranged, with his status, he naturally would not boast. This matter was already set in stone, but now, the Clan Mansion had suddenly gone back on their word. Why was that?","There had not been any major changes in the Imperial Family, so why had it suddenly become like this?","There was definitely something fishy about this!","Liu Xunyu?","Was this possible? She was only a hostage, so what right did she have to influence the decision of the Clan Mansion, and even offend a minor lord like Tang Yan?","Strange.","“I will go and investigate this matter, but in terms of time...” Tang Yan was slightly hesitant. Looking at the present firm attitude of the Clan Mansion, the difficulty level of changing their decision was not low.","He was only a minor marquis, and was not the Emperor, so he could decide things with just a","word.","“That’s right!” Tang Yan suddenly recalled something, and clapped his hands loudly. However, he paused for a moment, then immediately shook his head, “No, no, this will","definitely not work.”","“What did you think of?” Ling Han asked.","“There’s another way. We don’t have to pass through the Clan Mansion, but the possibility is","close to zero,” Tang Yan said.","“Oh, tell me about it,” Ling Han said with a smile. As long as there was a sliver of hope, he","could give it a try.","Tang Yan pondered for a moment, before saying, “In another 20 or so days, it’ll be His Majesty’s 30,000-year-old birthday. To celebrate this, the entire nation will be celebrating. Moreover, His Majesty loves young prodigies the most, so he’ll host a tournament for each cultivation level. If you’re able to rise above the others, you might even be bestowed an official position, what more leaving the Clan Mansion.”","Ling Han didn’t care at all whether he was conferred an official title or not, but to be able to come out of Jia Yuan Manor, this was very important.","He smiled slightly, “This is not a bad idea.”","“You’re only an alchemist, so battle prowess isn’t your forte!” Tang Yan said with a shake of","his head. “I’ll consider this as a backup plan. I’ll go and ask the Clan Mansion again. Which person is opposing me? I just want to fish someone out, and they are giving me all kind of","excuses.”","“All right.” Ling Han nodded, but he had already placed his hopes on the martial arts","competition.","With his strength, how could it be that he wasn’t powerful enough to defeat Foundation Building cultivators?","En, in the entire universe, he may not even be able to rank in the top ten. After all, there were so many freakish beings in this world, but in the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire and their subordinate forces? That was naturally no big deal.","Moreover, he would only need 10 or so days to advance to the Ultimate Dao Foundation. At that time, even if he were to battle against Origin or Myriad Dao, he would still have enough confidence that he could emerge victorious.","Tang Yan left. He naturally felt that it was very unreliable to have an alchemist go and fight. Thus, he naturally still had to go to the Clan Mansion to find out who was playing tricks on him, and reverse the decision that had previously been reached.","Only a day later, Tang Yan returned again.","“The Clan Mansion has a Deputy Mansion Leader called Meng Shuchang. It was he who","suppressed the matter of you leaving the Clan Mansion.”","Ling Han was surprised, “This is the first time I’ve heard of that person’s name. It should be impossible that I have offended him.”","“It is indeed not him, but rather Liu Xunyu,” Tang Yan said.","Yi, it really was this woman?","“She has such great power?” Ling Han asked in surprise.","“Hehe.” Tang Yan showed a disdainful smile, “Meng Shuchang did not say that it was related","to Liu Xunyu. Instead, I sent someone to investigate. Old Geezer Meng thought that he had","done it covertly, but at least half of the people in the Clan Mansion know that he has an affair","with Liu Xunyu.”","So it was this kind of adulterous relationship."]},{"number":3765,"title":"Chapter 3765: Breaking through into Ultimate Dao Foundation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3765: Breaking through into Ultimate Dao Foundation","Ling Han finally understood why Liu Xunyu had so much power in the Political Hostage Manor, that she could even win a day of freedom for a hostage.","That was because she had a “person” in the Clan Mansion.","Thinking about it, it made sense. In order to recruit Ling Han, she didn’t mind using her own body as a bargaining chip. Then, for the sake of this relationship with the Clan Mansion, she was naturally even more willing to throw caution to the wind.","There was also Han Bing and Zhao Xiao. It was no wonder that they felt an indescribable jealousy. Clearly, they were all patrons of Liu Xunyu, and saw him as a rival in love.","Were they rivals in love? Uh, at most, they were just gigolos.","Disgusting, this was really disgusting.","“Old Geezer Meng has been besotted by that woman, and is gritting his teeth to disagree with me,” Tang Yan said in displeasure, “Though the Clan Mansion does not have much real power, and Old Geezer Meng is only an unimportant member of the Imperial Family, his surname is still Meng, after all. Even I cannot do anything to him. If this perverted old geezer does not relent, I really have no way.”","As he saw it, how difficult would it be for him, as the Little Marquis, to protect someone? But Meng Shuchang was determined not to relent, so there was nothing he could do.","After all, the Clan Mansion had authority over the internal matters of the Meng Clan, so it was taboo for Tang Yan to interfere.","“It’s all right. I’ll take the second path, and go fight!” Ling Han said with a smile.","“But-“Tang Yan frowned. He did not have the slightest bit of confidence in Ling Han.","You are an alchemist, so could it be that you would take out a few alchemical pills to bribe others during the martial arts tournament?","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Don’t worry, don’t worry. I will definitely get first place.” Fine then.","Tang Yan could only choose to believe Ling Han. After all, this was the only way now. He explained the details of participating in the martial arts tournament to Ling Han. The current emperor of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire was called Meng Yonghua, and he was a Sect Master great elite. He was already thirty thousand years old this year.","Theoretically speaking, Minor Advanced Tier possessed a lifespan of 40,000 years. However, cultivating and battling would definitely leave some hidden injuries. Thus, 40,000 years was only the theoretical limit. Generally speaking, Minor Advanced Tiers could only live for around 35,000 years.","... Unless one could ingest Saintly medicines that could extend one’s lifespan. However, those were treasures that even Saints would be tempted by, so how could Minor Advanced Tier elites possibly obtain them?","From this aspect, Meng Yonghua should only have about one seventh of his life left. Of course, this was about five thousand years’ time, which was even longer than the lifetime of a Core Formation Tier cultivator.","To Meng Yonghua, this was most likely the last 10,000 years of his life. Thus, he placed a lot of importance on this event. This banquet would also become extremely grand. Not only would the subordinate territories send representatives over, but even the Majestic Empires and great sects would send representatives over.","The only imperfection was the invasion of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire, which added a shadow to the situation.","This birthday banquet would begin twenty days later, and would continue for ten days, and the last day would be Meng Yonghua’s birthday. This was the most important day.","Ling Han needed to fight his way out of the selection competition that would begin on the first day of the banquet. Finally, he and the other victor would hold the final battle at Meng Yonghua’s birthday banquet. If he could win, he would definitely be rewarded by Meng Yonghua.","This was indeed a very good opportunity.","The registration had already begun, and there was no restriction on the region. As long as one was in the Foundation Building Tier, they could participate.","Of course, Foundation Building Tier cultivators had auditions for them, and Cauldron Forging Origin Tier cultivators had auditions as well. However, these auditions were only limited to the two cultivation levels. When one reached the Core Formation Tier, they could be referred to as elites and great elites. It was practically impossible for them to lose face and perform for others.","When the empress, Hu Niu, and the others found out, they were all in high spirits, expressing that they too wanted to go and join in on the excitement.","Ling Han waited patiently, making the best use of his time to cultivate. In this kind of selection tournament, aside from Talisman Weapons, it was not allowed to use other means. Perhaps, it would turn a person whose battle prowess was originally mediocre into a great elite. Thus, Ling Han felt that it was safer to increase his cultivation level a step further. -If he could avoid using the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, he would. After all, there were definitely a lot of people here who knew what was what.","Another ten days later, Ling Han had already cultivated to the peak stage of Heavenly Dao Foundation. His second cornerstone of the Celestial Path was already flawlessly Consummate level.","He could break through now.","Ling Han had bought enough Treasured Fruits of Life through the Galaxy Network, so he naturally wouldn’t waste any time. He immediately started to break through to Ultimate Dao","Foundation.","This time, he had experience, and directly began to forge the third cornerstone of the Celestial Path.","He used the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower to suppress the two Celestial Foundations, then mobilized the power of living beings in his body to protect the newly created third Celestial Foundation. He had to hurry up. He had to complete it in one go. Otherwise, he would have to wait for the living beings in his body to recover before starting again.","This time, he was gaining another cornerstone of the Celestial Path, so the repulsive force naturally increased considerably.","Previously, it had been incredibly difficult for him to forge a second Celestial Foundation, and he had tried his best. Now, this was practically an impossible task.","Ling Han suddenly had an idea. Wouldn’t the first and second Celestial Foundations repel","each other?","Fine, you can repel each other.","These two foundation stones of the Celestial Path were both perfect and flawless, so it was naturally hard to determine a victor. They repelled each other, so the pressure on the third","Celestial Foundation was naturally less.","Seizing this opportunity, he had to be quick.","Ling Han seized the time to form the core of the third Celestial Foundation, using the power of millions and millions of living beings to protect it. Once the core was stabilized, there was","no need to worry about it being shattered by the other two Celestial Foundations.","‘Soon, soon, soon... I’ve succeeded!’","Ling Han broke into a smile. The third Celestial Foundation had been formed.","Boom, the power of heaven and earth surged towards him. The third Celestial Foundation had","just formed, and was madly absorbing the power of heaven and earth.","Ling Han naturally wouldn’t miss such a good opportunity. He focused on absorbing the power of heaven and earth, improving his cultivation level and abilities.","This was like a reward from heaven and earth. It was clearly not dawn, but not only was Ling Han’s cultivation speed not slow, it had even surpassed his usual speed.","Unfortunately, this only lasted for less than half a day.","The power of heaven and earth no longer surged, and slowly calmed, signifying that this breakthrough was drawing to an end.","Ling Han felt the majestic power in his body, and couldn’t help but feel curious. Just what","level had his current strength reached?","“Can I fight against the weakest Cauldron Forging Tier?” he thought.","“Ling Han!” Right at this moment, a shout rang out from outside.","Zhao Xiao?","Ling Han recognized the voice, and thought that it was just right. He would use this person to","test his current strength.","He walked out, and saw that Zhao Xiao had already entered without an invitation, and was","standing in the courtyard.","“Ling Han, we can make a deal,” Zhao Xiao said.","“Oh?” Ling Han declined to comment.","“Hand over the cultivation technique that you cultivate, and I will guarantee your safety,”","Zhao Xiao said.","Ling Han spluttered in laughter, and said, “Why should I believe you?”","“Because you can only trust me,” Zhao Xiao said proudly. “Tang Yan should have told you by","now, right? He can’t possibly fish you out. And do you think that you can withstand the attacks of three Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators? So, you must depend on my protection!”"]},{"number":3766,"title":"Chapter 3766: Battling a Cauldron Forging Tier","paragraphs":["Chapter 3766: Battling a Cauldron Forging Tier","Ling Han chuckled, and said excitedly, “Come, let’s go to the battlefield.”","W-what?","Zhao Xiao thought that there was something wrong with his ears. He looked at Ling Han in surprise. Go to the battlefield? Yi, are you complaining that I can’t move freely here and can’t beat you up?","“I’ll oblige you,” he said calmly. In any case, Ling Han wouldn’t be able to escape from his grasp.","The two of them headed to the battlefield, and there were definitely people from the Political Hostage Manor that saw them, so they naturally followed them.","Ling Han was currently incompatible in the Political Hostage Manor. There were too many people watching him, hoping to watch a good show.","The battlefield was not far, and the two of them soon arrived at their destination.","The reason why the battlefield could be used for martial arts and sparring was not because this place was filled with sand, and it did not matter even if it was damaged, but rather because there was the protection of formations here. As long as it did not exceed its limits, there would be no power seeping out, and affect the outside world.","Thus, if they started a battle here, they could completely go all out.","Ling Han crooked a finger at Zhao Xiao, “Grandson, come.”","Zhao Xiao’s eyes were ice-cold, and he stated calmly, “You will definitely pay the price for this!”","Xiu, he charged out, his hands forming into claws that grabbed out at Ling Han. Boundless energy solidified, turning into three colours, azure, white and red, flowing with light, like three ribbons.","He was truly enraged now. A Foundation Building cultivator had actually provoked him time and time again, and it was also because of this Ling Han that he had been given a good thrashing by Tang Yan. It was obviously impossible for him to get his revenge on Tang Yan for this kind of great humiliation, so he could only take his revenge on Ling Han.","Ling Han was extremely excited. Could a Foundation Building Tier cultivator rival a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator?","Even if it was only the weakest Cauldron Forging Tier.","He unleashed his full power, and an incredibly rich power surged through his body. Then, he blasted out the Three Styles of the God of War.","It was as if the heaven and earth were using him as their core. Endless energy surged over, and he was the heaven and earth, the core of everything.","The first form was unleashed, heading towards Zhao Xiao.","“Has this guy gone mad?”","“He’s actually facing a Cauldron Forging Tier head-on?”","“Hehe, is there any difference whether it is a head-on confrontation or not?”","“True, Foundation Building Tier cultivators are like fish to be slaughtered in front of Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators. The only difference is how they’re slaughtered.”","Everyone exclaimed in shock, but when they thought about it, from the moment Ling Han walked onto the battlefield, his fate had already been decided.","A terrible defeat!","Boom, their attacks collided, and endless brilliance surged, incredibly dazzling.","Xiu, a figure flew out backwards.","It was Ling Han.","As expected, he was completely unable to match Zhao Xiao. This was an incredibly shocking disadvantage.","However, a hair-raising scene appeared. Ling Han had just landed, when he immediately charged back.","What!","This time, everyone was numb with shock.","How was this possible?","Ling Han had not been insta-killed by Zhao Xiao, and actually still had the ability to counter? ‘F*ck! F*ck! F*ck!’","Ling Han charged back, using the second form of the Three Styles of the God of War, which blasted towards Zhao Xiao.","Through the first exchange, Ling Han clearly understood that the power gap between him and the other was about three times, but he believed that Zhao Xiao probably didn’t use his full power just now, because the other definitely didn’t want to kill him – if a Cauldron Forging Tier used his full power, what Foundation Building Tier wouldn’t be blasted into smithereens?","However, Ling Han believed that with his current strength, he was completely capable of blocking attacks on the level of the Human Cauldron.","Zhao Xiao’s eyes were wide with shock. Ling Han had actually blocked his attack?","He hurriedly came back to his senses. Seeing that Ling Han’s attack was even more violent, he went all out, blasting towards Ling Han.","Peng, the two of them exchanged blows for the second time, creating an even more terrifying explosion. Everyone only felt a blinding light in front of their eyes, and could not see anything clearly.","Ling Han was sent flying again. He somersaulted in the air, dispersing the momentum of his retreat. Then, he charged back for the second time, and blasted out the Third Style of the God","of War.","This style was even more violent.","Zhao Xiao was both furious and flushed. A Foundation Building Tier actually managed to exchange a few blows with him. If this spread out, no one would say that Ling Han was heaven-defyingly powerful, but rather that he was too weak.","The weakest Cauldron Forging Tier in history.","Wasn’t it? If that wasn’t the case, how could he have been forced to this extent by a Foundation Building cultivator?","Boom!","He also channeled a powerful move, with cyan-coloured energy entwined around his hands,","as he counterattacked Ling Han.","Humph, have a taste of pain.","With a thought, Ling Han’s fists also burned with the Heavenly Dao Flames. In a battle of high-level energy, who would be afraid of whom?","Boom!","The two of them clashed for the third time, but this time, Ling Han didn’t fly backwards. When the brilliance completely dissipated, Ling Han stood proudly, and didn’t take even half","a step back.","On the sidelines of the battlefield, everyone was gaping, unable to say a single word.","It was a tie!","A Foundation Building cultivator was actually tied with a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator? Who could believe this?","Impossible, absolutely impossible. There was only one possibility, and that was Ling Han wasn’t some Foundation Building cultivator, but rather a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator.","As the person involved, Zhao Xiao knew better than anyone else that Ling Han didn’t have the slightest bit of the aura of the Cauldron Forging Tier on him. Thus, he must be a Foundation Building cultivator.","At first, he was confused and stunned, which then became incredibly fanatical.","For a Foundation Building cultivator to be so strong, he must have cultivated some kind of powerful secret technique, and if he could obtain it, then wouldn’t that mean...","His heart beat wildly, as if it was about to jump out of his chest.","“Humph, you used all your ultimate moves to just barely manage a tie with me. For such a powerful move, could you continuously use it?” Zhao Xiao asked coldly. Being able to become a Cauldron Forging Tier elite, his insight was naturally extraordinary. With a single glance, he could tell that the Three Styles of the God of War was a powerful move, and definitely could","not be used continuously.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Then bring it on.”","“Humph!” Zhao Xiao did not waste words, and directly launched a powerful offensive.","Ling Han indeed couldn’t cast the Three Styles of the God of War for a short period of time. He channeled the Starlight Screen as he unleashed the Eighteen Claws of the Golden Eagle, Celestial Crossing Finger, and exchanged blows with Zhao Xiao.","In all fairness, the Eighteen Claws of the Golden Eagle and Celestial Crossing Finger were both too ordinary, and could not compensate for the gap in cultivation level between Ling Han and Zhao Xiao at all. However, added with the Starlight Screen, Ling Han escaped unscathed. This layer of defense was truly powerful now. It was impossible for Zhao Xiao’s attack to","penetrate it with a single strike, and as long as it could not be penetrated with a single strike, then with the support of Ling Han’s incredibly abundant mystical power, he was completely","capable of repairing it in an instant.","In theory, he was completely capable of exhausting Zhao Xiao to death.","Ten moves, thirty moves, a hundred moves! Everyone was transfixed with shock and disbelief. It was as if they were in a dream.","Though Ling Han had always been at a disadvantage, they could tell that Ling Han was indeed","a Foundation Building cultivator. That kind of life fluctuation was completely different from","Zhao Xiao.","Was there really such a powerful Foundation Building cultivator?","“Impossible, the Cauldron Forging Tier can suppress the Foundation Building Tier-this is","an iron rule!”","“En, this is a truth that will never change, and cannot be broken.”","“Thus, it must be that Zhao Xiao is too weak.”","“Perhaps he exerted too much energy on our captain yesterday, so he’s out of energy today.”","“Hehe, it’s possible.”","Everyone knew that Ling Han was strong, but it was definitely impossible for him to be strong enough to match the Cauldron Forging Tier. Thus, this must be because Zhao Xiao was too","weak."]},{"number":3767,"title":"Chapter 3767: The fourth big shot","paragraphs":["Chapter 3767: The fourth big shot","Ling Han activated his ocular technique, and instantly, Zhao Xiao’s attacks were filled with flaws in front of him.","However, identifying weaknesses and exploiting them were two different things.","The attack speed of a Cauldron Forging Tier was too fast, and any flaws in attack would only be momentary, so how could he make use of it?","This kind of weak point would be fatal in a battle of equal cultivation levels, but now, the gap between their cultivation levels was too wide, and there was also an obvious gap in power. Even if Ling Han saw the weak point, he would not be able to grasp it.","However, this was still useful. Ling Han had a panoramic view of Zhao Xiao’s attack patterns.","When everyone attacked, there would be a sign. Every muscle tensed and relaxed would have a sign. For example, if you wanted to kick, you would definitely have to tighten the muscles in your waist and legs, and the mystical power would also condense more towards your legs.","After seeing this with his eye technique and exchanging a few more blows, Zhao Xiao’s attacks became completely transparent in front of Ling Han.","It was as if Ling Han possessed the ability to predict the future. The moment Zhao Xiao moved, he would be able to react in advance.","In this manner, Ling Han actually managed to slowly reverse the disadvantageous situation. Though it was not completely equal, he was no longer at a disadvantage.","Everyone was watching dumbfounded. Could it be that they would be watching a supreme show of a Foundation Building cultivator defeating a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator today? Zhao Xiao was extremely depressed. He really felt that Ling Han was like a worm in his stomach. No matter what kind of powerful move he prepared, Ling Han would be able to react in advance, causing his attacks to be unsuccessful. In fact, Ling Han would even take advantage of the opening to counterattack.","This battle was really too depressing, that he was practically about to go crazy.","It was about time.","Ling Han waited for the right moment, and finally used his trump card.","Heavenly Pattern Jade, go!","Xiu, the Heavenly Pattern Jade had already been compressed to about 100g. It was extraordinarily light, and with the boost of the colossal Spiritual Power, it instantly reached","40 times the speed of sound, blasting towards Zhao Xiao.","It was too fast, 40 times the speed of sound. Even if it was a Cauldron Forging Tier, his speed would only be around 30 times, and there was absolutely no way he could dodge.","Zhao Xiao was naturally unafraid. Was there any need for him to dodge the attacks of a Foundation Building cultivator?","He also activated his Spiritual Power, which transformed into a large net that wrapped around the Heavenly Pattern Jade, layer by layer.","However, his expression immediately changed drastically.","That was because when his net of Spiritual Power spread over, it would be like using an ordinary fishing net to catch a crocodile. How could he possibly catch it? Frightening power surged over, like a hot knife through butter, and he was completely unmatched.","This was a Spiritual Power Spirit Tool!","Zhao Xiao shouted internally. How could he dare to parry? He hurriedly dodged to the side. However, how could the Heavenly Pattern Jade at 40 times the speed of sound be dodged? Peng! He had just made a dodging motion, when the Heavenly Pattern Jade had already reached his waist, and instantly, a dazzling brilliance spread out.","‘Hmm?’","Ling Han looked slightly surprised, because the Heavenly Pattern Jade didn’t manage to break half of Zhao Xiao’s waist. Instead, it was blocked by a layer of light, and then slid sideways, crashing into the sandpit.","He hurriedly used his Spiritual Power as his hand and grabbed the Heavenly Pattern Jade back. He had not thought that Zhao Xiao actually had a treasure on him. Otherwise, he would not have been able to escape the fate of having half his body destroyed just now.","This was still because Ling Han hadn’t wanted to kill anyone. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have deliberately missed. However, killing an envoy of another nation was naturally a serious crime, unless he wanted to directly become hostile.","Zhao Xiao’s body was trembling. He had a rare treasure on him that would activate when he was in life-threatening danger, turning the crisis around. However, this rare treasure could only be used three times, and he treasured it extremely much.","However, who would’ve thought that he could use it once while cooped up in the Political Hostage Manor? Moreover, he had actually used it on a Foundation Building cultivator!","This, this, this, this, if word got out, he would become a joke for all eternity.","“Who would’ve thought? You actually have a Spiritual Power Spirit Tool!” he said through gritted teeth. His heart was bleeding. He hadn’t obtained anything, and he had even made a fool of himself. As a result, he had lost one use of the rare treasure instead.","Ling Han raised the Heavenly Pattern Jade slightly, “What is it? Want to do it again?”","Zhao Xiao’s expression changed drastically, filled with wariness.","Not only was Ling Han’s power so strong that it didn’t seem like a Foundation Building cultivator’s, but his insight was also far too terrifying. It was as if he didn’t have any secrets to speak of in front of Ling Han, and Ling Han knew his every move like the back of his hand. Added with the threat of the Heavenly Pattern Jade, he was no match for Ling Han at all.","If they continued fighting, not only would he not be able to suppress his opponent, he would instead exhaust all his rare treasures.","He suddenly turned around. Xiu, with a leap, he had already left the battlefield, and did not even leave behind a word of courtesy.","True, faced with a Foundation Building Tier cultivator, no matter what he said, it would only be embarrassing.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He turned around, and saw Liu Xunyu.","Her expression was quite ugly, because she had used all her tricks. She thought that she had already taken control of Ling Han, yet had forgotten the most crucial link, and that was Ling","Han’s own strength.","Originally, there was no need to consider this at all. How could a mere Foundation Building cultivator be as strong as the heavens?","However, how could there be such strange things in this world? This Foundation Building Tier cultivator was truly heaven-defyingly powerful. He could even scare off a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator.","-Though Zhao Xiao was only Human Cauldron Tier as well, and had even only formed two cauldron legs.","It should be known that her cultivation level was only that of a Human Cauldron. Though she had formed three legs, which was slightly superior to Zhao Xiao, the degree of superiority was","really limited.","What was she supposed to do?","At first, she had thought that Ling Han was a trapped bird, but now, he was a trapped beast. Once this trapped beast wanted to fight to the death, that was definitely no joke.","For the first time, she felt that the situation had spiraled out of control.","Ling Han only gave her a meaningful smile before leaving.","Now, he was filled with confidence.","His individual battle prowess was already just barely close to reaching the level of the Cauldron Forging Tier. Though it still couldn’t be considered a match, it wouldn’t be to the extent that he would be insta-killed by a sneak attack from such an elite. Then, as long as he was given time to react, whether it was using the Heavenly Dao Flames to destroy the enemy, or using the Imminent Skyline to flee, it was all possible.","Everyone watched as Ling Han left. They knew that Liu Xunyu, Han Bing and Zhao Xiao, the three big shots, were not the only ones in the Jia Yuan Manor now. There was also Ling Han. Though he had not yet advanced into Cauldron Forging Tier, he was no longer inferior. Moreover, once Ling Han broke through to the Cauldron Forging Tier, who would be able to","rival him?","This was the most terrifying part!","Everyone looked at each other, and felt that they needed to change their way of thinking. They could no longer follow Liu Xunyu and the others all the way to the end. This was obviously","better to follow Ling Han.","Instantly, a great many people quietly slipped away.","Ling Han returned to his room, and saw seven people quietly arrive. Subtly and openly, they expressed their desire to follow him.","He neither accepted nor rejected them. He only said that he would make a decision based on the performance of these people.","He did not have much interest in this kind of opportunistic people, but it was fine to use them","to disgust Liu Xunyu.","What Ling Han cared about the most was still the competition that would be held in a few","days’ time.","Day after day passed, and Liu Xunyu and the others were all very silent. Perhaps they knew that they could do nothing against Ling Han, and were presently thinking of an even more","vicious plan.","However, the Emperor’s thirty thousandth birthday had finally arrived, and the Imperial","Capital was filled with jubilation.","Tang Yan came personally to pick Ling Han up. With him by his side, even if Meng Shuchang came, so what? He would still dare to bring him out."]},{"number":3768,"title":"Chapter 3768: You are about to meet your match","paragraphs":["Chapter 3768: You are about to meet your match","Ling Han and Tang Yan left the Political Hostage Manor and headed to the location of the tournament.","Previously, Tang Yan had already registered for him. Thus, Ling Han only had to announce his name now, and after testing his cultivation level, he could begin the competition.","On the surface, the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire was a Sect Master-level force, but in secret, there was also a Venerate Tier overseer. From a certain aspect, this could even compare to the Holy Land of Metal Element. The difference was that the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire had too few Venerate Tiers, only one, and they didn’t have a Saint Tool, so they couldn’t be everlasting.","—Just look, what force would invade the Holy Land? Whether or not there was a Saint overseeing things, the Holy Land was still so high and mighty, and could not be violated.","This was their background.","The Azure Dragon Majestic Empire was already powerful enough. Not only had the various planets subordinate to it sent mighty figures over to celebrate His Majesty’s birthday, but even the forces of many galaxies had sent envoys.","Meanwhile, the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire also halted their invasion. In fact, they even sent envoys over.","On the surface, it was obviously to celebrate his birthday, but in truth, they wanted to investigate the situation of that old Venerate Tier from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, to see how serious his injuries were, and how much battle prowess he still had left.","If this Venerate Tier was already done for, then the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire would increase its offensive when it returned, swallowing more resources of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire.","Even though there were nine days of screening time, in truth, because there were too many people participating, they all wanted to show off in front of Meng Yonghua. Thus, the competition was still very fierce, and there were too many people who had to be eliminated.","In the first round, it would be a direct battle royale, and 90% of the participants would be eliminated.","The rules were very simple. There would be ten people in a group, and only one person would be able to walk out.","The tournament began, and Ling Han pounced out like a fierce tiger.","“Aiyo!” Tang Yan couldn’t help but press a hand on his forehead. You, an alchemist, have to be so fierce? Couldn’t you have kept a low profile, and let others fight to the death, and then calmly take advantage of the situation in the end? Now that you are the first to charge out, you naturally have become the first to stick out your head. If they don’t hit you, who would they hit?","As expected, the other nine people were on guard against each other at first, and no one dared to act rashly, but now that Ling Han had rushed out, he naturally became the target of everyone.","Everyone moved one after another, blasting towards Ling Han.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and with a sweep of his leg, peng, peng, peng, the force of the kick swept past. Like an autumn wind sweeping away fallen leaves, the nine people were all sent flying. Like a celestial maiden scattering flowers, they fell from the skies, and not one of them could get back to their feet.","It was just a kick, and he had dealt with all of them. F***!","Tang Yan couldn’t help but stare in shock. If it were him, even if he suppressed his cultivation level to Ultimate Dao Foundation, he would still be able to easily defeat those nine people. After all, there were all kinds of people mixed together. With so many Foundation Building Tier cultivators participating in the competition, how many prodigies could actually participate?","However, Ling Han was different. He was an alchemist, and a grandmaster that was destined to become an Earth Tier High Grade alchemist .","How could there be someone who was both dazzlingly talented in alchemy and brilliantly talented in martial arts?","He realized that he had still underestimated the value of Ling Han.","After Ling Han won, he had about ten minutes’ time to rest before starting the next battle.","This time, it was not a group fight, but a one-on-one battle. His opponent had also just emerged victorious from the ten-man battle.","Tang Yan was no longer worried, and merely watched quietly.","As expected, Ling Han was invincible, and there was no one that could match him in ten moves. Usually, he would be able to deal with his opponent in five to six moves, and even the hardest to deal with would not be able to block ten moves from him.","And this was still because Ling Han had deliberately gone easy on him. Otherwise, if he unleashed his full battle prowess, it was probable that only around a thousand people in the Foundation Building Tier of Galaxy Network would be able to block one move from him. A hundred people would be able to block ten moves from him, and there would only be about ten people that could truly fight him head-on.","However, Ling Han believed that he would definitely be the final victor.","After this day’s battle, Tang Yan did not send Ling Han back to the Political Hostage Manor, but rather to his Marquis Residence.","As a titled Marquis, he had his own manor. Though it was far from being comparable to the Tang Clan Manor, it still occupied an extremely large area and was glorious.","“It’s all right if I don’t go back?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“It’s all right. I don’t believe that Meng Shuchang would dare to come to my place and demand for your return,” Tang Yan said domineeringly. He had already sent someone to inform Jia Yuan Manor that Ling Han would be a guest at his residence tonight.","On the second day, after Ling Han finished cultivating, he began to battle again. Sweeping, sweeping, sweeping. There was absolutely no one that could be Ling Han’s match, even if as time passed, the opponents he encountered became more and more powerful.","Nine days passed in the blink of an eye, and Ling Han also emerged victorious, becoming one of the final competitors.","And his opponent was Wang Yafei.","“You will meet your match tomorrow.” Tang Yan said seriously, “This Wang Yafei is not so simple. Though he is not an Innate Divine Physique, he has fused with the remains of an ancient great elite. His battle prowess is considerably frightening, and is at least comparable to a sixth grade Divine Physique. Furthermore, he has been suppressing his cultivation level without breaking through, and that is because he wants to become famous through a battle at His Majesty’s birthday banquet, so that his name would soar sky-high.” “Though the Wang Clan is only a True Self Tier force, they have clearly prepared for today for a very, very long time. Even if I step out... they probably won’t give me face either.” Ling Han cracked a smile, “It’s all right. I was worried that my opponent wasn’t strong enough. That would be so boring.”","Tang Yan couldn’t help but be rendered speechless. After a while, he finally said, “That guy has stayed at the peak stage of the Ultimate Dao Foundation for at least thirty years. It’s not that he doesn’t have the ability to cross over, but that he has been suppressing it all this while. Furthermore, the Wang Clan has even been preparing this matter since fifty years ago. Thus, they must have prepared a great many powerful rare treasures for Wang Yafei. Additionally, they must have studied the images of your battles these few days thoroughly.” Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh loudly. In the past few days, he had only been casually battling, because his opponent was too weak. He didn’t need to use his full strength at all. “You’re still in the mood to laugh?” Tang Yan shook his head, and said, “His Majesty is an extremely competitive person, so in his eyes, the second place is nothing but bullsh*t. Only the victor deserves to be rewarded. Thus, even if you fight so hard all the way to the finals, if you lose, you are still bullsh*t.”","Ling Han patted Tang Yan’s shoulder and said, “I said don’t worry, so just relax. It’s fine.","Believe me.”","Tang Yan pondered for a moment before saying, “Just you wait. I’ll return to the clan to see if","I can find you some rare treasures.”","He left just like that, energetically.","At midnight, Tang Yan returned again, stuffing a sword and a cloak into Ling Han’s hands.","“This is the Star Fragment Sword, and it’s extremely sharp. After you activate it with your mystical power, you’ll be able to unleash a devastating Sword Qi. It’s similarly indestructible,” Tang Yan explained. “Also, this is the Blood Moon Cloak. It was personally refined by the ancestor of the Tang Clan. It can activate the Blood Moon Shield, and even Cauldron Forging Tiers need some time to blast it open.”","“However, the Blood Moon Cloak needs to be instilled with power beforehand. At most, it can","only activate the shield twice. Take it easy.”","Ling Han didn’t need these two treasures at all, but since Tang Yan was so cordial, he couldn’t bring himself to refuse. Thus, he accepted them, and said, “All right.”"]},{"number":3769,"title":"Chapter 3769: Day of the Final Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 3769: Day of the Final Battle","For many people, this was a very difficult night to endure. Tomorrow was the day of Meng Yonghua’s birthday, and perhaps, it would decide the future prosperity and decline of the Majestic Empire.","It was not just the situation of that old Venerate Tier, but also the next generation of the Meng Clan. Would they be able to produce a prodigy? Otherwise, the Meng Clan would not be able to walk very far either. When the older generation of elites gradually withered, and there was no successor, the Meng Clan would naturally have no choice but to walk to the end of its line.","Yet Ling Han slept soundly. When he woke up the next day, he was very energized.","Meng Yonghua’s birthday banquet was scheduled for tonight, so he still had a lot of time to cultivate in the face of the rising sun. Then, he began to concoct alchemical pills.","In the battles of the last nine days, though his opponents were all weaklings, he had also completely familiarized himself with his own strength, and had already adapted to the new cultivation level.","When they were eating breakfast, Tang Yan’s expression was not very good.","“Yesterday, I sent someone to investigate Wang Yafei’s situation, and found out at least one of his trump cards,” he said solemnly. “He has a treasure called the Celestial Descent Silver Water Bottle. It was forged as a replica of a seven-star precious tool. Though its might cannot be compared to the original item, it is said that it can reach the might of Pseudo Cauldron Forging Tier.”","“Once you’re locked onto, you’ll be drawn into the treasure bottle and directly refined into a pool of blood!”","“Let me warn you, His Majesty... only cares about the victor. Thus, even if you’re taken into the treasure bottle and lost, His Majesty will still ignore you. In his eyes, there’s only the victor.”","“So, if you lose, it’s very likely that you’ll lose your life as well.”","“Furthermore, His Majesty hates cowards the most. If you admit defeat, you may be bestowed death by His Majesty.”","Ling Han couldn’t help but laugh in spite of himself, saying, “In your eyes, I’m definitely dead, right? There’s nothing to look forward to at all.”","Tang Yan’s expression was solemn, “Now that things have come to this, there is no turning back for you. Sigh, I do not expect you to win either, as long as you can save your life. It is my fault. I should not have mentioned this matter to you at all.”","“Don’t, that Wang Yafei or whatever, I can deal with him with a single punch, so why is there so much fuss!” Ling Han smiled, comforting Tang Yan.","Yet Tang Yan could not let it go at all. This Celestial Descent Silver Water Bottle was only a rare treasure that he had found out about. Who knew how many more treasures Wang Yafei had on him?","The Wang Clan had already planned for a very, very long time for today. They were determined to get the final victory.","Soon, it was noon, then afternoon, and evening.","No matter how unwilling Tang Yan was, he had to bring Ling Han with him, and set out towards the Imperial Palace.","Not going?","That was a crime of deceiving the Emperor!","Oh, you have fought your way all the way here, yet dropped the ball at the most crucial moment. Wasn’t that a slap to His Majesty’s face?","After arriving at the Imperial Palace, Ling Han and Tang Yan separated. He had to make some preparations, change his clothes, and prepare to take the field for the final battle.","“Humph, humph!” Ling Han was just walking, when two cold laughs rang out from behind him.","He turned around to look. Oh, wasn’t this Ge Shuang?","“Ling Han, you’re dead meat today!” Ge Shuang’s face was filled with delight at Ling Han’s misfortune.","After returning to the Imperial Capital, he kept trying to make connections, hoping that he could enter into the Political Hostage Manor and give Ling Han a harsh beating. However, when others heard that it was the Political Hostage Manor, they all shook their heads in refusal.","Although it was a prison, it was imprisoning envoys from various nations. Moreover, it was under the jurisdiction of the Clan Mansion. The waters were very deep, so who would be willing to interfere?","Thus, he hated Ling Han to death, yet couldn’t do anything at all.","Right until now, when he discovered that Ling Han was actually a match for Wang Yafei, he was instantly amused.","He was dead. This time, Ling Han was definitely going to die.","He was afraid that Ling Han would be directly beaten to death by Wang Yafei, so he hurriedly ran over. He wanted to use this time to strike a blow on Ling Han’s pride. Otherwise, he would not have another chance in the future.","Ling Han merely smiled faintly, “When did you become a fortune-teller? Furthermore, with your standards, I guarantee that you will starve yourself to death.”","Ge Shuang couldn’t help but choke. This guy still had such a toxic tongue.","“Humph, you can only talk tough for a while now. After a while, you will become a corpse. Furthermore, hehe, who knows, you may not even be able to leave a whole corpse behind,” he","said, smiling.","“Don’t worry, you’ll definitely see me again.” Ling Han waved his hand, indicating for the person leading the way to continue walking.","Ge Shuang didn’t stop him. He had already said what he needed to say. Next, he only had to admire Ling Han’s death.","Ling Han stroked his chin as he walked. Was this Wang Yafei really so powerful? There was actually no one that had high hopes for him?","Additionally, the underground casino had also placed bets on the final battle between him and Wang Yafei. There were no stakes for Wang Yafei’s victory at all, but rather stakes for winning within ten seconds, winning within a minute, and so on, which showed just how pessimistic they were about him.","Ling Han had already told the large black dog to bet on his victory. This was a good opportunity to make money.","Looks like he had been too low-key.","He prepared himself in the resting room. Even if there were a great many walls separating them, he could still hear the noise outside. Clearly, this was a very lively time.","After a while, someone came over to call out that he could go up onto the stage to battle.","He walked out. There was no need for anyone to lead the way, because there was only one","path.","“...He is, Ling Han!” Someone was presently introducing him outside. The instant Ling Han stepped out, his name had also spread throughout the entire tournament grounds.","Ling Han swept his gaze around. He was presently in the area where the tournament was held. The tournament ground was surrounded by a high platform, which had formed a circle, layered on top of each other. And on his left side, there was a platform sticking out of the air, at least a few hundred meters off the ground. If one’s vision was slightly poorer, they would not be able to see the situation below if they were to sit on it.","The person seated on it was the current emperor of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, Meng Yonghua, who was also the main character of today’s birthday celebration.","“Now, let us welcome the other contestant, Wang Yafei from the Wang Clan!” the host called out again, slightly hysterical.","At this moment, the doors to the other passageway of the tournament ground opened, and a young man with a dark expression walked out.","The moment Wang Yafei appeared, he knelt towards the high platform, and shouted at the loudest volume, “This subject, Wang Yafei, will definitely obtain victory for Your Majesty!”","‘F*ck you! What do you mean by achieving victory for Your Majesty? You’re clearly doing this","for yourself!’","Ling Han mocked internally. This guy really knew how to curry favor. It was practically","sickening.","“Hahaha!” A loud laugh rang out from the high platform. Obviously, Meng Yonghua was in a","good mood.","“Then, let the tournament begin!” the host roared.","Wang Yafei immediately charged over from the other side. His speed was extremely fast. A second ago, he was at least a few thousand meters away, but an instant later, he had already appeared no more than thirty meters in front of Ling Han.","“Use your full strength. Otherwise, you won’t be able to show how powerful I am!” he said","haughtily.","This scene was captured and projected from the skies, magnified a few hundred times over. It was the same for the sound, which was seen and heard by everyone. Instantly, a great many","people screamed shrilly.","He was too domineering."]},{"number":3770,"title":"Chapter 3770: Collecting treasures","paragraphs":["Chapter 3770: Collecting treasures","“That won’t do.” Ling Han shook his head seriously.","Everyone booed. This guy was too cowardly, wasn’t he? They hadn’t even started fighting, and he was already showing weakness.","On the high platform, Meng Yonghua also revealed an expression of displeasure. He had been an iron-blooded ruler all his life, and hated this kind of spineless person the most.","Furthermore, he actually cowered at his birthday banquet, causing his killing intent to instantly rise.","Ling Han said slowly, “I’m afraid that if I go all out, I’ll accidentally beat you to death.”","Everyone faltered for a moment before bursting into laughter.","This was too funny. As it turned out, this guy was not afraid, but had rather laid out a trap with his words.","Meng Yonghua also revealed a smile, and said to the person beside him, “Young people nowadays are quite interesting.”","The person next to him was none other than Tang Lei, the current clan leader of the Tang Clan. He was also Tang Yan’s grandfather.","To be able to sit beside Meng Yonghua at this time, it was clear how much the Tang Clan and Tang Lei were doted on with imperial favour.","“Your Majesty is right,” Tang Lei said with a smile, but he was complaining internally. Who was the one who had said that he would drag Ling Han out and kill him after the tournament was over?","Below him, Wang Yafei revealed a baleful expression. This guy actually dared to snatch his limelight?","How long had the Wang Clan prepared for today’s battle? And how much suffering had he suffered because of this?","He should be the only star, and be the sole focus of everyone’s attention.","“Damn guy!” he said in a low voice. Xiu! With a flash, he charged towards Ling Han.","This despicable guy, just die.","He dismissed the idea of pretending that the two of them were evenly matched, and only after gaining everyone’s attention, would he then defeat Ling Han.","Boom, his whole body was exuding blazing light. Multiple seals bloomed, some complete, and some shattered. However, the strange thing was that the shattered seals actually looked even more terrifying than the complete seals, filled with astonishing destructive power.","On the spectators’ seats, even Meng Yonghua nodded. “This brat from the Wang Clan is quite diligent. It’s not easy to cultivate such battle prowess at the Foundation Building Tier.” “Hehe, His Majesty is really praising him too much.” Tang Lei laughed loudly, “If it was you back then, wouldn’t you be a hundred times stronger than this brat from the Wang Clan?”","Meng Yonghua couldn’t help but stroke his beard and smile, feeling very pleased with this flattery.","Boom! Wang Yafei charged over with this attack.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and casually threw a punch in response.","He did not need to use any kind of celestial technique. It was just the most ordinary and simple punch.","Peng, Wang Yafei was instantly sent flying, flying back at a faster speed than he had come. Furthermore, multiple seals exploded, as if fireworks had been lit.","At first, the whole area was filled with cheers, cheering for Wang Yafei. After all, this was a proper citizen of the Imperial Capital, and Ling Han was only a hostage that had come from another planet. Thus, when they saw this scene, everyone’s mouths were half-gaping, completely dumbfounded.","That was Wang Yafei, and he had actually been sent flying with a single punch!","It should be known that Ling Han did not look like he had used any kind of celestial technique. He had sent Wang Yafei flying with an ordinary punch. How could they accept this?","“You-“Wang Yafei turned around, and steadied his footing. He glared fiercely at Ling Han, revealing a powerful expression of fury.","He had not been injured by this blow, but felt even worse than if he had been severely injured.","In full public, especially when Meng Yonghua was still watching from above, he was sent flying with a single punch, revealing an ugly side of him.","How humiliating.","“You deserve to die!” he roared loudly, and directly used his trump card. A white jade bottle appeared in his hand.","Celestial Descent Silver Water Bottle.","Xiu, he only felt his vision blur, and saw that Ling Han was already standing in front of him. He paled in shock, and was just about to draw out the treasure bottle to suck Ling Han in, when he felt that his hand was empty.","Yi, where was the treasure bottle?","“How do I use this?” Ling Han asked Wang Yafei as he toyed with the Celestial Descent Silver Water Bottle that he had just snatched.","‘F*ck! When was it taken?’","Wang Yafei paled in shock. The treasure in his hands had actually been taken without his knowledge. Just how wide was the gap in strength?","How was this possible?","He had made so many preparations for today, and had also entered into the final battle as expected, but why had he encountered such a freak?","On the spectators’ seats, everyone was also stunned.","Why did they feel like Wang Yafei was just a child in front of Ling Han? He was completely no match for him. Wang Yafei had been sent flying with a single punch, and his treasure had been snatched away in a single move. How was he supposed to fight him?","“Give it back to me!” Wang Yafei shouted loudly.","“I can hear you. There’s no need to be so loud,” Ling Han said with a smile, as he continued to play with the treasure bottle.","“Retrieve!” Wang Yafei revealed a baleful expression. Do you think that this treasure bottle can only show its might in his hands?","Wrong, he had long since infused a sliver of divine sense into the treasure bottle, so he could activate it with a single thought.","Instantly, a field of light surged out of the treasure bottle, wrapping around Ling Han.","Wang Yafei laughed loudly. As long as he was enveloped by this light, he would be drawn into the treasure bottle. Terrifying formation patterns would intertwine, forcibly melting him","into a pool of blood.","“What are you laughing at?” Ling Han’s voice suddenly traveled over. “Have you gone stupid, child? You can laugh for no reason.”","What!","Wang Yafei revealed a terrified expression. Why hadn’t Ling Han been taken into the treasure","bottle yet?","“Truly disappoints me.” Ling Han shook his head. Pa, he squeezed hard, and this treasure bottle was forcibly crushed by him. This couldn’t reach the might of the Pseudo Cauldron Forging Tier at all. At most, it was equivalent to a four star Ultimate Dao Foundation.","A battle prowess of four stars was already very impressive. That was why Tang Yan had said that this was the might of Pseudo Cauldron Forging Tier, because there were only a handful of people in the Azure Dragon Empire that had reached the level of a four-star genius in the","Majestic Empire.","“Is there any more?” Ling Han casually tossed the shards of the treasure bottle onto the ground as he looked at Wang Yafei expectantly.","What kind of mockery was this?","Wang Yafei roared loudly, and retreated continuously, putting an absolute distance between","himself and Ling Han. Then, he took out a fan. As mystical power surged in, it immediately","emitted a black light.","He raised his hand, wanting to fan Ling Han. However, there was a blur before his eyes, and a","person had already appeared before him.","‘Motherf*cker!’","An ominous feeling welled up in his heart. As expected, the fan in his hand was already gone.","“It shouldn’t be difficult to use this, right?” Ling Han also injected his mystical power into the fan. The fan that had just dimmed immediately lit up again, and then waved lightly at","Wang Yafei.","Peng, Wang Yafei was sent flying again.","The powerful hurricane winds turned into multiple small blades that sliced at Wang Yafei’s","body. In just an instant, his clothes had all turned into pieces, and countless wounds had also appeared on his body. Thankfully, because of these wounds, his body was covered with blood,","blocking some important parts.","Oh, this fan was quite powerful.","Ling Han put away the fan. He didn’t need it, but he could leave it for the empress, Hu Niu,","and the others.","“Is there anything else?” he asked.","“Give it back to me!” Wang Yafei’s face turned green. Do you think I’m a wealth-delivering","boy?","He charged over without any regard for anything else. Multiple veined patterns were glowing on his body, making it seem as if he had become a demon god."]},{"number":3771,"title":"Chapter 3771: Broke through? Still beat him flat","paragraphs":["Chapter 3771: Broke through? Still beat him flat","“Yafei, Yafei has cultivated to the fourth level of the Blood God Path!” On the spectators’ seats, an old man shouted, filled with pleasant surprise.","He was the clan leader of the Wang Clan, Wang Haowen. At first, his face was already as black as ink, but when he saw this scene, it suddenly bloomed, filled with pleasant surprise.","The Wang Clan was not a very strong, or very weak clan on the Moonlight Planet. In these tens of thousands of years, there had been no improvement. In Wang Haowen’s generation, he worked hard to change the current situation, and when Wang Yafei was born, he felt that his dream could be realized.","Wang Yafei, his natural talent in cultivation was astonishing, and his potential was boundless.","For his sake, the Wang Clan had paid an unknown price. They had practically gone bankrupt, and had gotten him a bone from an ancient elite. Then, they had asked a great elite to move, and fuse that bone with Wang Yafei, so that it would become a part of him.","It was definitely not a waste to pay such a great price. Wang Yafei perfectly fused with this bone, and also obtained a secret technique from within. It was called the Blood God Path, and was the celestial technique that the original owner of the bone had cultivated when he was alive.","There were a total of 36 levels in the Blood God Path. With every additional level he grasped, his battle prowess would double, or even more. However, even if Wang Yafei’s natural talent in martial arts was astonishing, after so many years, he had only grasped the first three levels of the Blood God Path. And if he cultivated the Blood God Path, it would be the most perfect thing for him to cultivate the first four levels in the Foundation Building Tier.","The reason why Wang Yafei had not broken through to the Cauldron Forging Tier was firstly, for the sake of this tournament, and secondly, because he had not cultivated to the fourth level of the Blood God Path.","Of course, to outsiders, it definitely could not be said to be the latter reason.","And now, Wang Yafei actually broke through during battle, and cultivated to the fourth level of the Blood God Path. Not only did this give him hope of turning the tables, he had also cultivated the Foundation Building Tier to Consummate level.","With this double happiness, Wang Haowen would definitely be filled with endless, pleasant surprise.","He looked at Ling Han balefully. This brat was definitely going to die.","In the arena, Wang Yafei was also taken aback. He had broken through in his fury, and even he himself had not realized it. When he realized it suddenly, he even stopped his attack.","Boom, the power in his body surged, making him feel that he was inconceivably strong.","Ling Han or whatever, would all be killed with a single palm strike.","“Humph, I really have to thank you!” Wang Yafei said calmly. Now, he felt that everything had returned to his control.","Ling Han smiled and said, “You keep gifting me things, and you still want to thank me? This child, has his head been smashed? Forgive me for my sins!”","||","“You can talk tough now, but when I dismember you piece by piece, you’ll know regret.’ Wang Yafei roared fiercely, and grabbed his left wrist with his right hand. With a sudden pull, the entire left hand, along with the bones in his arm, was pulled out.","Strangely, there was actually not the slightest bit of blood spewing out from the severed wrist. Furthermore, it was as white as jade, and strangely shaped like a sword. Not only was it sharper than the normal bone, it was also longer.","This was the bone of the elite that he had fused together with. After so many years, he had actually cultivated it into a Spirit Tool. Furthermore, it had completely fused with his own body. It was his personal Spirit Tool, and he was more proficient in using it than any other weapon.","“This is the Blood Bone Sword, which I have refined with my own blood essence. No one has ever seen it before,” Wang Yafei declared proudly, “You are the first person to have seen it, and also the first person to have had your blood drunk by it!”","Ling Han sighed, “Your brain is indeed damaged! There are at least tens of thousands of people here, and they all saw this sword at the same time. It’s not just the two of us. Sigh, your intelligence is worrying!”","Wang Yafei was furious. Even at a time like this, Ling Han still dared to joke around. Really!","Gritting his teeth, he said, “When the flesh on your body is sliced off piece by piece, I hope you can still have such a toxic mouth!”","He raised the Blood Bone Sword high, and streams of black Qi surged out of his body, boiling, making him seem as if he had turned into a Demon God.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He used the Imminent Skyline, and instantly appeared in front of Wang Yafei. Then, with a light stretch of his hand, he snatched the Blood Bone Sword.","Wang Yafei was stunned. Why had his sword been snatched?","‘How the f*ck are you so fast?’","I have clearly already broken through in battle, and reached the fourth level of the Blood God Path. My abilities have improved astonishingly, but why am I still unable to see how Ling Han approaches, or how he makes his move?","“So disgusting!” Ling Han originally wanted to study the bone sword, but this sword hilt was actually a hand, and the fingers were still moving, desperately trying to break free, making Ling Han feel extremely disgusted.","Pa, with a toss, he threw out the bone sword.","This!","When everyone saw this scene, their faces twitched, feeling an indescribable pain in their b*lls.","At this moment, there were definitely 10,000 curse words racing through Wang Yafei’s mind. He had clearly used an ultimate move and was about to explode, but in front of Ling Han, it was like child’s play.","This wasn’t a confrontation on the same level at all. It was like a child being aggressive and taking out all kinds of toy weapons to threaten the adult, but in the eyes of the adult, this was just playing house and playing around.","Shouldn’t the finals be evenly matched and extremely exciting? Why was it now so one-sided?","On the spectators’ seats, Wang Haowen looked like he had swallowed a fly, feeling extremely","terrible.","If he could, he would definitely charge into the arena and tear Ling Han to shreds.","How could this be?","Just how many resources had the Wang Clan invested in Wang Yafei? Yet in the end, he couldn’t even be considered Ling Han’s opponent, and had completely become a laughing","stock.","This was definitely not because Wang Yafei was not strong, but rather because Ling Han was freakishly strong.","-How could there be such a freak in this world?","Was the heavens planning to stop the rise of the Wang Clan?","Wang Yafei roared, and even the Celestial Foundation was summoned. It was a silver square stone, with ancient patterns on it. He controlled the Celestial Foundation to smash it towards Ling Han, a tragic expression on his face.","The Celestial Foundation was the core of the Foundation Building Tier. Once the foundation stone of the Celestial Path was damaged, the cultivator’s cultivation level would also drop, and he might even decline to the mortal level.","Thus, unleashing his Celestial Foundation to battle was also the cultivator’s final gamble.","Ling Han was cold, and shot out a punch, which landed on the Celestial Foundation. Peng, the Celestial Foundation was instantly sent flying, and Wang Yafei also looked as if he had been severely injured, his face incredibly pale.","He and the Celestial Foundation were one and the same. There was no need to look to know that at this moment, a few cracks had already appeared on the Celestial Foundation.","What terrifying power of the punch.","The toughness of the Celestial Foundation was comparable to a Celestial Foundation of the same cultivation level. Yet, Ling Han’s punch was able to cause cracks to appear on the Celestial Foundation. Just how terrifying was his power, and just how terrifying was its","sturdiness?","He gritted his teeth, and summoned the Celestial Foundation back, which then blasted towards Ling Han.","He had lived his whole life for today. If he didn’t become number one, he would rather die","tragically.","Ling Han shook his head internally. He was a little impressed by Wang Yafei’s determination, but he actually built his life on the words of appreciation from others. This was too stupid. Furthermore, Wang Yafei was not a good person either. Every time he opened and closed his mouth, he would say that he wanted to kill him, and cut off his flesh, which made him unable","to feel any sympathy at all.","He threw another punch, and added a little more force. Peng, Wang Yafei and the Celestial Foundation were both sent flying. This time, he could no longer get back to his feet."]},{"number":3772,"title":"Chapter 3772: Crimson Captain","paragraphs":["Chapter 3772: Crimson Captain","“What an exciting battle, too exciting!” The host called out loudly, “And now, the top victor of today has finally appeared, and that is Ling – Han—”","Following his near-hysterical roar, thunderous cheers also sounded from the spectators’ seats.","“Ling Han performed very well. I am very pleased, and bestow upon him the title of Crimson Captain, serving in the Heaven Military Manor.” An incredibly majestic voice rang out from the spectators’ seats, booming and mighty. It was the current emperor of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, Meng Yonghua.","A smile tugged at the corners of Ling Han’s lips. He had been conferred the title of Captain, and was now working in the government. Thus, he naturally had a grand reason to leave the Political Hostage Manor.","He raised his clasped hands, and said, “Thank you, Your Majesty.”","“En?” On the spectators’ seats, Meng Yonghua showed a hint of displeasure.","Tang Lei, who was beside him, hurriedly said, “Your Majesty, the Dark North Nation is primitive and uncivilized. When the citizens see the emperor, they all clasp their hands in greeting.”","Meng Yonghua finally felt at ease, and said with a smile, “As expected of an outsider.”","“In future, the Dark North Nation will be able to bask in the blessings of our Empire, and will definitely develop gradually, and would not be so primitive and backward,” Tang Lei said with a smile.","He knew that Tang Yan was on good terms with Ling Han, and Ling Han was indeed worth befriending. That was why he had repeatedly exonerated Ling Han.","“Hahaha!” Meng Yonghua laughed loudly, appearing to be very happy.","On the spectators’ seats, some were shouting in excitement, but there were also some that were incredibly dejected. That was because they had all betted on how much time Wang Yafei would win in the underground gambling house. They had not thought that not only would Wang Yafei not win, he would lose so terribly instead. It could be said that they had been horribly screwed over.","There was also Ge Shuang, whose expression was dark, almost dripping ink.","At first, he had hoped that Wang Yafei would kill Ling Han and avenge him, but who would have thought that Wang Yafei would actually be so weak?","And he called himself the top elite of the Foundation Building Tier? This was absolute","nonsense.","And in the Imperial Family seats, Meng Yangcheng’s expression was also incredibly ugly. He naturally recognized Ling Han. In the past, in order to compete for the Buddhist Race’s opportunity, he had come to blows with Ling Han. In the end, he had almost been killed. If it was not for the fact that he had a few subordinates who were desperately blocking for him, he would have long since died—he naturally would not admit that it was he who had actually sucked dry the mystical power of the few servants.","This brat was really outrageously bold. He actually dared to come here?","He wanted nothing more than to immediately step forward and kill Ling Han, but what kind of place was this? Furthermore, Meng Yonghua had personally bestowed an official rank on Ling Han. If he dared to make a move, then losing the right to inherit would be a small matter. If it was serious, he might even be executed.","-With Meng Yonghua’s temperamental nature, this was not impossible.","Thus, he could only endure for now. However, since he had discovered Ling Han, he would definitely not let Ling Han have a good time in the following days, right until... Ling Han died. The battle had ended, but Meng Yonghua’s birthday banquet naturally didn’t. Afterward, there was still the final battle of the Cauldron Forging Tier elites, as well as the activities of the diplomatic missions of the various nations. In short, the commotion would continue until midnight tonight, at least.","Ling Han was fine. He returned to the resting area.","After a long time, Tang Yan finally came to look for him.","“You, so your battle prowess is actually so high!” He punched Ling Han’s chest, “You hadn’t told me earlier, making me worry for so long.”","Ling Han laughed loudly, “I have always told you not to worry, yet you insist on worrying for no reason.”","“All right, all right, all right. It’s my fault, all right?” Tang Yan said with a smile. He was also in a very good mood. Ling Han had gotten the first place, and had even been bestowed an official position by the Emperor. Now, would the Clan Mansion still dare to control Ling Han? “You’re leaving tomorrow to assume your post immediately. Do you want me to send you off?” he asked.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “As the Little Marquis, you aren’t a very idle person, so I won’t trouble you with everything.”","“All right, I’ll find you for some tea later.” Tang Yan nodded. In any case, Ling Han had already left the Political Hostage Manor and become a free man, so it would be easy for them to get together.","After the birthday banquet ended, Ling Han returned to the Political Hostage Manor. He had just entered, when he saw a great many people offering their congratulations.","As it turned out, the fact that he had been appointed as an official by Meng Yonghua had already spread throughout the entire Imperial Capital. Even this Political Hostage Manor was no exception.","This was awesome. Just look, everyone were still hostages, but Ling Han had already been personally bestowed the title of an official by the emperor of the Majestic Empire. The gap between them was as wide as the gap between heaven and earth.","They definitely had to befriend this kind of person. To say nothing else, it would be good for them to have a few more days of freedom.","On the other hand, Liu Xunyu and the others all bore ugly expressions, wanting nothing more than to swallow Ling Han whole and skin him alive.","How could they have imagined that even the Clan Mansion could not stop the rise of Ling","Han?","Now, they could only sit by and watch as Ling Han became stronger and stronger. An alchemy prodigy that could concoct the Foundation Dissolution Pill, Ling Han, had boundless future","prospects.","Ling Han swept an eye over these people, not bothering to stop at all. How could he possibly treat these few people as his opponents?","He stayed for a night, and on the morning of the second day, cultivated for a while. Then, he left proudly.","“Lord Ling!” The guards at the entrance naturally would not stop him. Instead, they greeted him obsequiously.","This young man was really too incredible. How many days had it been? And he had already walked out of the Political Hostage Manor. Who knows, he may be able to become a Marquis or Minister in future.","Ling Han smiled faintly, and strode away.","Behind him, Liu Xunyu, Zhao Xiao, Han Bing and Tan Zhengjie were all staring at him, their expressions icy cold.","“What should we do? Could it be that we are just going to sit by and watch him grow?” Tan Zheng Jie asked, unwilling to give up.","“If you have the ability, you can assassinate him tonight and drag him down with you.” Han Bing made a sarcastic remark, “Haven’t you always said that you want to sacrifice your life for Sister Liu? This is an extremely good opportunity, right?”","Tan Zhengjie’s expression instantly crumbled. Firstly, he did not want to die at all, and secondly, even if he did not care about his own safety, there was absolutely no way that he would be a match for Ling Han. He would only be committing suicide.","“All of you, speak less.” Liu Xunyu said in displeasure, “I will definitely think of a way. I will definitely not allow him to leave just like that!”","Zhao Xiao and Han Bing looked at each other, and both shook their heads secretly. By now, it was clear that Ling Han was out of control. Could it be that you want to go to the Heaven","Military Manor and solicit him again?","...","The Heaven Military Manor was the department that oversaw the security of the Imperial Capital, and the Imperial Capital was very, very big. Thus, the Heaven Military Manor had also established a considerable number of subbranches, each managing a small area.","Ling Han was bestowed the title of Crimson Captain. This was only a minor eighth-rank official position, and was not even qualified to be a leader at a branch of the Heaven Military","Manor.","He was assigned to the Great Peace Division. The leader of the division was a seventh-rank captain named Yan Lesheng. After meeting Ling Han, he appointed Ling Han as a captain of the division. However, because no captain had left the division previously, Ling Han’s current role as captain was actually an empty post. He didn’t have a single subordinate.","“A murder happened in Long Li, I’ll hand it over to you.” Yan Lesheng tossed over a scroll.","On the first day of work, there was already a mission.","Ling Han didn’t refuse. He accepted the scroll and started to flip through it.","“A murder has taken place in the Imperial Capital, and the nature of this crime is extremely","vile. I will give you ten days’ time. If you are unable to catch the culprit, you can resign on your own!” Yan Lesheng set a deadline for Ling Han."]},{"number":3773,"title":"Chapter 3773: Investigating the case","paragraphs":["Chapter 3773: Investigating the case","Wasn’t this making things difficult for him?","Ling Han didn’t have a single soldier under his command. Moreover, he had just arrived here, yet he actually wanted him to solve the crime within 10 days? How was he supposed to solve the crime?","Ling Han looked at Yan Lesheng, thinking that there was no animosity between them, so why was he digging a trap for him right from the start?","This wasn’t taking him down a notch, but rather giving him a hard time.","However... hoho.","Ling Han looked up, and said with a smile, “All right, I promise to complete the mission.”","“Then you may go.” Yan Lesheng waved his hand, “Make the most of your time. After all, human life is of utmost importance. As long as the culprit is not caught, who knows, there may be even more victims.”","Ling Han nodded, took the file, and left.","After Yan Lesheng left, he immediately opened the connection device and said, “Lord Ma, I’ve already handed the case over to him as per your wishes. In ten days, he definitely won’t be able to catch the culprit. I’ll immediately make him resign.”","...","Ling Han finished flipping through the file, and a thoughtful expression appeared on his face. Actually, there was not just one case of murder within this jurisdiction, but rather seven cases, and they had all happened within half a month’s time.","The first murder took place fifteen days ago, the second was ten days ago, and the third was seven days ago. Then, it became more and more frequent. In the last four days, a murder happened every day.","These murders were all believed to have been committed by the same culprit, because all the blood in the bodies of the victims had been drained.","The strange thing was that there was actually no drop of blood near the corpse.","Ling Han immediately set off, heading to the location of the first murder.","This was a man who lived alone. He was in his thirties, and his corpse had naturally been carried away long ago. Furthermore, because he didn’t have any family, this place was empty, filled with emptiness and coldness.","Ling Han circled around the room. The furnishings here were very simple, and very messy at that. However, it was not disorder caused by battle, but rather disorder caused by carelessness in tidying up.","After walking around for a while, he did not find any clues.","However, this didn’t matter.","Ling Han retrieved the Jade Toad. Right now, he could already use this treasure to perfection.","He placed the jade toad on the ground for a while, then put it away. He left the house, and headed to the quarters of the second victim.","The victim of this house was not single, but rather there was another man living there. The victim was his wife.","“Who are you?” Seeing Ling Han walk straight into the house, the man hurriedly asked.","Ling Han smiled and said, “I’m from the Heaven Military Manor, and I’ve come to investigate your wife’s case.”","“Another investigation,” the man muttered. “You guys come here every few days to investigate, but there’s still no result. What are you guys doing?”","“Don’t worry. Within three days, I will definitely give you justice,” Ling Han said calmly. That man raised his head to look at Ling Han, his face filled with disbelief.","What kind of joke was this? Previously, he had been given excuses and when he asked for progress, the reply was that they were investigating the case, yet you suddenly said that you would be able to find the culprit in three days?","Could this person... be a conman?","Ling Han smiled faintly, “I am not a conman. In any case, there are only three days, and you will soon find out.”","He took out the jade toad, and began to extract the aura of this place.","-The use of this jade toad was very simple, and that was to allow it to first absorb the smell, and then it would be able to follow the traces of aura, and he could begin his pursuit.","However, Ling Han made a comparison, and there were as many as eleven auras that overlapped.","The majority of them should be from the Heaven Military Manor, but was there any among them that had been left behind by the culprit?","Ling Han couldn’t be sure, because how long the smell could be preserved was determined by many conditions, such as whether the space was empty, the flow of air, or temperature. Perhaps the killer’s scent had long since disappeared, so these eleven auras were all left","behind by the guards of Heaven Military Manor.","He left, and went to the home of the third victim.","At this moment, only seven identical auras remained.","Ling Han spent half a day’s time to visit all the places where the seven victims had died, using the jade toad to memorize many auras.","Then, he returned to the branch division, and called over all the people who had participated in the investigation of the seven victims’ cases.","“Captain Ling, isn’t it a little unruly to call my subordinates over without asking first?”","Someone immediately came over and protested to Ling Han.","There were a total of thirteen small teams in this branch, and this person was the captain of the fourth team.","Ling Han smiled and said, “I’ll just borrow them for one minute.”","He used the jade toad to absorb their scents, then waved his hand, indicating that they could leave.","“What’s the meaning of this?” the captain of the fourth team asked in displeasure. Oh, he had called his subordinates over. Was it fun to cause so much trouble and then just dismiss them?","These are my people!","Ling Han glanced at him coldly, “I am investigating the case, yet you are holding me back. Could it be that you have some relation with the murderer?”","“You’re slandering me!” the captain of the fourth team shouted as he pointed at Ling Han. He couldn’t be blamed for this. Otherwise, not only would he lose his official position, but he would even be executed.","“Then shut up, and don’t hold me back!” Ling Han said balefully.","The captain of the fourth team was stunned by Ling Han’s aura, and actually forgot to refute","him. When he came back to his senses, his face was instantly flushed red.","They were both captains, and you are only a general without an army. What right do you have","to be fierce to me?","Ling Han summoned another soldier in charge of the case, comparing his aura.","It wasn’t long before he recorded everyone’s aura.","The captains of the 13 small teams were all extremely displeased. Ling Han didn’t even greet","them and directly called them over. It was unknown what he was doing.","But no matter what the matter was, you are stretching your hand too far! Usually, those captains would also be fighting over power, and their relations were actually very bad, but now, because of Ling Han, these people were all standing together.","“We can’t just let it go like this.”","“That’s right. Otherwise, this brat would think that we are easy to bully, and want to ride on","top of us.”","“We have to teach him a lesson!”","These small captains nodded one after another, then walked towards Ling Han.","“Captain Ling, let’s spar a bit,” someone said with a smile.","“That’s right, let’s go to the training ground.” Immediately, someone agreed.","“That’s right, that’s right. Let’s spar a bit, and improve our relations.”","Ling Han glanced at these 13 people, and asked with a smile, “You really want to spar?”","“What is it? Captain Ling is afraid now?” someone provoked.","“All right, let’s go.”","The group walked towards the training ground. When the ordinary soldiers saw this, they hurriedly followed to watch the excitement.","“How many battles do you guys think this new captain can last?” a soldier asked curiously.","“Three rounds, at most,” someone said with a smile.","“Maybe five rounds,” another person said.","Right at this moment, someone said slowly, “All these captains added together would not be","enough for the new captain to fight.”","After an instant of silence, everyone laughed.","How was this possible? What a colossal joke!","“Could it be that you guys don’t know that this new captain is the man who defeated Wang","Yafei at His Majesty’s birthday banquet yesterday and won the title of the strongest","Foundation Building Tier?”","Ah?"]},{"number":3774,"title":"Chapter 3774: Found the murderer","paragraphs":["Chapter 3774: Found the murderer","This new captain was so powerful?","“Really?”","“Of course it’s true. I have an uncle working in the main division. When we had lunch today, my uncle personally told me that this fierce man has been assigned to our branch division.” “F***!”","The soldiers all shook their heads. Looks like their captains were going to be out of luck.","In the arena, Ling Han smiled and said, “You guys can attack together.”","“You really know how to show off!”","“However, since you’ve said so, I’ll oblige you!”","These captains didn’t take any sense of honor to heart. In the first place, they wanted to teach Ling Han a lesson, and as for what methods they used, they didn’t mind at all. Moreover, wasn’t this what Ling Han had requested himself?","Their expressions were all smiles, but they had already spread out, ready to attack at any time. “Let’s go!”","Someone called out, and instantly, the 13 captains moved at the same time, attacking Ling Han.","Ling Han stood proudly and unmoving.","‘Show-offs die quickly!’ these 13 captains all thought, but their offensive did not slow down in the slightest.","Then we will oblige you.","Just when the attack was about to reach him, with a thought from Ling Han, weng, the murderous aura shot out.","Pa, pa, pa, pa! This aura surged past, as if it could topple mountains and overturn seas. Those thirteen people involuntarily paused, and then collapsed onto the ground.","Pu!","The soldiers watching from the sidelines were all gaping, completely dumbfounded.","No way, thirteen captains collapsed just like that?","They knew that Ling Han was powerful, and had even defeated Wang Yafei, but he had not even made a single move, and the 13 captains seemed to have been possessed, and collapsed on their own.","F***, this was too shocking.","There was a smile on Ling Han’s face as he casually walked forwards. However, every step he took was on the backs of those captains, causing these captains to groan. It was so heavy that even their bones were groaning.","They were astounded. How could Ling Han be so powerful?","“Did you enjoy the spar?” Ling Han asked.","What was there to enjoy about? Was there anything to be happy about when they were lying on the ground and being stepped on?","However, when they saw the dangerous expression on Ling Han’s face, how could they dare to say this? They hurriedly nodded in agreement.","“Do you still want to play?” Ling Han asked.","The 13 captains hurriedly shook their heads in unison.","Ling Han nodded, and walked out of the training ground.","He was extremely busy, and he still had to find the culprit.","Right now, there were still two auras that hadn’t been eliminated. However, the sky was already dark, so Ling Han decided to call it a day and continue tomorrow.","He didn’t return to the Political Hostage Manor and stayed in the sub-division.","In terms of conditions, it was actually the Political Hostage Manor that was better, but no matter how luxurious the prison cell was, how could it compare to the air of freedom?","A night passed, and Ling Han woke up early, greeting the morning sun to cultivate. Not long after he finished, he saw that the division had suddenly become noisy.","He ran out to take a look, but his expression darkened, because someone else had died the night before, and their blood had been sucked dry.","“Where is it?” he hurriedly approached and asked.","“Xiuhua Village, third alley, number four.”","Ling Han immediately moved out, heading towards Xiuhua Village. He was practically running at full speed, and soon arrived at the crime scene.","The surroundings had already been sealed off by the soldiers, and unauthorized people were forbidden from entering.","Ling Han walked in, only to see a corpse lying on the ground. There was a look of terror on the corpse’s face.","There were two rows of teeth marks on the neck of the corpse. They were very deep, but should not be fatal. Thus, the cause of death was still excessive blood loss.","He took out the jade toad and extracted auras again. Then, he eliminated them one by one.","In the first place, there were only two suspects left, and after comparison, there was only one left.","Ling Han had the jade toad start tracking the aura, and this toad immediately moved, heading in a certain direction.","“You, you, you, follow me.” Ling Han pointed at three people.","The three of them hurriedly followed behind him. Ling Han had defeated all 13 of the captains yesterday, and he had instantly established a powerful prestige. Thus, they did as he said without a second thought.","Every time Ling Han turned a corner, he would use the jade toad to relocate the trace of aura.","When the three soldiers saw Ling Han fiddle around with a toad, they were all very confused. What was he playing at? Furthermore, he wanted them to follow him.","After about half an hour, Ling Han stopped in front of a very small, dilapidated courtyard. The direction that the Jade Toad was presently pointing in was precisely this courtyard. Ling Han walked over and knocked on the door. However, no one answered.","He knocked again, and still no one answered.","Ling Han released his divine sense, and with a sweep, he discovered that this courtyard was","empty.","He directly pushed open the doors and entered. Mystical power merely vibrated slightly, and the door was broken.","“Captain Ling!” The three guards hurriedly followed him in, feeling even more baffled.","Why are you barging into the home of a commoner for no reason?","Ling Han drew out a chair and sat in the courtyard, waiting patiently. The three soldiers had no choice but to squat at the corner of the wall and keep him company.","At noon, a door creaked open, and the half-closed door was pushed open. A tall man walked","in.","This man looked to be in his thirties, and there was a vigilant expression on his face. He shouted at Ling Han and the others, “Who are you people? Why have you barged into my","house?”","Ling Han smiled faintly, and said, “We’re from the Heaven Military Manor. As for why we’re here, don’t you know?”","“I don’t know what you’re talking about,” the middle-aged man said with a shake of his head. “Even if you’re from the Heaven Military Manor, you still can’t enter my room as you please. I didn’t do anything wrong! Leave, I want you to leave immediately.”","Ling Han stood up and walked toward the middle-aged man.","The man stepped aside, “Leave!”","Ling Han shook his head, “Why do you suck the blood of others?”","The man’s expression changed drastically.","At first, he had thought that Ling Han had only come in by chance, but when these words","entered his ears, he understood that Ling Han had come with a clear target.","But how had the Heaven Military Manor discovered him?","When he had committed the crime, he had clearly confirmed that the other party was only one person, and it was absolutely impossible that there would be any witnesses.","No, he was going to kill them to keep the secret.","A thought flashed through his mind, and he immediately opened his mouth, revealing two","rows of eerie white teeth. He bit down on Ling Han’s neck, and his hands also spread open,","grabbing out at Ling Han’s shoulders.","He had revealed his true colors so quickly?","“Captain Ling, be careful!”","“He is a blood-sucking demon!”","The three soldiers hurriedly called out. At this moment, they didn’t think about how Ling Han","had found the culprit.","Ling Han stretched out a hand. Pa, he had grabbed hold of the man’s neck. Under the suppression of his vigorous power, that man could not even dream of moving a single muscle.","...This man was only in the Enlightenment Tier.","“Strange!” Ling Han used his eye technique to scan the surroundings, and couldn’t help but look surprised. “Where did the blood you sucked go?”","This man’s face was extraordinarily pale. Thus, Ling Han used his eye technique to scan him, yet discovered that there was pitifully little blood in this man’s body. It only looked to be a few tenths of the blood of an ordinary person.","Being able to cultivate to Blood Transformation Tier, one’s blood and Qi should be extremely vigorous, so how could it possibly decline like this?"]},{"number":3775,"title":"Chapter 3775: Ended abruptly","paragraphs":["Chapter 3775: Ended abruptly","Ling Han swiped out a finger like a blade, easily slicing open the middle-aged man’s skin. Wisps of blood seeped out of the wound, as if there was no blood in this person’s body at all.","A blood-sucking monster, logically speaking, should have a lot of blood in his body, but why did he look like a dried corpse?","“Yi!” The three soldiers all exclaimed in shock, an expression of intense shock on their faces. This kind of scene was not something that could be seen every day.","Ling Han picked up the middle-aged man a bit, and said, “Tell me, why exactly did you kill him?”","The middle-aged man suddenly changed his previously fearful expression, and bared his teeth at Ling Han, looking extremely vicious and evil.","Ling Han’s fingers clenched slightly, and instantly, a cracking sound was heard. However, the middle-aged man did not react at all, as if the person Ling Han was squeezing was not him at","all.","Yi, didn’t he feel any pain?","“Do you want to know? Let me take a bite, and you’ll understand everything,” the middle- aged man said. His eyes emitted a crimson light.","Ling Han instantly felt a consciousness invading his mind, wanting to control him. However, the three Celestial Foundations in his mind all vibrated slightly, and this evil thought of invasion immediately vanished without a trace.","Shua, shua, shua! However, behind Ling Han, the three soldiers all moved, grabbing out at Ling Han’s neck.","The eyes of these three people... had all become bloodshot.","They had been controlled.","Ling Han’s Celestial Foundations could be considered supreme in quality, so no evil could penetrate him. However, these three soldiers did not have such strong abilities, and were immediately bewitched.","“An!” Ling Han opened his mouth and spat out a Buddhist chant.","Peng! Black smoke billowed from the bodies of the three guards, and was instantly annihilated. Meanwhile, the eyes of the three guards immediately returned to normal. They were all at a loss. In fact, there was a strong sense of fear in their eyes.","“Just now, I seemed to have been possessed by a ghost.”","“I can’t control my body at all.”","“No, it’s a willpower that affected me, causing me to completely lose myself.”","Fear lingered in their hearts. If Ling Han hadn’t dispelled the evil aura for them, who knew what they would have done.","“You are actually the heir of the Buddhist Race!” The middle-aged man also looked shocked. This Six Characters Bright King Curse was one of the Buddhist Sect’s two ultimate techniques, purifying all beings and expiating evil. Now, it was actually seen from a young man. This was really extremely unexpected.","“Are you surprised? Are you shocked?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“Brat, don’t be so smug. You can’t possibly know anything!” the middle-aged man said. Pa, his entire head exploded like a watermelon, white-colored brain matter splashing everywhere, almost without blood.","Ling Han instantly activated the Starlight Screen, blocking all the filth. However, the three soldiers didn’t have that kind of strength. Caught off guard, they were splattered all over. Some had good immunity, while others didn’t. Immediately, they threw up on the sidelines. Ling Han frowned upon seeing this. The culprit had actually self-destructed!","In this way, the clues came to an abrupt stop.","This middle-aged man was indeed the culprit. However, why did he suck blood? Where did the blood he sucked go?","These doubts had not been resolved.","“Take him back to the sub division,” Ling Han said, casually tossing the headless corpse onto the ground.","“Yes, milord!” The three guards hurriedly straightened their backs and replied respectfully. Ling Han returned to the division. He had a feeling that the middle-aged man’s death was not the end of the blood-sucking incident. On the contrary, it was very likely just the beginning.","When the three soldiers brought the middle-aged man’s corpse back, the entire division was in an uproar.","How could it not be shocking?","Seven blood-sucking cases had already happened before, and the length of time had surpassed half a month, but no one had solved the case. However, when it was Ling Han’s turn, he had just arrived at the division, and did not have a single soldier under his command. He actually used only a day and a half to solve the case and catch the culprit.","Of course, the only flaw was that the culprit had committed suicide.","The 13 captains all wore dark expressions. The more capable Ling Han was, the more it highlighted their incompetence.","‘F*ck! You clearly already have a clue, so why didn’t you bring them along when you captured the culprit?’","Someone immediately tattled on Ling Han, saying that Ling Han had no concept of teamwork, and only knew how to play the role of a hero. Otherwise, with the other captains going together, they would definitely be able to capture him alive and prevent him from committing suicide.","It wasn’t just one of them. The other captains all joined in, completely ignoring the fact that Ling Han had solved the case. Instead, they talked about how he had not captured him alive, and rebuked him harshly.","More importantly, it was as if Yan Lesheng had gone blind as well, giving Ling Han a heavy reprimand.","Ling Han smirked coldly. On his first day here, this guy had deliberately made things difficult for him, having him take over a troublesome case, and even requested that the case be solved within ten days. Now that he had solved the case, he was making a huge fuss over a minor issue. This was practically going too far.","The other party was still babbling, and Ling Han directly turned around and left.","“Ling Han! Ling Han!” Yan Lesheng shouted loudly, but Ling Han acted as if he had not heard him, and had already walked out.","“F***!” He couldn’t help but feel like he was about to go crazy, throwing things around. He was also so terrifying that the soldiers who had wanted to come in to take a look at the situation retreated one after another.","After being angry for a while, he opened the connection device, “Lord Ma, that brat actually solved the murder!”","“... Yes, don’t worry. I will definitely cause trouble for him, and make him obediently resign, and get back to the Political Hostage Manor.”","“Alright, I’ll report to you when the matter is settled.”","Ling Han rented a courtyard nearby, then brought the large black dog and pervert pig over from the Political Hostage Manor.","He logged onto the Galaxy Network again, and sent the address to the empress. After another half an hour, the empress, Hu Niu, and the babies all appeared.","Lin Luo, Zhou Heng, and the others had already joined various sects. With their natural talent,","it was definitely no problem for them to be nurtured as key disciples. In fact, they would even become Dao Child-level disciples in the future.","“Ling Han!” Hu Niu was the first to jump over and hug him, like a koala.","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. A large part of the reason why he was so determined was because of the people around him. This was his motivation.","“Greetings, Father!” The seven babies giggled. After so long, they still looked like babies, as","if they wouldn’t grow up.","However, their strength increased very quickly. They had all advanced into Ultimate Dao Foundation, and were not the slightest bit inferior to Ling Han.","Meanwhile, Tang Yun’er pouted. The appearance of this Handsome Brother had caused the","empress to ignore her. This was taking things too far!","The family reunited. Unfortunately, those like Liu Yutong and the others could only be","trapped in the inner world.","Ling Han believed that when he became stronger, even if these people hadn’t reached the Heavenly Venerable Tier yet, he would still have the ability to safely send them out.","On this night, the Ling Clan was filled with joy.","The next morning, everyone welcomed the rising sun to cultivate. The empress, the large black dog, and the others were about to reach the peak stage of Human Dao Foundation. Coincidentally, Ling Han had a large number of Foundation Dissolution Pills in his possession, which was enough to help them cultivate the foundations of the Celestial Path to","perfection when they broke through.","After he had finished cultivating, Ling Han logged onto the Galaxy Network and began the","ranking battles."]},{"number":3776,"title":"Chapter 3776: New case","paragraphs":["Chapter 3776: New case","Ling Han had initially wanted to challenge Origin to a battle to earn more money from tickets, but he had never imagined that Origin would actually break through.","He was now a Cauldron Forging Tier elite.","Although the Galaxy Network could suppress cultivation level and a relatively fair battle at the same cultivation level could be achieved, suppressing one’s own cultivation level was unjust in the first place for a true prodigy.","-If he did not fight on the cultivation level that he should have, no matter what, it would have an effect.","Thus, Origin refused his invitation to battle, and only told him to break through to the Cauldron Forging Tier as soon as possible, so they could start another supreme battle.","Not only Origin, but Myriad Dao and Heaven Crushing also broke through to Cauldron Forging Tier, unwilling to battle Ling Han at the same cultivation level.","Alright, if he couldn’t earn this money, then he would break records. He could also earn some money in that manner.","Ling Han started to break all kinds of records. Records of power, records of speed, he would break any record. Breaking any record would earn him a reward of 1000 Universe Coins, which added together was quite a lot.","By now, he was already in the Ultimate Dao Foundation, and his strength had reached a pinnacle level. He had broken practically all the records.","Though he had not truly battled Origin at the same cultivation level, and had not even battled Myriad Dao or Heaven Crushing, everyone now agreed that in terms of aptitude and natural talent, Ling Han was definitely the strongest in all eternity.","Although Ling Han’s power was the strongest and his speed was the fastest, this didn’t mean that his battle prowess was the highest. However, when one reached the heights of Ling Han and Origin, who would be weaker than the other in terms of battle awareness?","Ling Han could surpass Origin and the others in all aspects, and was definitely the strongest prodigy of all eternity.","Right now, the entire galaxy was searching for the four of them. Some of them wanted to take them as disciples, while most of them wanted to capture them and slowly investigate their secrets. The freakish nature of their existence was inconceivable, and it was definitely impossible for them to appear out of thin air.","However, fortunately, Ling Han and the others had concealed their identities very well. They were clearly famous throughout the Galaxy Network, and the entire universe had heard of their names, but no one knew their true identities.","For example, Ling Han. Who would have thought that a hostage that Dark North Nation had sent over would actually be the freakish freak that was even more freakish than Origin and the others, “Number One in the Galaxy”?","The following two days passed very calmly. Aside from cultivating, Ling Han spent his time concocting alchemical pills, accompanying his wives and children, and watching the large black dog and pervert pig look at each other in disdain. Though it was simple, it was filled with warmth, making Ling Han feel as if he was leaving behind all the troubles, and was just going to spend the rest of his life like this.","However, this thought only flashed through his mind, and he immediately became serious. In this world where martial arts were paramount, where was the true land of peace?","Only by possessing absolute strength would he be able to protect the people by his side, and only then would he be able to safeguard the peace that he had now.","But on the fourth day, something happened.","Ling Han went to the division as usual, but was immediately called to Yan Lesheng’s place.","Peng, the moment the other saw him enter, he slammed the report in his hands onto the table, pointed angrily at him, and said, “Ling Han, do you know what the crime of deceiving the Emperor is?”","Ling Han smiled faintly, and sat down on the chair. “Don’t accuse me for no reason.”","The other only had the cultivation level of Human Cauldron, so he was unafraid.","Yan Lesheng suppressed his anger, and said, “Last night, another blood-sucking murder case appeared, and it was three consecutive cases at that! So, the corpse you brought back isn’t the culprit at all!”","“Oh?” Yet Ling Han’s eyes lit up. Previously, when that blood-sucking person had committed suicide, all the clues were cut off, and a great many doubts were buried with him.","Now, a new blood-sucking murder had happened. Though it was a tragedy, it also meant that the answer could be found again.","He picked up the murder report and examined it, then said, “These are three new murderers.” “What makes you so sure that there are three people?” Yan Lesheng said. The cause of death for the three victims were completely the same, and all of them had had all their blood sucked out, which was shockingly similar.","“Instinct,” Ling Han said. “The person I brought back was definitely the culprit of the previous eight murders. Now, there are three new culprits. Hehe, what’s hidden behind them?”","“Since you’ve solved the first serial blood-sucking murder case, then I’ll hand these three cases over to you. I’ll give you three days’ time. If you can’t solve the case on time, I’ll punish you,” Yan Lesheng said in an overbearing manner.","Ling Han did not speak, and merely stared at him, which made Yan Lesheng feel slightly uncomfortable.","“Lord Yan, please don’t ruin yourself!” he said calmly.","“Are you threatening me?” Yan Lesheng exploded in anger. You are merely in the Foundation Building Tier, and you actually have such a big mouth?","Ling Han cracked a smile, “I have accepted this case. Within three days, the culprit will be found, not because I am afraid of you, but rather because I am interested in this matter. In future, whether I accept the case or not would depend on my mood.”","After saying this, he strode off.","Peng, peng, peng! Yan Lesheng began to madly smash the furniture again.","Ling Han immediately headed to the homes of the three victims. The homes of these three victims were more or less the same distance from him, so Ling Han chose one randomly. After he arrived, he immediately used the jade toad to collect auras. Excluding those of the soldiers, their families, and friends, there were only three unfamiliar auras left. He traced","them one by one.","The first... wasn’t.","Ling Han shook his head. He had used the eye technique to check, and this person’s Qi and blood was normal, so he should not be the murderer.","Change.","The second person was a middle-aged woman. Ling Han swept an eye over her, and immediately launched an attack. Xiu, he instantly appeared in front of her, and delivered a palm strike. Not only did it seal off her cultivation level, it also sealed off her divine sense.","-There was pitifully little blood in this person’s body, so she must be the blood-sucking murderer.","Ling Han brought the middle-aged woman back to the sub-division, and directly threw her in","front of Yan Lesheng.","“The culprit has been captured alive. I’ll leave the rest to you.”","Yan Lesheng’s anger had not subsided yet. He looked coldly at Ling Han, “You say she is the murderer, so she is the murderer?”","Ling Han shrugged and said, “You can undo her restrictions and interrogate her yourself.”","Yan Lesheng frowned, then called out loudly, “Guards!”","The soldier outside immediately came in, “What is your command, Lord?”","“Prepare a torture chamber, and prepare for the interrogation.”","“Yes,”","Two guards arrived, dragging the middle-aged woman away, her hands and feet bound. The captains also arrived. Although they didn’t participate in the arrest, they could still participate in the interrogation and naturally earn some credit.","After removing the restrictions, the middle-aged woman immediately looked terrified. “Why","are you arresting me? I didn’t commit any crime!”","Ling Han tapped out a finger. Pa, the middle-aged woman’s left hand immediately exploded,","but the strange thing was that there was only a pitifully small amount of blood gushing out.","The middle-aged woman immediately turned to look at Ling Han, revealing a baleful","expression.","“It’s you again!” she said.","Yi?","Ling Han couldn’t help but be startled. How did this middle-aged woman recognize him?","Ling Han believed that she was in cahoots with the blood-sucking man from before. However, the blood-sucking man didn’t have any contact with the outside world before he self-exploded. So, how did this middle-aged woman recognize him?","It was indeed strange."]},{"number":3777,"title":"Chapter 3777: Trap","paragraphs":["Chapter 3777: Trap","“Tell me quickly, why do you suck human blood!” Yan Lesheng put on his authority as an official, and shouted loudly.","“A mere Cauldron Forging Tier dares to be impudent, humph!” the middle-aged woman said coldly.","Yan Lesheng was already furious to begin with, and with her words, his face instantly turned livid.","Where was his authority?","First, it was Ling Han, a Foundation Building cultivator, who dared to talk back to him, and now it was this mere Inscription Tier cultivator. Which of them took him seriously?","“Beat her!” He waved his hand.","The middle-aged woman released a strange howl, and her eyes suddenly lit up. Weng, instantly, the eyes of every single person in the room turned red, exuding an aura of madness. Their reason was instantly drowned out, and only one thought remained – to kill.","Only two people were unaffected. One was Ling Han, and the other was Yan Lesheng, but he wasn’t completely unaffected. His eyes were also slightly red, but compared to the others, he only became more irritable, but didn’t lose control to the point of wanting to kill.","Ling Han’s heart clenched. This kind of bewitching technique was truly powerful. Even Foundation Building cultivators wouldn’t be spared. Moreover, the one who cast this kind of technique was only a measly Inscription Tier cultivator.","Could an Inscription Tier cultivator be as strong as this?","That was absolutely impossible. If such an existence really existed, then the whole world would be in complete chaos.","Then... what was the real reason?","Peng! Peng! Peng!","Right at this moment, everyone was already fighting fiercely.","Those captains had all had their minds controlled, and launched attacks at Yan Lesheng and Ling Han.","“Humph!” Yan Lesheng roared in fury, and the battle prowess of the Cauldron Forging Tier was activated. He merely raised his hand, and those captains and soldiers were all subdued. “Freak, who exactly are you!” he shouted at the middle-aged woman.","Obviously, he didn’t think that a mere Inscription Tier could possess such massive power that it could even bewitch a Foundation Building cultivator.","The middle-aged woman laughed loudly, extremely crazed, but as she laughed, pa, her head exploded.","It was exactly the same as the previous murderer.","However, this time, Ling Han spread out his divine sense, carefully capturing it.","He keenly discovered that a sliver of soul fluctuation had shot out, but it was too fast, so he couldn’t catch up at all.","As expected.","Ling Han nodded internally. Why was it that this middle-aged woman had never seen him before, yet could recognize him with a single glance? Why was it that she was clearly only an Inscription Tier, yet could bewitch Foundation Building Tier elites?","That was because she, as well as the blood-sucking man from before, had all been taken over by an elite through a sliver of his divine sense. They were not themselves at all.","This elite’s cultivation level should be very high. Otherwise, it was impossible that a sliver of divine sense could affect a Foundation Building cultivator.","Moreover, where had the blood of this middle-aged woman and the blood-sucking man gone?","Had all the blood been delivered to that elite?","However, since he was so powerful, why didn’t he attack himself?","There were two possible reasons for this. Firstly, that person had been severely wounded, so it was inconvenient for him to move. Thus, he could only use his divine sense to affect others and have them bring him blood to heal his injuries. Secondly, it was also possible that the identity of that person was too sensitive, so he could not take the risk of being discovered, even if there was the slightest bit of chance.","Ling Han thought for a moment, and ruled out the second possibility.","Because if it was a sensitive identity, how was he supposed to get blood from the “blood slaves”?","Whether it was a blood slave going to his place, or him coming to find the blood slave, or a third location for them to meet up, it was possible that he would be seen.","Perhaps this was also possible, but Ling Han was more inclined towards the first possibility. Some elite was severely wounded, and he needed blood to heal himself. However, he couldn’t move, so he could only use his divine sense to affect others and have them bring blood to him. If that was the case... just how many blood slaves were there in this city?","Ling Han couldn’t help but let his thoughts wander. That was because that elite could even affect Foundation Building Tier cultivators, and it was too convenient for Foundation Building cultivators to kill people. It was also very easy to destroy the evidence.","There should be more than eleven victims. In fact, the number of victims should be several times, dozens of times, or even hundreds of times this number.","This matter was more serious than he had imagined.","Ling Han set out again to catch the remaining two murderers. However, he found their home, yet after a long while, the two of them had still not returned.","‘Heh, he knows that I have a special tracking technique, so he’s hiding and not coming back?’ Ling Han continued his pursuit, but he lost all clues when he reached the banks of a large river.","The two of them should have jumped into the river and used the river water to wash away their aura. It was unknown where they had landed.","Ling Han walked along the bank, continuously using the jade toad to search for a scent. After half a day, he still did not find anything.","He switched to the other bank of the river, and continued his search.","Found it!","A smile appeared on Ling Han’s face. He had captured two auras at the same time. Clearly, the two of them had reunited after coming ashore.","He followed the trail, and after going around in circles for a long time, he actually arrived in","front of a large cemetery.","The jade toad was pointing at this place.","Ling Han didn’t act rashly. Instead, he retrieved the Void Beast hide and draped it over his","body, concealing his tracks.","Things had progressed too smoothly. Those two people had both thought of using the river water to conceal their aura, so how could he have found them so easily?","Moreover, the two of them were moving together, as if they were afraid that he would not be","able to find them.","Thus, this could possibly be a trap.","Perhaps there was a super elite hidden in the dark, so Ling Han had to be careful.","He entered into the mausoleum, and quietly circled around, but did not discover anything.","He released his divine sense, and searched inch by inch.","‘Hmm?’","He had found something!","In a tomb, he discovered the fluctuations of life.","How could there be fluctuations of life in a tomb?","The auras of the two people from before had disappeared here, but he had already searched the entire cemetery, yet did not find anything. Thus, the possibility that the two of them were hiding in the cemetery was very high.","Ling Han remained calm and collected. He was naturally unafraid of those two people, but that mysterious elite might also be lying in ambush here.","He waited quietly, filled with patience.","It wasn’t long before the sky darkened. The moon hung in the middle of the sky, radiating","with a silvery glow.","Peng, a hand suddenly stretched out of the mud, and then another hand broke out of the","ground.","If Ling Han had been unprepared, he would probably have been shocked, but now, he only","smiled faintly.","Peng, another person broke out of the ground.","The two blood slaves had appeared, so where was that elite? Was he also here?","Ling Han was very patient, and continued to wait.","Another few hours passed, and when a sliver of white appeared on the horizon, peng, another","pair of hands broke through the mud at the same time.","Ling Han was shocked, because he had not discovered beforehand that there was actually a living person buried underneath.","It must be that elite that managed to deceive his divine sense.","Ling Han was internally shocked. This was indeed a trap. If he had not been very careful, and","exposed himself, he would naturally be dead now.","Peng, the dirt split apart, and the third person also sat up.","This was an old man with crimson red hair, two sharp fangs, and bloodshot eyes. Looking at This fingernails, they were sharp and long, as if they were small knives."]},{"number":3778,"title":"Chapter 3778: The real culprit","paragraphs":["Chapter 3778: The real culprit","Ling Han activated his eye technique and looked at the elder.","He couldn’t see through him!","If the other was in the Foundation Building Tier, then Ling Han would be able to clearly see his cultivation level. If he was in the Cauldron Forging Tier, then he would at least be able to vaguely see the appearance of the Celestial Cauldron, but from the Core Formation Tier","onwards, he wouldn’t be able to see anything.","It was not that his eye technique was not strong, but rather that his cultivation level was too low.","However, his eye technique couldn’t see through him at all, meaning that he was at least at the Core Formation Tier, or perhaps even stronger.","There was shockingly a hole in the old man’s chest, as if it had been pierced through by someone’s hand. Blood was still flowing from it, but the speed was extremely slow. Furthermore, this blood was like crystal, as if it was about to solidify.","“Damn it, I need more blood!” The old man coughed. He rubbed lightly at the top of the wound, while his eyes revealed a baleful killing intent, “Five Dao, when I recover from my injuries, find the Mystery Realm, and my cultivation level goes up another level, it will be the time of your death!”","“There’s also that damn brat. He actually has a treasure that can track scents, almost exposing where I’m hiding.”","“That brat is quite smart. Logically speaking, he should have found this place long ago, yet has not appeared for a long time. Clearly, he knows that this is a trap.”","“I have to change locations. If he seeks out an elite, with my cultivation level that has just recovered to Cauldron Forging Tier-level, it would not be easy to block them.”","As he spoke to himself, the two blood slaves stood solemnly at the side, as if they were stone statues.","“The two of you, come and help me up,” the old man commanded the two blood slaves. The two of them hurriedly went to help him up. When they helped the old man out of the pit, Ling Han shockingly discovered that this old man actually lost a leg.","The wound was very new, and just like his chest, blood was still dripping from it.","Ling Han’s heartbeat sped up slightly. He was thinking about whether he should take the chance to make a move.","This was a very good opportunity. The enemy’s ambush had failed, and they were about to leave in disappointment. This was the time when their defenses were at their weakest.","His opponent had the strength of the Cauldron Forging Tier. If he suddenly activated the Heavenly Pattern Jade to launch a sneak attack on him, there was a very high chance that he would succeed.","The question was, would this be another trap?","That old man may already know that he was nearby, and those words previously were deliberately spoken for him to hear, in order to draw him to make a move.","‘No, if he wanted to bait me, he should say that he’s in the Foundation Building Tier. Otherwise, if there’s a gap of a major tier, so what if I launch a sneak attack? How many people can succeed?’ Ling Han immediately thought. After all, such a powerful Foundation Building Tier like him was extremely rare. If that old man could even predict this, then he was truly kickass.","Ling Han pondered internally, and thought that his judgement was correct.","‘Alright, I’ll take a gamble.’","Ling Han took out the Heavenly Pattern Jade, and after injecting his Spiritual Power into it, it became extraordinarily light.","He approached quietly, and when he was within fifteen meters of the old man, he did not come any closer. With a thought, the Heavenly Pattern Jade had already shot out.","“Die!” Ling Han also activated Imminent Skyline and charged forward.","This was really too sudden. Who would have thought that an attack would suddenly appear in an empty place?","The Heavenly Pattern Jade streaked through the air at 40 times the speed of sound.","The old man couldn’t help but feel astonished.","If he had been prepared, with his current Cauldron Forging Tier cultivation level, he would still have space to dodge. However, this was too sudden, and the distance was too close, so he couldn’t dodge.","This old man was quite ruthless. With a grab of both hands, he had already thrown the two blood slaves as a shield in front of him.","Peng, peng! The Heavenly Pattern Jade smashed into their bodies, immediately blasting out. Under the powerful shockwaves, the bodies of the two blood slaves also exploded, as if they were balloons that had been popped.","The Heavenly Pattern Jade’s speed only decreased slightly, continuing to attack the old man.","The elder roared loudly, and with a flip of his right hand, he delivered a palm strike at Heavenly Pattern Jade.","Peng!","Blood sprayed through the air, and his right hand was obliterated. The forearm was also obliterated, and it only stopped when it reached the elbow.","Sigh, Cauldron Forging Tier elites were truly hard to kill. The Wolf Tribe High Priest was like this, and so was this old man.","Ling Han sighed internally, but his figure had already arrived. The Three Styles of the God of War unfolded, enveloped with Destructive Energy. From the very beginning, he had practically exploded with his strongest battle prowess.","The old man’s heart ached to death.","Of course, his heartache was not due to the two blood slaves. These could be easily created, and he could have as many as he wanted. However, in order to block Ling Han’s attack, he had lost his right arm. This was a serious injury.","He had already lost a leg, and now he had lost another arm, so his battle prowess would naturally drop drastically.","Most importantly, it was only a Foundation Building cultivator who had attacked.","He, a dignified Spirit Transformation True Lord, was actually crippled by a Foundation Building cultivator? How humiliating!","This was truly like a tiger that had fallen from grace. If he was still the high and mighty Spirit Transformation True Lord, so what if a sneak attack was launched on him with the Heavenly Pattern Jade? This kind of measly low-level Spirit Tool was like child’s play in front of him. “Detestable pawn!” he roared. His Spiritual Infant Tier aura surged toward Ling Han. At the same time, he extended his left hand toward Ling Han’s neck.","He really did not underestimate Ling Han in the slightest, and directly used his aura that was on the level of Spiritual Transformation Tier to suppress Ling Han. This was the greatest advantage of having a higher cultivation level, and in terms of level, he could crush all life. However, this kind of aura suppression was completely useless against Ling Han.","His Celestial Foundation was built as an imitation of the primitive Celestial Gate, and could be said to be the most powerful foundation of the Celestial Path in the world. With such a stable foundation, what need was there for him to fear being suppressed by aura?","The first style of the God of War had already arrived, and Ling Han added another move. He opened his mouth and spat out a golden sword. At the same time, he also unleashed the barrage of murderous aura.","The murderous aura attack was the first to reach him, but it was completely ineffective. The other party was not a real Cauldron Forging Tier, but rather a Spirit Transformation True Lord. The gap in cultivation level was too wide, and it was completely impossible for it to be","effective.","However, Ling Han didn’t place his hopes on this. The Three Styles of the God of War and the Destructive Energy were his trump cards.","Boom!","The two of them exchanged a blow, and Ling Han was instantly sent flying. He felt as if all the bones in his body were trembling, as if they were about to fall apart.","...This old man had indeed only recovered to the Cauldron Forging Tier, but it was definitely","not Human Cauldron, but rather Heaven Cauldron!","“Ah!” The old man released a terrible scream. Though he had sent Ling Han flying, his left","hand had been contaminated by Destructive Energy, and it was presently corroding him. With his present abilities, he was actually unable to expel it, and could only suppress it. Two of his","fingers instantly disappeared.","What terrifying destructive power.","The old man was both furious and shocked. He had deliberately withdrawn the two blood","slaves in order to lure Ling Han to take the bait and resolve a hidden danger. Who would have","thought that it would bring a great calamity to himself?","Right now, he was only left with his right leg and left hand. Meanwhile, he still had two fingers missing from his left hand. This was truly a tragedy.","“Die! Die! Die!” He was extraordinarily furious, and attacked Ling Han madly.","This was a battle prowess on the level of Heaven Cauldron. It was too terrifying. Though Ling","Han was able to contend with the Three Styles of the God of War, the moment they came into contact, his whole person was sent flying. The Starlight Screen instantly shattered. “Wa!” Ling Han threw up blood madly, feeling that at least half the organs in his body had","been damaged.","And this was still because he had strengthened his foundations too well. Otherwise, this strike","alone would be enough to kill him.","“Die!” The old man leaped out with one leg, and charged towards Ling Han again."]},{"number":3779,"title":"Chapter 3779: Suck yourself to death","paragraphs":["Chapter 3779: Suck yourself to death","Weng, a precious tower appeared above Ling Han’s head, pouring down tens of thousands of Primal Chaos Qi. There were flashes of lightning flickering, and it was indescribably divine.","Peng!","The elder’s attack arrived, and his palm pressed down. However, it was blocked by the Primal Chaos Qi, which brought his hand directly downwards.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, an Imperial Weapon!","However, the old man’s battle prowess was still Heaven Cauldron-level, after all. He immediately roared loudly, and exerted strength in both his hand and foot, stopping the sinking of his body.","He was astonished. Although he only had the power of the Heaven Cauldron, what Foundation Building Tier cultivator wouldn’t he be able to completely crush? This kind of crushing power was definitely not something that any Spirit Tool could reverse. Limited by cultivation level, even if it was a Four Star or Five Star Spirit Tool, the might it could unleash would be limited. But why was it that the aura of Primal Chaos was actually enough to make him stumble?","Unless... he couldn’t help but feel a jolt in his heart.","Could it be that this was a Saint Tool?","Materials that could be forged into Saint Tools naturally possessed indescribable might. Thus, even in the hands of low cultivation level cultivators, they would often be able to unleash might that surpassed their cultivation level.","“Give it to me!” The old man changed his target of attack and grabbed at the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, planning to forcibly capture it.","Zi, the light of lightning surged madly, striking towards the old man.","This light was too fast, and even the elder couldn’t dodge it. Instantly, he was hit head-on. Under the surging of the electric current, his whole body shivered, and even his hair stood on end.","How could the might of an Imperial Weapon be underestimated?","Ling Han let out a battle cry, and took advantage of the opening to launch a counterattack. That old man was really strong. Under the circumstance of missing one hand, one leg, and two fingers, numbed by electricity, he was still able to send out a palm strike towards Ling Han.","Peng, the two of them exchanged a blow, and Ling Han once again cried out loudly, throwing up blood madly. Meanwhile, the old man was not having a good time either. His face was completely pale, and blood was gushing from the wounds on his chest, elbow, fingers and leg. The amount was a little frightening.","The elder paled in shock. The cultivation technique he cultivated was unique, and blood was the source of his energy. This was also why he had used his divine sense to infiltrate those blood slaves when he was severely injured. A large amount of blood could speed up the recovery of his injuries.","However, on the other hand, he was losing a lot of blood now. Not only would this affect his battle prowess, but in serious cases, it might even kill him.","He was both greedy and furious.","How much he wanted to obtain this “Saint Tool”. To have it fall into the hands of a measly Foundation Building cultivator was practically a huge waste. However, this measly Foundation Building cultivator was actually about to force him into desperate straits, which made him extremely furious.","He was a Spirit Transformation True Lord, and he could kill this ant with a single breath. After he recovered from his injuries, he would suck this brat dry of his blood and turn him into a corpse slave without any willpower.","The elder decided to retreat. With a turn of his body, he was just about to flee.","However, he only had one leg now, so how fast could he run?","Ling Han activated the Imminent Skyline and instantly caught up to him. He threw a series of attacks at him, especially the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Every streak of Primal Chaos Qi was as heavy as a mountain, and every bolt of lightning was incredibly fierce.","The old man shouted loudly, but there was nothing he could do.","Who asked him to be severely injured, and only have one leg left?","“Brat, you forced me to do this!” the old man said through gritted teeth. He finally summoned his own Spirit Tool, a small rattle-drum.","He bit his lip, and with a ‘pu’, spat out a mouthful of blood at the rattle-drum.","“Huh? You’re clearly covered in blood, so why did you bite yourself?” Ling Han asked in","confusion.","Right, right!","The elder was also taken aback. ‘Why do I have to bite my own tongue? Although my Spirit Tool can only be activated with blood, aren’t I bleeding continuously now?’","What a loss, a great loss!","He was extremely depressed. He had actually been laughed at by a minor character like this. This was utterly humiliating.","“Die!” He flew into a humiliated rage. He didn’t care anymore. As long as he killed this brat, all his humiliation would disappear without a trace.","Boom, with his full power, that rattle-drum instantly rang out.","Tong! Tong! Tong!","Multiple sounds rang out, directly stabbing into Ling Han’s heart, instantly causing him to bleed from all his apertures.","This was originally a Spiritual Transformation Tier precious tool. If it unleashed its full power, Ling Han would instantly turn into a pool of blood. However, the old man was severely injured now, so he couldn’t unleash its full power. Moreover, he knew how he himself was suffering now, because once this precious tool channeled, it would endlessly extract his blood and Qi.","Under normal circumstances, it wouldn’t matter. He would just suck the blood of others, but now that he had lost too much blood, how could he bear such torment?","He would die at the slightest provocation.","Thus, he had first thought of escaping, and was forced into desperate straits. Only then was he willing to put his life on the line.","Tong! Tong! Tong!","The old man shook his rattle-drum. He himself was not much better, and his face was also becoming paler and paler. It was not that he had lost all rosiness in his face, but he really","looked like a white candle.","‘F*ck! I’m about to die!’","Weng, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower sent down endless streaks of Primal Chaos Qi. This coudl greatly weaken the destructive power from the sounds released by the Spirit Tool, and Ling Han was also shouting the Six Characters Bright King Curse loudly in his mind. Though that sound was not an evil existence, but rather pure destructive power, using sound to oppose sound, there should still be some effect.","Ling Han gave a loud shout, and used the Demonic Monkey Fists. A boundless air of violence circulated, and he shot out a punch. A seven-coloured brilliance spread out, and it was as if the whole world had turned into an endless darkness. Only a single fist shot out, and even the stars that filled the skies were dazzlingly bright, this punch was capable of shattering them","with a single punch.","When the Battle Saint Emperor had used it before, it would have definitely possessed the might to shatter stars with a single punch. However, in Ling Han’s hands, it only possessed a","kind of aura.","But even if it was just an aura, it still caused the old man to pale in shock.","This was a real Imperial Technique!","The punch landed, and the old man was instantly hit. A heavy punch landed on his chest. Thankfully, it was not where the original wound was. Otherwise, this punch would probably","take his life.","The old man was blasted back 90 meters. He looked down, and there was another groove in his chest. At least three of his ribs had been broken by this punch, causing his chest to cave in.","What kind of precious technique was this? It was too terrifying. The might of a single punch could actually reach such an extent.","This was definitely a Saint’s technique. This brat’s luck was heaven-defying, and he had obtained the inheritance of a Saint. Thus, he had wielded a Saint Tool and delivered a Saint’s","technique with his fist!","The elder’s eyes were bloodshot. He was going to fight with his life on the line. The","inheritance of a Saint was worth this risk.","“Die!” He shook the rattle-drum even more intensely. The little bit of Qi and blood that he had in the first place was continuously drawn away, and not only had his whole body lost its colour, it was also shriveling, as if he had turned into a skeleton.","This Spirit Tool was truly sinister.","It shouldn’t have been forged by the old man himself, right? Otherwise, there was really something wrong with this old man’s brain.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower floated above Ling Han’s head, chanting the Six Characters Bright King Curse, resisting the attacks of this Spirit Tool. Though he was still bleeding from his seven apertures, his body was brimming with life, far from being killed by","the shockwaves.","A few minutes later.","“I... f*ck your entire family!” the old man said in defiance. He was like a dried corpse as he was actually sucked to death by his own Spirit Tool."]},{"number":3780,"title":"Chapter 3780: Threat from an unknown source","paragraphs":["Chapter 3780: Threat from an unknown source","The old man crashed to the ground. A mighty Spirit Transformation True Lord had actually died at the hands of a Foundation Building cultivator because he had been severely wounded. This was truly an incredible injustice.","He died with remaining grievances. His eyes were still wide open, and there was a hint of greed in his expression.","It was very likely that he was still thinking about the “Saint’s inheritance” before he died, and if he knew that it wasn’t the Saint’s inheritance at all, but rather the Imperial Weapon and Imperial Technique, who knew how pained and resentful he would be.","Ling Han also flopped onto the ground. The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was automatically retracted and sank into his forehead.","His personal Spirit Tool could be stored inside one’s body.","This battle was really fatal. He was bleeding from all his apertures, and more than half of his internal organs had been destroyed. At least, his lifespan would be shortened by a dozen over years.","It was no wonder that Foundation Building Tier cultivators could live for 1000 years, while Minor Advanced Tier cultivators could live for 40,000 years. This was because it was inevitable that one would be severely wounded in battle. This was all at the cost of expending one’s life essence. Even if one’s injuries recovered, these hidden wounds would still remain. They couldn’t be healed.","... Unless he could ingest Saintly medicine and recover to a perfect body.","Ling Han ingested a healing alchemical pill, and channelled the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll. After quite a while, he finally suppressed the boiling inside his body. The damaged organs were already beginning to recover under the dual nourishment of the medicinal effects and mystical power, but if they were to completely recover, it would take at least a few days.","Right at this moment, the old man’s body suddenly lit up.","What the heck, was it a reanimated corpse?","Ling Han was already prepared to pour out the Heavenly Dao Flames. In his current state, he definitely wouldn’t be able to defeat a Cauldron Forging Tier elite.","Weng, that rattle-drum floated up by itself. Xiu, it tore through the air and left.","Yi?","Ling Han was confused. This Spirit Tool that had lost its owner could fly away on its own? Absolutely impossible! Unless-","He had not even finished the thought, when he saw a ball of light suddenly appear beside the old man’s corpse. It was continuously kneading, as if it was about to take form, yet had not taken form all this while.","“You dare ruin my plans, ant!” A voice rang out mentally.","Ling Han was shocked, and instantly understood. That rattle-drum Spirit Tool belonged to the owner of this voice, and for some unknown reason, it was given to the old man to use. Now that the old man was dead, it was taken back by the owner of this voice. It was even manifesting a sliver of intent here, issuing a threat to him.","Hehe, do you think I’m afraid of you!","With a thought from Ling Han, he threw a rock at it. However, divine sense was invisible, and the rock passed through the shadowy image.","“How dare you!” That was obviously a super elite, capable of manifesting his thoughts from some unknown corner of the universe. Perhaps, he was even more powerful than a Sect Master.","Peng! The reply was an even larger rock that passed through the shadowy image before heavily crashing into the ground, causing a cloud of dust and dirt to billow into the air. “Good! Good! Good!” That elite had probably exploded in fury, and could not even speak. Peng, a larger, larger rock smashed over again, landing directly on the old man’s corpse. In this way, even that shadowy image could not be seen.","However, in an instant, the ball of light floated out of the rock.","“You’re dead!” the super elite said in a cold voice that was transmitted through divine sense.","However, after saying this, the ball of light dissipated, as if it was afraid that Ling Han would throw another rock at it.","-He had never seen such a hothead, that even that elite felt exasperated.","Ling Han smiled faintly. He was naturally unafraid. If that elite could make a move, he would not have spoken so much nonsense, and directly captured or killed him. Obviously, the latter too could not reach him, and could only use his mouth.","He rested for a while, stabilizing the injuries in his body. Then, he stood up. With a thought, the stone on the old man’s corpse was snatched away by his Spiritual Power.","On the ground, the old man’s corpse hadn’t suffered any damage. Being able to cultivate to the Spiritual Transformation Tier, his bones and skin were naturally extremely tough. At the very least, they couldn’t be crushed by a rock... In fact, even if his body was crushed under a mountain, it might not be damaged.","Ling Han searched the old man’s body and found a Spatial Spirit Tool.","There were... not many things inside. There were only about a hundred Dao Stones and a thin metal plate.","The material of this metal was unknown, and was incredibly thin. There was a painting on it, and it looked like a map.","Being able to be stored away by a Spirit Transformation True Lord, it shouldn’t be anything ordinary.","Ling Han thought for a moment, then put away the thin plate. He would study it slowly in","future.","Aside from that, there was nothing else. He was really poor.","What kind of Spirit Transformation True Lord was this? How pitiful.","Ling Han could also guess that the majority of the old man’s wealth should be in the Galaxy Network, where it existed in the form of Universe Coins. Undoubtedly, with his death, this wealth would belong to the Chang Clan.","In this world, who knew how many people died arbitrarily every day. Their wealth in the Galaxy Network would naturally be pocketed by the Chang Clan – there was no need to write them off. The Universe Coins were virtual in the first place, and so what if the Chang Clan issued trillions of trillions? It would not affect them at all.","Only when the Universe Coins were exchanged for Dao Stones would the Chang Clan Clan pay","out.","Sigh, the Chang Clan had really profited greatly.","Ling Han once again sighed with emotion. The Four Directions Great Emperor had left a","golden rice bowl for their descendants.","Thankfully, the Chang Clan was an Imperial Clan. Otherwise, even if it was a Holy Land, they","would not be able to keep such great wealth to themselves.","Ling Han sighed ruefully, and returned with the old man’s corpse.","After arriving at the division, he took the corpse to Yan Lesheng’s place, threw it on the","ground, and said, “Here, this is the real culprit behind this blood-sucking case.”","Yan Lesheng had no time to care about Ling Han’s attitude. He merely swept an eye over this old man, and all the pores on his body couldn’t help but close tightly.","This was an elite, far surpassing him. The aftershock of a tiger’s death still lingered, causing him to practically tremble in fear.","“How could this be!” he finally spoke, his face filled with shock. He looked towards Ling Han, his eyes filled with deep wariness.","Ling Han actually managed to kill such an elite. Just look, the battle situation was too intense.","The old man had a broken arm and a leg, and there was also a pierced through hole and groove in his chest. This definitely could not have been caused by a sneak attack. From this, it could be seen just how exaggerated Ling Han’s strength was.","My gods!","“You, you killed him?” he asked in a trembling voice, thinking that he was extremely stupid, to actually become enemies with such a powerful person.","Ling Han smiled and said, “I was indeed the one who killed him. However, when I found him, he was already severely injured. He only had the strength of a Foundation Building cultivator, and I took advantage of that.”","He suppressed the old man’s strength by a level. Otherwise, if a Foundation Building Tier cultivator killed a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, he would probably be captured and","studied.","Now that it was a Foundation Building Tier that had killed a person with Foundation Building Tier-level battle prowess, there was no problem. He was originally the strongest Foundation Building Tier cultivator of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire in the first place.","Yan Lesheng breathed a sigh of relief, then felt slightly awkward. He was actually shocked by","a Foundation Building cultivator.","He coughed, and pretended to be stern, “How do you know that he is the real culprit in the blood-sucking murder?”","“Have an elite examine the corpse, and you’ll know,” Ling Han said calmly. “I also killed two blood slaves, but I don’t know how many people this old geezer has bewitched... En, he’s dead now, so the spiritual control should have lost its effect. Even if there are other blood slaves, they should have recovered by now.”"]},{"number":3781,"title":"Chapter 3781: Treasure Map","paragraphs":["Chapter 3781: Treasure Map","Yan Lesheng hurriedly searched the old man’s body, but naturally couldn’t find anything. He couldn’t help but glare at Ling Han, “Where are the things on him? Hand them over, these are all evidence, and you can’t take them for yourself.”","Haha, what a colossal joke.","I killed him with my own abilities, so why hand it over?","Ling Han knew that this old man was just being greedy. After all, this old man was a Spirit Transformation True Lord. Just thinking about it was enough to know that this kind of elite definitely had an astonishing background.","He shook his head, “Nothing.”","“Do I look like an idiot?” Yan Lesheng asked coldly, daring to tell such a super low-level lie. Ling Han nodded, “Looks like it.”","“You know I’m not-yi!” Yan Lesheng didn’t expect Ling Han to be so bold and direct, to actually nod. He couldn’t help but look livid. You’ve gone too far, haven’t you? I’m your superior, and I’m more so a Cauldron Forging Tier elite. You dare to insult me right in front of my face?","“Ling Han, do you want to die?” he asked balefully.","‘You’re ignoring me time and time again. Do you really think I don’t dare to deal with you?’ “Heh, I’ve already apprehended the culprit. You can deal with the matters in the future on your own.” Ling Han waved his hand before turning around to leave.","Yan Lesheng wanted to make a move, but when he recalled that Ling Han still had a Little Marquis behind him, he forcefully suppressed the fury in his heart.","He could not afford to trifle with Tang Yan. At most, he could only make things difficult for Ling Han, and make use of the rules to scheme against Ling Han, but for him to step out and oppose Tang Yan directly?","Firstly, he did not dare, and secondly, he was not qualified either.","Ling Han returned home, and took out that thin metal plate to study with everyone.","“Yi, this is an extremely rare Cold Water Metal,” Second Baby immediately said.","“It should be, I can’t break it.” Eldest Baby bared her teeth. She was trying to break the metal plate.","Ling Han couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat. This little maniac’s power was explosive. If it wasn’t for the fact that this plate could withstand breaking, it would probably have already turned into pieces by now.","“Give it to me!” The large black dog darted out, biting down on the plate, “Just nice, it can be made into a new pair of underpants for me.”","“Scram!” Ling Han shot out a foot, blocking the large black dog’s attack.","He placed the metal plate on the table, and said, “This is very likely a treasure map.”","“Oh, that’s right. There are mountains and rivers.” Hu Niu was also studying it, feeling around with her fingers. “So strange. These aren’t carved on, and there’s no unevenness at all.”","“Mother Hu, Cold Water Metal only needs to be injected with Spiritual Power, and it can form various images. Furthermore, it also has a very strong interaction effect. You will see different images in specific places,” Second Baby explained.","Yi, this was really amazing.","Ling Han was also very interested, and lightly stroked the metal plate.","“Unfortunately, we’re not from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. We lack understanding of this place, and can’t find a corresponding place.” He shook his head. “I think that the blood sucking Spirit Transformation True Lord should have come for some place on this map.” The empress and the others had also heard about the blood-sucking murder from Ling Han. Thus, the empress immediately said, “That Spiritual Transformation Tier cultivator should have suffered serious injuries when he fought over this map with others. Thus, he’s recuperating here, and when his injuries are healed, he’ll look for the treasure trove.”","“Treasure trove, treasure trove!” Hu Niu’s eyes lit up. She loved the excitement the most. “If we really want to find the treasure trove, we have to find someone first,” Ling Han said. “Tang Yan?” the empress asked.","Ling Han nodded, and said, “He’s a native, so he should know better than us. Moreover, he’s a Little Marquis, so he’s in possession of many resources. It should be very easy for him to find the location of this place. If this is really on the Moonlight Planet.”","After such a long time together, he also felt that Tang Yan was a friend that he could depend on. If that really was a treasure trove, Ling Han wouldn’t mind bringing Tang Yan along with him.","Moreover, Tang Yan was at Cauldron Forging Tier, after all, so he could also be considered a powerful contributor of battle prowess.","On the second day, he went to find Tang Yan. As for the blood-sucking murder case, he couldn’t be bothered to deal with it anymore. If Yan Lesheng wanted to snatch the credit, he could do as he liked. He didn’t have the slightest interest in being rewarded by the Azure Dragon Empire.","He soon arrived at the Marquis Manor, and had someone report his arrival to Tang Yan.","“Lord Ling, please wait for a moment.” The guard recognized Ling Han, and hurriedly went in to report.","In a short while, Tang Yan personally came out to receive him.","“You finally know to come see me?” Tang Yan pretended to rebuke him.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Previously, there was a case that I had been busy with, so I did not","have the time to pay a visit.”","“What case? It can’t be the blood-sucking murder case, right?” Tang Yan asked.","“That’s right.” Ling Han nodded.","“Then you’re going to have a hard time. This case isn’t something that can be solved in a short amount of time,” Tang Yan said with a smile.","“Then I’m really sorry. I already caught the culprit yesterday.”","“Ah?” Tang Yan was very surprised.","“Furthermore, I have another gain, and have deliberately invited you to come with me.”","“Yi?”","As the two of them walked into the manor, Ling Han talked about the treasure trove, causing Tang Yan’s expression to quickly turn from inattentive to solemn.","To be treated like a treasure by a Spirit Transformation True Lord, or even in fact, it was extremely likely that the Spirit Transformation True Lord would be severely injured because of this, the treasure trove corresponding to this treasure map should be incredibly shocking.","“Haha, you’re really something!” Tang Yan said.","Ling Han smiled and said, “Actually, it’s mainly because I’m not familiar with the Moonlight Planet. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have thought of you.”","“Haha!” Tang Yan laughed loudly. He naturally would not take these words seriously. If he really wanted to find someone familiar with the Moonlight Planet, where could he not find","them?","After arriving at the study, Ling Han retrieved the Cold Water Metal and handed it over to","Tang Yan.","“Yi, I seem to have some recollection of this place.” Tang Yan rubbed his chin, and a thoughtful expression appeared on his face.","After a while, he opened the connection device and brought up the map of the Moonlight Planet. Then, he projected it.","In the Moonlight Planet, ordinary people could only buy a simplified version of the map. There were large blank areas, and the exact ratio was also very different, but the map in Tang Yan’s hands was extremely complete.","“It’s here.” Tang Yan pointed at a spot, then enlarged it. That was a massive lake.","“Calm Mountain Lake?” Ling Han was surprised.","Tang Yan nodded, “The surrounding terrain is extremely similar, but this lake doesn’t match.","However, this map may have been drawn tens of thousands of years or even longer ago. Thus, the seas have changed, and it is possible that the original mountains and rivers have become","lakes.”","“That’s very likely,” Ling Han expressed his agreement.","“When do you want to set out?” Tang Yan asked.","“In any case, the blood-sucking murder case has been solved. I don’t have much to do","recently, so I can do it at any time,” Ling Han said.","“Then as soon as possible?” Tang Yan asked again.","Ling Han nodded, “All right, then let’s do it tomorrow.”","“So soon?”","“Didn’t you want to do it as soon as possible?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“Then it’s a deal,” Tang Yan said.","The matter was already agreed upon, and Ling Han returned to his quarters. Though he had a","Spatial Spirit Tool, the place he was going was possibly an ancient site, so he still had to make","some preparations."]},{"number":3782,"title":"Chapter 3782: Jin Yexue","paragraphs":["Chapter 3782: Jin Yexue","On the second day, Ling Han went to find Tang Yan alone. The empress, the large black dog, and the others were all at the crucial moment of breaking through to Heavenly Dao Foundation. Thus, they did not move out this time.","“Let’s go.”","After the two of them left the city, they both flew on their respective Tools.","With their cultivation level, the speed of flying on a Tool would not be any slower than the speed of a flying vehicle. A shuttle like Tang Yun’er’s was more suited to traversing through the galaxy, but if they were to fly on a planet, it may not be that much faster.","Tang Yan’s flying Spirit Tool was a sword. Stepping on it, he appeared very carefree.","Ling Han actually had a considerable number of Spirit Tools, but flying on a Tool required instilling a portion of one’s divine sense into it, and even if it was just a sliver, or a little bit, it would affect oneself.","For normal people, this little bit of influence wouldn’t matter at all, but Ling Han wanted to pursue the strongest and perfection, so he naturally couldn’t be the slightest bit affected.","Thus, he used the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. However, the Imperial Weapon was keeping a low profile, so at least with Tang Yan’s insight, it was impossible for him to notice anything off.","“Haha, most people would fly on their swords, yet you’re using a tower. How unconventional,” Tang Yan said with his divine sense.","Ling Han smiled, and also said with his divine sense, “This is called being different from the norm.”","They could only communicate through their divine sense. Otherwise, with their present speed, their voices couldn’t possibly enter the other party’s ears.","Unlike Celestial Sea Planet, which was actually a shattered planet, Moonlight Planet was much larger. Thus, even if Ling Han and Tang Yan were both flying at more than 20 times the speed, they still flew for seven days before finally arriving at their destination.","This was a colossal lake, and there were mountains on all sides. Under the sunlight, the waves were dazzling, like golden snakes dancing wildly.","Ling Han took out the “map”, and shockingly discovered that the images on it had changed. Furthermore, they were animated. It was a person spinning a golden pillar, turning left three times, and right nine times, repeating endlessly.","Obviously, Tang Yan had not led them the wrong way. The unique trait of this Cold Water Metal was that when they arrived at a unique location, it would display the images that had been left behind beforehand.","Precisely because they had found the place, the map had changed.","“Go into the water?” Tang Yan looked towards Ling Han.","Ling Han nodded earnestly, “Let’s go.”","With their cultivation levels, there was naturally nothing for them to be afraid of. They both jumped into the water.","The lake water was not cold. Instead, it was warm, making one feel comfortable all over.","The two of them dived downwards. Now that they had advanced into Celestial Path, there was no need for them to worry about the problem of breathing. As long as they could absorb the power of heaven and earth, cultivators would be able to continue living.","After swimming for a while, a large fish suddenly swam over from ahead of them. It was more than thirty meters long, and was completely dark green in colour. Every fish scale was the size of a bowl.","This fish demon was very fierce. The moment it came up, it opened its mouth wide and bit at the two of them, its teeth as sharp as sabers.","Tang Yan moved, and with a tap of his finger, pa, a bloody hole appeared on the head of that giant fish. Its stomach turned upwards, and it was completely dead.","Once this giant fish died, small fish immediately popped out from who knows where, and began to eat around it. In just a short while, this giant fish had turned into a skeleton, and was sinking towards the bottom of the lake.","They continued to advance, and not long after, a black eel swam over. From afar, it arched its body, and zi, a bolt of lightning struck over.","This was a Foundation Building Tier fish demon. This bolt of lightning was as thick as an arm, and it formed the shape of a zigzag.","Ling Han directly shot out a murderous aura attack. Weng, that eel immediately fainted.","“Yi?” Tang Yan was surprised.","If Ling Han had killed the demonic fish with a single punch or kick, he wouldn’t have found it strange at all. After all, he knew just how powerful Ling Han was. In fact, he could be regarded as number one among Foundation Building Tier cultivators. However, he had knocked the demonic fish unconscious without even needing to attack physically. This was simply unfathomable.","“I have discovered that you really have hidden depths,” he said.","When Ling Han heard these words, he couldn’t help but think of the large black dog. Presumably, if this guy was here, he would probably look at his crotch, and mutter something along the lines of “as expected, it didn’t show”, instantly making people not know whether to laugh or cry.","“Then you can slowly discover them,” he said with a smile.","The two of them continued to swim towards the bottom of the lake. The light instantly dimmed, and in the end, this place became completely dark. However, there was a mysterious marine creature here. It was very small in size, but it would emit a weak light. Once there were too many of them, this lake would also become hazy, so it was not like they couldn’t even see the fingers of their own hands.","“Hmm?”","Ling Han and Tang Yan exclaimed in surprise at the same time. They saw a white object float over from ahead of them.","Very soon, they could see clearly. It was actually a woman. She was dressed in white, and her black hair spread out like water plants, possessing a kind of messy beauty.","There was actually a woman floating in such deep waters?","Was this place haunted?","“She’s injured.” Ling Han’s eyes swept over her, and saw that behind this woman, there was a slight red in the lake waters.","The two of them swam over. As expected, this woman was injured, and there were also signs","of life.","Ling Han stretched out a finger and tapped on the woman’s head. A mystical power surged in, instantly causing the woman’s delicate body to tremble, and she regained consciousness.","“Who are you people?” she asked through divine sense. She immediately went into a","defensive stance.","Tang Yan’s eyes involuntarily lit up. This woman was truly beautiful. Her eyes were bright like water, and her brows were slender like a painting. Moreover, she had an indescribable bearing, making her appear extremely noble. He hurriedly replied, “My name is Tang Yan, and he is Ling Han. Don’t be afraid. We have just saved you!”","The woman looked him and Tang Yan over several times, then nodded, and said, “Thank","you.”","“Beauty, how did you get injured?” Tang Yan was very proactive, “Did you get injured by someone? Tell me, and I will avenge you!”","As the son of the Tang Clan, what kind of beauty had he not seen before? Yet now, he actually took the initiative to curry her favour, which showed how beautiful this woman was.","The woman paused slightly, then said, “I wanted to come here to hunt a kind of treasure fish, but accidentally discovered a golden pillar. Out of curiosity, I turned it around, and in the end, suffered a serious injury, and passed out. If I had not been saved by you guys, it is very possible that I would have died in the stomach of the fish.”","Golden pillar?","Ling Han and Tang Yan exchanged looks. Was there really such a coincidence?","“Where is that pillar? Can you bring us there?” Tang Yan asked.","Seeing that he was chatting happily with this woman, Ling Han remained silent all this while,","acting as a spectator.","A hesitant expression appeared on the woman’s face, and she said, “That place is extremely","dangerous...”","“It’s fine. We have heard you talk about it, so we’re already prepared,” Tang Yan interrupted.","He still hadn’t been overwhelmed by her beauty. He didn’t say that he and Ling Han were actually looking for this golden pillar.","“All right,” the woman nodded.","The three of them swam forward together. The woman had only suffered some light injuries,","but they were not serious. She was fine now that she had woke up.","The journey was relatively peaceful. After more than half an hour, a massive clump of water","grass appeared ahead of them.","“Right here,” the beauty said, pointing at the seaweed.","“Oh, that’s right. How should I address you, beautiful woman?” Tang Yan asked shamelessly.","The woman pondered for a moment, then said, “Jin, Jin Yexue.”"]},{"number":3783,"title":"Chapter 3783: What a coincidence","paragraphs":["Chapter 3783: What a coincidence","“Jin Yexue, what a good name!” Tang Yan praised, as he pushed aside the water plants and continued onwards.","This was a stretch of water grass, which was tall and dense. After travelling for half a minute, the eyes of the three lit up, and a golden pillar appeared.","It was about six meters tall, and as thick as a thigh.","“Ling Han, it’s here!” Tang Yan said to Ling Han.","“Yi, you guys are looking for this thing?” Jin Yexue asked curiously.","Tang Yan chuckled, “This is all thanks to you. Otherwise, if we had to find this place on our own, we would probably have to search for a good few days.”","Visibility was greatly affected at the bottom of the lake, and the golden pillar was standing in the dense underbrush, which was really hard to find.","Ling Han glanced at Jin Yexue, and a question flashed through his mind. However, he didn’t say it out loud.","At present, Tang Yan was very keen on expressing himself. Though he was the Little Marquis, now that he had met the woman he liked, his performance was also like all men in love. His intelligence had seriously declined, and his desire to express himself was soaring.","He gripped the golden pillar, and began to spin it.","Three on the left, nine on the right.","Ka, ka, ka! Suddenly, there was the sound of gears turning. That golden pillar slowly descended, right until it had completely disappeared.","Boom, a louder sound was heard, like an earthquake.","No, this really seemed like an earthquake. A powerful wave rose up in the water, causing the three of them to tremble slightly.","However, Ling Han and Tang Yan were both elites of Celestial Path, and Jin Yexue was not inferior either. She was shockingly also a Cauldron Forging Tier. When the waves crashed onto her, she was completely unaffected, and only swayed slightly.","Ling Han didn’t use his eyes to observe, but he continued to observe with his divine sense. When Tang Yan spun the golden pillar just then, her eyes narrowed slightly, and a hint of pleasant surprise appeared on her beautiful face.","At present, Ling Han was not sure what this pleasant surprise actually meant, but he was sure that it was definitely not as simple as she had said, how she had accidentally come here for fishing.","Hong long long, the mountains shook and the ground shook, incredibly intense.","“Yi, it seems like the bottom of the lake is rising!” Tang Yan said.","At first, they were floating in the water, but now, their feet were standing on the mud. There was a force pushing them upwards at an extremely fast speed, causing them to feel a clear pushing force.","About ten minutes later, a loud splash was heard, and the three of them actually broke through the water surface!","Hiss!","They looked ahead, and all of them looked stunned. That was because there was a group of buildings ahead of them. The walls of gold were brilliant, and they were presently standing in the plaza of this group of buildings. At this moment, the mud was dispersing like water, revealing floor tiles that were as white as jade.","It was not the whole lake that had risen, but rather an area within the lake. It was like an island had suddenly risen up in the lake, and its surface area was really not small either.","“This is... what ancient site is this?” Tang Yan murmured.","The three of them walked forwards. After walking past this plaza, a wall blocked their path. They turned towards the main doors, and saw two words were written on the plaque of the doors: “Jin Manor”.","Jin Manor?","Ling Han and Tang Yan both turned to look at Jin Yexue, their expressions filled with strong questions.","This was the Jin Manor, and this woman’s surname was Jin. Moreover, she had been injured because of the golden pillar from before... With all this added together, how could Ling Han and Tang Yan not suspect that this woman had no relationship with the Jin Manor?","Jin Yexue took a deep breath, then nodded, and said, “That’s right. This is the ancestral grounds of our Jin Clan. I have not come to catch some treasure fish, but rather to find our lost ancestral grounds.”","“It’s fine, it’s fine. Who doesn’t have a bit of vigilance?” Tang Yan smiled and played mediator, “No wonder you were able to find this place. We followed the map and searched for a very long time.”","Jin Yexue smiled bitterly, and said, “In order to find the lost ancestral grounds, the clan has been searching for generation after generation. It was only in my generation that I finally found the location. However, I was unable to enter. Instead, I was knocked unconscious.” She paused, then continued, “When I saw you guys, I was suspicious. This place is so remote, so how did you guys come here? Could it be that you guys have obtained the lost ancestral map of the Jin Clan? Thus, after you guys invited me, I took advantage of the situation and brought you guys here.”","F***, how could things be so coincidental? They actually encountered the descendant of this treasure trove while searching for it.","Ling Han and Tang Yan exchanged looks. Then what were they now? Thieves?","Yet Jin Yexue took the initiative to say, “Though this is the ancestral grounds of our Jin Clan, it has been too many years, and secondly, I do not have the slightest understanding of this place either, so I am not qualified to call myself owner of this place at all. Come to think of it, it is still because of you that I have been able to see the ancestral grounds again. So, why don’t we explore together, and share the gains we obtain?”","“All right.” Ling Han and Tang Yan exchanged a look, and nodded at the same time.","“Alright,” Jin Yexue said with a smile. It was as if 100 flowers had bloomed at the same time, and she appeared especially captivating.","Tang Yan was slightly dazed, and only came back to his senses after being nudged by Ling","Han.","“Let’s take a look now.” Ling Han took out the Cold Water Metal, because he wasn’t sure if opening this door required a special technique.","There was indeed a change in the image on the Cold Water Metal, but it was not focused on the main doors. Going by the look of things, there was no need for any special technique to enter the main doors.","“I’ll go,” Tang Yan said. He was very willing to show off in front of beautiful women. After he knew that there was no danger at the main doors, he immediately rushed forwards to push the","doors open.","A creak was heard, and there was a rustle of dust as the great doors were slowly pushed open. The three of them walked through the doors, and what appeared in front of them was a garden that had already withered. In the past, this place should have been very beautiful. Multiple flowerbeds were decorated in a unique manner, and had an indescribable charm to them.","Ling Han gave a ‘yi’, and said, “Don’t move.”","“What is it?” Tang Yan did not mind, and took a step forwards.","Shua, a streak of light blasted towards him at an astonishing speed.","Tang Yan was unable to dodge, and he was instantly struck head-on. However, a ball of light also flickered on his body, turning into a screen of light that blocked the light that was","assailing him.","Tang Yan’s face paled in fright, and he hurriedly stepped back. “F*ck! I almost died once!” He had a life-saving treasure on him, and it would only activate automatically when he encountered life-threatening danger. It was that treasure that had activated just now, saving","his life.","“That attack definitely reached the level of the Core Formation Tier. If it weren’t for the treasure my grandfather gave me, I would definitely be dead!” He was filled with lingering","fear.","Ling Han sighed, “Can’t you take it easy?”","This guy’s behavior was a little abnormal. Looks like if one met someone he liked, his brain","would really fail.","“Hehe, wasn’t it because I didn’t see any danger either?” Tang Yan argued. From the image on the Cold Water Metal just now, they were still far from reaching that place, so he had been","a little careless.","Ling Han said with a serious expression, “There’s a formation set up here. If one doesn’t think of a way to break through it, or doesn’t follow the rules, they’ll be attacked. Just calculate how many more times that treasure can be used.”","Tang Yan smiled sheepishly. Though there was no limit to the number of times he could use the treasure on him, a shield could only be activated every minute. Thus, as long as the attacks were concentrated, it would definitely be unable to block them.","“Yi, you’re also a Formation Master?” He suddenly turned around."]},{"number":3784,"title":"Chapter 3784: Destroying the Formation","paragraphs":["Chapter 3784: Destroying the Formation","Ling Han smiled, “What is it? Can’t I become a Formation Master?”","Meanwhile, Jin Yexue was slightly confused. You, a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, brought a Foundation Building Tier cultivator into an ancient site. That must be because of his","formation skills. Otherwise, why would you bring a burden?","This was not a senior bringing a junior for training.","But looking at Tang Yan’s expression, it seemed like he had completely no idea that Ling Han was a Formation Master. This was very strange.","“Of course!” Tang Yan hurriedly said. “Have you forgotten that you’re an alchemist? Have you forgotten that you just obtained the title of the strongest Foundation Building Tier during His Majesty’s birthday celebration? And now you’re telling me that you know formation techniques? F***, are you trying to scare me to death?”","Was this for real?","Jin Yexue’s small mouth was half-gaping, as she surveyed Ling Han. This time, she was extremely serious.","Previously, though she had also observed Ling Han, he was merely a Foundation Building cultivator, so how could she possibly spend too much effort on him? She only took a glance, and after confirming his cultivation level, she naturally stopped paying attention.","She really couldn’t tell that such a young man actually cultivated three fields at the same time.","Ling Han smiled faintly and said, “There’s no harm in learning more skills. It’s not a bad idea to learn more.”","Tang Yan instantly suffered a blow. He was not very old either, but with his talent and the support of his clan, he had already charged up to the Cauldron Forging Tier. This had always made him self-satisfied. This accomplishment was incredible. But compared with Ling Han? That’s right. He was indeed inferior to him in terms of cultivation level, but firstly, his potential was not the slightest bit inferior. Secondly, he had also dabbled in alchemy and formation techniques at the same time, and had even concocted Foundation Dissolution Pill, so his future achievements in alchemy and formation techniques were boundless.","Dual cultivation in alchemy and martial arts was already kickass enough. Now, another identity popped up, and he was actually a Formation Master?","‘Holy f*ck!’","To compare oneself with another, it was really infuriating.","“Sigh!” He sighed, “I too want to learn another skill, but I don’t have the time at all!” “Alright, stop moaning. I’ll go break the formation first,” Ling Han said. “Come, continue forward and stimulate the formation. I need to observe more to make a judgement.”","Tang Yan’s expression instantly darkened. ‘You f*cking want me to be beaten?’","“Then should I go?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","Tang Yan waved a hand dismissively, “Then forget it. It’s better for me.”","He had rare treasures that could save his life, but did Ling Han have rare treasures?","He walked forward again, and instantly, a ray of light shot over. This time, it could be seen clearly, and turned into a sword of light.","Tang Yan couldn’t block it at all. Peng! He was struck head-on, and then he hurriedly retreated.","Ling Han took everything in. Then, he closed his eyes, and his eyeballs trembled slightly. This was him performing a high-speed deduction.","What he saw was not only the strike of a sword of light, but also the changes that had taken place in the whole garden before that.","“Combined with the arrangement of the flowerbed, I can conclude that this is the Gauze King White Bird Formation,” Ling Han thought. Then, he opened his mouth and said, “Brother Tang, go out again. This time, stand on the second brick in the third row.”","“... Left or right?” Tang Yan asked. There were four bricks in that row.","“Left!” Ling Han really wanted to kick him. Did he count from right to left?","Tang Yan didn’t dare to act rashly. A minute passed, and the rare treasure could be activated again. He then leaped out, landing on the brick that Ling Han had mentioned.","Yi, no light shot out.","He faltered at first, then was overjoyed, “Ling Han, you have really broken through the formation!”","“Don’t be happy too early. There are a lot of changes to the Gauze King White Bird Formation. I need to observe it a few more times to be able to confirm which change it is,” Ling Han said calmly, instead of cheering.","“All right, all right.” Tang Yan nodded. He was not being attacked now, which already proved that Ling Han’s strength in formations was very extraordinary.","Jin Xuesha also saw this, and her beautiful eyes lit up. It was as if she were thinking about something.","Tang Yan walked forward again. Xiu, the sword of light shot over again. After sustaining a strike, he hurriedly retreated to a safe place.","Ling Han pondered for a moment, then said, “The third brick on the fifth row ahead of you.”","“All right.” Tang Yan leaped out, and landed on the brick that Ling Han had mentioned. True enough, he had not been attacked.","“Good job!” He gave Ling Han a thumbs up.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Enough with the show. Let’s continue forward.”","“I still have to be beaten?” Tang Yan was a little depressed. He was the Little Marquis!","Ling Han merely chuckled, and ignored him.","Tang Yan was only joking. He took another step forwards.","Yi, no attack had reached him?","Tang Yan had already prepared himself to retreat, but he had never imagined that this brick","that he had randomly chosen would actually be a safe area.","Ling Han was also rendered speechless. This guy’s luck was really quite good.","“Haha, I am indeed blessed by the heavens!” Tang Yan laughed loudly.","“Yes, yes, yes.” Ling Han also smiled, and began to walk forwards. At the same time, he turned his head and said to Jin Yexue, “Follow the bricks that I have stepped on.”","“All right,” Jin Yexue nodded. Though she was a descendant of the Jin Clan, she lacked understanding of this place.","After taking two steps, Ling Han was already standing behind Tang Yan. At this moment, he had already completely grasped this formation. It was impossible for him to break through, but it was completely no problem for him to find a safe path from within.","With another leap, he landed on the fourth brick.","This caused Tang Yan’s heart to skip a beat. Ling Han didn’t have a rare treasure, and if he were swept by that light, a Core Formation Tier-level attack, it would be enough to insta-kill","him several hundred times over.","Thankfully, it did not just strike out.","Tang Yan breathed a sigh of relief, and discovered that there was actually some sweat on his","palms.","Xiu, Ling Han leaped out again, and landed on the fifth brick.","“Follow,” he said.","Tang Yan and Jin Yexue hurriedly moved as well, moving in unison. You jump, I jump. One","landed behind Ling Han, while the other landed behind Jin Yexue.","-Tang Yan had Jin Yexue go first, while he brought up the rear.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! It was at this moment that several figures flew past in the skies, and all of them","landed on the plaza outside.","“Yi, someone actually activated the mechanism, making the ancient site reappear!”","“Who are you people to the Old Geezer Gu?”","There were a total of five people in that group, and they were three men and two women respectively. They all looked very young, but every single one of them was in the Cauldron Forging Tier, exuding a powerful aura.","What Old Geezer Gu?","Tang Yan and Jin Yexue were both at a loss, but a thought flashed through Ling Han’s mind.","The blood sucking Spirit Transformation True Lord that he had killed was very likely to have a fierce battle with someone over the treasure map. In the end, he lost a leg, and his chest was also severely wounded. His battle prowess dropped drastically, and he actually had to control others to bring him blood to heal his injuries.","Then, could his competitors have also seen the treasure map?","That would at least be a Spirit Transformation True Lord. With the memory of such an elite, it shouldn’t be difficult for him to remember everything he saw.","Perhaps that elite had also been severely wounded, and that was why he had sent his juniors","over. In any case, he remembered where it was.","Of course, this was only Ling Han’s deduction.","“How dare you! You actually dare to disrespect our Lord!” Ling Han decided to trick him, and","immediately shouted."]},{"number":3785,"title":"Chapter 3785: Advantage of Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 3785: Advantage of Time","“Haha, what Lord? One of his legs was broken by my Founder, and he almost dug out his heart. If Old Geezer Gu dares to come out now, I’ll kill him,” a red-robed man said, his face filled with disdain.","As expected, it had been tricked out.","This was caused by the unequal information that both sides knew. When the other party saw that not only had Ling Han and his group found the place, they had also activated the mechanism, they must have thought that they were the blood sucking Spirit Transformation True Lord’s people. They had never thought that it was actually Ling Han who had killed him and snatched his treasures.","Ling Han continued to bluff, “Humph, Milord’s recovery rate is extremely good. Just a few nobodies like you dare to come here; you’re really courting death!”","Hearing these words, the expressions of the five people changed slightly.","After all, that was a Spirit Transformation True Lord. Even if a tiger died, its might was still there. Moreover, he was not dead yet. What if he really recovered to the strength of Core Formation Tier, or even True Self Tier? Then wouldn’t they just be seeking death?","“Humph, don’t try to trick me!” Among the five of them, the man in black clothing smirked coldly, “Our Founder has returned to the sect, and has a large amount of Celestial medicines to support him. He has just recovered the battle prowess of the Core Formation Tier, and Old Monster Gu has fled into Moonlight Planet. How could it be that he would dare to publicly suck blood to heal his injuries, and is not afraid of being killed by the elites of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire?”","Ling Han smiled faintly. These words revealed a lot of information.","Firstly, the elite who had competed with the blood sucking Spirit Transformation True Lord for the treasure map was also severely wounded, so he couldn’t take the treasure himself.","But why had only a few Cauldron Forging Tiers been sent?","Because they were not the people of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, sending elites over would attract the attention of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. It should be known that it was presently the time when the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire was invading, and the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire would definitely not allow unfamiliar elites to come to their base.","There were other considerations as well. Perhaps that so-called Founder was worried about elites of the same cultivation level as him. What if someone really took the treasure and did not hand it over to him?","When it concerned precious cultivation techniques and rare treasures, who would even consider the friendship of fellow sect members?","Moreover, the higher one’s cultivation level was, the higher the teleportation fee would be. This should also be one of the reasons.","“Alright, I won’t trick you,” Ling Han said with a smile. “What do you guys want to do now?” “Needless to say, I’m naturally going to kill you!” The red-robed man laughed loudly. “Since we’ve confirmed that Old Monster Gu isn’t here, the three of you... should just die!”","Ling Han was trying to trick them, and they were also trying to get information out of him. Tang Yan laughed loudly, and crooked a finger, “Come on then!”","“I’ll kill you!” A woman in green leaped over, sword in hand. She directly burst through the doors, and charged towards Tang Yan.","“Sigh!” Tang Yan didn’t dodge, and he remained as calm as could be.","“Junior Sister Wu, be careful!” the red-robed man suddenly shouted.","However, it was already too late.","Though the woman in green had not stepped on the ground in the garden, after she had flown a certain distance in the air, she had also activated the formation. Xiu, a flash of sword light immediately slashed towards her.","It was incredibly fast, and it was equivalent to the attack of a Core Formation Tier elite. How could a Cauldron Forging Tier dodge it?","Pa, a ball of blood exploded, as if a rose had bloomed in fury.","“Ah!” The woman in green screamed in pain. She had already retreated, but her left arm had been severed from the shoulder. Blood was gushing out, and she looked extremely miserable. “Junior Sister!” The other four people all surrounded her, all of them concerned and furious. “You people are so ruthless!” the man in black chided harshly.","Tang Yan shrugged, “Oh, you guys can kill us, and we are ruthless just because we counterattack? Hehe, this has nothing to do with us. We were not the ones who set up the formation.”","“Humph, do you really think that we cannot kill you just because of this?” The man in green robes who had not spoken all this while finally spoke up. He took out a sculpture. It was only about a foot tall, and was as white as jade.","He recited an incantation, and his eyes suddenly burst with silver light. Weng, the eyes of that statue actually turned the same lustre white. Xiu, a pillar of light suddenly shot out, striking out at Tang Yan.","Peng!","Light clashed fiercely, dazzling and brilliant.","Tang Yan was given a fright. This was because the Light of Dao had struck him too quickly, and he had not managed to dodge or block in time at all. Furthermore, it was the rare treasure on him that had automatically activated, saving his life.","What if he delivered another shot?","“Quick, follow me!” Ling Han obviously thought of it as well, and hurriedly shouted.","Moreover, it was fortunate that it was Tang Yan who had been shot. What if it had been him or Jin Yexue?","Jin Yexue hurriedly followed, and Tang Yan also followed closely behind. However, it was clear from this how meticulously Tang Yan was thinking. As he walked, he sent out a palm strike, stimulating the power of heaven and earth, which turned into a dazzling brilliance, blurring the position where they had landed, so that the green-robed man and the others would not remember their route.","The man in green was also astonished. He hadn’t expected that he would still fail to kill Tang Yan even after unleashing his most powerful weapon.","Moreover, this Spirit Tool was actually at the level of the Core Formation Tier. With his strength, he couldn’t activate it continuously, so he hurriedly handed it over to the red-robed","man beside him.","The red-robed man injected his mystical power into the statue. Weng, the eyes of the statue lit up again. Xiu, a pillar of light shot out.","Unfortunately, Ling Han and the others had already made a turn in time, and circled behind a flowerbed. This pillar of light landed on the stones of the flowerbed, and did not hit them.","In this way, Ling Han and the others had already left them far behind. Firstly, it was not easy to aim, and secondly, there were even more obstacles on their way, so it was impossible to hit","them.","“Junior Sister Nangong, it’s up to you now,” the man in green said to the woman at the end.","Her name was Nangong Qian, and aside from being a cultivator, she was also a Formation","Master.","“All right!” She nodded, “I will break through the formation as soon as possible, and make those three pay the price for Junior Sister Wu’s injuries!”","The woman in green held a sword, her face pale, her eyes filled with killing intent.","She had lost an arm, and from now onwards, she had become a cripple!","And all this was because of those three people.","Ling Han led the way, and soon walked through this garden.","“This isn’t good. Not only do they have more Cauldron Forging Tier elites than us, but they also have a rare treasure with astonishing destructive power.” Tang Yan frowned. “I still have the ability to protect myself, but if you guys take a hit, you’ll probably be in trouble.” Ling Han and Jin Yexue both nodded. They did not have a life-saving treasure like Tang Yan. “We still have some advantage in time. Let’s move quickly,” Ling Han said.","“En!”","They hurriedly walked forwards. After passing through the garden, there was a hall ahead of them. Ling Han first observed it, and after confirming that there was no danger, it was still Tang Yan who took the lead. Then, Ling Han and Jin Yexue followed him in. Though there were no treasures here, Jin Yexue was slightly distracted. She looked left and","right, her eyes slightly drifting, as if she was picturing how when the ancestors of the Jin Clan were still alive, this place was filled with guests.","They passed through the Main Hall, and when they came out, three paths appeared at the","same time.","“One leads to the inner courtyard, one leads to the training ground, and one leads to the Cultivation Technique Library,” Jin Yexue said.","This should be a memory left behind by their ancestors. Even in their dreams, they dreamt of returning to their ancestral grounds."]},{"number":3786,"title":"Chapter 3786: Library","paragraphs":["Chapter 3786: Library","There was nothing much to say. They definitely should go to the cultivation technique library. Jin Yexue led the way, and they chose a left turn.","They had to pass through a bamboo garden first. After so long, and furthermore, it had been buried deep at the bottom of the lake all this while, this bamboo garden was actually still verdant and dark green.","“Yi, this is Nine Patterns Bamboo!” Tang Yan exclaimed in shock, “This is something that can be forged into a Three Star precious tool!”","“This thing only grows a bit every 10,000 years, and can wait for a dead person,” he said endlessly. “Growing it for 90,000 years is the limit. There are a great many that have rotted away from old age here, and they are all bamboos that have exceeded 90,000 years old. This is really a great waste! This needs to be submerged in Boundless Water for three years first, and it would be sturdy and uncorroded, which would last a million years.”","“What a waste, what a real waste,” he lamented bitterly.","Ling Han took a look, and cut off a few Nine Patterns Bamboo that had reached maturity. He gave two to each of them, and said with a smile, “The ones planted along the path are all Nine Patterns Bamboo, used for ornamental purposes. Lady Jin, your family’s ancestors must be incomparably glorious.”","Jin Yexue nodded implicitly, “My clan does indeed have some reputation.”","“You’re making me look forward to it even more.” Tang Yan rubbed his hands together, “It can’t be a Saint Technique, right?”","“Of course not,” Jin Yexue said with a shake of her head. “The Jin Clan has never produced a Saint before. I’m sorry to disappoint you.”","“How could that be!” Tang Yan hurriedly replied. “You didn’t in the past, but you definitely will in the future.”","Jin Yexue faltered upon hearing this. Only then did she realize that he was talking about her. She couldn’t help but smile beautifully, and her ice-cold demeanor instantly disappeared. She was extremely graceful, and Tang Yan couldn’t help but stare at her.","This guy forgot his friends when he saw the woman he was in love with.","Ling Han shook his head, and walked straight ahead.","The Jin Manor was huge, and after walking for a while, they finally arrived at their destination.","Ahead of them was a small building, and in front of the small building, there was a fierce- looking stone Pixiu keeping watch.","Ling Han took out the Cold Water Metal for a look, and said, “To open the doors, the mechanism is behind that Pixiu.”","“I’ll open it.” Tang Yan hurriedly ran over.","However, he hadn’t reached it yet, when he saw that stone Pixiu actually came back to life. It opened its bloody mouth and bit at him.","There was a snapping sound, and before Tang Yan could even dodge, he had already been bitten.","The stone Pixiu swayed left and right, and after chewing a few times, it finally threw Tang Yan out. With a bang, he fell onto the ground. Meanwhile, the stone Pixiu returned to its original position, and flopped down, turning back into a stone statue.","“F***!” Tang Yan struggled to get to his feet. The rare treasure he had on him had already been activated, but it was completely useless. He had been bitten through by the stone Pixiu, but the strange thing was that he had only suffered a light injury.","Theoretically speaking, it should have been able to crush a Core Formation Tier-level shield with a single bite, so what difference did Tang Yan have with a small fish? He would have become a dead fish with a single bite.","Thus, it wasn’t that Tang Yan was lucky, but rather that the stone Pixiu had no intention of killing him.","“What do we do now?” Tang Yan was dumbfounded.","“Let’s attack together. You’re in charge of attracting its attention, and I’ll open the mechanism,” Ling Han said.","Tang Yan wore a dark expression, and he asked, “Why don’t I open the mechanism?”","“Because you’re more compatible with it,” Ling Han said with a smile.","Pei, you are the one who is compatible.","Tang Yan grumbled internally. However, his cultivation level was higher than Ling Han’s, and he also had the rare treasure to protect him. No matter what, he would be able to withstand a beating better than Ling Han. Thus, it was definitely him.","“Come!”","As he said this, he immediately charged out. The stone Pixiu also responded, and suddenly stood up.","“Come and chase me!” Tang Yan had successfully drawn its attention, and hurriedly broke into a run.","The stone Pixiu chased after him, which was slightly dumb.","Ling Han hurriedly leaped out as well, but he had just leaped out, when he saw the stone Pixiu’s body tremble, and another one actually appeared in its original position.","F***!","This stone Pixiu immediately charged out, biting towards Ling Han.","Its abilities were far too terrifying, and it was extremely likely that it had already reached the True Self Tier. So what if Ling Han was freakishly powerful? He was only at the Foundation Building Tier, after all.","He couldn’t resist at all, and he was bitten and thrashed.","When the stone Pixiu had played enough, it opened its mouth and spat. Pu, Ling Han fell onto","the ground.","How tragic.","On the other side, the one that was pursuing Tang Yan had also completed its mission. It jogged back, and then fused with the other stone Pixiu, turning back into one.","“I say, what kind of terrible idea did you come up with?” Tang Yan came back, his hands on","his hips.","Ling Han spread his hands and said, “I didn’t know that would happen either.”","Thankfully, the stone Pixiu didn’t kill them, and only bit them painfully.","“What do we do now?” Tang Yan asked gloomily.","“I’ll do it,” Jin Yexue stepped forward and said.","“You’re no match for it!” Tang Yan hurriedly exclaimed. He had already activated his trait of","chivalry.","“I’m not going to fight it,” Jin Yexue said as she walked forward. When the stone Pixiu came back to life, she bit her finger, and blood instantly seeped out.","The stone Pixiu’s movements came to an abrupt stop. It looked dumbly at Jin Yexue, as if it","had turned back into a stone statue.","Jin Yexue walked over and wiped the blood on the stone Pixiu’s forehead.","She turned around again, and said, “The ancestral bloodline can freeze it for about half an hour. Let’s go in immediately.”","Tang Yan and Ling Han both nodded. They went to the stone statue’s location and pulled the trigger. Ka, ka, ka! The doors to the small building immediately opened.","They entered, and saw that it was filled with bookshelves. Some were filled with books, some were filled with jade plates, and there were also animal hides and stone tablets.","“There aren’t any valuable secret techniques on the first floor. Let’s go to the second floor,”","Jin Yexue said.","Ling Han and Tang Yan both nodded in understanding. Although Jin Yexue had never come here before, she was still a member of the Jin Clan, after all. Thus, she would naturally know more about this place than them.","They went up to the second floor. The layout here was more or less the same as the floor below. There were still rows of bookshelves, covered with dust.","Ling Han picked up a book, yet it immediately turned into dust. Too much time had passed.","Tang Yan and Jin Yexue were also searching, but without exception, ordinary books definitely could not be preserved for tens of thousands of years, and had long since decayed. However, this place had not been touched all this while, and that was why it maintained the appearance of a book, but would shatter at the slightest touch.","Then what about the stone plates and jade plates?","“Thirteen Blood Moon Palms.”","“Thousand Transformations Fist Scroll.”","“Night Scroll.”","“...”","They found a great many cultivation techniques, and they were all very first-class, but they were only limited to the level of the True Self Tier. There was no True Lord Tier cultivation technique or Sect Master Tier-level technique.","Could it be that even the strongest ancestor of the Jin Clan was only a True Self Tier elite?","If that was the case, then “Old Monster Gu” would die with remaining grievances.","A mighty Spirit Transformation True Lord had actually died for the treasure trove of a measly","True Self Tier elite?","Hehe.","Ling Han did not believe this. He had been secretly observing Jin Yexueall this while. This woman was a descendant of the Jin Clan. If there was a precious technique, she should know","where it was stored.","Though Jin Yexue did not make any unusual movements all this while, and was just like Ling Han and Tang Yan, rummaging through the bookshelves, every once in a while, she would use her gaze to look in a certain direction. It was very covert. If Ling Han had not been observing","her all this while, he would definitely not have noticed.","What... lay there?","Ling Han walked over, and his divine sense immediately discovered that Jin Yexue looked","slightly nervous."]},{"number":3787,"title":"Chapter 3787: Background of the Jin Clan","paragraphs":["Chapter 3787: Background of the Jin Clan","There was a wall in front of Ling Han, and there was nothing else.","He stretched out a hand, and began knocking on the brick.","Tong, tong, tong, the sound was muffled.","Ling Han switched to another brick, and knocked again. It was still the same, and he moved again.","After switching to a dozen over bricks, the sound suddenly changed, becoming very crisp and clear.","He revealed a smile. This was hollow.","“Tang Yan, Lady Jin,” he called out.","Tang Yan walked over, a dazed expression on his face. However, Jin Yexue wore a smile of admiration as she said, “Sure enough, I wasn’t able to fool you.”","Ling Han merely smiled faintly.","“Yi, what kind of secret signal are you guys playing? Why don’t I understand?” Tang Yan’s expression was filled with confusion.","“If you don’t understand, that’s right.” Ling Han pointed at that brick, “Come, smash it open.”","Yet Jin Yexue shook her head, “Don’t worry. There is no danger here.”","She walked forwards, and delivered a palm strike. Pa, the brick immediately shattered. She stretched out her hand again, and when she took it out, there was an iron box in her hand. “Yi!” Tang Yan’s eyes instantly widened.","Jin Yexue opened the box. There were three items inside.","There were two thin books and a piece of animal hide.","When Ling Han’s eyes swept over this animal hide, his heart involuntarily beat wildly.","He had seen this thing once.","“Can I take a look first?” He pointed at the animal hide.","“As you wish,” Jin Yexue said with a nod. “We’ve already discussed this before. Everyone will have a share of the cultivation techniques that we obtain.”","Ling Han retrieved that piece of beast hide and unfurled it. Meanwhile, Jin Yexue and Tang Yan also retrieved a book each.","“Hiss, the Great Overarching Heaven Technique!” Tang Yan’s voice was trembling slightly. He suddenly stood up, pointed at Jin Yexue and said, “You, you are a descendant of the Jin Clan of the Eternal Prosperity Majestic Empire!”","“That’s right!” Jin Yexue nodded proudly, exuding an indescribable air of nobility.","Meanwhile, Ling Han’s heart trembled madly. That was because he had not guessed wrongly. What was recorded on this beast hide was the Spirit Diagram of Destruction Energy!","He had only grasped a portion of it, and this was another portion. Whether the two together could complete the Spirit Diagram, Ling Han did not know either, because he had yet to begin cultivating.","He suppressed the excitement in his heart, and asked, “What Eternal Prosperity Majestic Empire?”","“Let me explain,” Jin Yexue said as she pressed a hand down on Tang Yan. Her domineering aura caused Tang Yan to involuntarily shut up.","“Before the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, the Eternal Prosperity Majestic Empire ruled over the Moonlight Planet and its thirty-six subordinate planets,” she said proudly, a flash of nostalgic glory appearing on her pretty face. “However, around sixty thousand years ago, the Eternal Prosperity Majestic Empire’s Emperor, Jin Yue, failed to break through to Saint Tier and died. The Meng Clan, which should have been loyal and devoted, suddenly betrayed and massacred the Jin Clan.”","“Fortunately, the Jin Clan’s Emperor had left a bloodline treasure in the outside world just in case. No one knew about it, and it was because of this that they managed to escape.”","“However, in order to prevent the Meng Clan from finding the ancestral grounds of our Jin Clan, the ancestors would rather oppose them and hide the ancestral grounds. It was also because of this that the Jin Clan’s branch family was also unable to find the ancestral grounds. Generation after generation, they hid their hatred for the Meng Clan while searching for the whereabouts of the ancestral grounds.”","Ling Han was astonished. He hadn’t imagined that Jin Yexue would have such a powerful background.","Meanwhile, Jin Yexue looked at Tang Yan, “Young Marquis, do you still dare to accept the precious technique here?”","“You know who I am?” Tang Yan was slightly surprised.","“Who hasn’t heard of the dignified Little Marquis?” Jin Xuexue asked calmly.","Tang Yan couldn’t help but frown.","The moment the Meng Clan rose to power, they immediately began to clear their name. Tens of thousands of years had passed, and ordinary people knew that the Moonlight Planet only had one Imperial Family, and that was the Meng Clan. However, in some powerful forces, the truth of the past still circulated. In fact, there was even a portion of forces that were loyal to the surviving dregs of the Jin Clan, and were just waiting for the day when the descendant of the Jin Clan would appear, and with a wave of his arm and a shout, destroy the Meng Clan.","If he obtained the inheritance of the Jin Clan’s cultivation technique, that would be equivalent to standing on the opposite side of the Meng Clan, unless he handed over the things here at the first instant.","And that included Jin Yexue.","This caused him to feel conflicted. Jin Yexue was the first woman that had moved his heart, and the ancestor of the Jin Clan was actually qualified to attempt breaking through to Saint Tier, which showed how awesome the inheritance of the Jin Clan Clan was.","The Meng Clan had not stopped their search for the Jin Clan. Firstly, they wanted to kill all of them, and secondly, they wanted to obtain the Jin Clan’s precious technique.","Would Tang Yan be willing to surrender his chance to become a Saint?","Moreover, even if he handed it over, would the Meng Clan believe that he didn’t have a reserve copy?","Even if it was just to be safe, they would still kill him.","Tang Yan only had one choice, and that was to remain silent, and never reveal the slightest bit of today’s secret. Furthermore, with such wariness, would he still be loyal to the Meng Clan? “What a huge mine!” Tang Yan sighed. If Jin Yexue had long since informed him that this was the ancestral grounds of the Majestic Empire, he could have immediately returned to make his report, and not set foot a single step here, but now? He could only go all the way to the end. Jin Yexue smiled faintly, “To be able to cultivate the Jin Clan’s precious technique, you are still so picky?”","“True.” Tang Yan smiled bitterly. This was at least a Venerate Tier-level Technique, and in future, he would still have the chance to glimpse Saint Tier.","Ling Han had already finished reading the contents of the beast hide. He naturally didn’t have the time to cultivate it. He only memorized the extremely complicated seals that were continuously changing after fusing into his mind, and then placed it back into the box.","“Memorize the contents of the precious technique first,” Jin Yexue said. “I’ll take the original. You guys don’t mind, right?”","“I don’t mind,” Ling Han and Tang Yan both said. This was a secret technique that had been passed down from her ancestors. Being able to let them study it was already extremely","generous.","After Tang Yan and Jin Yexue finished reading the book in their hands, the three of them exchanged notes, and continued to read.","The technique in Ling Han’s hands was the Great Overarching Heaven Technique. This was a secret technique, and after channeling it out, its might was boundless.","At that time, the Jin Clan had used the Turbid Heaven Scroll and the Great Overarching Heaven Technique to sweep aside all opposition, achieving imperial dominance. This was the Jin","Clan’s true wealth.","“Yi, what is this thing? Why can’t I understand it at all?” Jin Yexue held the animal hide, her expression completely blank.","Was it because her brain wasn’t working well? Why did the seals on the beast hide look like","ghost drawings?","“Let me see.” Tang Yan leaned over, and instantly, his expression was also dumbfounded.","‘What is this? Is this some kind of incomprehensible drawing?’","“Can you understand it, Ling Han?” he asked Ling Han.","“Yes, this is a Spirit Diagram.” Ling Han didn’t hide anything. In any case, it was one matter","whether he knew about the Spirit Diagram or not, but whether he could learn it was another matter. He had only mastered it because of the millions of dimensions in his body, which was","very strange.","“Really?” Tang Yan looked at the animal hide again, but he still couldn’t tell anything.","This was definitely a ghost drawing, so how could it possibly be a Spirit Diagram? However, if it wasn’t a high-level Spirit Diagram, why would Jin Clan’s ancestor have stored it","in a box, along with two great rare techniques?","Tears welled up in his eyes. The precious treasures were right in front of him, yet he could only stare at them helplessly. This was the greatest sorrow in the world."]},{"number":3788,"title":"Chapter 3788: Inheritance!","paragraphs":["Chapter 3788: Inheritance!","“You can understand it?” Tang Yan asked Ling Han, unwilling to give up.","Ling Han nodded, “More or less.”","Tang Yan received a heavy blow. Ling Han could understand it, but why couldn’t he?","Was there such a large gap between their talent in martial arts and their ability to comprehend","Dao? Most importantly, this was a pile of drawings, so what did it have to do with comprehension ability?","Jin Yexue also looked doubtful, and thought that Ling Han was just boasting.","Ling Han did not explain, and merely flipped through the Great Overarching Heaven Technique in his hands. Though this technique could not compare to the Demonic Monkey Fists, it could just barely compare to the Three Styles of the God of War, which could enrich Ling Han’s library of techniques.","He soon finished flipping through the book, and the contents of the book were completely memorized, automatically manifesting in his mind.","The three of them exchanged again, and Ling Han obtained the Turbid Heaven Scroll.","He flipped through it. This was a cultivation technique created by an elite of the fourth pinnacle level, but it was only limited to the fourth pinnacle level. Unless someone from the Jin Clan advanced into Saint Tier, and continued to write this cultivation technique, only would they be able to possess the Saint Chapter.","In terms of Foundation Building Tier, the Turbid Heaven Scroll was definitely not as good as the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll, but Ling Han had only obtained the Foundation Building chapter. Now, he was actually not too far away from the Cauldron Forging Tier, but it was obviously impossible for him to return to the Celestial Sea Planet in a short while. Thus, it was temporarily impossible for him to obtain the Cauldron Forging Tier chapter of the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll.","This Turbid Heaven Scroll was just right for him, and he could temporarily cultivate it. Moreover, he could refer to two high-level cultivation techniques at the same time, so he could appraise each other’s strengths and weaknesses, and take advantage of their strengths and make up for their shortcomings.","After memorizing the Turbid Heaven Scroll, Ling Han placed the book back into the box. Tang Yan did the same, and Jin Yexue also put away the box.","The distribution was completed.","A relaxed expression appeared on Jin Yexue’s face. After regaining the ancestral technique, there was hope for the Jin Clan to rise again.","Tang Yan was also very satisfied. He could immediately switch to cultivating the Turbid Heaven Scroll, and his abilities would rocket in the short term.","Ling Han was also very satisfied. He had unexpectedly obtained another portion of the Spirit Diagram for Destructive Energy. Once he successfully cultivated it, his battle prowess would definitely increase greatly.","“There should still be a Medicinal Garden and an alchemy chamber in this place. However, who knows how much will remain after so many years,” Jin Yexue said, feeling slightly rueful.","In the past, the Jin Clan had been glorious for a while, and had ruled over dozens of planets. Now, however, they were like drowning dogs, not daring to reveal their identities at all.","Tang Yan couldn’t help but sigh when he recalled Jin Yexue’s identity. It was clear that Jin Yexue and the Meng Clan were irreconcilable enemies. If he wanted to pursue Jin Yexue, he would definitely have to stand on the opposing side of the Meng Clan, which put him in a very difficult position.","If he went back and told his family, his legs would be broken, and he would never see Jin Yexue again. He would pretend that the two of them had never met.","The three of them plundered all the cultivation techniques and precious techniques on the bookshelves. Although their value was inferior to the Turbid Heaven Technique and the Great Overarching Heaven Technique, there was no reason for them to leave them here and waste them.","Then, they went downstairs and left.","They had just descended a few steps, when they saw five people arrive together. They were Nangong Qian and the others, who had previously had a conflict with Ling Han and the others. This was really the meeting of enemies, and their eyes were red with envy.","The green-robed woman’s eyes immediately became bloodshot. She drew her sword, and charged towards them.","There shouldn’t be any formations or restrictions here, right?","Unfortunately, there was no formation technique, but there was a stone Pixiu.","Half an hour had passed, and the trace of blood that Jin Yexue had left behind had already dried up. That stone Pixiu had already returned to normal.","It quickly charged out, biting onto the green-robed woman in a single bite. It shook its head repeatedly, and after chewing for a while, with a ‘pu’, spat the green-robed woman out. “Junior Sister!” The other four hurriedly rushed forwards, and saw that the wound that the woman in green had originally bandaged was bleeding again.","-The stone Pixiu didn’t kill people, and even the injuries it caused were very light, but it couldn’t hold up against the green-robed woman who was already heavily injured in the first place. With such torment, the wound naturally split open.","Tang Yan laughed loudly, “Come on, come on. The five of you can come at me together. I will take you all on alone.”","“Humph!” The man in green took out the sculpture again, causing the expressions of Ling Han and the others to change drastically.","This Spirit Tool’s destructive power was astonishing, and they couldn’t withstand it.","They hurriedly retreated back into the small building, but the man in green robes did not care at all. Xiu, a ray of light shot out, and landed on the small building. With a bang, a corner of the small building was instantly blasted open.","What depressed Ling Han and the others was the fact that the stone Pixiu was actually completely unmoved.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Every once in a while, a ray of light would shoot over, and in a few moments, the whole building was on the verge of collapse.","“What do we do?” Tang Yan asked with a frown.","“We’ll split up later,” Ling Han said. There was no hope in battle. Firstly, the other side had five Cauldron Forging Tier elites, and secondly, they also had that terrifying deadly weapon. Only Tang Yan could withstand it for a while.","“Lady Jin and I are Cauldron Forging Tier elites, so it’s no problem for us to flee. But what about you?” Tang Yan shook his head, disagreeing with this plan.","“In terms of fleeing, I can still compare to the Cauldron Forging Tier.” Ling Han was filled","with confidence.","Tang Yan looked at him in disbelief.","Boom! The entire building was collapsing, causing rubble to fall and dust to fly everywhere.","Jin Yexue couldn’t help but urge them, saying, “Don’t look at each other so lovingly. What’s","your decision? Hurry up!”","“Let’s go!”","Ling Han did not give Tang Yan the chance to hesitate any longer, and was the first to charge out. He used Imminent Skyline, and his speed was astonishingly fast.","“F***!” Tang Yan couldn’t help but stare. Ling Han’s speed was not much slower than his.","“You hold the rear,” Jin Yexue said as she charged forward.","“Haha, Grandpa Tang is also coming!” Tang Yan used his movement technique, but","deliberately slowed down a bit.","He had a rare treasure that could protect him, so he had to absorb a wave of attacks first, creating an opportunity for Ling Han and Jin Yexue to escape.","With the three of them fleeing, Nangong Qian and the others were also slightly surprised. However, after only being startled for a moment, the man in green immediately said with divine sense, “Junior Sister Wu, you go and chase after that Foundation Building cultivator. Junior Sister Nangong and I will chase after that male Cauldron Forging Tier. Junior Brother Qian and Junior Brother Zhao, go and chase after that woman.”","“All right!” The other four nodded respectively, and each set off in pursuit of their own target.","His distribution was very reasonable. Ling Han was the weakest, so even if the woman in green had lost an arm, it would not be difficult to take him down, and Tang Yan should be the strongest. He had a rare treasure for defense on him, so he needed to mobilize the deadly","weapon to break through it.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Everyone used movement techniques, their speed extremely fast.","Ling Han didn’t fly. The entire Jin Clan Manor was protected by formations, so he couldn’t fly too high. Otherwise, he would immediately be attacked by the formations. He simply ran on the ground, using one building after another to throw off the pursuer.","However, the woman in green had suffered a loss twice, and she had even lost an arm. This hatred could be said to be absolutely irreconcilable. She pursued him relentlessly, determined","to capture Ling Han.","Though Ling Han’s Imminent Skyline was fast, it was ultimately limited by his cultivation","level. After running for more than ten minutes, the other party gradually caught up to him.","“Die!” The woman in green slashed with her sword. Shua, a flash of sword light shot over, wrapped in icy energy. It was incredibly cold, as it rapidly pursued Ling Han. Ling Han humphed, and without even turning his head, shot out a punch. Peng, the force of","the punch landed on the sword light, and was instantly sliced apart. However, with this obstruction, the Sword Qi also slowed slightly, and did not catch up to him in the end."]},{"number":3789,"title":"Chapter 3789: An excellent alchemy cauldron","paragraphs":["Chapter 3789: An excellent alchemy cauldron","“A mere Foundation Building cultivator actually has such strength, truly remarkable. Unfortunately, you are only a Foundation Building cultivator, and are destined to die by my hands,” the woman in green said coldly, chasing after him with all her might.","Ling Han smiled and said, “As a disabled person, it’s quite remarkable that you still have such battle prowess. Unfortunately, if you want to kill me, you can only dream.”","Hearing Ling Han mock her for being disabled, the woman in green couldn’t help but wear a frosty expression. This was the agonizing pain in her heart.","“Die! Die! Die!” She was about to go crazy, and struck repeatedly with her sword. Sword Qi danced, as dense as a spider’s web.","Ling Han was calm and composed as he unleashed a murderous aura attack. The woman in green instantly faltered, and a flaw appeared in her attack. Ling Han caught it and calmly tore a hole in her defenses. As the net of Sword Qi swept over him, he was completely unscathed. The woman in green was stunned. What kind of attack was this? It actually went straight into her mind, causing her mind to go blank for an instant. Though it was only an instant, in a battle, this was really too dangerous.","Thankfully, Ling Han wasn’t a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator. Otherwise, it was extremely likely that he would have seized the opportunity and insta-killed her at the very least, she would be at a huge disadvantage.","“Like I said, you’re just dreaming,” Ling Han said calmly.","“Is that so?” The woman in the green garment smirked coldly. She summoned the Celestial Cauldron, and two silver cauldrons floated above her head. One had three legs, while the other had two legs.","Two cauldrons meant that she was an Earth Cauldron, and one cauldron only had two legs, which meant that she had not cultivated Earth Cauldron Tier to peak stage.","However, the main point was not here.","-The Celestial Cauldron possessed an irresistible crushing effect on Foundation Building Tiers. Thus, as long as she summoned the Celestial Cauldron, Ling Han’s battle prowess would be weakened by at least half. In fact, it was even possible that he would directly sprawl out on the ground.","However, Ling Han was still running very quickly.","F***, how was this possible?","The woman in green was slightly dumbfounded. This was completely illogical. Once the Celestial Cauldron appeared, a Foundation Building Tier was actually unaffected?","What kind of freak was this?","She naturally could not possibly give up, and hurriedly set off in pursuit again.","It would be indecent to not reciprocate.","Ling Han thought. With a thought, xiu, Heavenly Pattern Jade shot out rapidly.","The Heavenly Pattern Jade could reach 40 times the speed of sound, and the green-robed woman was in hot pursuit at more than 20 times the speed of sound. This relative speed exceeded 60 times the speed of sound, and the green-robed woman couldn’t dodge at all. She didn’t even have the time to think of dodging, and merely slashed out instinctively.","Ding!","The Heavenly Pattern Jade smashed into the sword, and a terrifying power surged over. The woman in green felt the web between her thumb and forefinger go numb, and the sharp sword slipped from her hand.","A look of terror spread across her face. This was because the Heavenly Pattern Jade was still crashing toward her. However, the angle of her slash was slightly off. Peng! There was a splash of blood, and it was clear that a chunk of her left waist was missing. Blood was still flowing from her wound.","Ling Han charged back. When he used the Demonic Monkey Fists, there was only one move. However, the Imperial Technique was extremely awesome. Merely its aura alone was enough to crush all life.","The woman in green had just suffered a severe injury, and was still in a state of distraction. When this Demonic Monkey Fists flew towards her, it was like heaven’s might was issuing a punishment, making it difficult for her to even have the will to resist.","However, she was a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, after all, so her instincts as a cultivator still allowed her to send out a palm strike in response to Ling Han’s attack.","Peng!","The punch landed, and the woman in green was instantly sent flying. Blood gushed from her shoulder injury and waist injury, and her whole person was extremely dispirited.","This injury added to her injury caused her condition to instantly drop to rock bottom.","Without hesitation, she turned around and fled.","Ling Han chased after her, but the woman in green was really putting her life on the line now. Ignoring the seriousness of her injuries, she ran madly, and her speed was actually slightly faster than before.","After chasing for a few steps, Ling Han finally stopped.","After all, there were still four people in the other party, so it was not appropriate to pursue her to desperation.","Although he had taken the green-robed woman by surprise and severely wounded her with the Heavenly Pattern Jade, it wouldn’t be as effective if he used it again. Moreover, they also had an extremely powerful Spirit Tool. This was something he couldn’t resist at the moment.","Let’s go.","Ling Han turned around, but didn’t leave. Instead, he went to find the alchemy chamber and Medicinal Garden.","Since he had entered into a mountain of treasure, how could he possibly return empty- handed?","He strode forward, searching for the location of the alchemy chamber and Medicinal Garden. Now, the others were in the midst of a great chase, and this was a good opportunity to make a","move.","He took out the Void Beast hide and draped it over his body. Instantly, he entered into the Void. No one could discover his existence.","He searched slowly, and after more than half an hour, he finally found the alchemy chamber.","However, there was a formation protecting the alchemy chamber.","Ling Han began to decipher the formation. Fortunately, this formation couldn’t be considered a high-level formation, and it had been buried at the bottom of the lake for too long. The power of heaven and earth had long since changed, and there was pitifully little power of heaven and earth that it could draw on, so it was very easy to decipher.","He entered the alchemy chamber, and the first thing he saw was an ancient-looking alchemy cauldron. It was completely purple-red in colour, and was not stained with the slightest bit of","dust.","This was good stuff.","Ling Han immediately confirmed that this alchemy cauldron wasn’t ordinary.","He reached out to touch the cauldron, feeling its texture. Then, he channeled mystical power slightly, and it was immediately transmitted into the alchemy cauldron. When he also instilled Spiritual Power into it, he shockingly discovered that the Spiritual Power would actually affect the power transmitted by the alchemy cauldron.","These was a Spiritual Power material!","He nodded internally. Spiritual Power could affect the transmission of power through materials. If this was used to concoct alchemical pills, it was practically indescribably","amazing.","Good stuff, this was really good stuff.","Ling Han was overjoyed, and he hurriedly put the alchemy cauldron away. His gains this time","were truly astonishing.","As expected of the ancestral grounds of a Venerate Tier-level force. This alchemy cauldron","was probably something that even Earth Tier High Grade alchemists would fight tooth and","nail over.","He searched around the room again, and discovered several bottles of alchemical pills.","He basically didn’t recognize these alchemical pills, but with his talent in alchemy, he only needed to smell them, and he would be able to roughly determine the effects of these","alchemical pills.","‘Hmm?’","He hurriedly put on the Void Beast hide again, because he heard footsteps coming from","outside.","Looking, it was Nangong Qian and the others.","“How detestable! Those three people actually managed to escape!” The man in green robes","wore a furious expression.","“I wonder what secret technique they obtained.” The man in black was filled with regret.","The man in green humphed, and said, “They’ve all been scared off, so there’s no one here to compete with us. I refuse to believe that the only valuable thing in this place are cultivation","techniques.”","“This is an alchemy chamber. Perhaps there is a supremely valuable medicine that can heal Junior Sister Wu’s injuries,” Nangong Qian said.","The woman in green did not speak. Her injuries were too severe, and she would be a cripple from now onwards, so how could she get used to it all of a sudden? Previously, she still had the thought of revenge to hold on, but now that there was no hope for revenge, her emotions had also fallen to rock bottom.","She could clearly feel that the attitudes of the other four people towards her had suddenly","turned cold.","“That’s not right. There are signs that someone has broken through the formation here!” Nangong Qian suddenly called out.","“Are you sure?” the man in green asked.","“Positive!” Nangong Qian was extremely certain.","“It must be that Foundation Building brat!” The green-robed man nodded. “He didn’t manage to escape, and is still here! Who knows... he might be in this alchemy chamber!”"]},{"number":3790,"title":"Chapter 3790: Surrounded","paragraphs":["Chapter 3790: Surrounded","When the woman in green heard this, she was instantly energized.","She had lost an arm, but she couldn’t actually blame Ling Han and the others for that. Although she had also lost her arm because of them, the fact that she had lost a piece of her waist was completely because of Ling Han.","Now that she heard that Ling Han was still here, she couldn’t help but feel her spirit soar. With a wave of her sword, she was just about to charge in. However, she had already suffered, so she hurriedly stopped abruptly, and asked Nangong Qian, “Senior Sister Nangong, the formations here have all been broken through?”","“En.” Nangong Qian nodded.","The woman in green no longer had any reservations. Wielding her sword, she charged out. With her three Senior Brothers and Senior Sister standing guard, she was naturally unafraid. But when she rushed into the alchemy chamber, she did not see anything.","“He escaped!” she said hatefully.","The other four naturally followed her in as well, and couldn’t help but look disappointed. That was because this place looked like it had been ransacked at first glance, and there was nothing good left?","“Damn it!” The man in black pressed down a palm on empty air. He was presently filled with anger, so how could he not vent it out?","Boom, boom, boom! He struck out repeatedly with his palms, naturally hitting a spot where there was no one, but when he had struck his seventh palm strike, a figure actually appeared out of thin air, greeting his attack.","This time, it was really too sudden. The man in black had completely not expected this. He had only casually delivered a palm strike to vent his anger, so how could he have blasted out a person?","In a rush, he had no way to increase his power, but Cauldron Forging Tier was Cauldron Forging Tier, and in such a critical moment, he still summoned a triangular shield to protect himself.","Peng!","Ling Han’s punch landed on his opponent’s shield, causing him to slide back a few steps. He didn’t linger in battle at all, and directly rushed out the door.","Nangong Qian and the others faltered for a moment before coming to their senses. “That Foundation Building brat!”","“Chase!”","“So he’s still here!”","“He must have taken away the treasures in the alchemy chamber.”","“Who knows, there may even be cultivation techniques!”","“Capture him!”","The five of them were all excited, and hurriedly chased after him. Meanwhile, the woman in green’s expression was filled with killing intent. At present, her hatred for Ling Han far surpassed her thirst for treasures.","She only had one thought, and that was to kill Ling Han!","Ling Han couldn’t do anything about it. He had dodged very well, but the man in black suddenly went crazy, launching a flurry of palm strikes. If he hadn’t made a move just now, he would have been hit by the palm strike, and he would still have to show himself.","It could not be helped. He was only wrapped in the Void Beast hide, and could not completely escape into the Void.","Ling Han activated the Imminent Skyline and fled.","Nangong Qian and the others were hot on his heels. At this moment, the difference in their strength could be seen. The man in green and the man in black were even faster, and were rapidly catching up to Ling Han, while the other three were slowly closing the distance between them.","“Hehe, you won’t be able to escape!” The man in green sneered. He had not thought that there would be another fish that had slipped through the net, and it was a big fish at that.","“Stop right there obediently. Hand over the cultivation technique and alchemical pills, and perhaps we can even reward you with a quick death,” the man in black said.","Ling Han ignored them. These two people only wanted to disturb his emotions, so he naturally wouldn’t fall for it.","“Then don’t blame me for being rude!” The man in green robes took out the sculpture.","“Senior Brother!” the man in black hurriedly shouted. They had to capture him alive, and the destructive power of this pillar of light was too terrifying. If they used it, it might destroy the alchemical pills and cultivation technique together.","“It’s fine. I’ll aim for his legs,” the man in green said with a grin, revealing a bloodthirsty expression.","The man in black nodded. As long as he didn’t die, and the treasure didn’t break, it was fine.","The man in green immediately began to channel the Spirit Tool. His eyes shone with white light, and it was at this moment that a terrifying spiritual attack struck, making him involuntarily feel an indescribable fear. Xiu, the pillar of light shot out, but it had completely lost its aim.","The man in black got a scare, because this pillar of light was more inclined to shoot towards him.","“Senior Brother, what’s wrong with you!” he roared. With his cultivation level, he would either die or be injured by the attack of the pillar of light. The destructive power was too","terrifying.","The green-robed man came back to his senses, and was slightly dazed, as he said, “I don’t know who was attacking my mind just now, and caused me to lose my wits.”","“Senior Brother, it’s that brat!” The woman in green transmitted a message from behind, “He has a kind of spiritual attack, which is very hard to block!”","“So that’s how it is!” The man in green sneered. He waited for a while, and when he recovered, he once again controlled the Spirit Tool in his hands, but this time, he used Spiritual Power to protect his mind, and formed a mystical power shield outside his body.","Weng!","He had not even launched his attack, when the barrage of murderous aura came again. Even with his heavy defenses, he was still unable to completely block the barrage of murderous aura. He felt a pain in his head, and his attack was involuntarily sent out, unreasonably","slanted.","“This brat is really f****** hard to deal with!” he couldn’t help but roar, and felt a kind of fear.","This Foundation Building cultivator was far too terrifying. In terms of speed, he could already rival Cauldron Forging Tier cultivators. In fact, with his relentless attacks, he had even forced his Junior Sister to abandon her pursuit and flee in disarray. If this kind of cultivator advanced to the Cauldron Forging Tier, just how terrifying would he become?","“Kill him! We definitely have to kill him today!” His killing intent became incredibly firm.","“There’s no need for all of us to pursue him. Spread out in every corner. This place is only so big, so we’ll definitely be able to intercept him!” he said.","“En!”","The man in black and the others all nodded, and dispersed at the same time, going in different directions. Only the man in green was still hot on his heels.","In this way, the pressure on Ling Han was greater, because as he ran, it was possible that a person would suddenly appear in front of him to attack him, and this kind of sneak attacker was even a Cauldron Forging Tier elite.","The more this was the case, the calmer Ling Han became.","He suddenly charged back, and looked like he was going to fight the man in green one-on-","one.","“Haha, how foolish!” The man in green sneered, “I am in Heaven Cauldron Tier!”","Naturally, he was unafraid. He charged out, and put away the statue. He switched to using a","staff, and as he swept it out, endless energy boiled, turning into a dazzling brilliance. There were seals everywhere, and the might was unimaginable.","That was because not only was he a Heaven Cauldron, he was also a silver cauldron. His battle prowess was much higher than a copper cauldron of the same level.","Ling Han did not hesitate in the slightest as he summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Multiple flashes of Primal Chaos Qi descended to guard him, while flashes of lightning flickered violently towards the green-robed man.","Weng, the murderous aura attacks hit first, causing the man in green robes to pause slightly. Then, with a thought from Ling Han, the Heavenly Pattern Jade was also launched. Under his feet, he channeled the Imminent Skyline. The Demonic Monkey Fists wrapped with Destructive Energ followed closely behind.","In just a single exchange, Ling Han had revealed practically all of his trump cards – aside from the Heavenly Dao Flames inside the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","Peng!","The barrage of murderous aura reached him, but the man in green was already prepared, so the effect on him was negligible. Seeing that the Heavenly Pattern Jade was about to hit him, a cloth appeared in front of him. Pu, the Heavenly Pattern Jade crashed onto him, but was wrapped by the cloth. It actually couldn’t be torn open, but rather caught in the fabric."]},{"number":3791,"title":"Chapter 3791: Escape","paragraphs":["Chapter 3791: Escape","Ling Han charged over, and the lightning exploded at the same time. Meanwhile, the Demonic Monkey Fists wrapped in Destructive Energy also arrived.","“Haha, your courage is truly commendable!” The man in green sneered. His cultivation level was at the Heaven Cauldron. No matter how freakish you are, how could a mere Foundation Building cultivator resist?","He put away the cloth, and swept out with his staff.","Ling Han activated his ocular technique, and with a step, he actually broke through the multiple staff strikes of the green-robed man.","What!","The man in green was shocked. His sweep was not done casually, but was rather a staff technique. Even though it was only a sweep of the staff, it was covered densely with energy, as if a large net had been spread out.","In this kind of situation, the other party actually managed to seize that slight opening and rush out. This insight was really too brilliant, wasn’t it?","However, there was no time for him to feel rueful at this moment. He hurriedly abandoned his staff and clenched his hands into fists, greeting Ling Han’s attack.","As the saying went, it was out of reach. At this time, the staff was too long to hit him. If someone came close enough, the staff would not be able to turn around to strike him.","Boom!","Their fists clashed together, and a terrifying power collided. Ling Han was undoubtedly sent flying, and he crashed heavily into the wall, directly creating a large hole. He continued to fly backwards.","Only after crashing through seven walls did Ling Han finally fall to the ground. He felt as if all the bones in his body had been shattered, and he couldn’t move a single finger.","However, there was no time for him to rest now. He hurriedly forcibly got to his feet, drew out the Void Beast hide, and draped it over his body. He concealed himself, and left quietly.","Xiu, the man in green had already rushed over. He stared at where Ling Han had fallen, but there was no longer any trace of Ling Han.","Not good, he had escaped!","He was filled with hatred, and also wanted to vent his anger through random attacks, but shockingly discovered that there was actually a power corroding his fist.","What was this thing?","He was shocked. Though this energy was weak, it was incredibly tenacious. He had already used his mystical power to expel it, yet it was actually not completely expelled, and was still wreaking havoc on him.","Though the damage was not very great, it was like gangrene attached to one’s bones. It was extremely annoying.","Just how many secret techniques had this brat grasped?","The green-robed man’s eyes were filled with greed. The Spirit Tool that the other had summoned and the fist technique that he used contained a mysterious high-level energy. If he could obtain all of it... just how strong would he be?","“I will definitely find you!”","He sent out a signal to gather Nangong Qian and the others.","“Where is he?” The moment the woman in green arrived, she immediately questioned.","“He managed to flee from me,” the man in green said. “However, I also wounded him.” “Since he has been wounded by you, he still actually managed to slip away?” the man in black asked, his expression filled with suspicion.","When his words fell, Nangong Qian and the others all turned their eyes towards him.","The man in green couldn’t help but feel his expression darken, “You guys don’t believe me?” “Hehe.” The man in black sneered. He very much suspected that the other had taken the treasure for himself, and then lied about how Ling Han had snuck away.","The man in green took out the Heavenly Pattern Jade, and said, “That Foundation Building brat used this Spiritual Power Spirit Tool to attack me. I had no choice but to dodge, and that was how he managed to escape. You guys also know that the brat has a way to hide his tracks.”","That was true.","The other four people were skeptical. This sounded reasonable, but only this man in green knew the truth.","“Junior Sister Nangong, I’ll have to trouble you to guard the entrance. You know formation techniques, so you won’t let that brat slip away.” The green-robed man began to assign missions. “The four of us will split into groups of two, and continue to search for that brat.”","This distribution was quite reasonable, so the four of them nodded one after another, and for the moment, believed him.","They split up again, determined to find Ling Han.","...","The rooms here stretched on and on. Ling Han casually entered into one of them, closed the doors, and found a corner to sit down in. He hurriedly took out alchemical pills which he","ingested.","In the final attack, he clashed with the man in green, breaking several of his bones from the impact. His internal organs were also severely damaged, and his injuries were considerably serious. He needed to immediately heal his injuries.","Ling Han shook his head, and said, “Right now, I can only barely rival the Human Cauldron. A strike from Heaven Cauldron was able to severely wound me.” This was something that couldn’t be helped. The gulf between him and Heaven Cauldron was far too great, so he was already extremely fortunate to be able to escape.","“The Heavenly Pattern Jade has fallen into his hands. I definitely have to get it back,” Ling","Han murmured.","The problem was, how was he supposed to obtain it?","“Unless... I break through to the Cauldron Forging Tier!”","Ling Han retrieved the alchemical pills that he had obtained from the alchemy chamber. After opening the bottles one by one, he carefully examined them.","Many alchemical pills were already disshapen, turning into a paste that stuck to the bottom of the bottle. Naturally, a lot of the medicinal effects were also lost.","“This bottle of pills should help one break through to the next cultivation level. The original medicinal effects should be enough to help a True Self Tier cultivator break through to the next cultivation level. Now, it should only be able to help a Foundation Building cultivator break through to the Cauldron Forging Tier.”","“This bottle is for increasing cultivation level. It has lost lost too much medicinal effects, so it should be just right for my current cultivation level.”","“Humph, I’ll break through to the Cauldron Forging Tier here, and then seek out those five people for an accounting!”","Ling Han was not the type to be willing to suffer losses. Being repeatedly hunted down by Nangong Qian and the others, how could he not be angered?","He dug out some medicinal paste from the pill bottle and swallowed it. This was medicine that could increase one’s cultivation level.","In a short while, he felt a heat in his stomach, as if it was about to burn.","Boom, vigorous energy surged within his body, as if it could topple mountains and overturn","seas.","“F***, I miscalculated. Though the medicinal effects have weakened, it has still surpassed","my current cultivation level.”","“I’ve already eaten, so I can only take it head-on!”","Ling Han gritted his teeth. The energy in his body was too terrifying, as if it was about to","burst him. In fact, he even felt his body expand.","This was naturally an illusion, but it also showed how astonishing the energy in his body was, that he could not control it at all.","Ling Han could only channel the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll, desperately converting this energy into mystical power to strengthen his Celestial Foundations.","Pa, pa, pa! Energy rampaged madly. His bones and internal organs had already been severely injured in the first place, and he had just barely managed to reconnect his bones and close up his injuries. However, with such an impact, they were instantly broken open again.","It was so bitter!","Ling Han forcefully endured the agonizing pain, and did his best to absorb the energy in his body. Only by enduring the medicinal effects would he be able to heal his injuries again.","Half a day later, the medicinal effects finally stabilized.","Ling Han panted heavily, cold sweat rolling down his forehead, mixed with blood.","He had really lost half his life. Now, his whole person was like mud. There was practically not","a single complete bone or muscle left in his whole body. However, his cultivation level had also increased greatly, so he had not suffered for nothing.","“The price for rapidly increasing one’s cultivation level in this manner is one’s own life!” Ling Han mused ruefully. Though the medicinal effects were dense, and contained a great amount of energy in itself, it was a destructive method to allow his cultivation level to advance so rapidly. It was definitely expending his future lifespan.","Ling Han didn’t regret it. What was the point of living a few more years, but living a coward’s","life?","As a man, he should be quick to repay debts of gratitude and revenge, and laugh proudly.","“I can’t stay here any longer,” Ling Han murmured. He had already stayed here for so long, so the five of them would definitely find him eventually. He needed to change locations."]},{"number":3792,"title":"Chapter 3792: Battling a Cauldron Forging Tier","paragraphs":["Chapter 3792: Battling a Cauldron Forging Tier","Ling Han exited the room. He had not walked for too long, when he saw the man in green robes and the woman in green walk over from the distance, side by side.","He hurriedly hid in a corner, suppressing the flow of blood in his body to prevent the blood from flowing and exposing him.","Thankfully, the two of them were searching room by room, and did not pay any attention to the pathway.","Ling Han took advantage of the opening and hurriedly moved.","It wasn’t long before the man in green and the woman in green found the place where Ling Han had previously hidden. They discovered a large pool of blood on the ground.","“Found it!”","“This guy has indeed been severely injured.”","“Unfortunately, we were still a step too late.”","“It’s fine. Now that the main doors are guarded, he’s just a turtle in a jar. Sooner or later, he’ll fall into our hands.”","“Let’s go!”","The two of them continued their pursuit.","...","This time, Ling Han didn’t go into a room. Instead, he dug a hole in the dense forest and buried himself inside.","In any case, he was already a Foundation Building cultivator, so he didn’t need to eat or breathe anymore.","He suppressed his injuries, then took some medicinal paste. This time, he really only took a little.","Energy surged in his body again, but this time, it was still fine. It was within a controllable range.","In just one hour, Ling Han had completely absorbed the medicinal effects. His cultivation level had once again improved significantly.","Again.","Ling Han continued to take alchemical pills. At this moment, he was filled with fury. He definitely had to break through to the Cauldron Forging Tier and seek out those five people for an accounting.","The next morning, Ling Han didn’t take any more pills. Instead, he faced the rising sun and inhaled and exhaled the essence of heaven and earth. This was something that could not be found in the medicinal effects.","Then, he continued to take alchemical pills and continued to cultivate.","Ordinarily, even tonic medicines couldn’t be taken continuously, and immunity was only a secondary reason. Medicines had their poisons, and taking too many would only have disadvantages.","However, Ling Han didn’t care about this now. He only wanted to improve his cultivation level.","After continuous consumption, the medicinal effects naturally became weaker and weaker. However, this alchemical pill was fierce in the first place, so even if it decreased greatly, it still had a very strong effect on Ling Han.","Of course, the disadvantage was also very obvious. Now that the poison had accumulated, putting aside what effect it would have on his body, at least for the time being, it would no longer be effective for him to take other alchemical pills.","Five days later, Ling Han had already pushed his cultivation level to the peak stage of the Ultimate Dao Foundation. Moreover, his injuries had also recovered by more than half.","In these five days, he would move at night, leaving traces of blood in different rooms, creating the illusion that he had actually been healing his injuries indoors, confusing Nangong Qian and the others.","“I can attempt to break through to the Cauldron Forging Tier.”","“I’ve already tried. Even with the suppression of the Imperial Weapon, the living beings in the dimensions inside my body aren’t powerful enough to resist the shockwaves from the three Celestial Foundations. Thus, constructing four Celestial Foundations is an absolutely impossible task.”","“In truth, others only have one Celestial Foundation, but I have three. This is already inconceivable, breaking the impossible twice.”","“Now, I will attempt to break through to the Cauldron Forging Tier.”","“The Galaxy Network is really a good thing. As long as you’re willing to spend money, a Cauldron Forging Tier-level Treasured Fruit of Life will immediately be delivered to your doorstep.”","Ling Han didn’t immediately ingest the Treasured Fruit of Life. This was because he had only reached the peak stage of the Foundation Building Tier and still hadn’t obtained the opportunity to break through yet.","He simply lay on the ground, fused with the ground, and began to accumulate appreciation. From Foundation Building Tier to Cauldron Forging Tier, it was very simple to say. It was to transform the cornerstone of the Celestial Path into a Celestial Cauldron. However, the transformation of form was only a symbol. The true change was the leap in level of being. Ling Han released his divine sense, fusing with the ground and the heavens.","Images appeared in his mind. They were scenes of Ancestral King Pan Shi comprehending Dao all those years ago.","Ling Han didn’t obtain any techniques from Ancestral King Pan Shi. However, he obtained something even more precious, and that was the various difficulties and deviations that Ancestral King Pan Shi had gone through during his breakthrough.","This was like a cultivation scroll left behind by a great predecessor elite. It was extremely","precious.","From this, it could be seen that Ancestral King Pan Shi was truly broad-minded, imparting this kind of experience selflessly to the future generations.","What Ling Han saw was the multiple failures experienced by Ancestral King Pan Shi, so there was no need for him to take that path.","Two days later, his whole body did not release the slightest bit of aura, as if he had become a corpse. However, in his mind, an incredibly intense change was presently taking place, and","was about to happen.","The three foundation stones of the Celestial Path were presently undergoing change!","They were evolving in the direction of the cauldron, and Ling Han’s body had also gone from a dead silence to spewing out astonishing energy.","Three cauldrons appeared at the same time!","Ling Han didn’t feel anything, but if outsiders saw this, they would definitely be shocked to","the extreme.","How was the Cauldron Forging Tier divided into minor levels?","Simple, just look at the number of Celestial Cauldrons. One cauldron was Human Cauldron Tier, two cauldrons was Earth Cauldron Tier, and three cauldrons was Heaven Cauldron Tier.","But now, Ling Han was going to forge three Celestial Cauldrons all at once. Didn’t that mean that he had skipped over the two stages of Human Cauldron and Earth Cauldron, and directly advanced into Heaven Cauldron?","Was there such a way to break through?","But was there a second person in this world that could form three foundation stones of the Celestial Path when he was only in Foundation Building Tier?","An impossible miracle had created even more impossible possibilities.","Boom! The energy of heaven and earth surged over. Originally, it could not be absorbed unless","it was morning, but now, it was actively surging into Ling Han’s body, replenishing his reserves of mystical power, speeding up the transformation of his Celestial Cauldron.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Nangong Qian, the man in green robes and the others all rushed over.","The scene of heaven and earth here was too shocking. The power of heaven and earth was endlessly gathering here, and as long as one was a cultivator, it was impossible that he would","not have discovered it.","“Has precious treasures appeared?” There was an expectant look on the man’s face. When this kind of phenomenon happened, it was usually when precious treasures appeared. Furthermore, couldn’t you see that these energies were all gathered underground? The rare treasure naturally came out of the ground, which was reasonable.","“After obtaining this precious treasure, it’s about time for us to leave. Otherwise, we might encounter powerful enemies,” the man in green said after a moment of thought. Tang Yan and Jin Yexue had fled. It was highly possible that they would summon elites over. Furthermore, this “island” had surfaced, and as time passed, it would definitely attract","people over.","Thus, they couldn’t stay here forever. After all, they weren’t from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, so they didn’t want the tables turned on them.","“Let’s retrieve the treasure!”","They all gathered around, wanting to dig up dirt and retrieve treasures.","Though Ling Han was presently at the crucial moment of breaking through, his instincts as a","cultivator were naturally still there. He sensed the auras of the five of them, and immediately","burst out with power. Peng, he broke out of the ground.","“What kind of treasure is this!”","“Saintly medicine?” “It’s extremely likely. Otherwise, how could it be in human form?”","The man in green and the others were all excited, and rushed out, especially the woman in","green, whose face was slightly flushed.","-If she could obtain the Saintly medicine, she would be able to regrow her arm.","“What!”","“F***!”","However, they soon saw clearly that this wasn’t some Saintly medicine, but rather that","Foundation Building cultivator!","“Why is it you?!” The woman in green was extremely disappointed. To her, even the inheritance of the Saint couldn’t compare to a healthy body.","“Haha, we’ve finally found him. Capture him, and let’s leave quickly!” The man in green","laughed loudly."]},{"number":3793,"title":"Chapter 3793: Unbreakable","paragraphs":["Chapter 3793: Unbreakable","After capturing Ling Han, they would leave quickly, to avoid another elite coming, who could easily wipe them out.","Ling Han ignored him. He was at the crucial moment of breaking through.","“Charge!” The man in green and the others charged over at the same time, wanting to capture Ling Han.","Ling Han activated Imminent Skyline and directly fled.","The man in green and the others naturally wouldn’t let Ling Han escape, so they hurriedly chased after him. This was especially the case for the woman in green. She had gone from filled with hope to disappointment. She was truly filled with so much hatred that she wanted to commit murder.","Previously, the five of them had already set up a siege. Thus, whether Ling Han barged left or right, he would always be surrounded by the five of them.","“This time, you won’t be able to escape!” the man in green said coldly.","The encirclement became smaller and smaller, and Ling Han finally had reached the point that was at the end of his rope.","“Die!” The woman in green brandished her sword in a mad slash, pouring out all her fury and despair.","Ling Han summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, which exuded a chaotic aura above his head.","An astonishing scene appeared. The green-robed woman’s Sword Qi slashed over, but was actually unable to break through the Primal Chaos Qi. Instead, she was counterattacked by the power of lightning, electrocuted until her whole body was numb.","“What kind of precious tool is this?!” The eyes of those who had never seen it before lit up. This precious tool was definitely extraordinary. It had an indescribably mighty aura, as if it could suppress the heavens and the underworld.","“S-Saint Tool!”","“It must be!”","“Hiss, this should be the treasure he obtained in this space. Previously, the phenomenon of heaven and earth appeared because of this precious tool.”","Even the man in green was suspicious. This was a treasure that Ling Han had obtained in this space, and it was only now that its true might had been developed.","Hong! Hong! Hong!","The green-robed man and the others attacked madly, wanting to break through the precious tool’s defenses and capture Ling Han. However, after much difficulty, when they managed to rip an opening in the Primal Chaos Qi, an endless stream of Primal Chaos Qi once again descended, making up for this gap. It was completely useless.","What were they supposed to do?","Under the protection of this precious tool, Ling Han was already invincible. How were they supposed to take him down?","“I’ll go!” the man in green said. He summoned the stone statue and aimed it at Ling Han.","Xiu, a pillar of light shot out, and the Primal Chaos Qi was instantly blasted apart, revealing a hole. However, it was only a short while, and another burst of Primal Chao Qi descended, and the hole disappeared.","“Shoot at that tower.”","“Good idea.”","The stone statue Spirit Tool was handed over to the man in black. He controlled his mystical power, and xiu, a pillar of light shot out, striking the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. Instantly, the Imperial Weapon shook lightly, as if it was about to capsize.","It was not that the Imperial Weapon was weak. In truth, when Ling Han broke through, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower had also improved by leaps and bounds. Otherwise, how could it have possibly withstood the combined attacks of five Cauldron Forging Tier elites? However, after all, Ling Han had not truly advanced into the Cauldron Forging Tier yet, so the might of the Imperial Weapon was naturally limited. Furthermore, the might of the stone statue was too terrifying. It had definitely surpassed the level of Heaven Cauldron. “I’ll go!”","The stone statue Spirit Tool was relayed and controlled by Nangong Qian and the others respectively, launching one terrifying attack after another that landed on the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","The Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was forged from an Imperial-level material, so it was naturally unafraid of attacks. However, one after another, fierce attacks were launched, causing the precious tower to deviate from its original position. Finally, it was sent flying, exposing Ling Han.","“Ha, this brat is trying to break through to the Cauldron Forging Tier!” the man in black said with a smile.","“Truly reckless, to actually dare to break through at such a time and place.”","“Kill him, and directly search his soul.”","The five of them attacked in unison again.","Right at this moment, Ling Han suddenly opened his eyes.","Instantly, it was as if a bolt of lightning had streaked across the incredibly dark sky, tearing open the darkness and dazzling the world.","The green-robed man and the others were all shocked, and involuntarily stopped their steps, as well as their attacks.","How was this possible? A Foundation Building cultivator had actually managed to scare them off just by opening his eyes?","What kind of might was this?","That’s not right.","“He’s not in the Foundation Building Tier, but has already succeeded in breaking through!”","“Cauldron Forging Tier!”","The five of them immediately came to a realization. Ling Han had already completed his breakthrough. Otherwise, he definitely couldn’t have been so powerful.","“It’s fine. I’ve just broken through, and I’m only in the Human Cauldron Tier.”","They quickly calmed down. So what if he broke through? They had five Cauldron Forging Tiers on their side, and three of them had reached the Heaven Cauldron Tier, and had a powerful","weapon in their hands.","“He hasn’t passed the Heavenly Dao Heart Tribulation yet, so this is a good opportunity to kill him!”","The five of them moved again, charging towards Ling Han.","“An!” Ling Han shouted lightly. It was indeed the Heavenly Dao Heart Tribulation for him now. However, he cultivated the Six Characters Bright King Curse, so an internal demon was completely nothing to him. Mainly, his divine sense was extremely sturdy in the first place, so even without the Six Characters Bright King Curse, he could still pass. This could only be considered as adding icing on the cake.","With a thought, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower had already flown back and hovered above his head again, sending down streaks of Primal Chaos Qi.","Peng, peng, peng! A series of attacks shot over, yet they were all in vain.","The five of them were exasperated, so they could only take out the stone statue again and launch a barrage of attacks at the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower.","After several consecutive attacks, the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower was once again","sent flying, revealing Ling Han.","“Come battle!” Ling Han crossed his arms behind his back, completely disregarding those five people.","He had already destroyed the internal demon in his heart, and had completely advanced into","the Cauldron Forging Tier.","He had never been this powerful before.","Breaking through to the next major tier was completely different from breaking through to","the next minor level. Ling Han had a feeling that even ten versions of himself before breaking through added together wouldn’t be a match for him now.","This caused him to be filled with confidence, looking down on these five people like an elite. “What a joke, a mere Human Cauldron!” the man in green said disdainfully.","“Is that so?” Ling Han released his Celestial Cauldron, and instantly, three footless cauldrons appeared. They were neither copper nor silver nor gold, and seemed to be made of stone,","exuding an ancient aura.","F***!","The man in green and the others were all stunned. What was going on?","Three cauldrons?","Wasn’t three cauldrons Heaven Cauldron Tier? But the problem was, this guy was clearly only","in the Foundation Building Tier previously. If he broke through, shouldn’t he be in the Human","Cauldron Tier?","Becoming a Heaven Cauldron the moment he broke through was practically a fantasy story. Additionally, the three cauldrons did not have any legs. What the hell was this?","Also, what was going on with this stone-like Celestial Cauldron? They had never heard of such","a Celestial Cauldron.","However, they immediately discovered that their auras were actually being suppressed. Ling Han’s Celestial Cauldron released an incomparably domineering aura, causing them to only have one thought, and that was to submit.","This caused them to break out in a cold sweat. In this state, their strength had been weakened","by at least half.","Did he have a chance of winning?","Faced with a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator who had just broken through, and with them","having an advantage in numbers on their side, the green-robed man and the others still felt a","chill from being outmatched.","“Kill him with the Spirit Tool!” The man in green was the first to react. He held the stone statue in his hand, and after injecting mystical power into it, xiu, a pillar of light shot rapidly","towards Ling Han.","Peng, he had hit his target. Brilliant light flashed wildly.","The man in green and the others faltered for a moment. They hadn’t expected that Ling Han,","who had been arrogant for so long, would actually be hit with a single strike. Then, they cheered. Being hit by this rare treasure, his only fate was death."]},{"number":3794,"title":"Chapter 3794: Killed All","paragraphs":["Chapter 3794: Killed All","“What are you guys celebrating? Tell me, so I’ll be happy too.” Ling Han’s voice rang out.","The cheers of the man in green and the others suddenly stopped, as they looked at Ling Han in disbelief.","How was this possible?","Taking on he might of a Spirit Tool, he was actually unscathed.","They were all trembling in fear. What kind of monster was this? Why couldn’t they kill him?","Ling Han smiled faintly. The attack launched by the stone statue was indeed very powerful, and even a Heaven Cauldron couldn’t possibly withstand it. However, it was still far from reaching the level of the Core Formation Tier. If one were to compare the two, that would be equivalent to four cauldrons, or even five cauldrons.","But once Ling Han broke through, he had three cauldrons – though he had not cultivated every single cauldron completely, and he was a few stars prodigy, so after conversion, his battle prowess would at least be equivalent to five cauldrons. Thus, this attack from the Spirit Tool was indeed not something that he could underestimate, but if he went all out to neutralize it, it would not be too difficult.","“How could you possibly not have died!” the woman in green forced out through gritted teeth.","“Because I’m strong!” Ling Han said calmly. With a flash, he had already appeared in front of the woman in green. With a flick of his finger, pu, a gust of wind swept past, and blood immediately bloomed on the woman’s forehead. Her mind was instantly shattered, and she was completely dead.","“Charge!” The man in green hurriedly handed the Spirit Tool over to the man in black. The latter also activated the Spirit Tool at the first instant, blasting out a pillar of light at Ling","Han.","However, Ling Han shattered the pillar of light with a single punch.","He charged over and threw a punch at the man in black.","The man in black hurriedly drew out the triangular shield to shield himself.","Peng, the fist landed, and the shield could not block it at all. It was sinking at a frightening speed. Ka, ka, ka! The sound of bones being squeezed and broken rang out. The triangular shield had completely fused with the ground, and there was blood gushing out from all directions.","Nangong Qian and the others were all pale with fright. So what if he was holding a precious tool for defense? He had not used the power of his fist to attack empty air at all. Instead, he had directly delivered a punch in the most barbaric manner, and forcibly crushed him into a pancake.","What kind of astonishing power was this?","The three people’s courage to go all out vanished without a trace. The gap in strength was too wide; they were not even on the same level at all.","Ling Han frowned, and said, “Make your move. I don’t like to kill people who don’t resist.” When the three of them heard this, their eyes lit up, as if they had discovered a sliver of hope. All of them straightened their backs, looking like they were generously going to their deaths. Ling Han snapped his fingers. Pu! Blood instantly sprayed from the man’s forehead. His body then tilted, and he collapsed to the ground. His face was still filled with disbelief.","Didn’t you say that you wouldn’t kill those who didn’t resist?","“Just because I don’t like it doesn’t mean that I won’t kill them,” Ling Han said calmly.","‘Holy f*ck! Are you messing with me?!’","This was too deceiving, too devious.","Nangong Qian and the red-robed man hurriedly raised their lowered weapons again, aiming them at Ling Han. However, they couldn’t stop their bodies from trembling.","Their hearts were filled with despair. How could there be such a freakish guy? He had clearly just advanced into Cauldron Forging Tier, yet could kill a Heaven Cauldron with a snap of his fingers. It was as easy as the turn of a palm.","“Any last words?” Ling Han asked.","“I promise I won’t speak of today’s events. In the future, I won’t come to Moonlight Planet again, please spare my life,” the red-robed man said, lowering his head and begging for mercy.","Ling Han was unmoved. If they exchanged blows, and Tang Yan or Jin Yexue begged for mercy, would the latter be lenient?","He wouldn’t.","He threw a punch, and a powerful energy roared. The punch turned into a heavy hammer, and multiple seals exploded, blasting towards the red-robed man.","The red-robed man roared loudly, and brandished the large saber in his hand in a slash.","Pu! The heavy hammer arrived, and the saber in the red-robed man’s hand was instantly sent flying. The remaining power did not dissipate, and continued to crush down on him.","The force of the punch swept over, and the red-robed man was also thoroughly killed.","Ling Han turned to look at Nangong Qian, his eyes cold.","Nangong Qian hurriedly threw away the weapon in her hand, knelt on the ground, and said, “I am willing to submit to you.”","“What use are you?” Ling Han asked calmly.","“I am a Formation Master, and am proficient in formations.”","Ling Han shook his head and said, “Unfortunately, I’m also a Formation Master myself, so I don’t need that.”","“Hehe, you are too arrogant!” Nangong Qian suddenly retreated rapidly, and at the same time that she retreated, her hands moved, and instantly, veined patterns lit up on the ground, “You didn’t realize, did you? Actually, I have been setting up formations all this while!”","Ling Han smiled, “With your formation skills, this little bit of time is not enough for you to set up a formation at all, so you should have long since set up the formation. Let me guess, this formation is actually not targeting me, but rather to kill your fellow disciples, so that you can take all the treasures for yourself, right?”","Nangong Qian’s expression changed drastically. Ling Han had guessed correctly.","Realizing that it was suspected that precious treasures were about to appear here, she secretly set up a formation nearby. Once the treasures appeared, she would kill the man in green and the others. In any case, when searching for treasures in an ancient site, it was very normal for","some people to die.","She had never imagined that Ling Han would be able to guess it with a single guess.","“So what if you guessed correctly? The formation is formed, so just wait for death!” Nangong Qian smirked coldly.","Ling Han smiled, “All right, then let me see just how powerful the formation you have laid","out is.”","He summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, which floated above his head. The air of Primal Chaos hung down, and it was as if he could not be penetrated by anything.","Ling Han took a step forward, and instantly, a flame rose up from the ground, burning","towards him.","“Earth’s Core Flames?” Ling Han shook his head. “They can’t be considered Earth’s Core Flames yet. At most, they’re only the outer flames of the Earth’s Core Flames. Their might is","too weak.”","When these flames came into contact with the Primal Chaos Qi, they were directly crushed and","extinguished.","He advanced further, and an ice arrow formed out of thin air, shooting rapidly towards him. Xiu, after one arrow, several dozen more formed.","Ding, ding, ding, ding! These arrows of ice shot onto the Primal Chaos Qi, yet were completely unable to penetrate through it.","—As Ling Han advanced into the Cauldron Forging Tier, this Imperial Weapon that had been cultivated with his life naturally also immediately advanced into Two Stars-level Furthermore, it was also one of the strongest among Two Stars Spirit Tools.","It couldn’t be helped. Who asked it to be forged from Origin Gold? Nangong Qian’s face became paler and paler. The formation that she had deliberately laid out was originally meant to kill all her companions through trickery. She had not thought that in front of Ling Han, she would not even be able to break through the defence of his Spirit Tool. “Don’t be sad. This Spirit Tool was forged from Origin Gold, and is a future Imperial Weapon. It is only natural that it is invincible among its peers,” Ling Han said calmly.","What, Imperial Weapon!","Nangong Qian’s heart beat wildly. No matter how courageous she was, she only dared to guess that it was a Saint Tool. She had not thought that it would be more than that.","A supreme Spirit Tool forged from Origin Gold.","No wonder it was so awesome!","Gritting her teeth, she turned around and fled. However, she had only taken two steps when","she saw a figure appear in front of her.","It was Ling Han.","After advancing into the Cauldron Forging Tier, Ling Han’s speed naturally increased to another level. He could even compete with the Core Formation Tier.","Nangong Qian’s pretty face was as white as a sheet. Ling Han had already revealed the secret","of the Imperial Weapon, so how could he possibly let her leave alive? Worse come to worst, even if she didn’t know that it was the Imperial Weapon, Ling Han still wouldn’t let her reveal the secret that he possessed a “Saint Tool”.","She sighed, and delivered a palm strike to the top of her head, choosing to commit suicide."]},{"number":3795,"title":"Chapter 3795: Going home","paragraphs":["Chapter 3795: Going home","Ling Han was neither sad nor happy. Defeating an opponent of this level was not enough to excite him — it was a matter of course, so what need was there for him to be especially happy?","However, the gains this time made him extremely satisfied.","An excellent alchemy cauldron, a Venerate Tier-level technique, and the Spirit Diagram of Destructive Energy were all extremely valuable.","He searched the corpses of the green-robed man and the others. He naturally had to retrieve the Heavenly Pattern Jade, as well as the stone statue Spirit Tool, which was also quite high- end. Probably more than 90% of Cauldron Forging Tiers wouldn’t be able to withstand a single strike from it. As for other items, there was just a small number of Dao Stones.","Ling Han mused ruefully. With the Galaxy Network, it would become difficult to rob others. He went to the Medicinal Garden to take a look. Unfortunately, this place had not been taken care of for a long time, and most of the Celestial medicines here had already withered. There were only a few that were still alive, but the fruits that grew were far from reaching maturity, and could not be used in medicine at all, so Ling Han could only reluctantly give up.","Forget it, let’s go.","After Ling Han left the Jin Manor, he rode his Tool and flew towards the Imperial Capital.","He journeyed through the night, and five days later, he had returned to the Imperial Capital. His cultivation level had increased by a level, so his speed had naturally increased by another level.","He had already contacted the empress and the others on the Galaxy Network. Thus, after returning to the Imperial Capital, he first went to look for Tang Yan.","“You’re finally back!” When Tang Yan saw him, he felt as if a heavy burden had been lifted from his shoulders, “Don’t you have a Galaxy Network account number? Hurry up and register one, it’ll also be easier to contact you.”","If it was convenient, Ling Han would have long since befriended Tang Yan on the Galaxy Network, but that would have exposed the secret that he was “Number One in the Galaxy”. For the moment, at least, Ling Han didn’t want the other party to know about this identity.","“Hehe.” He chuckled, and managed to bluff his way out of this matter. “How are things going between you and Jin Yexue?” He hurriedly diverted the cannon fire.","Tang Yan’s expression instantly darkened, “What else could it be? It is filled with difficulties.”","This was the honest truth. Even if the two of them fell in love with each other, just because of their backgrounds, there was not much chance that they would be able to get together, what more when Jin Yexue may not even like him.","Ling Han patted his shoulder, but did not speak.","Though he and Tang Yan hit it off very well, at least for now, he could not incite the latter to rebel against the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire.","“Oh, that’s right. Why have you only returned now?” Tang Yan asked. Because this involved the Majestic Empire of the last era, he could not report this matter either. Otherwise, if it was found out that he had possibly obtained the inheritance of the Jin Clan, and had an unclear relationship with the descendants of the Jin Clan, he would definitely be punished. In fact, the Tang Clan would be implicated as well.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “Didn’t you realize that I have broken through to Cauldron Forging Tier?”","“Yi, that really is the case.” Tang Yan slapped his forehead, his expression filled with shock, “How long has passed, and you have already broken through?”","“Impressive, right?” Ling Han asked with a smile.","“Impressive!” Tang Yan said sincerely, then smiled, “You can’t be saying that after you broke through, you showed your might and killed those guys, right?”","“What is it? Can’t I?”","“Hehe, firstly, you have just broken through. Secondly, they have five Cauldron Forging Tier elites, and thirdly, they also have a deadly weapon that can insta-kill all Cauldron Forging Tiers. Say, should I believe you?” Tang Yan countered.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “Come, let’s have a spar.”","“Forget it. I don’t want to bully you.” Tang Yan shook his head. He was an elite of Heaven Cauldron Tier.","“All right, I won’t bully you. I’ll use one hand,” Ling Han said. He placed his right hand behind his back, then stretched out his left hand, and delivered a palm strike at Tang Yan.","“Heh, you’re quite confident!” Tang Yan said with a chuckle. He also unleashed a palm strike at Ling Han.","As he saw it, the Heaven Cauldron would definitely crush the Human Cauldron.","However, his expression immediately changed drastically.","F***, this was a Human Cauldron? Was there such a powerful Human Cauldron?","He hurriedly activated the might of the Divine Physique, and a ball of fire gushed out of his body, covered with complicated seals.","Peng! He was instantly sent flying by Ling Han’s strike. However, Ling Han’s power was withdrawn upon contact, so it naturally didn’t cause him any damage.","“You...” Tang Yan’s head went numb with shock. “Are you even human? You’ve just advanced into the Cauldron Forging Tier, and you’re already so powerful. Even I’m almost no match for you.”","“Almost?” Ling Han rolled up his sleeves. Did this guy want to be harshly taught a lesson? Tang Yan hurriedly waved his hand, “You have just broken through, so I disdain from bullying you.”","Ling Han was rendered speechless. He really couldn’t tell that this Little Marquis had such a shameless side to him.","“You really killed all five of them?” Tang Yan approached. This was too hard to believe.","Ling Han retrieved the stone statue Spirit Tool and handed it over to Tang Yan.","This!","Tang Yan had to believe it even if he didn’t want to. This Spirit Tool had already appeared in Ling Han’s hands, so how could it not be an adequate explanation?","“I rarely admire people, but for you, there’s only one word for it-convinced!” He was completely convinced, but after some thought, he suddenly had an idea. “Brat, hurry up and get yourself a Galaxy Network account. With your freakishness, it’s enough to rank in the top 10,000 in the Cauldron Forging Tier.”","Martial arts were a pyramid, and the higher one’s cultivation level, the fewer people there would be.","With the vastness of the galaxy, even Foundation Building Tiers numbered in the billions, but","if it was upgraded to the next level, the Cauldron Forging Tier would only be over 100 million. And even if one could be ranked in the top 10,000,000 out of 100 million people, that was still very shocking. For example, in the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire, there were only two Cauldron Forging Tier elites that had advanced into the top 10,000.","“As long as you can squeeze into the top eight thousand, you would be the undisputed number one in the Cauldron Forging Tier in our Empire’s territory.”","Seeing that Ling Han was a little dazed, Tang Yan explained, “Right now, there are only two people from the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire that have squeezed into the top 10,000 of Galaxy Network. One is Xiong Zhao, ranked in the 9500s, and the other is Liu Yuyin, ranked in","the 8800s.”","Ling Han shook his head, and said with an expression of righteousness, “I have absolutely no interest in empty titles like rankings.”","This was really a serious nonsense, but Tang Yan just had to believe it, because he knew that Ling Han was also a prodigy alchemist. Who knows, Ling Han may be completely focused on","alchemy?","“Sigh!” He couldn’t help but sigh. If Ling Han had made a name for himself on the Galaxy Network, then as Ling Han’s friend, he would also feel honored.","“All right, I have to go back first.” Ling Han waved his hand dismissively.","“All right. Let’s keep in touch.” Tang Yan nodded. He had been provoked by Ling Han, and","was determined to cultivate diligently.","After re-cultivating the Turbid Heaven Scroll, the quality of his mystical power would definitely improve further. Who knows, he may be able to defeat Ling Han.","-That must be the case.","When Ling Han returned home, the empress and the others were already waiting for him. The","moment he entered, the seven toddlers surrounded him, causing Hu Niu to bawl loudly. ‘You little kids have already taken up all the space, so how am I supposed to hug Ling Han?’","“Out of the way, out of the way, Ling Han is Niu’s!”","“Father is everyone’s!” The seven babies naturally wouldn’t give up easily. “Childish,” Tang Yun’er said in disdain. She licked the lollipop, and it was quite tasty. Ling Han laughed loudly, feeling the warmth of home."]},{"number":3796,"title":"Chapter 3796: Return to Political Hostage Manor","paragraphs":["Chapter 3796: Return to Political Hostage Manor","Ling Han taught the Turbid Heaven Scroll to the empress, Hu Niu, and the large black dog. Though the cultivation technique they were presently cultivating was of a higher level, it was still necessary just in case. If they advanced into Cauldron Forging Tier, yet did not have a corresponding cultivation technique to cultivate, then what could they do?","For example, Ling Han. At present, he could only switch to cultivating the Turbid Heaven Scroll, because the Foundation Building chapter of the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll was already insufficient for him to continue cultivating.","He decided to cultivate in seclusion for a few days to fully comprehend the Turbid Heaven Scroll. He also had to grasp the newly obtained Destructive Energy Spirit Diagram.","Comparatively speaking, the Turbid Heaven Scroll was the easiest to grasp. Though it had been created by a cultivator at the fourth pinnacle level, and could be considered both mysterious and profound, Ling Han had easily grasped even the cultivation technique of a Saint, so this Venerate Tier-level cultivation technique was naturally even easier.","Without spending too much time, he had already mastered the Cauldron Forging Tier chapter of the Turbid Heaven Scroll.","The comparison was clear. The mystical power that the Turbid Heaven Scroll had refined was not as pure as the mystical power that the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll had refined, but there was nothing that could be done. Who asked that Ling Han presently did not have the follow-up chapter of the Ancient Sun Divine Scroll?","He then went to cultivate the Spirit Diagram of Destruction Energy.","Strangely, this time, the Power of Dimension in his body stopped channeling.","There was nothing else that could be done. Ling Han could only do it himself.","These seals were incredibly complex, and they were practically baffling. It was as if they had been drawn randomly, and were completely meaningless.","If that had not been the case, Tang Yan and Jin Yexue would not have repeatedly said that they did not understand.","Ling Han used the Destructive Energy that he had mastered as reference, cross-referencing one seal after another. After spending three days, he finally cracked a seal, which filled him with joy.","This was an indescribable feeling of accomplishment.","He channelled the Destructive Energy, and immediately discovered that the Destructive Energy that he stimulated was slightly more powerful.","There was pitifully little, but there was indeed a little more.","The more threads of Destructive Energy there were, the more destructive power there would be.","All right, continue.","With the experience of his first success, it was much easier for Ling Han to decipher the remaining seals. Another two days later, he had mastered the second seal, and another day later, he had mastered the third seal. Another half a day later, he had mastered the fourth seal, but next, he could not further compress the time he needed to comprehend the seals.","There was indeed a slight improvement, but it was pitifully small.","Ling Han stayed in seclusion, and after a whole two months, he finally cracked all the seals. He stretched out his hand. Boom, Destructive Energy wrapped around him, and compared to before, the size had doubled.","This was far from the ultimate form of Destructive Energy.","Ling Han couldn’t help but click his tongue in wonder. Just where did this Destructive Energy come from? And just how terrifying was the ultimate form Destructive Energy?","However, two months had passed, so it was time for him to go out for a walk.","Firstly, since he had advanced into Cauldron Forging Tier, he should concoct some Cauldron Forging Tier alchemical pills.","-But there was no hurry, because he had ingested too many alchemical pills in a short period of time previously, and there was still a large amount of medicinal dregs in his body. Even if he ingested it now, it would not have much effect. It would only accumulate more alchemical poison inside his body.","Secondly, he also had to go to the Political Hostage Manor and Heaven Military Manor to take a look.","Going to the Political Hostage Manor was naturally to settle accounts, and in the case of the Heaven Military Manor... he was a captain, after all, and had a position in the Heaven Military Manor, so he naturally couldn’t skip work for too long.","“Ling Han, Niu will go with you.” Hu Niu approached.","“Woof! Grandpa Dog reluctantly agrees to accompany you,” the large black dog said in a showy voice.","If Ling Han was still a Foundation Building cultivator, it definitely wouldn’t volunteer. However, this time was different. Ling Han was going to strut around and slap people in the face, so it naturally had to join in on the excitement.","Ling Han smiled, “All right, let’s go together.”","He brought Hu Niu with him, while the large black dog followed behind him, heading towards Jia Yuan Manor.","“Hey, friend, this beast pet of yours is really interesting. It’s actually wearing a pair of underpants. How refined.” They had not walked too far, when someone walked over, and pointed at the large black dog as he spoke.","The large black dog’s embarrassment turned into fury, and he immediately charged over to bite him. “You’re the f*cking human pet here. Woof! See if Grandpa Dog won’t bite you to death!”","That person was only a Mystery Realm Tier, so how could he possibly withstand the large black dog’s bite? He instantly screamed in agony.","After this experience, the large black dog had developed a psychological trauma. He stood on his hind legs, and straightened his body. His two front paws were crossed behind his back, and The appeared very imposing.","“Brother, your beast pet is quite interesting. It’s even wearing a diaper.” Not long after, another person approached.","Woof! Woof! Woof!","The large black dog was greatly provoked, and couldn’t be pulled back no matter what.","After walking for half an hour, they finally arrived at Jia Yuan Manor.","Ling Han suddenly stopped in his tracks. He raised his head to look, smiled, and strode","forwards.","“Yo, Lord Ling, you’re back!” The leader of the guards just happened to come out, and when he saw Ling Han, he hurriedly ran over. “Lord Ling, you’re really a nostalgic person. You","didn’t forget to come and see us old brothers.”","He looked at Hu Niu and the large black dog, his eyes filled with envy.","Just look, only four months had passed, and he already had a beauty by his side as company. He even had a beast pet by his side. His days were really comfortable. “Woof, what’s with that look!” The large black dog had suffered too many blows on his way here, and they all thought that he was Ling Han’s pet beast. He was presently in a state of biting whoever he caught doing that, and when he saw the strange look in the eyes of the leader of the guards, he immediately bared his teeth again.","Ling Han laughed loudly, and grabbed hold of the large black dog. This time, they had not come to drop down to the level of the guards.","They walked into the manor, and very soon, the news that Ling Han had returned to the manor spread out. The hostages all came out to welcome him.","Of course, there were also exceptions, such as Liu Xunyu, Zhao Xiao and the others. The gazes they directed at Ling Han were filled with hatred.","Tan Zhengjie was Liu Xunyu’s lackey. He was the first to walk over, and said coldly, “Ling","Han, aren’t you a little too conceited? Do you think that just because His Majesty has conferred you an official position, you can strut around in front of us?”","Ling Han sighed, and said, “You idiot, you’re always confused about the situation.”","He moved, and delivered a palm strike at Tan Zhengjie.","In the past, when Ling Han was still in the Foundation Building Tier, Tan Zheng Jie was no match for him, what more now that he was already in the Cauldron Forging Tier?","He raised his hand and lowered his palm. Pa! Tan Zhengjie directly collapsed to the ground.","Ling Han cracked a smile, “I am not here to strut around. Instead, I have deliberately come back to thrash you all.” He stretched out a hand, and pointed at Liu Xunyu, Zhao Xiao and Han","Bing respectively.","“Alright, I really want to see how you are going to beat me up!” Zhao Xiao walked out, and strode towards Ling Han, his confidence soaring.","He had recently obtained a breakthrough, and had already advanced into Earth Cauldron Tier.","Thus, he was filled with confidence.","Ling Han?","Hehe, he was indeed freakish, but he had already taken another step forward. Wouldn’t","suppressing this brat be a piece of cake for him?","From Human Cauldron to Earth Cauldron, it was a massive improvement like the leap from Enlightenment Tier to Mystery Realm Tier, so he had absolute certainty.","“Surrender obediently!” Zhao Xiao had already approached, and his hand was aimed directly","at Ling Han’s neck.","Ling Han moved, and similarly, delivered a palm strike towards Zhao Xiao.","Pa, a crisp sound rang out, and Zhao Xiao had also collapsed onto the ground.","F***!","Instantly, everyone’s eyes widened in shock."]},{"number":3797,"title":"Chapter 3797: Settling old debts","paragraphs":["Chapter 3797: Settling old debts","That was Zhao Xiao, an elite of the Cauldron Forging Tier, and he had actually been knocked down with a single palm strike from a Foundation Building cultivator?","It was like a fantasy story.","Everyone was dumbfounded, completely unable to believe this.","You are indeed the number one cultivator in the Foundation Building Tier, but you can’t be this powerful, right?","“Haha!” The large black dog stretched out its paw and stepped on Zhao Xiao’s head, “I am Little Han’s master. You guys dare to bully my human pet, and today, I have come to teach you a lesson!”","Zhao Xiao wasn’t knocked unconscious. He clearly knew that a dog’s paw was pressing down on his head, and he was about to explode in fury.","He was a mighty Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator, yet he was actually being stepped on by a Foundation Building Tier dog demon. How could he accept this?","Ling Han smiled faintly, “I said I would come and beat you guys up!”","He strode forwards, approaching Liu Xunyu and Han Bing.","Liu Xunyu and Han Bing both involuntarily retreated. The pressure that Ling Han exerted on them was really too great. It was like a supreme god was walking towards them.","How was this possible? Just a Foundation Building cultivator... Huh!","“Cauldron Forging Tier!” the two of them exclaimed at the same time. Only now did they realize that Ling Han had already advanced into the Cauldron Forging Tier.","It was no wonder that they had not been able to tell at the first instant. That was because just how much time had passed? How could they possibly believe that Ling Han could become a Cauldron Forging Tier so quickly?","But even if they knew that Ling Han had advanced into Cauldron Forging Tier, this was still too shocking.","A Human Cauldron had destroyed an Earth Cauldron with a single strike?","Hiss, this continued Ling Han’s legend of being invincible among Foundation Building cultivators. Was there really someone who could be so freakish and invincible?","The two of them exchanged a look. Neither of them had any thought that they would be lucky, and hurriedly broke into a run and fled.","Xiu, Ling Han’s figure moved, and Imminent Skyline unfolded. How fast was that?","Pa, pa, with two slaps from him, Liu Xunyu and Han Bing were also sprawled out on the ground.","Ling Han turned around and said to the large black dog, “Little Black, aren’t you very excited? Give each of them a piss.”","“Get lost, I am a dog that cares about my pride!” The large black dog refused decisively, but there was a slight eagerness in his expression. Peeing on the head of a Cauldron Forging Tier was too tempting. After all, peeing to leave scent was the nature of a dog. Even if it had developed intelligence, it could not be changed.","Yet for Liu Xunyu and the others, their faces had turned green with fear. If they were peed on the head by a demonic dog, how would they be able to continue living in future?","“Humph, daring to bully Niu’s Ling Han, I’ll beat you all to death!” Hu Niu rushed out, and stomped fiercely on Liu Xunyu and the others.","When everyone saw this, they all felt rueful.","Ling Han was a miracle. He had only been in the Political Hostage Manor for a few days, and had already stirred up boundless storms. He had even stood out on the day of His Majesty’s birthday, and left the prison of the Political Hostage Manor all of a sudden.","At first, they had thought that this was the end of the miracle. They had not thought that only a month or so had passed, and Ling Han had already returned aggressively, defeating Liu Xunyu and the others.","Awesome, this was really too awesome.","Liu Xunyu and the others were both furious and regretful. If they had known that Ling Han would become so powerful, they would have targeted him with all their might from the very beginning, not giving Ling Han the chance to grow at all. However, it was naturally too late for regrets now. The only thing that did not exist in this world was medicine for regret.","After Hu Niu was satisfied with stomping, Ling Han left with her and the large black dog, heading to where he was assigned to work.","“Ling Han, do you still have me, the commander, in your eyes?” Yan Lesheng saw him appear, and immediately rebuked him with a straight face, “You actually disappeared without a sound. What kind of place do you think this is? You think you can come and go as you please?” Ling Han smiled calmly, and said, “I gave you face, so I accepted the blood-sucking murder case. Moreover, I solved the case in a short amount of time and apprehended the culprit. As far as I know, when you reported this murder to the higher-ups, you placed all the credit on yourself!”","“Forget it, I can’t be bothered to argue with you about this either.”","“However, I’m giving you face, so you can’t be shameless.”","Yan Lesheng instantly flew into a humiliated rage. Just as Ling Han had said, he had indeed placed the credit for the blood-sucking murder case on himself. This was killing a Spirit Transformation True Lord; the credit was practically heaven-defying.","However, it was one thing for him to embezzle this merit, and another for Ling Han to expose it directly.","In the first place, he was already very displeased with Ling Han, and now that his cover had been lifted, his blood rushed to his head. How could he still control himself? Immediately, he leaped out, and waved his hand to deliver a palm strike at Ling Han.","He wanted Ling Han to obediently shut up. In future, he would not be allowed to speak a single word about that blood-sucking murder.","Ling Han crossed his arms behind his back, disdaining to make a move at all.","Yan Lesheng’s attack arrived. Weng, Ling Han shot out a murderous aura attack. A terrifying aura surged out, and Yan Lesheng’s pupils suddenly contracted rapidly. The attack came to an abrupt stop. Then, his body fell forwards, and he instantly collapsed onto the ground.","If their cultivation levels were the same, it would be difficult to find even one in 10,000 people who could withstand the murderous aura of Ling Han.","Yan Lesheng’s face was filled with shock. He could not accept at all that he would be knocked down by Ling Han’s aura alone.","A Foundation Building cultivator... f***!","Cauldron Forging Tier, this guy actually advanced into the Cauldron Forging Tier.","“Old Black, I’ll leave it to you,” Ling Han said with a smile.","The large black dog walked over, stepped on Yan Lesheng’s face, and said, “Old brat, who commanded you to target my Little Han?”","“Ling Han, I am an eighth rank commandant of the Imperial Court, and you actually dare to humiliate me. I will definitely not let you off, and the Imperial Court will not let you off either!” Yan Lesheng roared in fury. He had really gone too far, to actually allow a dog to","humiliate him.","“What’s with that look? Are you looking down on Grandpa Dog?” The large black dog howled in anger, stomping repeatedly at Yan Lesheng.","“Ling Han, just you wait and see!” Yan Lesheng was very stubborn. Of course, perhaps it was because the background of the person who commanded him was too big, he did not dare to reveal it at all, so he could only keep his mouth shut.","“Heh, Grandpa Dog is still unable to deal with you?” The large black dog sneered, “Grandpa Dog likes people who are stubborn.”","It didn’t know where it had gotten a few yellow carp from, and then began to take off Yan Lesheng’s pants.","Yan Lesheng’s face instantly turned green, and he started to struggle violently, “What do you","want to do?”","“Of course, I’m going to put these yellow carp in.” The large black dog bared his teeth in a grin, looking indescribably sinister, “Do you know that yellow carp to crawl through holes the most? Put them in your pants... hehe, where do you think they’ll crawl to?”","Yan Lesheng’s whole body was trembling. This was too devious, wasn’t it? How could you come up with such a wicked idea?","“Yi, you’re still talking tough?” The large black dog grabbed a yellow carp and stuffed it into","his pants.","A mere yellow carp, even if it wormed into his body, Yan Lesheng wouldn’t have to worry about life-threatening danger. When he was at the mortal level, he had long since cultivated his organs to the level of steel and iron. However, if one, no, even several yellow carps wormed into his an*s, how terrifying would the psychological trauma left behind be? After a series of struggles, he finally couldn’t overcome the terror in his heart. He said dejectedly, “I’ll talk, I’ll talk!”"]},{"number":3798,"title":"Chapter 3798: Summoned","paragraphs":["Chapter 3798: Summoned","Yan Lesheng opened his mouth, and revealed the mastermind behind all this.","That person’s surname was Ma, and his name was Ma Qiyun. He was a Deputy Chief of the Heaven Military Manor, a dignified fifth rank high official.","However, Ling Han had clearly never offended this person before, so why would he be targeted by him?","Yan Lesheng didn’t understand this either. He was only following orders, so he didn’t dare to ask Ma Qiyun why he targeted Ling Han.","Yi, could it be that person?","Ling Han suddenly recalled that he had once formed a great enmity with Meng Yangcheng. Furthermore, Meng Yangcheng was an heir to the throne, so there was a 99% chance that he would attend Meng Yonghua’s birthday banquet. In that case, Meng Yangcheng would definitely know of his existence.","To publicly kill a hostage from another nation, even an Imperial Prince would not dare act so recklessly. Furthermore, Ling Han had just received a reward from Meng Yonghua. If anyone dared to make a move on Ling Han at this time, that would be equivalent to not giving Meng Yonghua any face.","-Meng Yonghua was a temperamental person. Who would dare go against him?","Thus, Meng Yangcheng couldn’t touch Ling Han on the surface. Thus, he used an underhanded move, making reasonable use of the rules to deal with Ling Han.","With this in mind, everything made sense.","A crown prince wanted Ma Qiyun to cooperate with him, so would Ma Qiyun dare to disobey him? Furthermore, there was no need for him to step out for this matter. He only had to inform a subordinate, and there would be no cost to him. Thus, Ma Qiyun would definitely be willing to help him.","Since he knew who the mastermind was, Ling Han couldn’t be bothered wasting time on Yan Lesheng. He directly turned around and left.","The large black dog smiled evilly, and stuffed all the yellow carp into Yan Lesheng’s pants.","“No...!” Yan Lesheng screamed in agony. However, his cultivation level had been sealed, so he couldn’t move at all. He couldn’t channel his mystical power either, so he could only scream in humiliation.","—","Ling Han calmly cultivated. Previously, he had forcefully broken through, leaving behind a lot of aftereffects. There was nothing he could do about the damage to his life force, but if other aspects could be healed, it definitely had to be healed as soon as possible.","On the other side, he was also continuing to fight in the level battles on the Galaxy Network. Of course, it was now the Cauldron Forging Tier that he had switched to.","In truth, he had not given up on fighting Foundation Building Tier-level cultivators either. In any case, he only had to suppress his cultivation level.","He issued a challenge to Origin. Right now, he was also a Cauldron Forging Tier elite. However, Origin raised two conditions. Firstly, they were going to battle this time, and Ling Han would definitely be collecting money for tickets, so he wanted half the profits. Secondly, he also wanted to take half of the profits from entrance fees from last time.","Ling Han did not want that.","If he split half of the entrance fees for the two times with Origin, wouldn’t that mean that he had worked for nothing this time?","Moreover, why did he have to bear the infamy while the money was divided equally among them?","Ling Han resolutely didn’t accept this challenge. Instead, he turned around to challenge Myriad Dao and Heaven Crushing. However, it was as if these two people had discussed this with Origin. They actually made the same request.","‘F*ck! Are they ganging up on me?’","Ling Han resolutely ignored them. He began to break records. However, though the three Celestial Cauldrons that he had cultivated were unlegged, he was still recognized as Heaven Cauldron Tier by Galaxy Network. Thus, this was naturally a great disadvantage. He had not been able to break any record, though he was all just a slight bit away.","Furthermore, Cauldron Forging Tier could even cultivate to the limit of the Nine Cauldrons. This meant that Ling Han was still far from reaching the peak stage of the Cauldron Forging Tier, so how could he possibly surpass the strongest prodigy of all eternity?","He turned his attention to pill recipes, searching for alchemical pills that were suitable for the Cauldron Forging Tier.","Very soon, he found a corresponding pill recipe, and it was called the Cauldron Forging Pill. After consumption, it could speed up the forging of the Celestial Cauldron.","This pill recipe was priced at three million Dao Stones, and Ling Han bought it without hesitation.","However, though he had a considerable amount of money on hand, it was also spent very quickly, because he still had the empress, the large black dog and the others by his side. Furthermore, if he used the Time Chamber, then no matter how many Universe Coins he had, there were still not enough for him to spend.","Hence, he had to think of some way to open up new channels of income, as he could not just sit by and do nothing.","He went to the Saint Pill Hall. There was naturally a large amount of medicinal ingredients there. As long as one was willing to spend money, and added with the fact that he was now a Human Tier Low Grade alchemist, there were naturally no medicinal ingredients that could not be bought.","As usual, he would first transfer the money to Hu Niu, and then make the transaction through Hu Niu’s account. He would not expose the secret that he was the “Number One in the","Galaxy”.","He began to concoct alchemical pills. His new alchemy cauldron was naturally useful.","Ling Han had studied it quite a few times these days, and had long since familiarized himself with how to use it.","In terms of alchemy, this was even better than the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower. This was because the circulation and suppression of heaven and earth’s energy was far too","smooth.","However, after failing three times, Ling Han had already concocted the Cauldron Forging Pill. Unfortunately, he still couldn’t take it, as the immunity level in his body was too high.","For the sake of opening up new sources of income, he sold the Foundation Dissolution Pills in bulk on the Galaxy Network. Even though this was the lowest grade Celestial pill, there were a great many people who were willing to pay a high price for it. The price was far above that of","the Cauldron Forging Pill.","When Ling Han had bought this pill recipe, he had done so for its financial benefits.","However, it was a shame that his peaceful life didn’t last long. Ling Han was ordered to go to the military encampment tomorrow.","The official statement did not explain what was going on, but Tang Yan soon arrived.","“Come, let’s have a battle first.” This guy immediately pulled Ling Han to the arena.","Otherwise, if they battled inside the city, the destructive power of Cauldron Forging Tier","would be too great.","Ling Han couldn’t help but feel speechless. After being defeated by him, this Little Marquis seemed to have a lot of pent up energy.","Fine, I’ll oblige you.","The two of them went to the arena. Tang Yan immediately asked for a battle room, and the","two of them began fighting.","Boom! Tang Yan unleashed a powerful attack from the very beginning. Flames entwined around his entire body, and there were multiple seals circulating around him. He charged out,","like the Divine Son of Flames.","Ling Han couldn’t help but nod internally. After switching to cultivating the Turbid Heaven Scroll, Tang Yan’s power had condensed considerably. When he delivered the same attack, the might was at least four times stronger than before.","However, in front of him, this was not enough at all.","Ling Han planned to give Tang Yan some face, and thus began to contend with him. Only after over a hundred moves did he seize the opportunity to strike Tang Yan’s weak point, defeating","him.","“I still can’t beat you!” Tang Yan sighed, but his eyes were filled with excitement. Previously, he hadn’t been able to withstand a single strike from Ling Han. Now, he could fight for more than a hundred moves, which showed how great his improvement was.","“You didn’t let me win, right?” he asked again.","“What do you think?” Ling Han smiled.","“You did?” Tang Yan was a little nervous. “Hehe.”","“Did you let me win or not?”","“Hehe.”","Ling Han didn’t directly answer the question of whether he had let him win or not. When he returned home, he asked, “You didn’t come this time to fight me, did you?” “That’s one of the reasons,” Tang Yan said with a smile. “Have you received the summons?”","“En.” Ling Han nodded, “I was just about to ask you what’s going on.” “Something big has happened.” Tang Yan lowered his voice, “The Shadow Moon Majestic Empire suddenly attacked Golden Wealth Planet. This is one of our most important resource planets, which produces all kinds of precious metals and ores. The materials used in the weapons and armor of our army all came from Golden Wealth Planet.”","“If Golden Wealth Planet is taken, then we would lack important supplies. This war would really be difficult to fight.”"]},{"number":3799,"title":"Chapter 3799: Going to war","paragraphs":["Chapter 3799: Going to war","Hence, Golden Wealth Planet was a strategic location, and was the most important.","Previously, though the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire had invaded, it could only be considered a small skirmish at most, forcing the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire to send a large number of elites to the front lines. They didn’t really launch a large-scale offensive.","But this time was different. The Shadow Moon Majestic Empire suddenly mobilized a large number of troops and took a pedantic detour, invading Golden Wealth Planet and directly striking the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire’s vital point.","If they lost Golden Wealth Planet, the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire would lose their strategic supplies, and it would be extremely disadvantageous if they fought a drawn-out battle.","Thus, in order to express their determination not to lose Golden Wealth Planet, the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire decided to mobilize the young prodigies of the Imperial Capital and the second generation of officials to form an army to head to Golden Wealth Planet and battle against the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire.","Ling Han rubbed his nose awkwardly. Naturally, he was completely displeased.","He did not have the slightest bit of positive feelings towards the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. Whether it was himself, or taking into account Brother Monkey, Chen Fengyan and the others, he was standing on the opposing side of the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire. Now, he had to be willing to throw up his head and shed blood for the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire?","Ling Han was naturally unwilling. It was already good enough that he didn’t stab them in the back, and they still wanted him to work for them?","Moreover, wasn’t he a hostage? How could they allow a hostage to go to the battlefield?","However, from this, it could be seen that the Azure Dragon Majestic Empire was really anxious. They were about to mobilize the second-generation young masters into the battlefield. This was a signal to all the citizens that Golden Wealth Planet could not be lost, and this battle could not be lost either.","Whether Ling Han was willing or not, he still went to the military encampment at noon the next day.","-If he did not go, that would be publicly disobeying the imperial decree, unless he wanted to immediately turn hostile.","An official was reading there. It was a crusading declaration that had been created by a few great scholars of the Empire, expressing a strong fury at the invasion of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire. The words used were lavish, and very capable of stirring emotions, making those who heard feel impassioned, wanting nothing more than to immediately charge to the front lines and fight. They would not regret it even if they were buried here.","Ling Han was sure that these people would only be excited for five minutes. There was no need for them to go to Golden Wealth Planet. Probably, once the mobilization meeting ended, they would be filled with regret.","In short, this was a very successful mobilization meeting. Everyone’s faces were glowing, filled with longing. They all dreamed of killing their enemies to repay their country’s favour, and establish an undying empire.","Finally, that official announced that three days later, everyone would board the warship together, and charge towards Golden Wealth Planet. Whoever dared to flee during battle would be killed without mercy.","Why was the warship used instead of the Transfer Formation?","Because once the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire invaded Golden Wealth Planet, it took control of the Transfer Formation. If they used the Transfer Formation to enter, then they would really be sending everyone to death, and whether they wanted to kill them or cut them into pieces was completely up to the whim of their enemies.","After Ling Han returned, he discussed this with the empress and the others.","This trip to Golden Wealth Planet should be very dangerous, but at the same time, it should also be filled with opportunities. That was because Golden Wealth Planet was an extraordinarily rich resource planet, which produced high-level Celestial Material, as well as some Celestial medicines. If they could be harvested, they would be extremely beneficial for cultivation.","However, Ling Han was going to battle, so he naturally couldn’t bring his family with him. Moreover, if Ling Han was alone, he could leave or stop whenever he wanted, so he would have much less scruples.","After much consideration, the empress, Hu Niu, and the babies still stayed behind at the Moonlight Planet. However, the large black dog and the pervert pig could follow Ling Han as pet beasts.","The perverted pig was naturally unwilling to do this. However, he was unable to resist. Meanwhile, the large black dog was delighted. This guy loved to join in on the excitement.","The short three days of preparation time quickly passed. Everyone gathered at the designated location, and then boarded the ship.","There were many, many people. One warship couldn’t hold them all, and a total of twelve warships were mobilized. It was said that even the imperial heirs had all been mobilized. This was a very good chance to make a contribution. Who knows, they might be able to rise above the rest, and upon their return, their status as imperial heirs would be confirmed.","It wasn’t long before the warship set off for Golden Wealth Planet.","Ling Han stayed in his room. Aside from cultivating, he basically spent his time in the Galaxy Network. Aside from being able to battle, there were also Mystery Realms that he could explore, and they basically all existed in real life. They had all been moved into the Galaxy Network, and experiencing it with his divine sense, it was extremely signifcant for his","understanding of Mystery Realms.","Aside from that, he was also learning new formation techniques. As his cultivation level increased, his influence on the great power of heaven and earth was naturally also increasing, and he could set up even stronger formation techniques.","He had bought a formation through the Galaxy Network. Its name was Extreme Thunder Formation, and among Two Star Formation Techniques, it could be considered very powerful. Those who did not know formation techniques would be madly blasted by the power of lightning upon entering, and die from it.","Ling Han even rented the Time Chamber, but in order to save money, he did not use the highest acceleration rate.","From the Moonlight Planet to the Golden Wealth Planet, it was only about a month’s galactic journey. When 30 days had passed, and after passing through one wormhole after another, that resource-rich planet also appeared in their vision.","From afar, this was a great planet that was purple-gold in colour, and was surrounded by four","moons.","The warship began to descend, and through the Galaxy Network, it communicated with the people on the ground, locating a safe landing spot.","Xiu, a ray of light suddenly shot out from Golden Wealth Planet, and landed on one of the warships. Instantly, a brilliant light exploded.","Thankfully, the warship had long since activated its defenses. Otherwise, with such a blow, the warship would definitely disintegrate.","“Enemy attack!”","The 12 warships all entered into battle mode. However, they were unable to determine which corner of Golden Wealth Planet the attack originated from, so they were naturally unable to counterattack. Moreover, the warships didn’t have such a large range of attack.","-The attacker must be a supreme elite, and it was highly possible that it was a great elite of","the level of Sect Master.","Xiu, another streak of light shot over. The clumsy warship couldn’t dodge at all, and could only take it head-on. Peng, the originally invisible shield immediately manifested, trembling","endlessly.","“Land quickly! Land quickly!”","The 12 warships all rapidly descended. Right now, they could only take a beating. Even their shields wouldn’t be able to withstand this kind of bombardment. They would definitely be","destroyed.","Xiu, xiu, xiu! Multiple streaks of light blasted over, all aimed at the same warship. As","expected, after sustaining just over thirty attacks, that warship’s light shield was finally shattered. Another streak of light shot over, and the warship was forcefully disintegrated, shattering into at least a few hundred pieces.","Some were directly crushed into dust, while others were fortunate enough not to die. They all flew on their Spirit Tools, wanting to fly to another warship, or land directly on ground. However, even dozens of times faster than the speed of sound was exceedingly slow in the vast universe. Though it was not crawling like a turtle, it was not much better. Fortunately, this warship that had disintegrated was not the one that Ling Han had been","aboard.","However, after destroying a warship, those streaks of light targeted another warship. Unfortunately, this was the warship that Ling Han was aboard.","“F*ck! We’re about to die!” the large black dog exclaimed in shock.","“Wu!” The perverted pig also screamed in pain. If it was still on Celestial Sea Planet, it would","definitely be eating and hitting on girls. How could there be so many dangerous things going","on?","Ling Han was calm and unperturbed. He summoned the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower and released streaks of Primal Chaos Qi. This was just in case.","Peng, peng, peng! The ship shuddered violently, and its shield continued to withstand the barrage of attacks. It was on the verge of shattering."]},{"number":3800,"title":"Chapter 3800: Extermination of the Army","paragraphs":["Chapter 3800: Extermination of the Army","“We’re bout to explode!” The large black dog hugged Ling Han’s thigh, and its mouth gaped open. It was so anxious that it began to bark.","The perverted pig also “paled in terror”. Although it was impervious to all attacks, and it was as if it would never be wounded, in terms of abilities, it was truly an ordinary pig. If it floated in space, how long would it take to land on a planet?","He was really scared to death, b@stard.","Ling Han grabbed hold of the lecherous pig. He didn’t need to worry about the large black dog, as he was already grabbing onto him with all his might.","Inside the warship, it was complete chaos, and everyone was worried about themselves.","They had come with hot blood in their hearts, but the result was great. They had not even seen the enemy, and they had already suffered a heavy blow, causing the mentality of a great many people to collapse all of a sudden.","Peng, the warship’s shield was quickly shattered. Then, a ray of light blasted over, forcibly severing this colossal warship. The remaining power spread out in all directions, shattering the warship that had been broken into two halves, turning into several hundred slightly larger pieces of the warship, as well as innumerable tiny pieces.","Instantly, a powerful force pulled Ling Han along, and rapidly swept through the galaxy. Previously, inside the ship, there was a steady pressure, but now that the ship had shattered, this pressure naturally disappeared, causing everyone to float rapidly.","Aside from that, endless coldness also assaulted Ling Han madly, instantly causing Ling Han’s whole body to be covered with frost. The large black dog and pervert pig also turned into an ice dog and an ice pig.","Ling Han activated the Starlight Screen, and instantly, the coldness was completely expelled from his body. He controlled the Primal Chaos Extreme Lightning Tower, and xiu, it descended towards one of the moons in Golden Wealth Planet.","It couldn’t be helped. The other planets were too far away. If one were to fly with his physical body, he would need dozens or even hundreds of years. Furthermore, there was no","replenishment from the power of heaven and earth in this process, so it wouldn’t take long for him to die.","‘Wormhole?’","Those who could physically pass through the wormhole had to be Spirit Transformation True Lords.","Furthermore, if they flew towards Golden Wealth Planet, they would only have to be struck by the streaks of light once, and it was guaranteed that they would die immediately.","Thus, after comprehensive consideration, it was best to go to one of the moons to hide.","Ling Han unleashed his full speed. At close to 40 times the speed of sound, he was overwhelmingly fast. If it was not for the protection of the Starlight Screen, it was guaranteed that the large black dog would have been torn into pieces at any moment.","On the way, Ling Han saw another warship being destroyed, and a great many people chose to fly towards a certain moon just like him.","It wasn’t that they didn’t directly land on Golden Wealth Planet, but they were basically sliced into pieces by the sweeping light.","That should be saber light.","Ling Han deduced. Previously, the warship he had been on had been destroyed. He sensed that light at a very close distance, and it was filled with the domineering nature of a saber, causing him to deduce that it was an elite wielding a saber on Golden Wealth Planet that had moved, sniping the expeditionary troops like them.","In fact, this elite was on the level of Sect Master.","That was because there were Spirit Transformation True Lords in the army, but they were completely unable to resist that saber light. They could just barely protect themselves.","In just a few moves, nine of the 12 warships were destroyed, and the elites were killed. Two successfully retreated, while one circled to the other side of Golden Wealth Planet, and it was possible that they could land safely.","The problem was, could it be the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire’s troops that were waiting for them on the ground?","According to the intelligence that had been sent back previously, the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire had already occupied half of Golden Wealth Planet’s territory in a flash. However, a month had already passed, so would there be any changes? Could it be that the entire Golden Wealth Planet had already fallen into the hands of the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire?","Of course, it was already meaningless to talk about this now.","Golden Wealth Planet was very big, and Golden Wealth Planet’s moon was also very big. Thus, there were clearly a great many people that were heading towards the moon that Ling Han had aimed for, but when they landed on the ground, they were very far away.","This was a moon, lacking vitality. Greenery could not be seen anywhere. However, this place was not completely devoid of life. Some rocks were very damp, and dark red moss grew here, showing a strong vitality.","Without air, gravity was extremely weak. One only had to exert a little force to jump, and his whole person would be able to soar high.","“Let’s find a place to hide first. After the first wave of attack from the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire, the Shadow Moon Majestic Empire will definitely send out an army to search for us who have slipped through their net,” Ling Han said.","“Sigh, Little Han, you’re definitely a jinx. Just take a look, we haven’t even reached our destination yet, and we were almost shot through,” the large black dog grumbled.","The pervert pig nodded repeatedly, his expression filled with resentment. He had been forcefully dragged here, b@stard.","Ling Han laughed loudly, “If I don’t experience the storms, how can I see the rainbow? Don’t worry, it’s fine. I’m here!”","His eyes swept over the surroundings, “Where should we go?”","He activated his eye technique and saw a mountain in the distance.","“Let’s go.”","He grabbed the large black dog and the perverted pig, and flew on his divine tool, heading","towards that mountain.","Half an hour later, he arrived at the foot of the mountain.","This was really a large mountain, but it was mostly bare rocks. Some of them even shone with","a metallic luster.","“Who knows, we may be able to gain something here,” Ling Han said.","“It would be best if I can find a piece of Origin Gold. Grandpa Dog also wants to forge an Imperial Weapon that belongs to me.” The large black dog was filled with greed. Ling Han smiled, “Your exclusive Imperial Weapon, is it a pair of Origin Gold underpants?” “Woof, don’t tease Grandpa Dog about this,” the large black dog said in frustration. The perverted pig bared his mouth in a grin, not giving him any face at all. He was so infuriated that the large black dog pounced over and bit him. However, though the perverted pig was weak in battle, his defense was invincible. No matter how the large black dog bit him, he was still unscathed. He continued to grin and laugh at the large black dog.","“Let’s go and take a look.”","Ling Han ascended the mountain, planning to look around. He had the Void Beast hide, which could hide him very well. Unless it was an existence on the level of Spirit Transformation True Lord, it would be impossible to see through his disguise.","“Little Han, there are pursuers coming,” the large black dog suddenly said. He pointed in the direction of Golden Wealth Planet.","Dozens of small dots were rapidly approaching. Upon a closer look, weren’t they warships? However, compared to the warships that Ling Han had boarded, these were clearly much","smaller.","These warships rapidly left Golden Wealth Planet, then dispersed, going to the four different moons. Each moon had ten warships, which landed in different locations.","One of the ships was at the foot of the mountain. The hatch opened, and groups of soldiers walked out. There were ten of them in a group, and they spread out in all directions. Ling Han had long since wrapped himself, the large black dog, and the perverted pig in the Void Beast’s hide. He stood by the roadside, watching a small team pass by.","He could clearly see that there were nine Foundation Building Tier cultivators in this team,","and the remaining person was a Cauldron Forging Tier cultivator. As a search team, this setup was also quite powerful. If they encountered danger, they only had to send out a signal, and he was sure that powerful reinforcements would soon arrive.","Ling Han did not make a move. Though he could have destroyed this team in an instant, it would naturally not be difficult for them to guess that the culprit was nearby, since a team had lost contact with base so quickly.","He looked at the warship, and a thought involuntarily flashed through his mind. Could he","steal this thing?","Worse come to worst, he could steer this warship back to the Moonlight Planet."]}]);
